        "Current_Status": "Intact (Dr Byrappa MG, Mythic Society Inscriptions Digital Conservation Team)",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "28\nDate about 1380 A.D.\n(Tamil) – According to the order of ………… Nagana Odappa-udaiyar, ………………. Vana-udayiyar Kasar and the senabova Madi-siyar Kambayar, the superintendent of Erumarai-nadu, seem to have made a grant …………….. Naganna-udai …………………………… (Usual final imprecatory sentence).\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "28\nಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಕತ್ತರಿಕುಪ್ಪೆ ಗ್ರಾಮಕ್ಕೆ ದಕ್ಷಿಣ ಊರಬಾಗಲವೊಳದಡೆ ಚಾವಡೀ ಬಳಿ.\n\nಅರವಕ್ಷರ",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "",
