        "name": "Kattarikuppe",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKu5e6br8ApAJuElctqEQUvT3pbjldv7TzgR1NYV4Y9DxFt2UuNIDjiky_IMWuEXESEoIo5A9v-r5va38uJkRTWhmsws5CDn-0P8A7YLAHCVoD6OWlzN85PzROpdbhn_iBACwKw8EiGq1OdvYok5Ff97iP3Kf1lgrJnbQhkVgoW0wKpnIt2JB-w_6wqRMFSsws2DP4M?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>EC 9 An#: 29<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: At thc same place, 2nd stone.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1376<br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): Sarjapura<br>Poster in Exhibition?: <br>Inscription language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Intact (Dr Byrappa MG, Mythic Society Inscriptions Digital Conservation Team)<br>English translation of the Inscription: 29<br>Date 1376 A.D.<br>(Tamil) – During the time that the maharajaraja paramesvara sri-vira-Bukka-Rayaru was ruling the earth – <br><br>(On the date specified), in order that virtue, wealth, gratification of desire, and salvation might be to the maha-mandalesvara, destroyer of hostile kings, champion over kings who break their word, Naganna-udaiyar, and to ……… mara Deppanna-udaiyar, …………………… Deppanna –udaiyar made by his own hand a grant to ……………. Mudeliyar, …………….Sadasiva-battar of the Pulasya-gotra. (Then follow signatures).<br><br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 29<br>ಅದೇ ಸ್ಥಳದಲ್ಲಿ ೨ನೇ ಕಲ್ಲು.<br><br>ಅರವಕ್ಷರ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: arun kumar mr <mrarunakumar@rediffmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: arun kumar mr <mrarunakumar@rediffmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Dr Byrappa MG, Mythic Society Inscriptions Digital Conservation Team<br>Latitude: 12.91559<br>Longitude: 77.76594<br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvaWFc2aqeVD8lJ0eHjx10tPcMFM4QvQhr-6WmITzBwlNJf7yw5Swr4GXZc28QKgdXlkr7o3MvFN_TmuJCwUEelgdJTEcGoxmnjZZNMnUNyshwTVBpjFYUG8_GvoG6lm0fdOnyYuFJ-Gjl8D_vaq6Y2Hek6T4l6lT1MKzdPKrBo1iOH8OMofbh-vycsbiJNnNfmlHM?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
