        "Current_Status": "Intact (Dr Byrappa MG, Mythic Society Inscriptions Digital Conservation Team)",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "29\nDate 1376 A.D.\n(Tamil) – During the time that the maharajaraja paramesvara sri-vira-Bukka-Rayaru was ruling the earth – \n\n(On the date specified), in order that virtue, wealth, gratification of desire, and salvation might be to the maha-mandalesvara, destroyer of hostile kings, champion over kings who break their word, Naganna-udaiyar, and to ……… mara Deppanna-udaiyar, …………………… Deppanna –udaiyar made by his own hand a grant to ……………. Mudeliyar, …………….Sadasiva-battar of the Pulasya-gotra. (Then follow signatures).\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "29\nಅದೇ ಸ್ಥಳದಲ್ಲಿ ೨ನೇ ಕಲ್ಲು.\n\nಅರವಕ್ಷರ",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "",
