      "properties": {
        "name": "Gattihalli",
        "description": "EC 9 An#: 36<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: On the stone oilmill by the village gate<br>Installation Date: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): Bidaruguppe hobli<br>Poster in Exhibition?: <br>Inscription language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English translation of the Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 36<br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಗಟ್ಟಿಹಳ್ಳಿಯ ವೂರಬಾಗಲ ಬಳಿ ಕಲ್ಲುಗಾಣದಲ್ಲಿ.<br><br>1. ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಶಖವರುಷ ೧೨೨೧ ನೆಯ ಚಿತ್ರ<br>2. ಭಾನುಸಂವತ್ಸರದಜೇಷ್ಟಸು ೫ ಉತರನ <br>3. ಅಕ್ಕಸಾಲೆಮಾರಪ್ಪನಮಗ ................<br>4. ತಂಣ ...................................<br>5. ಕಲ್ಲಗಾಣಕ್ಕೆ ಮಂಗಳ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: <br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: arun kumar mr <mrarunakumar@rediffmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: <br>Latitude: 12.868303<br>Longitude: 77.703582",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "EC_9_An_": "36",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "On the stone oilmill by the village gate",
        "Installation_Date": "",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "Bidaruguppe hobli",
        "Poster_in_Exhibition_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Kannada",
        "Size": "",
        "Current_Status": "Not traceable",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "36\nಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಗಟ್ಟಿಹಳ್ಳಿಯ ವೂರಬಾಗಲ ಬಳಿ ಕಲ್ಲುಗಾಣದಲ್ಲಿ.\n\n1. ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಶಖವರುಷ ೧೨೨೧ ನೆಯ ಚಿತ್ರ\n2. ಭಾನುಸಂವತ್ಸರದಜೇಷ್ಟಸು ೫ ಉತರನ \n3. ಅಕ್ಕಸಾಲೆಮಾರಪ್ಪನಮಗ ................\n4. ತಂಣ ...................................\n5. ಕಲ್ಲಗಾಣಕ್ಕೆ ಮಂಗಳ",
