      "properties": {
        "name": "Gattihalli",
        "description": "EC 9 An#: 37<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: In the inamati lands of Someshwara temple to the north-east<br>Installation Date: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): Bidaruguppe hobli<br>Poster in Exhibition?: <br>Inscription language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: To be verified<br>English translation of the Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 37<br>ಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮಕ್ಕೆ ಈಶಾನ್ಯ ಸೋಮೇಶ್ವರ ದೇವರ ಇನಾಮತಿ ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿ.<br><br>1. ವಿಜಯಸಂತ್ಸ<br>2. ರದಮಾಗ ಬ ೧೨ <br>3. ಲುರಾಜಪುರಸಿಂ <br>4. ವಾಹಸನ <br>5. ರದಕರ್ತಯದೇವ <br>6. ರಮಗನುಬಲಿವೀ <br>7. ರಯನು ............... <br>                       ಮುಂದೆ ಕಾಣುವುದಿಲ್ಲ.<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: <br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: arun kumar mr <mrarunakumar@rediffmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: <br>Latitude: 12.864286<br>Longitude: 77.705115",
