        "name": "Bangalore (Chikkapete)",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 2<br>Hobli: Bangalore (Pete & Cantt)<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: In Bangalore, on a stone near Tugada Achappas house in Chikkapete<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1633<br>Inscription Language: Telugu<br>Size: 4'X2'1\"<br>Current Status: Not traceable<br><br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 2<br>Date 1633 A.D.<br>(Telugu)—.... in order that dharma might be to the Yalahanka-nad prabhu, Immadi-Kempaya-Gauni, and his sons and grandsons in succession, as long as sun and moon cndure,—Guijari Visvanatha had the dharmasala matha built (in the year specified).<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1\t...matuyalahaṃka<br>2\tnāḍaprabhuvulainayiṃmaḍikeṃ<br>3\tpayagauniayavārikeācaṃdrā<br>4\trkaṃgānuputrapātrapāraṃparyayudha<br>5\trmaṃkorakugujjariviśyanāthu<br>6\tkaṭaṃcinadharmaśālamaṭhaṃ<br>7\tśrīmukhasaṃvatsaravaiśākhaśu<br>8\tdhatritiyyaṃdu<br><br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 2<br><br>ಬೆಂಗಳೂರು ಚಿಕ್ಕಪೇಟೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ತುಗದ ಅಚ್ಚಪ್ಪನ ಮನೆ ಮಗ್ಗಲಲ್ಲಿ ನಟ್ಟಕಲ್ಲಿನಲ್ಲಿ.<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 4’ 2’ 1”.<br><br>1\t...ಮತುಯಲಹಂಕ<br>2\tನಾಡಪ್ರಭುವುಲೈನಯಿಂಮಡಿಕೆಂ<br>3\tಪಯಗೌನಿಅಯವಾರಿಕೆಆಚಂದ್ರಾ<br>4\tರ್ಕಂಗಾನುಪುತ್ರಪಾತ್ರಪಾರಂಪರ್ಯಯುಧ<br>5\tರ್ಮಂಕೊರಕುಗುಜ್ಜರಿವಿಶ್ಯನಾಥು<br>6\tಕಟಂಚಿನಧರ್ಮಶಾಲಮಠಂ<br>7\tಶ್ರೀಮುಖಸಂವತ್ಸರವೈಶಾಖಶು<br>8\tಧತ್ರಿತಿಯ್ಯಂದು<br>(ಮೇಲ್‍ಭಾಗ ಒಡೆದು ಹೋಗಿಧೆ.)<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1\t...మతుయలహంక<br>2\tనాడప్రభువులైనయింమడికెం<br>3\tపయగౌనిఅయవారికెఆచంద్రా<br>4\tర్కంగానుపుత్రపాత్రపారంపర్యయుధ<br>5\tర్మంకొరకుగుజ్జరివిశ్యనాథు<br>6\tకటంచినధర్మశాలమఠం<br>7\tశ్రీముఖసంవత్సరవైశాఖశు<br>8\tధత్రితియ్యందు<br><br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br><br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.9714662<br>Longitude: 77.5722716<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
