        "Inscription_language": "Telugu",
        "Size": "4'X2'1\"",
        "Current_Status": "Not traceable\n",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "2\nDate 1633 A.D.\n(Telugu)—.... in order that dharma might be to the Yalahanka-nad prabhu, Immadi-Kempaya-Gauni, and his sons and grandsons in succession, as long as sun and moon cndure,—Guijari Visvanatha had the dharmasala matha built (in the year specified).",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "2\n\nಬೆಂಗಳೂರು ಚಿಕ್ಕಪೇಟೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ತುಗದ ಅಚ್ಚಪ್ಪನ ಮನೆ ಮಗ್ಗಲಲ್ಲಿ ನಟ್ಟಕಲ್ಲಿನಲ್ಲಿ.\n\nಪ್ರಮಾಣ 4’ 2’ 1”.\n\n1\t...ಮತುಯಲಹಂಕ\n2\tನಾಡಪ್ರಭುವುಲೈನಯಿಂಮಡಿಕೆಂ\n3\tಪಯಗೌನಿಅಯವಾರಿಕೆಆಚಂದ್ರಾ\n4\tರ್ಕಂಗಾನುಪುತ್ರಪಾತ್ರಪಾರಂಪರ್ಯಯುಧ\n5\tರ್ಮಂಕೊರಕುಗುಜ್ಜರಿವಿಶ್ಯನಾಥು\n6\tಕಟಂಚಿನಧರ್ಮಶಾಲಮಠಂ\n7\tಶ್ರೀಮುಖಸಂವತ್ಸರವೈಶಾಖಶು\n8\tಧತ್ರಿತಿಯ್ಯಂದು\n(ಮೇಲ್‍ಭಾಗ ಒಡೆದು ಹೋಗಿಧೆ.)",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "1\t...మతుయలహంక\n2\tనాడప్రభువులైనయింమడికెం\n3\tపయగౌనిఅయవారికెఆచంద్రా\n4\tర్కంగానుపుత్రపాత్రపారంపర్యయుధ\n5\tర్మంకొరకుగుజ్జరివిశ్యనాథు\n6\tకటంచినధర్మశాలమఠం\n7\tశ్రీముఖసంవత్సరవైశాఖశు\n8\tధత్రితియ్యందు\n",
        "English_Translation__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "English_Transliteration__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>\n",
