        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "1\t...matuyalahaṃka\n2\tnāḍaprabhuvulainayiṃmaḍikeṃ\n3\tpayagauniayavārikeācaṃdrā\n4\trkaṃgānuputrapātrapāraṃparyayudha\n5\trmaṃkorakugujjariviśyanāthu\n6\tkaṭaṃcinadharmaśālamaṭhaṃ\n7\tśrīmukhasaṃvatsaravaiśākhaśu\n8\tdhatritiyyaṃdu\n",
