        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvXdu24YvlMSJ5GS4m1vblU1ie1TOgHbPhpPMZ13nHou5Pd5igcHzPtVuuaa8rAkoTCj9Gg2A4GXPYUWfrk7UeUgpvA6Mqs3_r9vk7feR_pRa36_1zfBHM4BcZyIiWKQN-SOQHAvH2qsOu7sFsBu3H14CBx8VcaWwjQw81eEoObbk9fyE8wsRRO5elQBa7c3WRurRs?authuser=0&fife=s16383",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "3",
        "Hobli": "Bangalore (Pete & Cantt)",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "In Bangalore, on a stone Manchi-Someshware Temple in Chikkapete (Gosayi Temple )",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "3\nIn Bangalore, on a stone in the GOsdyi's temple in the same pete.\n\n1\tsvastiśrījayābhyūdayaśālivāhanaśakava\n2\trṣaṃgaḷu1777nesariyādarākṣasanāmasaṃ|\n3\tāṣāḍasuddha4guruvāradallupunahaṣaharuka\n4\tsabesomavāradapeṭeyalliruvasiddhagirigosā\n5\tviśiṣyavijayagirigosāviśiṣyabhagavaṃtagirigo\n6\tsāvibeṃgaḷūruvaḷagaḍibegūrutālūkupaiki\n7\ttāvarekeregrāmakkepūrvadikkinalliyiruvadharmadīkṣi\n8\ttarabhaṭamānyadaholakha1870gadekha180\n9\tvaṭhārakaṇatippesahanānudharmādhikṣitaravoṃ\n10\tmaganādaśāṃbhaṭarakaḍeyiṃdākuṃbhaṇirū\n11\tpāyi400nānūrurūpāyigeśuddhakrayakkenā\n12\tnutegadukoṃḍuyiruvabhaṭamānyavaṃnnube\n13\tṃgaḷūruaraḷepeṭegeseridamaṃcisomeśvarasyā\n14\tmigepaḍitaradīpārādhanearcikaparicārakanigu\n15\tsāhacaṃnnāgimāḍatakkaddakkenānutrikaraṇatri\n16\tvācakavāgibhagavatprītiyāgikoṭuyidhene\n17\tīviṣayadallitoṃdarenaḍaśidavarupātaka\n18\tkkevoḷagāgaḷuḷavarusumukhavāginaḍaśi\n19\tdaṃthāvarapādagaḷunannaśirassinalliyiḍu\n20\tteneyaṃdubarasikoṭṭaśilāśāsanasahi||\n21\tsyadattāputtikādhātrīpitṛdattāsahodharīa\n22\tnyadattāsvayaṃmātāvisradattāvasuṃdha\n23\trā||bhagavaṃtagirigosāvirujavū||\n\t\n\t(Maharashtra language)\n\n24\tsidhagirigosiṣyabījagirigosāvi\n25\tcesisabhagavaṃtagiraruju\n",
