      "properties": {
        "name": "Bangalore (Nelamangala)",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 5<br>Hobli: Bangalore (Pete & Cantt)<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: In Bangalore, in Chikkanna's Mango grove by the side of the road to Nelamangala<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1858<br>Inscription Language: Telugu<br>Size: 6'2\"X1'1'<br>Current Status: Yet to verify<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 5<br>Date 1858 A.D.<br>(Telugu) — Date. The tomb of Manapati Venkataramanappa-Nayini of Kalyanadurga in the<br>Rayadurga-samsthana, who attained to the feet of Virupa on the date (specified).<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 5<br><br>ಬೆಂಗಳೂರಿಗೆ ಉತ್ತರ ನೆಲಮಂಗಲದ ರಸ್ತೆಯ ಸಮೀಪ ಚಿಕ್ಕಣ್ಣನ ಮಾವಿನ ತೋಪಿನ ಬಳಿ ಇರುವದು.<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 6’22” 1’1’1”<br><br>1ಶಾಲಿವಾಹನಶಖ<br>2 17√1<br>3 ರಾಯದುರ್ಗಸಂ<br>1ಸ್ಥಾನವುಕಲ್ಯಾಣದು<br>5ರ್ಗಂಮಾನಾವನಿ<br>6ವೆಂಕಟರಮಣ<br>7ಪ್ಪನಾಯಿನಿವಾರಿ<br>8 ಸಮಾಧಿ.ಮೀರುವ<br>9ರುಸದಂವೊಂದಿ<br>10ನದಿಕಾಳಯುಕ್ತಿ<br>11ಸಂ||ಚೈತ್ರ ಬ|| ಇ<br>12ಗುರುವಾರಂ<br>13145__4_1<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Telugu the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 13.055504<br>Longitude: 77.479741<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1858",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Telugu",
        "Size": "6'2\"X1'1'",
        "Current_Status": "Yet to verify",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "5\nDate 1858 A.D.\n(Telugu) — Date. The tomb of Manapati Venkataramanappa-Nayini of Kalyanadurga in the\nRayadurga-samsthana, who attained to the feet of Virupa on the date (specified).",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "5\n\nಬೆಂಗಳೂರಿಗೆ ಉತ್ತರ ನೆಲಮಂಗಲದ ರಸ್ತೆಯ ಸಮೀಪ ಚಿಕ್ಕಣ್ಣನ ಮಾವಿನ ತೋಪಿನ ಬಳಿ ಇರುವದು.\n\nಪ್ರಮಾಣ 6’22” 1’1’1”\n\n1ಶಾಲಿವಾಹನಶಖ\n2 17√1\n3 ರಾಯದುರ್ಗಸಂ\n1ಸ್ಥಾನವುಕಲ್ಯಾಣದು\n5ರ್ಗಂಮಾನಾವನಿ\n6ವೆಂಕಟರಮಣ\n7ಪ್ಪನಾಯಿನಿವಾರಿ\n8 ಸಮಾಧಿ.ಮೀರುವ\n9ರುಸದಂವೊಂದಿ\n10ನದಿಕಾಳಯುಕ್ತಿ\n11ಸಂ||ಚೈತ್ರ ಬ|| ಇ\n12ಗುರುವಾರಂ\n13145__4_1",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Telugu the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !",
        "English_Translation__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "English_Transliteration__Retyped_By": "",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "Photographs_Provided_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
