        "name": "Bangalore (KR Market - Tipu Palace)",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsrD7Ih2LHcWmax_tY3hth5Rq7kAxri4IVnTkV49VZnyMNlDfsGEYH1bSmLfjwMDPsEqqL8kUXi_O_hzBc0m0f-3QnPVYviYJTBw74sKJ3nkSZJZ7vtcwal3gUKlkV-6L7YbI-FNRZVZDytpFhquQe1ZwpdfWaWNAZ5SsOw_n17C-jBqP-8lB1VQo2-5jb4rJHMKT9F3IELKTKAaMlPzro0ICUbvCFfLXf_0I_HTfut4cCw?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 7<br>Hobli: Bangalore (Pete & Cantt)<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: On a stone in the old palace in Bangalore fort.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1791<br>Inscription Language: Persian<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Yet to verify<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 7<br>Date 1791 A.D.<br>(Persian)—As soon as the foundation of this palace was laid, its head was raised to heaven<br>with joy. Oh, what a lofty mansion, a home of happiness, its summit being above the skies. It is a house of glass in purity, all who see it are struck with wonder. In magnificence it rivals the sky,which hangs down its head with shame. The description alone of this palace, when heard by Faridun, caused him to go to his long sleep. I sought by computation according to Zar for the date, and an unseen angel said—\"A house of happiness,\" 1196(1781 A.D.). When the painting of this new palace was finished, it cast the beauty of China into oblivion. I sougbt for this date from Khizir the wise, who said—\"Doubtless it is envied by heaven,\" 1206(1791 A.D.)<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 7<br><br>ಬೆಂಗಳೂರು ಕೋಟೆಯ ಅರಮನೆಯಲಲಿದ್ದ ಕಲ್ಲಿನಲ್ಲಿ.<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.9608745<br>Longitude: 77.5723591<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvkHLry4W74l7_TuqljHIEIkGZGU0c0Vh-hFRiABazCwZLH5Tkm_FN8gf96JgvUwJkhuh4qHMdZ-GqIZzRnxbTYoHsZaTBhxrdhSl1humP8XV_gNbcoVfBKoc3jSiyqKqDLWug7mK9F7kL0nlvTjqz1qChcrREBOeU6GOvuGYOTwdWd8I29RMEiJBG7a1StVedvpYeChVJaAhVHtEq9JpyJtCUVLnZ1oMvbqvtOJ1j2stDA?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtakJFPdYXAC8LClyevbs05EC9d1jPjYPU4RkleyzXSJdp3g_ZgvaB3_ifsVdP0D8pZG1W_TZISRcxx-0RL73qDSI81zF_nn_0jqkuNyvdpRjTFDS9JVb_ATYiIzl5jKCm7SCqtm4iOSB7Cye2SwwNhSeibZqExzkHCLcqqwJWg0mvWGE_3GxbUA9jHjZyBAulu6REC_yIuovigeQEJnao_LDJ0b1Fo9t6nhkVPAaGmzT0L?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvUAxIGK2Os3rBF83-eUo9d15bd7u1f0KbkmXjiRB28184l8DqJUGhkZfzzPSyXg8WuS0SkL5l4UdpbUz36jeGahcjPaswmx0RF07ALx4LwHVypmtmfDKhgTvJmvximnBgiiJbfxQ4eyQ_zHMQGDIfZjis3tGZxXZca0bPywEBysDYQvoX6mobcsi3hAxHGA8WAMKfnbTHf08qvf-bGN5C5gdn7hJ0kr6Kvd8woMphii02j?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvqPPp8ua5wNnpFwypXPUF7hiCd4C-zzRHSpYjkdX1gOQFootVPr9Vaxuk61Kapo0ySp5lPiGksUYT-lp_XmsWuPChY2GuGNYHifQpBA8IOWWpA8ntOT57OPRKZmocShfYD1kKbfOWyu5efFDPubFegmk5fOfn-DdMStIaRNqakVzrCswb5OowJ3Y9iKVK0OJ_xLdWolyh7bX73t_ZzTj8dUs9UhTd1tLSL2u3t8jmfo0GT?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
