      "properties": {
        "name": "Domlur Chokanatha Temple",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsTBICYRyLM_yIQ-hrWRkWBMNVkTH8mMfiAcmBObX4cqPZm_KX4CHVkaH15JA1d5CGLWairuz1q2YKo26msGjgAXWj7nPskKZwAbEA2dAvcYTcpiFwBN9Oh29LfL6Ji8ypLDHO7wCxTzYCTYm3nnzx6gLbe_toHXahEJnENFLS9skXsvhDQlfylhVwg7pdLJRjoCwo?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 9<br>Hobli: Bangalore (Pete & Cantt)<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the same temple, on the door-frame. (Chokkanatha temple.)<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1270<br>Inscription Language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Yet to verify<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 9<br>Date? About 1270 A.D<br>(Tamil)- I, Alagiyar, made.... in the name of... in the temple of Sokkapperumal. These two doors posts are his charity.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 9<br>1.cokka<br>2.perummā<br>3.ḷkō..<br>4.kkān.<br>5.pēril.<br>6.ṇṇinē<br>7. n aḷāki<br>8.yār i<br>9.ntat ti<br>10.ruṉilai<br>11.kāl ira<br>12.ṇṭum iva<br>13.ṉ tanma.<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 9<br><br>ಅದೇ ದೇವಸ್ಥಾನದ ಬಾಗಲ ಚವುಕಟ್ಟಿನ ಕಲ್ಲಿನಮೇಲೆ.<br><br>ಗ್ರಂಥ ಮತ್ತು ಅರವಕ್ಷರ.<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: 9<br>1.சொக்க<br>2.பெரும்மா<br>3.ள்கோ..<br>4.க்காந்.<br>5.பேரில்.<br>6.ண்ணிநே<br>7. ந்அளாகி<br>8.யார்இ<br>9.ந்தத்தி<br>10.ருனிலை<br>11.கால்இர<br>12.ண்டும்இவ<br>13.ன்தந்ம.<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.962491<br>Longitude: 77.635017<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1270",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Grantha & Tamil",
        "Size": "",
        "Current_Status": "Yet to verify",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "9\nDate? About 1270 A.D\n(Tamil)- I, Alagiyar, made.... in the name of... in the temple of Sokkapperumal. These two doors posts are his charity.\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "9\n\nಅದೇ ದೇವಸ್ಥಾನದ ಬಾಗಲ ಚವುಕಟ್ಟಿನ ಕಲ್ಲಿನಮೇಲೆ.\n\nಗ್ರಂಥ ಮತ್ತು ಅರವಕ್ಷರ.",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "9\n1.சொக்க\n2.பெரும்மா\n3.ள்கோ..\n4.க்காந்.\n5.பேரில்.\n6.ண்ணிநே\n7. ந்அளாகி\n8.யார்இ\n9.ந்தத்தி\n10.ருனிலை\n11.கால்இர\n12.ண்டும்இவ\n13.ன்தந்ம.",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
