        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At the same temple, on the door-frame. (Chokkanatha temple.)",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "9\n1.cokka\n2.perummā\n3.ḷkō..\n4.kkān.\n5.pēril.\n6.ṇṇinē\n7. n aḷāki\n8.yār i\n9.ntat ti\n10.ruṉilai\n11.kāl ira\n12.ṇṭum iva\n13.ṉ tanma.",
