        "name": "Domlur Chokanatha Temple",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuyHJLI6vbN_HIE2U1e87iHWg9lplARqRscn9JX3J3ylYdxSi83xp_k9cBTQD55WmrHQHp8S4Ba9VHx21SSgM8M25f52-yrtW2stQQOqABuFFhALo2UCZjeoIP_dHOl-LMCf1v-SCcYQD7lYJ3SRpzXZiuhSBeq8KZrnmO9x7FOMnNA-kaY-UcHflEsgG_Hl6qm6KU?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 12<br>Hobli: Bangalore (Pete & Cantt)<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the same place. (Chokkanatha temple.)<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1300<br>Inscription Language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 12<br>Date ? about 1300 A.D.<br>(Tamil)-(This inscription is mostly gone).<br>This is the daiva-sasana ………………………………………………….. of the followers of different callings. This edit of the carpenters is the ornament of this three worlds………………………………………….<br>The following is the permanent agreement made by all the Panchalas who had assembled, with-out a vacancy in the assembly, in front of the god Sokkapperummal; in the nadus…………………………………….<br><br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 12<br>1.svasti šrī upajīvana katrīṇām samasta vṛutavāsinām akarkaśālām parandaivam phautyamē<br>daivaśāsanam sādanam rathakāraṇam ētat trailōkya bhūṣaṇam<br>samastavā…..………………………………………..<br>2. ttārum samasta pañcāḷattārum cokkapperumāḷ tirumuṉpē kuṟaivarak kūṭi sdira śāsanam<br>paṇṇiṉapaṭi nāṭukaḷil………..<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: 13<br>1.ஸ்வஸ்தி ஸ்ரீ இராஜராஜசோழவளநாட்டு இலைப்பாக்கநாட்டு தொம்பலூரான தேசிமாணிக்க-<br>2.படணத்து திரிபுராந்தகப் பெருமாள் எம்பெ-<br>3.தேவர் கட்டிந் கட்டுபடி இரட்டமாதத்து-<br>4.கு திருவிளகு பண 5<br><br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: Rajagopal Subbiah & <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.96232<br>Longitude: 77.63517<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsv0hMLxvvka32UTm_K9odK-4dpXX5xZZfMLZdJSPmYzQeAfe_h6sABUC-84kvlnrvvZoYI6xfCmMpSVrnmYzNTvMoAg3We8ybWokSbtPN5zmqtMYTGtcOUycxLy6XQqNysUBXotWPzg8Y7_jhpKWHjqYJcw0rp-DDZt3J6I4MUPyN70bncGO-2_OtougRSDrsSmzU?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtTbHA40a0QmfWKio9--GkdLn-wop3mDxr-0j1NdQdHJJEbJQKHifVcKp4MjkpTprfSlEJOUqfuhT4FgTW-yuBdubzB9atwymyR88VnmP7HEw5JydNLUDinZP0EXuTcgyRtX6f5mv5Ma-u930jPZ-NPaM8LNy5S77kBNx7MYj9hD5CF59X13c1JlqlfvsyUYsCeewI?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1300",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Grantha & Tamil",
        "Size": "",
        "Current_Status": "Intact",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "12\nDate ? about 1300 A.D.\n(Tamil)-(This inscription is mostly gone).\nThis is the daiva-sasana ………………………………………………….. of the followers of different callings. This edit of the carpenters is the ornament of this three worlds………………………………………….\nThe following is the permanent agreement made by all the Panchalas who had assembled, with-out a vacancy in the assembly, in front of the god Sokkapperummal; in the nadus…………………………………….\n\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "13\n1.ஸ்வஸ்தி ஸ்ரீ இராஜராஜசோழவளநாட்டு இலைப்பாக்கநாட்டு தொம்பலூரான தேசிமாணிக்க-\n2.படணத்து திரிபுராந்தகப் பெருமாள் எம்பெ-\n3.தேவர் கட்டிந் கட்டுபடி இரட்டமாதத்து-\n4.கு திருவிளகு பண 5\n",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "English_Translation__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "English_Transliteration__Retyped_By": "Rajagopal Subbiah & ",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "Photographs_Provided_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "Latitude": "12.96232",
        "Longitude": "77.63517",
        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuyHJLI6vbN_HIE2U1e87iHWg9lplARqRscn9JX3J3ylYdxSi83xp_k9cBTQD55WmrHQHp8S4Ba9VHx21SSgM8M25f52-yrtW2stQQOqABuFFhALo2UCZjeoIP_dHOl-LMCf1v-SCcYQD7lYJ3SRpzXZiuhSBeq8KZrnmO9x7FOMnNA-kaY-UcHflEsgG_Hl6qm6KU?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsv0hMLxvvka32UTm_K9odK-4dpXX5xZZfMLZdJSPmYzQeAfe_h6sABUC-84kvlnrvvZoYI6xfCmMpSVrnmYzNTvMoAg3We8ybWokSbtPN5zmqtMYTGtcOUycxLy6XQqNysUBXotWPzg8Y7_jhpKWHjqYJcw0rp-DDZt3J6I4MUPyN70bncGO-2_OtougRSDrsSmzU?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtTbHA40a0QmfWKio9--GkdLn-wop3mDxr-0j1NdQdHJJEbJQKHifVcKp4MjkpTprfSlEJOUqfuhT4FgTW-yuBdubzB9atwymyR88VnmP7HEw5JydNLUDinZP0EXuTcgyRtX6f5mv5Ma-u930jPZ-NPaM8LNy5S77kBNx7MYj9hD5CF59X13c1JlqlfvsyUYsCeewI?authuser=0&fife=s16383",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "12",
        "Hobli": "Bangalore (Pete & Cantt)",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At the same place. (Chokkanatha temple.)",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "12\n1.svasti šrī upajīvana katrīṇām samasta vṛutavāsinām akarkaśālām parandaivam phautyamē\ndaivaśāsanam sādanam rathakāraṇam ētat trailōkya bhūṣaṇam\nsamastavā…..………………………………………..\n2. ttārum samasta pañcāḷattārum cokkapperumāḷ tirumuṉpē kuṟaivarak kūṭi sdira śāsanam\npaṇṇiṉapaṭi nāṭukaḷil………..",
