        "name": "Domlur Chokanatha Temple",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvp56eF6YKfDvD9Isafie2alSaPB5guv8oSsdj0w5ydqldO99Ril8YRe7h77SKnCQHLo73xIERi9lC83rMU_YBobZzA4gqIL8zI8trVVjjf0wfQUGOQslIxTEoObycIHg6bXlpvBAluJX1McNhiqfeUtIJDygt4_YDDn_SVP6fmLVdpWDtF9hgjeY3TZGDWwdSpzAo?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 13<br>Hobli: Bangalore (Pete & Cantt)<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the same place. (Chokkanatha temple.)<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1200<br>Inscription Language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 13<br>Date? About 1200 A.D.<br>(Tamil)- According to the stipulation made by Tripirantaka-pperumal Embe-devar of Tombalar, alias Tesimanikka-pattanam, of Illaipakka-nadu in Irajaraja-Sola-vala-nadu, five panams (are sanctioned) for lamps for two months.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 13<br>1.svasti šrī irājarājacōḻavaḷanāṭṭu ilaippākkanāṭṭu tompalūrāṉa tēcimāṇikka-<br>2.paṭaṇattu tiripurāntakap perumāḷ empe-<br>3.tēvar kaṭṭin kaṭṭupaṭi iraṭṭamātattu-<br>4.ku tiruviḷaku paṇa 5<br><br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 10-13<br><br>ಅದೇ ದೇವಸ್ಥಾನದ ತಳಪಾದೀ ಕಲ್ಲುಗಳಲ್ಲಿ.<br><br>ಗ್ರಂಥ ಮತ್ತು ಅರವಕ್ಷರ.<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: 13<br>1.ஸ்வஸ்தி ஸ்ரீ இராஜராஜசோழவளநாட்டு இலைப்பாக்கநாட்டு தொம்பலூரான தேசிமாணிக்க-<br>2.படணத்து திரிபுராந்தகப் பெருமாள் எம்பெ-<br>3.தேவர் கட்டிந் கட்டுபடி இரட்டமாதத்து-<br>4.கு திருவிளகு பண 5<br><br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.96232<br>Longitude: 77.63517<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtUb5W7MEQNQN4Auxbko7hPMjyZ2qfiMTixLnBs27viMRKLOp7T1cN09wHFnGaChy9ldERekTaWs8tNGJLp5Ov8p62h_Bn07-1rAmKW3CrKTvsmxftImGMFboSRiKFzEhUVw7thECdub-m6VPmg6Ef5gHgZR_exEFrSlENHGCGr6w2bogO-AgPW1Lau3a08f2oDaUs?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1200",
