        "Hobli": "Bangalore (Pete & Cantt)",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At the same place. (Chokkanatha temple.)",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "13\n1.svasti šrī irājarājacōḻavaḷanāṭṭu ilaippākkanāṭṭu tompalūrāṉa tēcimāṇikka-\n2.paṭaṇattu tiripurāntakap perumāḷ empe-\n3.tēvar kaṭṭin kaṭṭupaṭi iraṭṭamātattu-\n4.ku tiruviḷaku paṇa 5\n",
        "Name_": "",
        "EC_9_Ht_": "",
        "layer": "The Incredible Inscription Stones of Bengaluru — Bangalore Taluk",
