    {
      "type": "Feature",
      "geometry": {
        "type": "Point",
        "coordinates": [
          77.6271907,
          12.9770992,
          0
        ]
      },
      "properties": {
        "name": "Ulsoor",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvExmybYm-YpKbmPoYlBYg-AgQ2Tt6bjXP8GU7Uqzlo0PgelT_wQ8ma_jn-YcFX0L1zpcRF5vrg7246ZkRpEUPIwUePLWT6u_-rBNaKvz-PcDDudzDfDaQJ438RwCsmGSuhKeEApYm1Uwhfy4XEulibrKJ4__-LM1LCNOmVsFUsynUQ-NIdSs3FN5FkRh3swBrCBhQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 14<br>Hobli: Bangalore (Pete & Cantt)<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Halasur, on the basement of the kalyana-mantapa in the prakara of the Subrahmanya temple.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1821<br>Inscription Language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 14<br><br>Date 1821 A.D<br>(Tamil)-This is the sacred marriage hall built (on the date specified) by Tirukkanam Ayya-mudelayar’s son Vedagiri-mudeliyar for the god sri-Subbaraya-suvamiyar of Alasur. (The same repeated in Telugu).<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 14<br><br>ಹಲಸೂರು ಗ್ರಾಮದಲ್ಲಿ ಸುಬ್ರಹ್ಮಣ್ಯ ದೇವಾಲ್ಯದ ಪ್ರಾಕಾರದಲ್ಲಿ ಕಲ್ಯಾಣ ಮಮಟಪದ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: 14<br>1.ஸ்வஸ்தி ஸ்ரீ சாலிவாகன சகம் 1749 கலியுகாப்தம் 4916 ப்றபவாதி 15 இவ்வருஷம்<br>2.காற்திகை மாதம் 16 தேதி அலசூர் ஸ்ரீ சுப்பராயசுவாமியாருக்கு திருக்கணம் அய்யாமுதலியார் குமாரன்<br>3.வேதகிரிமுதலியார் கட்டிவைத்த் திருக்கலியாணமண்டபம்....... [கன்னடத்தில் 5 சொற்கள்]<br><br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: 14<br>1.svasti šrī cālivākaṉa cakam 1749 kaliyukāptam 4916 pṟapavāti 15 ivvaruṣam<br>2.kāṟtikai mātam 16 tēti alacūr šrī cupparāyacuvāmiyārukku tirukkaṇam ayyāmutaliyār kumāraṉ<br>3.vētakirimutaliyār kaṭṭivaitt tirukkaliyāṇamaṇṭapam ………[few words in Kannada]<br><br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Prashasth Neelakantan <prashasth25@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.9770992<br>Longitude: 77.6271907<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvUTlQjFCG336W5cFYUETYfCUz52zigIeFD7x7g8PfWwf0Fi1XfrXbzapwR-EjBY9lCoVHao25fCAUhPdPhrQkR1SW7afZs14zJATCqCvGZju_G2XrEhylgyj0_d8JcxIcn7UqlDpKtDjkE3yYSiilkbZSyK7G1EJw0So2047v6eK0Nl16pEZnXaKuiU6QN2laHfz8?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKti72NAl6h3_hGUaImIwzFgBlVirhTAesl8HMEwb5d7eoZngzn6wj0Nl3ZURK4JVSRPzLsjaZk18UFSRMTLR5fibPFpB8MF5hQ4ROAkdo4VqD6Z1w4FIltAEBm0vo9nFuKkMukYbTIpB4E1s3wLtTaHoev3R_QeoHrJcWRIgknwLKjhy60RMFBhu3J9qZ_-YL_N4j4?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvFdaXUhYm65VDWgcxAzQ7WEp3EH-gQOlWpnLgFM6I6DSJwvAW1FJ3GKKjZRrLoRAWfFAEuPW2Brf3_UHWvAwMyLHimUdFa_7lNhWg6g7-9mCsnjorO8yuA7jV5SdfCdS-OBnRWNmC_qyMyuXIAK8asJImnomdPOS-HHNqVXUCwADgzogaiRElXykpCxvwSAuZw13Y?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1821",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Grantha & Tamil",
        "Size": "",
        "Current_Status": "Intact",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "14\n\nDate 1821 A.D\n(Tamil)-This is the sacred marriage hall built (on the date specified) by Tirukkanam Ayya-mudelayar’s son Vedagiri-mudeliyar for the god sri-Subbaraya-suvamiyar of Alasur. (The same repeated in Telugu).\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "14\n\nಹಲಸೂರು ಗ್ರಾಮದಲ್ಲಿ ಸುಬ್ರಹ್ಮಣ್ಯ ದೇವಾಲ್ಯದ ಪ್ರಾಕಾರದಲ್ಲಿ ಕಲ್ಯಾಣ ಮಮಟಪದ",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "14\n1.ஸ்வஸ்தி ஸ்ரீ சாலிவாகன சகம் 1749 கலியுகாப்தம் 4916 ப்றபவாதி 15 இவ்வருஷம்\n2.காற்திகை மாதம் 16 தேதி அலசூர் ஸ்ரீ சுப்பராயசுவாமியாருக்கு திருக்கணம் அய்யாமுதலியார் குமாரன்\n3.வேதகிரிமுதலியார் கட்டிவைத்த் திருக்கலியாணமண்டபம்....... [கன்னடத்தில் 5 சொற்கள்]\n",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "English_Translation__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "English_Transliteration__Retyped_By": "14\n1.svasti šrī cālivākaṉa cakam 1749 kaliyukāptam 4916 pṟapavāti 15 ivvaruṣam\n2.kāṟtikai mātam 16 tēti alacūr šrī cupparāyacuvāmiyārukku tirukkaṇam ayyāmutaliyār kumāraṉ\n3.vētakirimutaliyār kaṭṭivaitt tirukkaliyāṇamaṇṭapam ………[few words in Kannada]\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "Photographs_Provided_By": "Prashasth Neelakantan <prashasth25@gmail.com>",
        "Latitude": "12.9770992",
        "Longitude": "77.6271907",
        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvExmybYm-YpKbmPoYlBYg-AgQ2Tt6bjXP8GU7Uqzlo0PgelT_wQ8ma_jn-YcFX0L1zpcRF5vrg7246ZkRpEUPIwUePLWT6u_-rBNaKvz-PcDDudzDfDaQJ438RwCsmGSuhKeEApYm1Uwhfy4XEulibrKJ4__-LM1LCNOmVsFUsynUQ-NIdSs3FN5FkRh3swBrCBhQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvUTlQjFCG336W5cFYUETYfCUz52zigIeFD7x7g8PfWwf0Fi1XfrXbzapwR-EjBY9lCoVHao25fCAUhPdPhrQkR1SW7afZs14zJATCqCvGZju_G2XrEhylgyj0_d8JcxIcn7UqlDpKtDjkE3yYSiilkbZSyK7G1EJw0So2047v6eK0Nl16pEZnXaKuiU6QN2laHfz8?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKti72NAl6h3_hGUaImIwzFgBlVirhTAesl8HMEwb5d7eoZngzn6wj0Nl3ZURK4JVSRPzLsjaZk18UFSRMTLR5fibPFpB8MF5hQ4ROAkdo4VqD6Z1w4FIltAEBm0vo9nFuKkMukYbTIpB4E1s3wLtTaHoev3R_QeoHrJcWRIgknwLKjhy60RMFBhu3J9qZ_-YL_N4j4?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvFdaXUhYm65VDWgcxAzQ7WEp3EH-gQOlWpnLgFM6I6DSJwvAW1FJ3GKKjZRrLoRAWfFAEuPW2Brf3_UHWvAwMyLHimUdFa_7lNhWg6g7-9mCsnjorO8yuA7jV5SdfCdS-OBnRWNmC_qyMyuXIAK8asJImnomdPOS-HHNqVXUCwADgzogaiRElXykpCxvwSAuZw13Y?authuser=0&fife=s16383",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "14",
        "Hobli": "Bangalore (Pete & Cantt)",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At Halasur, on the basement of the kalyana-mantapa in the prakara of the Subrahmanya temple.",
