    {
      "type": "Feature",
      "geometry": {
        "type": "Point",
        "coordinates": [
          77.6241891,
          12.9756739,
          0
        ]
      },
      "properties": {
        "name": "Ulsoor",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKs5Sc3RLyYCObgXfn_uZeHUNI7vzWY_WUATrQV99eXGq43RpzhiPse5xN8lw11NKq2EZBdWyWam4gon8TDoJJxdfwRfhBfLnFXUicVOGsB4-XqqZmANRryusVEFP5IM7gJK4AWPXXBRAZLkZU_4ElLi6ui51lz-LgG5WtqCtw_a_OuGxZFRW_ENPR7oAQrLXnVinQM_?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 15<br>Hobli: Bangalore (Pete & Cantt)<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the same village, on a stone set up by the side of the house presented to the Somesvara temple by Saranga Sabhapati Mudaliar.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1876<br>Inscription Language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: 3'X1'2\"<br>Current Status: Yet to verify<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 15<br><br>Date 1876 A.D<br>(Tamil)- (On the date specified), the pensioner Sarangu Sadupperi Sabapati-mudeliyar made a gift of this house for the festival in Karttiagai of the god Sri-Somesvara-suvami who has been please to reside in Arasa-ma-nagaram<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 16<br> At yelahanka (Yelahanka hobli), at the base of Garuda-kambha in front of the Gopala-Krishna<br>Svasti sri S’aka-varsha savirada munura muvatta murane Vikriti-samvastarada Bhadrapada-sudha-trydasiyu Gurvaradalu rajadhiraja raja-paramesvara sri-ira-Deva-Raya-Odeyaru sakalasambrajyavan aluva kaladalu Bommanna-ayyagala dharmada sasanada Bammanna-Settiya magaz Macharusa-Settiyaru madisidaz dipa-maleya-kambhakke mangala maha sri<br><br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 15<br>ಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮದಲ್ಲಿ ಸರಂಗ ಸಭಾಪತಿ ಮೊದಲಿಯಾರ್ರು ಸೋಮೇಶ್ವರ ದೇವಸ್ಥಾನಕ್ಕೆ<br>ಧರ್ಮವಾಗಿ ಕೊಟ್ಟ ಮನೆ ಪಕ್ಕದಲ್ಲಿ ನೆಟ್ಟಕಲ್ಲು.<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: சாலிவாகன சக ௵ <br>(1799) க்கு சரியான <br>தாத்ரு ௵ ஆனி ௴ <br>11௳ யில் திரு அரச <br>மாநகரத்திலெழுந்<br>தருளியிரா நின்ற ஶ்ரீ<br>சோமேஸ்வர சுவா <br>மியின் கார்த்திகை <br>வுச்சவத்துக்காக <br>பென்சன் சராங்கு <br>சதுப்பேரி சபாபதி<br>முதலியார் வைத்த<br>வீடு தற்மம்<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Ebinesan Jones<br>Latitude: 12.9756739<br>Longitude: 77.6241891<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuWYdQBbfaA5mPjGJkBUGUWSE0QtDKtcUhu8WXYBP6GTn7YTIVN9FXApNUyWOxv22cd7jmBJuYWPkYPqMpzLWQssFOrwSnhpQUuxyVBv3eDJB3E83ul55Wx3kQgH9kTKUmZGKXrISutgmAnvDWruwPNHiUIXIEafCr3pAFFEJmKVSfURdLcWREFoReYyTMDyB4CMpM?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvOaItgNJpdXVxndTKZON-ZspIG-UX1QMrTqqlY8GnKV087kahqb9HC4Y4rkJoI0lh_7PvHhPlrWwAocZaOcmZsq9jTOFU7ybFOQYklncvT69BmWE9xG8ymqQxz4hzpyuuof5Wf-Hf_VGGp4N4Vs-TFd8PO0zoK_h7aNMC7qq9Yfj_S3bLHunHRdMM37KLjIXJb8l19yOlH6zOdzPT9WFNsyV345ENuB5wp72Ilk5Xm_OKI?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtXCBSopev2WJFQqbEUDocOv7f_Xzpv2tLnoX1nD26r-W-DkFVbSOUgCCTGGScwxRwHuD9_O2ao0igHDrQAH0Jf1RK8Obej_2V-glSrt0Wt-trcy_Y6EXVzSWSuqt5VEldklPHYPyLFiS0syfHG-LIHnFvAAkr2hEWQ74iXtbQOYHqnASIgiSgdheb4A5nrswBcHUHAnwubt9HgybhQo-7dfEUwu2xkY_ifV_v4TvugAijv?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
