      "properties": {
        "name": "Yelahanka ",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsrlHCK4IgvreHHj7xgj0I1X36jsfov_1XWGbyWEr5EPq9-bcu57Kda7FVb4OUlCBk6NvaURv6844HxX0TSeQn0FWIrW0L7ikI15lVZVOaIbagH-dWDOXl6gmEXLhB-KDttM3DigZXyIRz1k568L9p7no8ngOeCXkwrkWXxvZKQlWK8X-THJSIxzgf6S515pyLRVSDi?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 16<br>Hobli: Yelahanka Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Yelahanka (Yelahahka hobli), at the base of Garuda-Kambha in front of the GopalaKrishna temple in fort.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1410<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: unknown<br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 16<br><br>Date 1410 A.D<br>Be it well. (On the date specified), at the time when the rajadhiraja raja-paramesvara vira-Deva-Raya-Odeyar was ruling the whole empire;- Bommasanna-Setti’s son Machirusa-Setti had this depamale pillar made.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 16<br><br>yalahaṃkada hobal̤i yalahaṃkada koṭĕyalli gopalakṛṣṇa devasthānada mumadĕgaruḍa kaṃbada buḍadalli.<br><br>1. svastiśrīśakavarṣasāviradamūnū__mūvatta mū__nĕ<br>2. vikrutisaṃvatsaradabhādrapadaśuddhatrayodaśĕyūgu<br>3. ruvāradalurājādhirājaparameśvaraśrī<br>4. vīradevarāyŏḍĕyarusakalasāṃbrājyava<br>5. nāl̤uvakāladalubŏṃmaṃṇayyagal̤a<br>6. dhaṃmrmadaśasāṇadaṃbamaṃṇnasĕṭṭayamagamācĕrū<br>7. śasĕṭṭayarumāḍisidadīpamālĕyakaṃbhakkĕ maṃgal̤amahāśrī<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team<br>svastiśrī śakavarṣa sāviṟada mūnūṟa mūvatamūṟanĕ<br>vikruta saṃvadarada bādrapada śuddha trayodaśĕyū gu<br>ruvāradalu rājadhirāja rājaparameśvara śrī<br>vīradevarāya ŏḍĕyaru sakala sāṃbrājyava<br>nāl̤uva kāladalu bŏṃmaṃṇa ayyagal̤a<br>dhaṃrmma daśagāṇada bŏmaṃṇnasĕṭṭiya maga mācĕrū<br>śa sĕṭṭiyaru māḍisida dīpamālĕya kaṃbhakkĕ maṃgal̤a mahāśrī<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 16<br><br>ಯಲಹಂಕದ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಯಲಹಂಕದ ಕೋಟೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಗೋಪಲಕೃಷ್ಣ ದೇವಸ್ಥಾನದ ಮುಮದೆಗರುಡ ಕಂಬದ ಬುಡದಲ್ಲಿ.<br><br>1. ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಶಕವರ್ಷಸಾವಿರದಮೂನೂ__ಮೂವತ್ತ ಮೂ__ನೆ<br>2. ವಿಕ್ರುತಿಸಂವತ್ಸರದಭಾದ್ರಪದಶುದ್ಧತ್ರಯೋದಶೆಯೂಗು<br>3. ರುವಾರದಲುರಾಜಾಧಿರಾಜಪರಮೇಶ್ವರಶ್ರೀ<br>4. ವೀರದೇವರಾಯೊಡೆಯರುಸಕಲಸಾಂಬ್ರಾಜ್ಯವ<br>5. ನಾಳುವಕಾಲದಲುಬೊಂಮಂಣಯ್ಯಗಳ<br>6. ಧಂಮ್ರ್ಮದಶಸಾಣದಂಬಮಂಣ್ನಸೆಟ್ಟಯಮಗಮಾಚೆರೂ<br>7. ಶಸೆಟ್ಟಯರುಮಾಡಿಸಿದದೀಪಮಾಲೆಯಕಂಭಕ್ಕೆ ಮಂಗಳಮಹಾಶ್ರೀ<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team<br>ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀ ಶಕವರ್ಷ ಸಾವಿಱದ ಮೂನೂಱ ಮೂವತಮೂಱನೆ<br>ವಿಕ್ರುತ ಸಂವದರದ ಬಾದ್ರಪದ ಶುದ್ಧ ತ್ರಯೋದಶೆಯೂ ಗು<br>ರುವಾರದಲು ರಾಜಧಿರಾಜ ರಾಜಪರಮೇಶ್ವರ ಶ್ರೀ<br>ವೀರದೇವರಾಯ ಒಡೆಯರು ಸಕಲ ಸಾಂಬ್ರಾಜ್ಯವ<br>ನಾಳುವ ಕಾಲದಲು ಬೊಂಮಂಣ ಅಯ್ಯಗಳ<br>ಧಂರ್ಮ್ಮ ದಶಗಾಣದ ಬೊಮಂಣ್ನಸೆಟ್ಟಿಯ ಮಗ ಮಾಚೆರೂ<br>ಶ ಸೆಟ್ಟಿಯರು ಮಾಡಿಸಿದ ದೀಪಮಾಲೆಯ ಕಂಭಕ್ಕೆ ಮಂಗಳ ಮಹಾಶ್ರೀ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 13.10267<br>Longitude: 77.59369<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuuGVDeb6voFq6SaIbcINhzi6L6TWeL-R2s4SOlLPpf9eoKEMeI-P2tMRC1GMixXOeayNhLigZ67x1wHrU2xU1kn5vfPbhKYnnpf0FqKDhHgZhh330IcGaamCcTphe6oSBT3t8qmByD_uZqAcXEyEpcAX_ERmR2zyuiLlF_6cFnldp2n92VXG97tEGwssNUCuu6189L?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsjgsgrGYOJ5W2NtQ8hJCiPXvC7pv0Y8HAkvVsuEefO0AlfLz5lhUYO5j176KdzLQWRUf6QukJ4Up0k2ivfut5qFkq8GJ5nofJpS-HsdrI6gltE9nVfAvYZkH7LGdfk5YBo9Ob66fRLAfyWYRMBlDtrwSJsBuvA9gKsuOqFcbBF06zdlb8Z8EEXjnkw_XJn1NMr3zQI?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
