        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKt8BYBb-imgoyQBKDRqHm_eJmj1KaPOKyAVOrqHY7gtvg_TdPi47Ioqb-31BivuCCZncvBmoV4mJtA_dCRoXyDBjTGGRSo1t0xGipmSMoOrrrh-zs8K3z4bCM0xT_WFjQU6sgr3PVQazktLTP6GLJM7HpCsykhhBhkNQ2xnADUhCxPSNTaoAw5EXskTnkfTZwgD6zY?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 17<br>Hobli: Yelahanka Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: Garudakamba in the prakara of GopalaKrishna Temple, Yelahanka<br>Installation Date: Not dated<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: Not given in the EC.<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 17<br><br>ade grāmada koṭĕyalli gopālakṛṣṇa devasthānada prākāradallina garuḍa kaṃbhada buḍadalli.<br><br>1 parābhavasaṃva<br>2 tsaradārśavījaku10<br>3 kikĕlikĕṃparājai£<br>4 paramagakaṃṭhīra<br>5 varasanavarasāvĕ<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team<br>parābhava saṃva<br>tsarada āsvija śu 10<br>kikeri kĕṃparājaina<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 17<br><br>ಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮದ ಕೋಟೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಗೋಪಾಲಕೃಷ್ಣ ದೇವಸ್ಥಾನದ ಪ್ರಾಕಾರದಲ್ಲಿನ ಗರುಡ ಕಂಭದ ಬುಡದಲ್ಲಿ.<br><br>1 ಪರಾಭವಸಂವ<br>2 ತ್ಸರದಾರ್ಶವೀಜಕು10<br>3 ಕಿಕೆಲಿಕೆಂಪರಾಜೈ£<br>4 ಪರಮಗಕಂಠೀರ<br>5 ವರಸನವರಸಾವೆ<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team<br>ಪರಾಭವ ಸಂವ<br>ತ್ಸರದ ಆಸ್ವಿಜ ಶು ೧೦<br>ಕಿಕೇರಿ ಕೆಂಪರಾಜೈನ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 13.1026596<br>Longitude: 77.5936565<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuc1FsWsDMHBijdMqcUEZqnD7qoWON_HVsWsZbTgQ1CmlYWt_kSGKneOsipcsSkqb2VVfD3cUs5mag4753_p3pLr7qRH0jZknuzdv2ybQKsAunKOR_CJUjOlaiX6ITz5y7Ge_lfiF0XEO-Ytw7XQ1aiKsoX1xKJjFjPCXeVr-7zxcWZkOFbNycheFyyWG6zIECOKqo?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
        "tessellate": "-1",
