        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "Not given in the EC.",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "17\n\nಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮದ ಕೋಟೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಗೋಪಾಲಕೃಷ್ಣ ದೇವಸ್ಥಾನದ ಪ್ರಾಕಾರದಲ್ಲಿನ ಗರುಡ ಕಂಭದ ಬುಡದಲ್ಲಿ.\n\n1 ಪರಾಭವಸಂವ\n2 ತ್ಸರದಾರ್ಶವೀಜಕು10\n3 ಕಿಕೆಲಿಕೆಂಪರಾಜೈ£\n4 ಪರಮಗಕಂಠೀರ\n5 ವರಸನವರಸಾವೆ\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team\nಪರಾಭವ ಸಂವ\nತ್ಸರದ ಆಸ್ವಿಜ ಶು ೧೦\nಕಿಕೇರಿ ಕೆಂಪರಾಜೈನ",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "English_Translation__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "English_Transliteration__Retyped_By": "",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "Photographs_Provided_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "Latitude": "13.1026596",
        "Longitude": "77.5936565",
        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKt8BYBb-imgoyQBKDRqHm_eJmj1KaPOKyAVOrqHY7gtvg_TdPi47Ioqb-31BivuCCZncvBmoV4mJtA_dCRoXyDBjTGGRSo1t0xGipmSMoOrrrh-zs8K3z4bCM0xT_WFjQU6sgr3PVQazktLTP6GLJM7HpCsykhhBhkNQ2xnADUhCxPSNTaoAw5EXskTnkfTZwgD6zY?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuc1FsWsDMHBijdMqcUEZqnD7qoWON_HVsWsZbTgQ1CmlYWt_kSGKneOsipcsSkqb2VVfD3cUs5mag4753_p3pLr7qRH0jZknuzdv2ybQKsAunKOR_CJUjOlaiX6ITz5y7Ge_lfiF0XEO-Ytw7XQ1aiKsoX1xKJjFjPCXeVr-7zxcWZkOFbNycheFyyWG6zIECOKqo?authuser=0&fife=s16383",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "17",
        "Hobli": "Yelahanka Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "Garudakamba in the prakara of GopalaKrishna Temple, Yelahanka",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "17\n\nade grāmada koṭĕyalli gopālakṛṣṇa devasthānada prākāradallina garuḍa kaṃbhada buḍadalli.\n\n1 parābhavasaṃva\n2 tsaradārśavījaku10\n3 kikĕlikĕṃparājai£\n4 paramagakaṃṭhīra\n5 varasanavarasāvĕ\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team\nparābhava saṃva\ntsarada āsvija śu 10\nkikeri kĕṃparājaina",
