        "name": "Yelahanka",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtccxFw5m7sM17s9AeHbzhOqaHUkCKeialvzMo7jqIyvpWHLtFzhvu30mgdUGv6oZzZG-ZFwnlHHpdP-htckXhekeg32WnrS5ArROGEonVNng7WlIFfb-3iC7QjyzYXolR1vensy-dYCAl-1Rf_kK_CB1e8KUW0_sxCSRKcyrON_xfMKg7EecMBHeku2jLmbBI7zRI?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 18<br>Hobli: Yelahanka Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the same village, on a stone lying near Hanumnathappas field to the south-west. <br>Installation Date: 01/01/1303<br>Inscription Language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: 5'X2'6\"<br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 18<br>Date ? 1303 A.D<br>(Tamil) – (This inscription is mostly gone).<br>While the (maha) mandalesvara, (Tribhu) vanamalla ……………………………….. (on the date specified) set up this stone…………….<br><br><br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 18<br>1.svasti šrīmanu……<br>2.maṇṭaḷēśvaran……..<br>3.ṉamalla…..<br>4.varā… nāna tamma……<br>5.paṟkaṭṭikkup pari…..<br>6.ṭetta laveṉa……<br>7.kaṉa ta kaṇṭika….<br>8.māraṉ maṇtētti.<br>9.cōpakiruti sammaca….<br>10.ttu cittirai māta…..<br>11.nāḷ ikkallu nāṭṭi.<br>12.ḷ vēḷāṇṭatti vuṭa<br>13.mai.<br><br>English retyped text provided by S. Rajagopal <srgopal1950@gmail.com> & <br>S Paranthaman <paranthaman26@gmail.com><br><br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 18<br><br>ಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮದ ನೈರುತ್ಯಮೂಲೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಹನುಮಂತನ ಹೊಲದಬಳಿ ಬಿದ್ದಿರುವದು.<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 5’ 2” <br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: 18<br>1.ஸ்வஸ்ததி ஸ்ரீமந……<br>2.மண்டளளேச0வரந……..<br>3.னமல்ல…..<br>4.வரர… நரந தம்ம……<br>5.பற்கட்டிக்குப் பரதி…..<br>6.டடத்த லடவன……<br>7.கன த கண்டிக….<br>8.மரரன் மண்ளதத்ததி.<br>9.ளசரபகதிருததி ஸம்மச….<br>10.த்து சதித்ததிரர மரத…..<br>11.நரள் இக்கல்லு நரட்டி.<br>12.ள் ளவளேரண்டத்ததி வுட<br>13.ரம.<br><br>Tamil retyped text provided by S. Rajagopal <srgopal1950@gmail.com> & <br>S Paranthaman <paranthaman26@gmail.com><br><br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 13.1017739<br>Longitude: 77.5909548<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1303",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Grantha & Tamil",
        "Size": "5'X2'6\"",
        "Current_Status": "Not traceable",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "18\nDate ? 1303 A.D\n(Tamil) – (This inscription is mostly gone).\nWhile the (maha) mandalesvara, (Tribhu) vanamalla ……………………………….. (on the date specified) set up this stone…………….\n\n\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "18\n\nಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮದ ನೈರುತ್ಯಮೂಲೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಹನುಮಂತನ ಹೊಲದಬಳಿ ಬಿದ್ದಿರುವದು.\n\nಪ್ರಮಾಣ 5’ 2” ",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "18\n1.ஸ்வஸ்ததி ஸ்ரீமந……\n2.மண்டளளேச0வரந……..\n3.னமல்ல…..\n4.வரர… நரந தம்ம……\n5.பற்கட்டிக்குப் பரதி…..\n6.டடத்த லடவன……\n7.கன த கண்டிக….\n8.மரரன் மண்ளதத்ததி.\n9.ளசரபகதிருததி ஸம்மச….\n10.த்து சதித்ததிரர மரத…..\n11.நரள் இக்கல்லு நரட்டி.\n12.ள் ளவளேரண்டத்ததி வுட\n13.ரம.\n\nTamil retyped text provided by S. Rajagopal <srgopal1950@gmail.com> & \nS Paranthaman <paranthaman26@gmail.com>\n",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "English_Translation__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "English_Transliteration__Retyped_By": "",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
