        "Latitude": "13.1017739",
        "Longitude": "77.5909548",
        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtccxFw5m7sM17s9AeHbzhOqaHUkCKeialvzMo7jqIyvpWHLtFzhvu30mgdUGv6oZzZG-ZFwnlHHpdP-htckXhekeg32WnrS5ArROGEonVNng7WlIFfb-3iC7QjyzYXolR1vensy-dYCAl-1Rf_kK_CB1e8KUW0_sxCSRKcyrON_xfMKg7EecMBHeku2jLmbBI7zRI?authuser=0&fife=s16383",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "18",
        "Hobli": "Yelahanka Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At the same village, on a stone lying near Hanumnathappas field to the south-west. ",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "18\n1.svasti šrīmanu……\n2.maṇṭaḷēśvaran……..\n3.ṉamalla…..\n4.varā… nāna tamma……\n5.paṟkaṭṭikkup pari…..\n6.ṭetta laveṉa……\n7.kaṉa ta kaṇṭika….\n8.māraṉ maṇtētti.\n9.cōpakiruti sammaca….\n10.ttu cittirai māta…..\n11.nāḷ ikkallu nāṭṭi.\n12.ḷ vēḷāṇṭatti vuṭa\n13.mai.\n\nEnglish retyped text provided by S. Rajagopal <srgopal1950@gmail.com> & \nS Paranthaman <paranthaman26@gmail.com>\n",
        "Name_": "",
        "EC_9_Ht_": "",
        "layer": "The Incredible Inscription Stones of Bengaluru — Bangalore Taluk",
