      "properties": {
        "name": "Chikka Bettahali ",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKt8DdQ5dQXqueaP9RNeXdxCZW-zCA1xc5Ki7XiaUAjVFSe70vM2E_VYZ7fK9LgGL6OT6lA44lF4tpr9s_r-Ank6O8y2UmzaBnbzZnc3nw5LeEVNZ-86Q3A8ue_1tFi2Z0pn4Te6-KX1gQiDfSBvM189IWodBqx-iP7dQUGHg5BI-PEqbsP1NAd0celuPe16a36Hvlhp?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 19 & Bengaluru ithihasa vaibhava issue 1 Singapura ( https://archive.org/details/singapura-itihaasa-vaibhava-nov-2021-english/page/29/mode/1up )<br>Hobli: Yelahanka Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Chikka Bettahalli (same hobli), on a stone to the south of the Hanumata temple.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1524<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 6'2\"X2'4\"<br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 19<br><br>Date 1524 A.D.<br><br>May it be prosperous. (In the year specified) , in the time of Krishna-Raya, - Singapa- Nayaka granted for the offerings to the god in Singapura, the Chiga Bettahalli (village), to Hiriaya Varada- rajaya, son of Timmanayya of Pattana, of the Ramanuja-kuta.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 19<br> At Chikka Bettahalli (same hobli), on a stone to the south of the Hanumanta temle.<br>Subham astu Tarana-samvastarada Maragasira-su 1 lu Krishna-Rayara kaladalli Singapa-Nayakaru Singapuradali iruvanta devara amrita-padiya navivedyakke Ramanuja-kutakke Pattana-Timmnayyanavara makkalu Hiriaya Varadarajayanavarige Chiga Bethahalliyanu bittev agiy idharmmakke (usual imprecatory phrases).<br><br>Re-Reading from <br>The Mythic Society Bengaluru Inscriptions 3D Digital Conservation Team<br>1 śubhamastu<br>2 tāraṇa sa0vatsarada mārgaṣi<br>3 ra śu 1 lu kriṣṇarāyara kāladali<br>4 siṃgapanāyakaru siṃgāpurada tiru<br>5 malĕdevara amrutapaḍiya naivedyakkĕ<br>6 rāmānujakūṭṭakkĕ paṭṭaṇa tiṃmmaṇayya<br>7 navara makkal̤u hiriāya varadarāja<br>8 yanavarigĕ cigabĕṭhahal̤iyanu bi<br>9 ṭĕvagi yi dharmakkĕ āru āl̤i<br>10 pidavaru gaṃgĕya taḍi<br>11 yalli kapilĕya vadisida papa<br>12 kkĕ hoharu yi tiruvĕṃgal̤anā<br>13 ta dānada yi dharmakkĕ tapidoru<br>14 taṃma taṃdĕtāya kāśiya<br>15 li kŏṃdavaru <br><br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: E C Reading -<br>19<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಚಿಕ್ಕ ಬೆಟ್ಟಹಳ್ಳಿ ಗ್ರಾಮದ ಹನುಮಂತ ದೇವಾಲ್ಯದ ಬಲಗಡೆ ನೆಟ್ಟಿರುವ ಕಲ್ಲು.<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 6’ 2” x 2’ 4”<br><br>1\tಶುಭಮಸ್ತು<br>2\tತಾರಣಸಂವತ್ಸರದಮಾರ್ಗಸಿ<br>3\tರಶು1ಲುಕ್ರಿಷ್ಣರಾಯರಕಾಲದಲಿ<br>4\tಸಿಂಗಪನಾಯಕರುಸಿಂಗಾಪುರದಲಿರು<br>5\tವಂತದೇವರಮೃತಪಡಿಯನೈವೇದ್ಯಕ್ಕೆ<br>6\tರಾಮಾನುಜಕೂಟಕ್ಕೆ ಪಟ್ಟಣತಿಂಮಣಯ್ಯ<br>7\tನವರಮಕ್ಕಳುಹಿರಿಆಯವರದರಾಜ<br>8\tಯನವರಿಗೆಚಿಗಬೆಠಹಳ್ಳಿಯನುಬಿ<br>9\tಟ್ಟೆವಾಗಿಯೀಧಮ್ರ್ಮಕ್ಕೆಆರುಆಳಿ<br>10\tಪಿದವರುಗಂಗೆಯತಡಿ<br>11\tಯಲಿಕಪಿಲೆಯವಧಿಸಿದಷಾಪ<br>12\tಕ್ಕೆಹೋಹರುಯೀತಿರುವೆಂಗಳ . .<br>13\t. . . ಯೀಧರ್ಮಕ್ಕೆ ತಪ್ಪಿದವರು<br>14\tತಂಮತಂದೆತಾಯಿಕಾಶಿ<br>15\tಲಿಕೊಂದವರು ||<br><br><br>Re-Reading from <br>The Mythic Society Bengaluru Inscriptions 3D Digital Conservation Team<br>1. ಶುಭಮಸ್ತು<br>2. ತಾರಣ ಸ೦ವತ್ಸರದ ಮಾರ್ಗಷಿ<br><br>3. ರ ಶು ೧ಲು ಕ್ರಿಷ್ಣರಾಯರ ಕಾಲದಲಿ<br><br>4. ಸಿಂಗಪನಾಯಕರು ಸಿಂಗಾಪುರದ ತಿರು<br><br>5. ಮಲೆ ದೆವರ ಅಮ್ರುತಪಡಿಯ ನೈವೆದ್ಯಕ್ಕೆ<br><br>6. ರಾಮಾನುಜಕೂಟ್ಟಕ್ಕೆ ಪಟ್ಟಣ ತಿಂಮ್ಮಣಯ್ಯ<br><br>7. ನವರ ಮಕ್ಕಳು ಹಿರಿಆಯ ವರದರಾಜ<br><br>8. ಯನವರಿಗೆ ಚಿಗಬೆಠಹಳಿಯನು ಬಿ<br><br>9. ಟೆವಗಿ ಯಿ ದ್ರಮಕ್ಕೆ ಆರು ಆಳಿ<br><br>10. ಪಿದವರು ಗಂಗೆಯ ತಡಿ<br><br>11. ಯಲ್ಲಿ ಕಪಿಲೆಯ ವದಿಸಿದ ಪಪ<br><br>12. ಕ್ಕೆ ಹೋಹರು ಯಿ ತಿರುವೆಂಗಳನಾ<br><br>13. ತ ದಾನದ ಯಿ ದ್ರಮಕ್ಕೆ ತಪಿದೊರು<br><br>14. ಥಂಮ ತಂದೆತಾಯ ಕಾಶಿಯ<br><br>15. ಲಿ ಕೊಂದವರು<br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br><br>The Mythic Society Bengaluru Inscriptions 3D Digital Conservation Team<br><br>Latitude: 13.08967<br>Longitude: 77.55332<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKv9PzOZQ_2TaYMbKfLsx69IwdlA8SEFAjCCksuy9s0ngsDp_l-hCSPTnLnqiq-vez1XX94URrztSWFfjrwc9l-3rukSV_wZK4ShPDHQAVwf9wbd3wNQM5FlAKIkkqo3JPuub7-hythsaBNabAV9Z4SLJ5cK716BegShzbfxnQsXoN6QoKVLTs-h0jJzMDmVoZYs2vEB?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsTdD46gVnwNmyh0goqTfasG06f-HRCPh5JJB5ZHmL5DHjzQLSu02e0FB4Mvpk_fcG78_2Zo0dLG0FkBAH5_6_RDTEKRSiIFESRWCLxjt6jMcl4q7HWCYNQkjvfSRHWaiEWA7rxCVGm6xfmrmHeSU0JhDqby4-PWcCj3xbg4i_ChFWDcoId8TqPjwNDTwE7mTbd1NE?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsHVW3P7sy3Z0fclTiMR2GlhAMkE0xkcE0O_seaja-jBN_EPJPwhFYzwZnfS22g-GjsRdVfXsL5iwZHpuMC_f-LU8lBlY5CTx1Zo7qCEXGh0NFQKgP9i4t09vOD16fdumZvKMuzVWADpGqZLBe5hZPMVKEKWsxNAjmAzUBXgr2Aycbh8EGtVEbv8CVvytspygw1OSQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsLJsbdZ0dxv_W0uDNnbXP97ZaUfXw9SxfLEGaAOHoC95Pmy6K3fA2JtO_G0rZv_8cm97gURclMHexWAGRj7vRr2MyGL3qP7AvOJJt0UAK27Us4FXcWPTh63tfHJNwirMCtq-auPtBH97PazboqAvZtv0G-OYbpNiiC9e724z4nKAmZP-J87V544gWa14sapwcFywI?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
