        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "19 & Bengaluru ithihasa vaibhava issue 1 Singapura ( https://archive.org/details/singapura-itihaasa-vaibhava-nov-2021-english/page/29/mode/1up )",
        "Hobli": "Yelahanka Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At Chikka Bettahalli (same hobli), on a stone to the south of the Hanumata temple.",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "19\n At Chikka Bettahalli (same hobli), on a stone to the south of the Hanumanta temle.\nSubham astu Tarana-samvastarada Maragasira-su 1 lu Krishna-Rayara kaladalli Singapa-Nayakaru Singapuradali iruvanta devara amrita-padiya navivedyakke Ramanuja-kutakke Pattana-Timmnayyanavara makkalu Hiriaya Varadarajayanavarige Chiga Bethahalliyanu bittev agiy idharmmakke (usual imprecatory phrases).\n\nRe-Reading from \nThe Mythic Society Bengaluru Inscriptions 3D Digital Conservation Team\n1 śubhamastu\n2 tāraṇa sa0vatsarada mārgaṣi\n3 ra śu 1 lu kriṣṇarāyara kāladali\n4 siṃgapanāyakaru siṃgāpurada tiru\n5 malĕdevara amrutapaḍiya naivedyakkĕ\n6 rāmānujakūṭṭakkĕ paṭṭaṇa tiṃmmaṇayya\n7 navara makkal̤u hiriāya varadarāja\n8 yanavarigĕ cigabĕṭhahal̤iyanu bi\n9 ṭĕvagi yi dharmakkĕ āru āl̤i\n10 pidavaru gaṃgĕya taḍi\n11 yalli kapilĕya vadisida papa\n12 kkĕ hoharu yi tiruvĕṃgal̤anā\n13 ta dānada yi dharmakkĕ tapidoru\n14 taṃma taṃdĕtāya kāśiya\n15 li kŏṃdavaru \n",
