        "name": "Doddabettahalli",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 20<br>Hobli: Yelahanka Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: Basavana Temple<br>Installation Date: Not dated<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: Not given in the EC.<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 20<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ದೊಡ್ಡ ಬೆಟ್ಟಹಳ್ಳಿಯ ಬಸವಣ್ಣ ದೇವಸ್ಥಾನದೊಳಗೆ ಬೋದಿಗೆ ಮೇಲೆ ಬರೆದಿರುವದು.<br><br>1.\tವಿಕ್ರಮದಸಂವತ್ಸರದಶ್ರಾ<br>2.\tವಣಶುದ೧೦ಯಲುದೆ . . .<br><br>(ಮುಂದೆ ವಂದು ಪಂಕ್ತಿ ಕಾಣುವದಿಲ್ಲ.)<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 13.093739<br>Longitude: 77.5545984<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
