      "properties": {
        "name": "Jakkur",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKujJymGcqn5YQsZSb5v_cQ-pUoPMh6jzb6i0bzg7YG5vnAbiakKRz34zEJaExE_Lap0y2x-7T59aYzSQ2-tLMl0ZIZXUf94PpkdkDCANOjQjwqBGOMS8jjhb1QoaEPLCbNYoFG2bp7ERc2WWaNzQ7qwBhejA-icdfx_hImVS7luFf3ww2Ypy2eE-IdL2x8xQapDMYI?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 21 & (https://bit.ly/BIV_Dec21_Jakkur_Kannada)<br>Hobli: Yelahanka Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Jakkur (same hobli), on a stone in Makkariga's field.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1342<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 4'X2'<br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 21<br><br>Date 1342 A.D.<br><br>Be it well. (On the date specified), when the pratapa-chakravartti Hoysala vira-Ballala-Deva-rasa was in Unnamale-pettana, ruling the Kingdom of the world :- all the subjects and farmers of Elahaka-nad, and the maha-savantadhipati, champion over mustaches, Chikka- Bayiraya-Nayaka’s son Honnamaraya-Nayaka, granted to the nad-senabhova Alaja, Land (specified) at Jakkur in this nad, as a sarvvamadanya kodagi, to continue as long as the sun and moon.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 21<br><br>ade hobal̤i jakkūru grāmada makkarigana hŏladalli naṭṭa kallinalli.<br><br>pramāṇa 4’ x 2’<br><br>(muṃbhāga)<br><br>1 svasti śrī śakābda 1265 nĕya<br>2 citra bhānu saṃ| aśvīja ku 5<br>3 bri śrīmatu pratāpa cakrava<br>4 rtti śrī hŏysal̤a vīraballāl̤a<br>5 devarasaru uṇṇāmalĕ paṭṭaṇa<br>6 dalu prithvīrājyaṃgĕyyuttira<br>7 lu śrīmanu mahā ĕlahkanāḍa<br>8 samasta prajĕ gavuṃḍugal̤ū.<br>9 manu mahā sāvaṃtādhipa<br>10 ti mīsĕyaragaṃḍa cikkabayi<br>11 rayanāykana maga hŏnnamāraya<br>12 nāykanū nāḍasenabŏva alāl̤arigĕ<br>13 śilāśāsanava māḍi kŏṭṭakrama<br>14 vĕṃtĕṃdaḍĕ yī nāḍŏl̤agaṇa<br><br>(hiṃbhāga)<br><br>15 jakkūra gaddĕ bĕddalu . .<br>16 pagĕmāl̤avŏl̤agāda ca<br>17 tussimĕenul̤l̤adanu sa<br>18 vryamānyadakŏḍagiyā<br>19 gi caṃdrādityarul̤l̤aṃ<br>20 barĕsaluvĕṃtāgi śilā<br>21 śāsanava māḍi kŏṭṭaru<br>22 maṃgal̤a mahāśrī<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team<br>svasti śrī śakābda 1265 nĕya<br>citrabhānu saṃ| āśvīja śu5<br>bra | śrīmatu pratāpa ccakrava<br>rtti śrī hŏysal̤a vīraballāl̤a<br>devarasaru uṇṇāmalĕ paṭṭaṇa<br>daṃ pṛthvirājyaṃgĕ yvuttira<br>lu śrī manumahā ĕlahkanāḍa<br>samasta prajĕgavuṃḍugal̤ū<br>manumahā sāvaṃtādhipa<br>ti mīsĕyara gaṃḍa cikkabayi<br>rayanāykana maga hŏṃnamāraya<br>nāykanū nāḍasenabŏva allāl̤arigĕ<br>śilāśāsanava māḍikŏṭṭa krama<br>vĕṃtĕṃdaḍĕ yi nāḍŏl̤agaṇa<br><br>jakkūra gaddĕ bĕddalu . .<br>pagĕmāl̤a vŏl̤agāda ca<br>tu sīmĕ enul̤l̤adanū sa<br>rvamānyada kŏḍagiyā<br>gi caṃdrādityarul̤l̤aṃna<br>bara saluvaṃtāgi śilā<br>śāsanava māḍikŏṭṭaru<br>maṃgal̤a mahaśrī21<br><br>ade hobal̤i jakkūru grāmada makkarigana hŏladalli naṭṭa kallinalli.<br><br>pramāṇa 4’ x 2’<br><br>(muṃbhāga)<br><br>1 svasti śrī śakābda 1265 nĕya<br>2 citra bhānu saṃ| aśvīja ku 5<br>3 bri śrīmatu pratāpa cakrava<br>4 rtti śrī hŏysal̤a vīraballāl̤a<br>5 devarasaru uṇṇāmalĕ paṭṭaṇa<br>6 dalu prithvīrājyaṃgĕyyuttira<br>7 lu śrīmanu mahā ĕlahkanāḍa<br>8 samasta prajĕ gavuṃḍugal̤ū.<br>9 manu mahā sāvaṃtādhipa<br>10 ti mīsĕyaragaṃḍa cikkabayi<br>11 rayanāykana maga hŏnnamāraya<br>12 nāykanū nāḍasenabŏva alāl̤arigĕ<br>13 śilāśāsanava māḍi kŏṭṭakrama<br>14 vĕṃtĕṃdaḍĕ yī nāḍŏl̤agaṇa<br><br>(hiṃbhāga)<br><br>15 jakkūra gaddĕ bĕddalu . .<br>16 pagĕmāl̤avŏl̤agāda ca<br>17 tussimĕenul̤l̤adanu sa<br>18 vryamānyadakŏḍagiyā<br>19 gi caṃdrādityarul̤l̤aṃ<br>20 barĕsaluvĕṃtāgi śilā<br>21 śāsanava māḍi kŏṭṭaru<br>22 maṃgal̤a mahāśrī<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team<br>svasti śrī śakābda 1265 nĕya<br>citrabhānu saṃ| āśvīja śu5<br>bra | śrīmatu pratāpa ccakrava<br>rtti śrī hŏysal̤a vīraballāl̤a<br>devarasaru uṇṇāmalĕ paṭṭaṇa<br>daṃ pṛthvirājyaṃgĕ yvuttira<br>lu śrī manumahā ĕlahkanāḍa<br>samasta prajĕgavuṃḍugal̤ū<br>manumahā sāvaṃtādhipa<br>ti mīsĕyara gaṃḍa cikkabayi<br>rayanāykana maga hŏṃnamāraya<br>nāykanū nāḍasenabŏva allāl̤arigĕ<br>śilāśāsanava māḍikŏṭṭa krama<br>vĕṃtĕṃdaḍĕ yi nāḍŏl̤agaṇa<br><br>jakkūra gaddĕ bĕddalu . .<br>pagĕmāl̤a vŏl̤agāda ca<br>tu sīmĕ enul̤l̤adanū sa<br>rvamānyada kŏḍagiyā<br>gi caṃdrādityarul̤l̤aṃna<br>bara saluvaṃtāgi śilā<br>śāsanava māḍikŏṭṭaru<br>maṃgal̤a mahaśrī<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 21<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಜಕ್ಕೂರು ಗ್ರಾಮದ ಮಕ್ಕರಿಗನ ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿ ನಟ್ಟ ಕಲ್ಲಿನಲ್ಲಿ.<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 4’ x 2’ <br><br>(ಮುಂಭಾಗ)<br><br>1\tಸ್ವಸ್ತಿ ಶ್ರೀ ಶಕಾಬ್ದ ೧೨೬೫ ನೆಯ<br>2\tಚಿತ್ರ ಭಾನು ಸಂ| ಅಶ್ವೀಜ ಕು ೫<br>3\tಬ್ರಿ ಶ್ರೀಮತು ಪ್ರತಾಪ ಚಕ್ರವ<br>4\tರ್ತ್ತಿ ಶ್ರೀ ಹೊಯ್ಸಳ ವೀರಬಲ್ಲಾಳ<br>5\tದೇವರಸರು ಉಣ್ಣಾಮಲೆ ಪಟ್ಟಣ<br>6\tದಲು ಪ್ರಿಥ್ವೀರಾಜ್ಯಂಗೆಯ್ಯುತ್ತಿರ<br>7\tಲು ಶ್ರೀಮನು ಮಹಾ ಎಲಹ್ಕನಾಡ<br>8\tಸಮಸ್ತ ಪ್ರಜೆ ಗವುಂಡುಗಳೂ.<br>9\tಮನು ಮಹಾ ಸಾವಂತಾಧಿಪ<br>10\tತಿ ಮೀಸೆಯರಗಂಡ ಚಿಕ್ಕಬಯಿ<br>11\tರಯನಾಯ್ಕನ ಮಗ ಹೊನ್ನಮಾರಯ<br>12\tನಾಯ್ಕನೂ ನಾಡಸೇನಬೊವ ಅಲಾಳರಿಗೆ<br>13\tಶಿಲಾಶಾಸನವ ಮಾಡಿ ಕೊಟ್ಟಕ್ರಮ<br>14\tವೆಂತೆಂದಡೆ ಯೀ ನಾಡೊಳಗಣ<br><br>(ಹಿಂಭಾಗ)<br><br>15\tಜಕ್ಕೂರ ಗದ್ದೆ ಬೆದ್ದಲು . .<br>16\tಪಗೆಮಾಳವೊಳಗಾದ ಚ<br>17\tತುಸ್ಸಿಮೆಏನುಳ್ಳದನು ಸ<br>18\tವ್ರ್ಯಮಾನ್ಯದಕೊಡಗಿಯಾ<br>19\tಗಿ ಚಂದ್ರಾದಿತ್ಯರುಳ್ಳಂ<br>20\tಬರೆಸಲುವೆಂತಾಗಿ ಶಿಲಾ<br>21\tಶಾಸನವ ಮಾಡಿ ಕೊಟ್ಟರು<br>22\tಮಂಗಳ ಮಹಾಶ್ರೀ<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team<br>ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿ ಶ್ರೀ ಶಕಾಬ್ದ ೧೨೬೫ ನೆಯ<br>ಚಿತ್ರಭಾನು ಸಂ| ಆಶ್ವೀಜ ಶು೫<br>ಬ್ರ | ಶ್ರೀಮತು ಪ್ರತಾಪ ಚ್ಚಕ್ರವ<br>ರ್ತ್ತಿ ಶ್ರೀ ಹೊಯ್ಸಳ ವೀರಬಲ್ಲಾಳ<br>ದೇವರಸರು ಉಣ್ಣಾಮಲೆ ಪಟ್ಟಣ<br>ದಂ ಪೃಥ್ವಿರಾಜ್ಯಂಗೆ ಯ್ವುತ್ತಿರ<br>ಲು ಶ್ರೀ ಮನುಮಹಾ ಎಲಹ್ಕನಾಡ<br>ಸಮಸ್ತ ಪ್ರಜೆಗವುಂಡುಗಳೂ<br>ಮನುಮಹಾ ಸಾವಂತಾಧಿಪ<br>ತಿ ಮೀಸೆಯರ ಗಂಡ ಚಿಕ್ಕಬಯಿ<br>ರಯನಾಯ್ಕನ ಮಗ ಹೊಂನಮಾರಯ<br>ನಾಯ್ಕನೂ ನಾಡಸೇನಬೊವ ಅಲ್ಲಾಳರಿಗೆ<br>ಶಿಲಾಶಾಸನವ ಮಾಡಿಕೊಟ್ಟ ಕ್ರಮ<br>ವೆಂತೆಂದಡೆ ಯಿ ನಾಡೊಳಗಣ<br><br>ಜಕ್ಕೂರ ಗದ್ದೆ ಬೆದ್ದಲು . .<br>ಪಗೆಮಾಳ ವೊಳಗಾದ ಚ<br>ತು ಸೀಮೆ ಏನುಳ್ಳದನೂ ಸ<br>ರ್ವಮಾನ್ಯದ ಕೊಡಗಿಯಾ<br>ಗಿ ಚಂದ್ರಾದಿತ್ಯರುಳ್ಳಂನ<br>ಬರ ಸಲುವಂತಾಗಿ ಶಿಲಾ<br>ಶಾಸನವ ಮಾಡಿಕೊಟ್ಟರು<br>ಮಂಗಳ ಮಹಶ್ರೀ<br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: 21<br><br>ade hobaḷi jakkūru grāmada makkarigana holadalli naṭṭa kallinalali.<br><br>pramāṇa 4’ x 2’ <br><br>(muṃbhāga)<br><br>1\tsvasti śrī śakābda 1265 neya<br>2\tcitra bhānu saṃ| aśvīja ku 5<br>3\tbri śrīmatu pratāpa cakrava<br>4\trtti śrī hoysaḷa vīraballāḷa<br>5\tdevarasaru uṇṇāmale paṭṭaṇa<br>6\tdalu prithvīrājyaṃgeyyuttira<br>7\tlu śrīmanu mahā elahkanāḍa<br>8\tsamasta praje gavuṃḍugaḷū.<br>9\tmanu mahā sāvaṃtādhipa<br>10\tti mīseyaragaṃḍa cikkabayi<br>11\trayanāykana maga honnamāraya<br>12\tnāykanū nāḍasenabova alāḷarige<br>13\tśilāśāsanava māḍi koṭṭakrama<br>14\tveṃteṃdaḍe yī nāḍoḷagaṇa<br><br>(hiṃbhāga)<br><br>15\tjakkūra gadde beddalu . .<br>16\tpagemāḷavoḷagāda ca<br>17\ttussimeenuḷḷadanu sa<br>18\tvryamānyadakoḍagiyā<br>19\tgi caṃdrādityaruḷḷaṃ<br>20\tbaresaluveṃtāgi śilā<br>21\tśāsanava māḍi koṭṭaru<br>22\tmaṃgaḷa mahāśrī<br><br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com> & Kevin Alex <kevin.atd@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 13.0790206<br>Longitude: 77.6072157<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKt_1qAqdaZ-XBRAYI0rYgrEYEXY4YO61xfY4LsLfiMVSF4hiHPt2t3SAqhR-wLoLihhNSarfrPvX1Pyi9DdmC6E5cmeWOEQJy6R0t55_42KmgAxVUdawkXzoFtr3QvlL9JxbF7QZ0392mDBJvXcwHWCQBOUK_MUZaykgIhFFs4SQmxD5KKORMnFg9DrsCXtO7OYU7o?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsvkyOA-UADJA3dWe_Hhqdmi1v1e-hpAjOxPjUjJh0iIUuNkjDhHb25q8DNcJLFbIpUujPWvvK94PPGggU_L9ILxCrkAYJdwDomGW_l5da0SafsEA6Ny-F8VgFvXm_LxU9KZevJm3nXEA-gIxx1a0cKvgieBjygFVgbWqDj_3uiyrsw_x3JVasR8p8v0Gu2RZNE1Rs?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hos