        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKujJymGcqn5YQsZSb5v_cQ-pUoPMh6jzb6i0bzg7YG5vnAbiakKRz34zEJaExE_Lap0y2x-7T59aYzSQ2-tLMl0ZIZXUf94PpkdkDCANOjQjwqBGOMS8jjhb1QoaEPLCbNYoFG2bp7ERc2WWaNzQ7qwBhejA-icdfx_hImVS7luFf3ww2Ypy2eE-IdL2x8xQapDMYI?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKt_1qAqdaZ-XBRAYI0rYgrEYEXY4YO61xfY4LsLfiMVSF4hiHPt2t3SAqhR-wLoLihhNSarfrPvX1Pyi9DdmC6E5cmeWOEQJy6R0t55_42KmgAxVUdawkXzoFtr3QvlL9JxbF7QZ0392mDBJvXcwHWCQBOUK_MUZaykgIhFFs4SQmxD5KKORMnFg9DrsCXtO7OYU7o?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsvkyOA-UADJA3dWe_Hhqdmi1v1e-hpAjOxPjUjJh0iIUuNkjDhHb25q8DNcJLFbIpUujPWvvK94PPGggU_L9ILxCrkAYJdwDomGW_l5da0SafsEA6Ny-F8VgFvXm_LxU9KZevJm3nXEA-gIxx1a0cKvgieBjygFVgbWqDj_3uiyrsw_x3JVasR8p8v0Gu2RZNE1Rs?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvoxkxKrZScQb7TzBtEhBepO8TS2ydsEEE4DZj_H_ZU0NEyPxVBSJ5cvMRHaot5JeFzKFmhXMPXGxZdfrmrlkVFpQ2qasFaHpDQtp0BtJIRXNgyKTXBdMXNYpPQl0EYJNjZoS7fTFTG3Id95WEPqgS-g007SteSjyR7YTnL-I5Zf8eacMYTZpoaLh0yzQri97juwU4?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtF8O0DRsiwITvCNqlMCKEluUKCHZnNOejjNqeqJqcUr9008nSi6StuxDt7LOfX2gsYVCRNc-T2bAdJlcmptCVAlWoaTYRXI3VHt30Hk3ZzeqCSlSRqcdR84Q_NcJsZ8X_i4hkIv6k9Wu6jnxPfA75fnmwA79p8Wp5yCdj7bgruuCwRMimMy2e9GjjMNIAa18qqNad7?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvTy4VdcbTctHD0MCDwPHm1bi_c6OWGmrFOCUUQq42xdJ-gFTlRno3jAgApJr_zlkY43PQcH6O4PvJC5dq5N3fSRnnDSBcHdQoXH7LtdSqK6BSJL9g3ADx55YAroS1RkRaQ2PeUP7wDE0Xl6Nn4wZ4AsB37ZGMEypBToTzXRnKL3kVCqcxqL7N0zx3yIi0R7r1HxgcR?authuser=0&fife=s16383",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "21 & (https://bit.ly/BIV_Dec21_Jakkur_Kannada)",
        "Hobli": "Yelahanka Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At Jakkur (same hobli), on a stone in Makkariga's field.",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "21\n\nade hobal̤i jakkūru grāmada makkarigana hŏladalli naṭṭa kallinalli.\n\npramāṇa 4’ x 2’\n\n(muṃbhāga)\n\n1 svasti śrī śakābda 1265 nĕya\n2 citra bhānu saṃ| aśvīja ku 5\n3 bri śrīmatu pratāpa cakrava\n4 rtti śrī hŏysal̤a vīraballāl̤a\n5 devarasaru uṇṇāmalĕ paṭṭaṇa\n6 dalu prithvīrājyaṃgĕyyuttira\n7 lu śrīmanu mahā ĕlahkanāḍa\n8 samasta prajĕ gavuṃḍugal̤ū.\n9 manu mahā sāvaṃtādhipa\n10 ti mīsĕyaragaṃḍa cikkabayi\n11 rayanāykana maga hŏnnamāraya\n12 nāykanū nāḍasenabŏva alāl̤arigĕ\n13 śilāśāsanava māḍi kŏṭṭakrama\n14 vĕṃtĕṃdaḍĕ yī nāḍŏl̤agaṇa\n\n(hiṃbhāga)\n\n15 jakkūra gaddĕ bĕddalu . .\n16 pagĕmāl̤avŏl̤agāda ca\n17 tussimĕenul̤l̤adanu sa\n18 vryamānyadakŏḍagiyā\n19 gi caṃdrādityarul̤l̤aṃ\n20 barĕsaluvĕṃtāgi śilā\n21 śāsanava māḍi kŏṭṭaru\n22 maṃgal̤a mahāśrī\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team\nsvasti śrī śakābda 1265 nĕya\ncitrabhānu saṃ| āśvīja śu5\nbra | śrīmatu pratāpa ccakrava\nrtti śrī hŏysal̤a vīraballāl̤a\ndevarasaru uṇṇāmalĕ paṭṭaṇa\ndaṃ pṛthvirājyaṃgĕ yvuttira\nlu śrī manumahā ĕlahkanāḍa\nsamasta prajĕgavuṃḍugal̤ū\nmanumahā sāvaṃtādhipa\nti mīsĕyara gaṃḍa cikkabayi\nrayanāykana maga hŏṃnamāraya\nnāykanū nāḍasenabŏva allāl̤arigĕ\nśilāśāsanava māḍikŏṭṭa krama\nvĕṃtĕṃdaḍĕ yi nāḍŏl̤agaṇa\n\njakkūra gaddĕ bĕddalu . .\npagĕmāl̤a vŏl̤agāda ca\ntu sīmĕ enul̤l̤adanū sa\nrvamānyada kŏḍagiyā\ngi caṃdrādityarul̤l̤aṃna\nbara saluvaṃtāgi śilā\nśāsanava māḍikŏṭṭaru\nmaṃgal̤a mahaśrī21\n\nade hobal̤i jakkūru grāmada makkarigana hŏladalli naṭṭa kallinalli.\n\npramāṇa 4’ x 2’\n\n(muṃbhāga)\n\n1 svasti śrī śakābda 1265 nĕya\n2 citra bhānu saṃ| aśvīja ku 5\n3 bri śrīmatu pratāpa cakrava\n4 rtti śrī hŏysal̤a vīraballāl̤a\n5 devarasaru uṇṇāmalĕ paṭṭaṇa\n6 dalu prithvīrājyaṃgĕyyuttira\n7 lu śrīmanu mahā ĕlahkanāḍa\n8 samasta prajĕ gavuṃḍugal̤ū.\n9 manu mahā sāvaṃtādhipa\n10 ti mīsĕyaragaṃḍa cikkabayi\n11 rayanāykana maga hŏnnamāraya\n12 nāykanū nāḍasenabŏva alāl̤arigĕ\n13 śilāśāsanava māḍi kŏṭṭakrama\n14 vĕṃtĕṃdaḍĕ yī nāḍŏl̤agaṇa\n\n(hiṃbhāga)\n\n15 jakkūra gaddĕ bĕddalu . .\n16 pagĕmāl̤avŏl̤agāda ca\n17 tussimĕenul̤l̤adanu sa\n18 vryamānyadakŏḍagiyā\n19 gi caṃdrādityarul̤l̤aṃ\n20 barĕsaluvĕṃtāgi śilā\n21 śāsanava māḍi kŏṭṭaru\n22 maṃgal̤a mahāśrī\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team\nsvasti śrī śakābda 1265 nĕya\ncitrabhānu saṃ| āśvīja śu5\nbra | śrīmatu pratāpa ccakrava\nrtti śrī hŏysal̤a vīraballāl̤a\ndevarasaru uṇṇāmalĕ paṭṭaṇa\ndaṃ pṛthvirājyaṃgĕ yvuttira\nlu śrī manumahā ĕlahkanāḍa\nsamasta prajĕgavuṃḍugal̤ū\nmanumahā sāvaṃtādhipa\nti mīsĕyara gaṃḍa cikkabayi\nrayanāykana maga hŏṃnamāraya\nnāykanū nāḍasenabŏva allāl̤arigĕ\nśilāśāsanava māḍikŏṭṭa krama\nvĕṃtĕṃdaḍĕ yi nāḍŏl̤agaṇa\n\njakkūra gaddĕ bĕddalu . .\npagĕmāl̤a vŏl̤agāda ca\ntu sīmĕ enul̤l̤adanū sa\nrvamānyada kŏḍagiyā\ngi caṃdrādityarul̤l̤aṃna\nbara saluvaṃtāgi śilā\nśāsanava māḍikŏṭṭaru\nmaṃgal̤a mahaśrī",
