        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKseLDSKeIGcm6qS55iXrO940H8gbBrWQJR8uAn4nAq7ucdZohW1HDpjeHE4V7WIw81BtGjx2pqL4qFAKFoGWOg5EEleUYX8VPQbXW476gyitzD8BLUfdeWlT2aPt-4KPxtxTab2nN1UCXh-tiNJi7dYCGbziH5pi51XGG5NMHNmZk4d8h75PF39uhahbjhOUAGAuqQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsK4hl3WQmI9YMm5QH2Eaf7w9IRkkKxfuz9ue0KmoDMYxAyMk2XhF_ZdziVa7tBNICdpNEYyDrk1_6n8I3Jf483CLZu1bQCTwgtGOLu_09MTohrghsRXTpmBbMhRPRmBxzTICjjULqarpczlfaJoOTOT4h0An_nkdH4fjZRJowAzMYp0HXeNVV0cEs143kaRwBK6zs?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKt5j8CTXjB470C6ky44sOIt6-HBqeDgBTKbD7Res4LCw8Mi0XAioiGmH9N5NIq8cvr-rj0FCbIXyfUffiGDN6TTZTsO8Qm6ttauJIkDNghYlmt4KVSehjzxSuLco2fxQhOEKfffKITolJ42P8QAfb3rPl6i-WKXD6ZbcDkDPTOWECpnAlyl57hPdAp1sB_7nTnt2eyE?authuser=0&fife=s16383",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "27",
        "Hobli": "Yelahanka Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At Tindlu (same hobli), on a stone in the pujari's field.",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "27\n\nade hŏbal̤i tiṃḍlu grāmakkĕ dakṣiṇadalli pūjāri hŏladalli\n\npramāṇa 7.6 ghi 3.6\n\n1. svastiśrīmatuśakavarusaṃgal̤u12.saṃ\n2. duvalanaṃvatra rapuvyaba.....godalu\n3. śrī manumahāmaṃḍal̤eśvara arirāyavi\n4. bhāḍabhāpĕgĕtappuvarāyaragaṃḍacatussa\n5. mudrādhivataṇirubukkaṃṇa.......\n(muṃdĕ savidu hogidhe\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team\nsvasti śrī matu śakavarusaṃgal̤u 1289 sa\nṃdu palavaṃga saṃvatsara puṣya ba 10 sodalu\nśrīmanumahāmaṃḍal̤esvara arirāya vi\nbhāḍa bhāṣĕgĕ tappuvarāyara gaṃḍa pūrbba\nsamudrādhipati śrīvīrabukkaṃṇa . . . .\nyadalu svasti samasta . . . . . . . . . . ubhaya\nnānādesi sālumūlĕ sa . . . . halarū . . .\nda hilavāgi . . . . . . sāvaṃtādhipati . .\n. . . . . . .ru . yaragaravu . . . . .\nna makal̤u siṃgayanāyaka tti . va ru . . . .\nda . . ya sa . . ya vi . . . ha bi . .\nkāya . . . . . .. . . . .. .\nara . . ra . . . . . .. . . .\nya . . . . . . . . . . . . .\nmaga . . . . ba . .. . .. .. . .\n. . . . . . . . . . .. . . . . .\n(muṃdĕ sālugal̤u kāṇuvudilla)\n",
        "Name_": "",
        "EC_9_Ht_": "",
        "layer": "The Incredible Inscription Stones of Bengaluru — Bangalore Taluk",
        "path": "N:/02.CURATE STUDIO/25.02_INFRACULTURE/08. WATER AND THE CITY/03 Interactive Timelines/to map/The Incredible Inscription Stones of Bengaluru.kml|layername=Bangalore Taluk|geometrytype=Point25D|uniqueGeometryType=yes"
      },
