        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsUouVcft0WCxz-XCzsh_pe6E7leZiPHnX9NTi75mcPAa9T7MfWta_xNBUeewGTpdQV0412vPJKOqnhh3JLlYNN7Dvv7J57dGdnE33eVb8PAEl9kwGvbPJNj8wAcFP-sTVnDjTMXBAGCHTOAkXhKfL0Kynr3FenvgGOarnNI0Dzk6LH_8aInqBOUI9Yhgc_d0Uj8Pfa?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvd6HYtty76V3kLMWi2bqlMUD-i7vVTuv7iwnwBUZkcjP9eQSuGUBJWLRsdjrujkO6Ud6b0Js-nvPOSfR7APiAzVZmpPAxhPayBPd7uxSgtjjujv4DRhvgTeQJcApDIZXioZxFXmFot9tUjmV2RZf0gE4SRlpJ2DhvmM8LneZktKLzZsCL_jm1AzXJr2qZdofTGHrbe?authuser=0&fife=s16383",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "28 & Bengaluru ithihasa vaibhava issue 1 Singapura (https://archive.org/details/singapura-itihaasa-vaibhava-nov-2021-english/page/29/mode/1up)",
        "Hobli": "Yelahanka Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At Harohalli (same hobli), on a stone near the Anjaneya temple.",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "28\n\nade hobal̤i hārohal̤l̤i grāmada āṃjuneya devālayada bal̤i nĕṭṭaruva kallinalli\n\npramāṇa 5 ghi 2.11\n\n1. svastiśrījayābhyudayaśālivāhaśaka\n2. varuṣa1452 ne vikṛtisaṃvatsara\n3. dakārtīkaśuddha 12 puṇya kāladalli ā\n4. cyutarāyamahārāyarigĕnamma taṃdĕba\n5. savappanāyakarigĕpuṇyavāgiacyutarā\n6. yarusolūrabasavappa nāyakaramakal̤ukri\n7. svappanāyakarigĕnāyakatanakkĕ pālisidasivana\n8. samudra dasta lakkĕ saluvahārohal̤l̤i grāmava\n9. susiṃgāpuradatiruvĕṃgal̤anātaliṃgaraṃga\n10. vaibhogāmru tapaḍinaiveddakkĕ rāmānujakū\n11. ṭakĕsalabekĕṃdu kŏṭṭasilaśasana\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team\n1 0 svasti śrī jĕyabhyudaya śālivāhana śaka\n2 0 varuṣa 1452 ne vikṛti ṣaṃvadara\n3 0 da khārtika śudha 12 puṇyakāladali ā\n4 cutarāya mahārāyarigĕ naṃma taṃdĕ ba\n5 savappanāyakarigĕ puṃṇyavāgi ācutarā\n6 yaru solūra basavappanāyakara maṃkal̤u kri\n7 ṣtpṇappa nāyakarigĕ nāyakatanakĕ pālisida sivana\n8 samudrada stalakĕ saluva hāruhal̤i gramava\n9 nu siṃgāpurada tiruvĕṃgal̤anāta āṃgaraṃga\n10 vaibhoga āmṛtapaḍi naivedyakĕ rāmānujakū\n11 ṭakĕ salabekĕṃdu kŏṭṭa sila śadana\n",
        "Name_": "",
