        "name": "Avalahalli ",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKs5aqKYcrJrJj1J2P0WSs1tsGuzqVA7uwgBJLFKbMtK6GK1fo4yMPlMqtD-1R6lBAuvaUig3AtQeHSZlCJrRXfA0_7iCgBpQGn0cQI30ArDkO-MtMpCfxyv9X6WlcvuE0ZhCrP2qPtsctcNvH1PYYp23ghkG2Q-cSU29ZMd5qtJLK3cGYA7zLm4QizpRFzK825fS_jg?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 29<br>Hobli: Yelahanka Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: Oringially - aAt Avalahalli (same hobli), on a virakal in Taranisi Iranna's field.<br><br>Now relocated to the museum<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1349<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: unknown<br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 29<br>Date 1349 A.D.<br>Be it well. (On the date specified), Anneya-Nayaka's son... be-Nayaka... slew and fell. Apparently repeated<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 29<br> At avalahalli (same hobli), on a virakal in Taranisi Iranna’s field.<br>Sri svasti sri jayabhyudaya 12.. ya Virodi-sam-da Vaisakha-su 1 Bu Anneya-Nayakana maga, be-Nayakanu . . . . . hoya biddanu . . . . ya-Nayaka . . . . . Abeya Rachaya-Nayakanu . . . . voydu sura-Joka-praptan adanu.<br><br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 29<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಅವಲಹಳ್ಲಿ ಗ್ರಮಾಕ್ಕೆ ದಕ್ಷಿಣ ತರಣಿಸಿ ಈರಂಣನ ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿ ಬಿದ್ದಿರುವ <br>ವೀರಕಲ್ಲು. <br><br>1.    ಶ್ರೀಸ್ವಸ್ತಿ <br>2.   ಶ್ರೀಜಯಾಭ್ಯು <br>3.   ದಯ1ರ್29ಯ <br>4.   ವಿರೋದಿಸಂದವೈಶಾ <br>5.   ಖಶು1ಬುಅಮೆ<br>6.   ಯನಾಯಕನಮಗ...... <br>7.   ಬೆನಾಯಕನು..........<br>8.   ಹೊಯಬಿದ್ದನು <br>9.   ...............<br>10.  ಯನಾಯಕ <br>11.   ನಾಅಬೆಯರಾ <br>12.  ಚಯನಾಯಕನು <br>13.  ದಾ..........<br>14.  ಪೊಯ್ದುಸುರಲೋ <br>15.  ಕಪ್ರಾಪ್ತನಾದ <br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.9747648<br>Longitude: 77.5957598<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtJ4dO_y5HHWDskSI7Tt4Zfs5-VnS5wter0yUcjasIGDfwMTdc7uHdTbiLJQ2SXaOkR3ATNl8oj6fg9TqThuHmHTsKfLKkUZOAp_MjCr0LAfrvmX0pYHx4BEBUD-_a0AWRROp865T22JuopNRZ6zBd0bGlPym-oWdEAIATUCdHmUIJ4_GwowiBsQ_vrrk0-w-i_Ssc?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsInlUroG7y_Ekk73BVNLIvFuIcNQo7ztc0N6TSL9w32vK85VZ7ZjoW8PQqZ6JIlUhrQhkiHooZI3g4xLlomi-u_jIVBLHSM7MJDtBC-JS3RrwHAQpIyLV6UbT7SVLMbwejEq0l-3-a6bIZ4UnLo47jmaYYx9fuSCox64sattM9jo5XyPL_fTYpsHPmTqB2DYJqHwxyj9HKjzkAokW9Fn_16i_9qGXYO-4g0MlJgcalnDlU?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
