        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "29",
        "Hobli": "Yelahanka Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "Oringially - aAt Avalahalli (same hobli), on a virakal in Taranisi Iranna's field.\n\nNow relocated to the museum",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "29\n At avalahalli (same hobli), on a virakal in Taranisi Iranna’s field.\nSri svasti sri jayabhyudaya 12.. ya Virodi-sam-da Vaisakha-su 1 Bu Anneya-Nayakana maga, be-Nayakanu . . . . . hoya biddanu . . . . ya-Nayaka . . . . . Abeya Rachaya-Nayakanu . . . . voydu sura-Joka-praptan adanu.\n",
