        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKv5H911k9H9DwxmWGFj5SNmnWhWmk4JnK2MgfU5EgpSjgeR1HFuA2Ld2RMzwBFggoihvgV8XkYQbYLEFK6iH5zx5tW8xwGFgUQp9TjTH7d4TTbL-5x1LhC7rJ9vJdakZaUF7HeUOVmR8WO9M3xv-W9vJMuClqZKxnKHGoLqK9xlbLEPBacfubO7sDEx3vmV3bE2FxU?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuEqQCUggElsxLJJFsV5-YqKVMNGabaKO6-m1pjqXx5iUrO_ztiaAXJx6Wuz4dRJCBJhiwhSS5Rb2jp-0u--NGWDSWGaNYUfBXf-uUT4xoNJyN-9AabtyoTI9isekHIC4aJj3yzz2IcGxXw15QdWFnK0UbGcNVJOjnQHgijwQCj09a7pFEumrYKsWkbud_RW7d2G2I?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKt9sApnDYyq3n5CCXshf3dVXlDONUZe2D5Wu-vq9TiUNRmI-lUDH0-OH-H66ht-unKtwjK6w-iXBdRI98VBU-CUunYl4MTZiBBes1jas1XDBkNrMQXWDM4qAxsH8Kec7kxhSRrKGTnQJt999A4zqNSF_IZLbuROVmMZZt1P-k0mamUkVOepfe5Jf7VD4FfuvPvVXgM?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvJNSL2fAhbPbauxLCz2z4T8LeiobQ73GGMiT9BRhHBPaAGc9Xqwl3cY8PT8aqAQM-mSaoa3wO6WxNMg5zjgKRHvlvDIYtltHiA6Z80_YQ0Ysk6aCYrkbmbJI4avvgajQNEx55O-wI437Z9VFRsRZL-zqM-0VGhm73UlQe6LKrHctNoqx-1icwlj1iVlh3HtgeQReo?authuser=0&fife=s16383",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "30 (https://bit.ly/BIV_Dec21_Jakkur_Kannada))",
        "Hobli": "Yelahanka Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At Allalasandra (same hobli), on a stone to the north of the village entrance.",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "30\nAtAllalasanddra (same hobli), on a stone to the north of the village entrance.\nSvasti sri jayabhyudaya-S’alivahana-saka-varusha 1461 neya Krodhi-samvatsarada Marggasira-su 5 lu srimanu-maharajadhiraja raja-paramesvara sri-vira-pratapa sri-vira-Sadasiva-m aharayaru prithvi-rajyam geuttamyiralu sriman-maha-nandalesvara sriMaratiya-Vithalesvara-Deva-maha-arasugala karyake karttar ada Rachura Narasimhayagalu Jekkura Allalanatha-devara amrit-padi-naivedyake Elahaka-nada S;ivanasamudrada simevalagapa Allalasandra-gramavanu Vithalesvara-srsugalige punyav agabeku yandu samarpisidevu a-gramake saluva chatus-simey-olagada kerre-kunte-gade-bed-dalu-gude-guyalu-tota-tuduga-kadaramba-niraramba-sakala(shkala) suvarnaday-untada ashta-bhoga-tejas-svamyavanu samarppisidevu yi-dharma-sadhana ……\n\nMythis Society Inscription 3d Scanning Team Re-Reading\n\n0 śvasti śrī vijayābhdudaya sālivāhana sa\n0 ka varuṣa 1462 nĕya krŏdhi saṃvatsarada\n0 mārggasira śu5lu śrī maṃnn maha\n0 rājadhirāja rājaparamĕśvara śrī vīra\n0 prathāpa vīrasadāsivamāhārayaru pri\n0 thvirājyaṃgĕutaṃyiralu śrī\n0 maṃnmahamaṃḍalĕśvara śrī\n0 marāṭĕya viṭalĕśvaradeva mahā\n0 arasugal̤a kāryakĕkarttarāda rā\n0 curanarasapayagal̤u jakura alā\n0 l̤anātha dĕvara a mrutapaḍi naive\n0 dyakkĕ ĕlakanāḍa sivanasamu\n0 drāda simĕvŏl̤agaṇa alāl̤a\n0 saṃdrā grāmavanu viṭalĕśara arasuga\n0 l̤igĕ pu(0?)ṇyavāgābĕku yĕṃdu sa\n0 marpisidĕu a grāmakĕ saluva\n0 catusimĕvŏl̤āgada kĕṟĕkuṃṭĕ\n0 gadĕ bĕjalu guḍĕguyalu tŏṭa(?)\n . . . kĕ kāḍāraṃba nirāraṃba .\n\n(hiṃbhāga)\n0 śvadatta dviguṇaṃ puṇyaṃ para\n0 datanupālanaṃ paradattapa\n0 hārĕṇa svadatta niṣpalaṃbavĕtu\n0 yi dharmakĕ tapidarĕ gaṃgĕya\n0 li kapilĕra kŏṃda pāpakĕ hŏ\n0 varu\n",
        "Name_": "",
        "EC_9_Ht_": "",
        "layer": "The Incredible Inscription Stones of Bengaluru — Bangalore Taluk",
        "path": "N:/02.CURATE STUDIO/25.02_INFRACULTURE/08. WATER AND THE CITY/03 Interactive Timelines/to map/The Incredible Inscription Stones of Bengaluru.kml|layername=Bangalore Taluk|geometrytype=Point25D|uniqueGeometryType=yes"
