      "properties": {
        "name": "Allalasandra ",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 32<br>Hobli: Yelahanka Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the same village, on a stone in the barren land of Kempapurada Muniyappa.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1080<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 5'4\"X4'<br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 32<br>Date about 1080 A.D.<br>Be it well. When Kulottunga-Chola, the Sanne-nad ruler Kadeya-Nayaka’s warrior, Mummadi-Setti’s son Guliyana’s younger brother, Rama-deva went forth for hunting, and in the hunt let fly (an arrow) at an old boar, he was wounded and killed. (Apparently a grant was made for him).<br><br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 32 <br><br>ಅದೇ ಗ್ರಮಾಕ್ಕೆ ಆಗ್ನೇಯ ಕೆಂಪಾಪುರದ ಮುನಿಯಪ್ಪನ ಪಾಳು ದಮಿನಿನಲ್ಲಿರುವ ಕಲ್ಲು. <br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 5 .4ಘಿ 4 <br><br>1.\tಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀ ಮಂನ್ಮಕುಲಥುಂಘಚೋಳಸಂಣ್ಮುನಾಡಾಳ್ಯ <br>2.ಕಾಡೆಯನಾಯಕನಭಂಠನುಮುಮ್ಮಡಿಸಟ್ಟಯಮಘನು<br>3.\tಗೂಳಿಯಣನ ಥಮ್ಮನು ರಾಮದೇವನು ಬೇಟಿಗೆ ಹೊರವಟ್ಠು <br>4.\tಹಿರಿಯಹಂಡಿಗೆವೇಂಟಿಲುಬಿಟ್ಟು ಡೆತಾಗಿಕೊ<br>5.\tನ್ದುದ್ರೆಹ ......... ಹ..... ಬಾಧೆಯಂ...... ನು<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 13.0837178<br>Longitude: 77.5847017<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1080",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Kannada",
        "Size": "5'4\"X4'",
        "Current_Status": "Not traceable",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "32\nDate about 1080 A.D.\nBe it well. When Kulottunga-Chola, the Sanne-nad ruler Kadeya-Nayaka’s warrior, Mummadi-Setti’s son Guliyana’s younger brother, Rama-deva went forth for hunting, and in the hunt let fly (an arrow) at an old boar, he was wounded and killed. (Apparently a grant was made for him).\n\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "32 \n\nಅದೇ ಗ್ರಮಾಕ್ಕೆ ಆಗ್ನೇಯ ಕೆಂಪಾಪುರದ ಮುನಿಯಪ್ಪನ ಪಾಳು ದಮಿನಿನಲ್ಲಿರುವ ಕಲ್ಲು. \n\nಪ್ರಮಾಣ 5 .4ಘಿ 4 \n\n1.\tಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀ ಮಂನ್ಮಕುಲಥುಂಘಚೋಳಸಂಣ್ಮುನಾಡಾಳ್ಯ \n2.ಕಾಡೆಯನಾಯಕನಭಂಠನುಮುಮ್ಮಡಿಸಟ್ಟಯಮಘನು\n3.\tಗೂಳಿಯಣನ ಥಮ್ಮನು ರಾಮದೇವನು ಬೇಟಿಗೆ ಹೊರವಟ್ಠು \n4.\tಹಿರಿಯಹಂಡಿಗೆವೇಂಟಿಲುಬಿಟ್ಟು ಡೆತಾಗಿಕೊ\n5.\tನ್ದುದ್ರೆಹ ......... ಹ..... ಬಾಧೆಯಂ...... ನು",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "English_Translation__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "English_Transliteration__Retyped_By": "",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "Photographs_Provided_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "Latitude": "13.0837178",
        "Longitude": "77.5847017",
