        "name": "Allalasandra",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtvB7XB3CHKnl5ZPcb-6yooxASGrrkHpRU6GSEYheIS_GbYBiHIRs0LcWhTXHt7wGukwap71kFLc4TfiyrgX8RTEDLlyZblnJbsHztwK-0pvG-t0c4NW372CHjvzWbkFYFkmfMVVvez99H1fQgY_uzvcy6kgFq4UL0hQXyU5pkGW_i2MeOkJ9Qz67HGbwpNQgcfHE4?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: Not in EC (https://bit.ly/BIV_Dec21_Jakkur_Kannada)<br>Hobli: Yelahanka Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: By the roadside (Yantradakal)<br>Installation Date: 12/31/1899<br>Inscription Language: Kannada & Tamil<br>Size: unknown<br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: Not in the EC<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: āl̤ala samu<br>dra vu yāsai bha lā<br>maghan nri thanārī pe<br>ś ra śrī yū . aiya<br>ripi ka l̤a/lamāśala<br>kaliranākiya ki<br>na di/vi tuvi/digĕ la<br>ṣa/śabhivi .<br>yichiru<br>māli ca/ā .(ma) na nadu di<br>viya nā . .tī . ti<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1. ಆಳಲ ಸಮು<br>2. ದ್ರ ವು ಯಾಶೈ ಭ ಲಾ<br>3. ಮಘನ್ ನ್ರಿ ಥನಾರೀ ಪೇ<br>4. ಷ ರ ಶ್ರೀ ಯೂವ ಐಯ<br>5. ರಿಪಿ ಕ ಳ/ಲಮಾಶಲ<br>6. ಕಲಿರನಾಕಿಯ ಕಿ<br>7. ನ ದಿ/ವಿ ತುವಿ/ದಿಗೆ ಲ<br>8. ಷ/ಶಭಿವಿ .<br>9. ಯಿಛಿರು<br>10. ಮ . ಲಿ ಚ/ಆ .(ಮ) ನ ನದು ದಿ<br>11. ವಿಯ ನಾ . .ತೀ . ತಿ<br>(ಕನ್ನಡ ಅಕ್ಷರಗಳನ್ನು ದಪ್ಪಕ್ಷರದಲ್ಲಿ ತೋರಿಸಲಾಗಿದೆ)<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1. ಆளಲಸமு<br>2. ದ್ರ வு ಯಾ(?) ஶை ಭ லா<br>3. ம ಘ ந் ನ್ರಿ த நா ரீ பே<br>4. ರ ಶ್ರೀ(?) யூ வ ஐய<br>5. ರಿಪಿ க ல மா ஶ ಲ<br>6. க ಲಿರನಾಕಿ ய ಕಿ(?)<br>7. ந ದಿ/ವಿ து ವಿ/ದಿ ಗೆ ಲ<br>8. ஶ பி வி .<br>9. யி சி ரு<br>10. ಮ . ಲಿ ಚ/ಆ(ச) .(ம) ನ ந து ದಿ<br>11. வி ய ನಾ . .ತೀ(தீ) . ತಿ(தி) . .<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 13.086589<br>Longitude: 77.587555<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuv6IFugqp2tyrNI0dqGylzdfu5kbk_5akYUKiyoeB-CPJvgd25Af3vZIaRpMMWp-w4sNclMhZjTO7ouxA941dWwC_KqxE4ZzpeYXR9c42BHI-BL9LCZZHJ6fD-ipnvzaVA6VH_cGmn3KlGn4UEq3pvc2xMYEGlEwC753hZQU3Rg5fymCBozHABJ9R55KMOLf49gCQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvc4XqK5J6njhQZMo1CAcEm6ZRk2fYcXDxtm8OLtQwBqf8O-DfiEk1s_1Vk4ADcWbNUeC3W9TsbI5_paeLb2JwNkBmVAkdSYAdL6W3Q3yjcijzQQwPekCECfJF07h_kTmKeflWKJL1FahLXqcNzxn9iCSnnsfPscmHd0ph5DfOJmMhZA_34RTk_r-h3XS1JSVxM9Wo?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
