      "properties": {
        "name": "Nagasandra",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKv2GGHAqeRyZtes-nXK818NpPT0X3xZfPy5GLKxUd5q6R8LkzW0VLsyHKfbXmq2bIHRqwyPqF7_zeYDTiHUaL8KHZMw3QbJ-1dPsnXSy9wSqMlS-5Ug_37qyJ3xezcV6JR7oLIG7YMqKjYTgpbsR7wVE3D8bact3nwoeOx-YvBpVI9ZdfZRQcJQZXE6mpvY6U2J6O4?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 34<br>Hobli: Yelahanka Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Nagasandra (same hobli), on a stone near the alada mara.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1342<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 4'X3'6\"<br>Current Status: Intact, In three pieces<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 34<br><br>Date about 1342 A.D.<br><br>Be it well. (On the date specified), when the refuge of the three words, [favorite of earth and fortune], maharajadhiraja raja-paramesvara, sun in the sky the Yadava-kula, crest-jewel of omniscience, ……… the pratapa-chakravartti Hoysala vira-Ballala………was ruling …………………. A grant in Elahaka-nad (details effaced) <br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 34<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ನಾಗಸಂದ್ರದ ಊರುಮುಂದೆ ಆಲದ ಮರದಬಳಿ ಟಿದ್ದಿರುವ ಕಲ್ಲಿನಲ್ಲಿ. <br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 4 ಘಿ3.6<br><br>1.\tಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಜಯಾಭ್ಯುದಯಶಕವರುಷ1214ನೆ <br>2.\tಚಿತ್ರಭಾನುಸಂವತ್ಸರದಶು13 ಮಂಸ್ವಸ್ತಿ<br>3.\tಶ್ರೀಮತಿ ಭುವನಾಶ್ರಯಂ....... ಭಂಮಹಾರಾಜಾ <br>4.\tಧಿರಾಜಂರಾಜಪರಮೇಸ್ವರಂಯಾದವಕುಲಾಂಬರದ್ಯಿಮಣಿ<br>5.\tಸಬ್ರ್ಬಜ್ಞಚೂಡಾಮಣಿ ......ಪ್ರತಾವಚಕ್ರವತ್ರ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಹೊಂಯ್ಸ<br>6.\tಳಶ್ರೀವೀರಬಲ್ಲಾಳದ........ರಾಜ್ಯಂಗೆಇವಲ್ಲಿ <br>7.\t.................................................<br>8.\t........ಎಲಹಕನಾಡ <br>9.\t........ ಮಾಚಿದೇವರು <br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 13.0398694<br>Longitude: 77.4992072<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1342",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Kannada",
        "Size": "4'X3'6\"",
        "Current_Status": "Intact, In three pieces",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "34\n\nDate about 1342 A.D.\n\nBe it well. (On the date specified), when the refuge of the three words, [favorite of earth and fortune], maharajadhiraja raja-paramesvara, sun in the sky the Yadava-kula, crest-jewel of omniscience, ……… the pratapa-chakravartti Hoysala vira-Ballala………was ruling …………………. A grant in Elahaka-nad (details effaced) \n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "34\n\nಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ನಾಗಸಂದ್ರದ ಊರುಮುಂದೆ ಆಲದ ಮರದಬಳಿ ಟಿದ್ದಿರುವ ಕಲ್ಲಿನಲ್ಲಿ. \n\nಪ್ರಮಾಣ 4 ಘಿ3.6\n\n1.\tಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಜಯಾಭ್ಯುದಯಶಕವರುಷ1214ನೆ \n2.\tಚಿತ್ರಭಾನುಸಂವತ್ಸರದಶು13 ಮಂಸ್ವಸ್ತಿ\n3.\tಶ್ರೀಮತಿ ಭುವನಾಶ್ರಯಂ....... ಭಂಮಹಾರಾಜಾ \n4.\tಧಿರಾಜಂರಾಜಪರಮೇಸ್ವರಂಯಾದವಕುಲಾಂಬರದ್ಯಿಮಣಿ\n5.\tಸಬ್ರ್ಬಜ್ಞಚೂಡಾಮಣಿ ......ಪ್ರತಾವಚಕ್ರವತ್ರ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಹೊಂಯ್ಸ\n6.\tಳಶ್ರೀವೀರಬಲ್ಲಾಳದ........ರಾಜ್ಯಂಗೆಇವಲ್ಲಿ \n7.\t.................................................\n8.\t........ಎಲಹಕನಾಡ \n9.\t........ ಮಾಚಿದೇವರು \n",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "English_Translation__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
