      "properties": {
        "name": "Dasarahalli",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 36<br>Hobli: Yelahanka Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Dasarahalli (same hobli), on a virakal in Kote Hanumantas field.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/0750<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 4'6\"x3'9\"<br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 30<br>Date about 750 A.D.<br>Be it well. When S'ripurusha-maharaja was ruling the kingdom of the earth : called Polettalvor, Kukkara who was ruling Bidirkkal in Karika-nad, drove out the Palikkari-nad people, and smiting the whole force of foot-soldiers, fell.<br>Ambi-achari's son Naga made this.<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 36<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ದಾಸರಹಳ್ಳಿ ಗ್ರಾಮದ ಕೋಟೆ ಹನುಮಂತನ ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿರುವ ವೀರಕಲ್ಲು. <br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 4.6 ಘಿ 3.9<br><br>1. ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರಿಮತ್‍ ಶ್ರಿಪುರುಷ ಮಹಾರಾಜಂ ಪೃಥುವೀ ರಾ<br>2. ಜ್ಯಂಗೆಯ್ಯೆ ವೊಲೆತ್ತಾಳ್ವೊರೆನ್ನ ಕರಿಕನಾಡ<br>3. ಬಿದಿರ್ಕಲ್ಲಾಳ್ದ ಕುಕ್ಕರಪಾೞಿಕ್ಕಾಱಿನಾಡಿಯರ್ ತುರಿದು<br>4. ಪಡೆಯುಳವರಷ್ಟೆ ಬಲಮನ್ನ ಎಱಿದುಬಿಱ್ದು . .<br>5. ಶ್ರೀಅಮ್ಬಿ ಆಚಾರಿಯರ ಮಗ ನ್ನಾಗನ್‍ ಮಡಿದ<br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 13.0430617<br>Longitude: 77.5098261<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/0750",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Kannada",
        "Size": "4'6\"x3'9\"",
        "Current_Status": "Not traceable",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "30\nDate about 750 A.D.\nBe it well. When S'ripurusha-maharaja was ruling the kingdom of the earth : called Polettalvor, Kukkara who was ruling Bidirkkal in Karika-nad, drove out the Palikkari-nad people, and smiting the whole force of foot-soldiers, fell.\nAmbi-achari's son Naga made this.",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "36\n\nಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ದಾಸರಹಳ್ಳಿ ಗ್ರಾಮದ ಕೋಟೆ ಹನುಮಂತನ ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿರುವ ವೀರಕಲ್ಲು. \n\nಪ್ರಮಾಣ 4.6 ಘಿ 3.9\n\n1. ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರಿಮತ್‍ ಶ್ರಿಪುರುಷ ಮಹಾರಾಜಂ ಪೃಥುವೀ ರಾ\n2. ಜ್ಯಂಗೆಯ್ಯೆ ವೊಲೆತ್ತಾಳ್ವೊರೆನ್ನ ಕರಿಕನಾಡ\n3. ಬಿದಿರ್ಕಲ್ಲಾಳ್ದ ಕುಕ್ಕರಪಾೞಿಕ್ಕಾಱಿನಾಡಿಯರ್ ತುರಿದು\n4. ಪಡೆಯುಳವರಷ್ಟೆ ಬಲಮನ್ನ ಎಱಿದುಬಿಱ್ದು . .\n5. ಶ್ರೀಅಮ್ಬಿ ಆಚಾರಿಯರ ಮಗ ನ್ನಾಗನ್‍ ಮಡಿದ\n",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "English_Translation__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "English_Transliteration__Retyped_By": "",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "Photographs_Provided_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
