        "name": "Dasarahalli",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 37<br>Hobli: Yelahanka Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the same place, on another stone.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/0980<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 4'x2'9\"<br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 37<br><br>Date ? about 980 A.D.<br><br>Be it well. When Indara was ruling- Dharmagudu, piercing ………………. Went to svargga. A grant was made for him. Impreciation.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 37 <br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ದಾಸರಗಹಳ್ಳಿ ಗ್ರಾಮದ ಕೋಟೆ ಹನುಮಂತನ ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿರುವ ವೀರಕಲ್ಲು. <br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 4 ಘಿ 2.9<br>1. ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರಿ ಇನ್ದರನಾಳಾಧರ್ಮಗುಡು . . .<br>2. ನುಮಿಱಿದು ಸ್ವರ್ಗ್ಗಸ್ತರಾದರ್ ಇದ . .<br>3. . . . . . ದಳ್ದಗಿಯರಮ್ಮ . . .<br>4. ಇದಮ್ಮಸಿದಾಪರಿಯ . . . .<br>5. . . . .<br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 13.0430068<br>Longitude: 77.5099656<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
