        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKu0C4iq3lIGOA0tNB0I9b8PnRBtV8Fzsam06fQgAcHulhfmXyL4vDoRzFd8ebRRrPz1dc5kicCwAZVAjPZFR6V6R9c83WfL3Ash0IwZlyGKCb1yozapoRFKQyP9kkV78ez7W4U9n9jYFi61CDCyWdCN9jpJp365PfBDhXWx238lsNnjZFDYXAyhpQxEK7wAVWCWbil3?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 38<br>Hobli: Yelahanka Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the same village, on a virakal in Shanbogha Ellappas field<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1000<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 6'X4'6\"<br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 38<br><br>Date about 1000 A.D.<br><br>Be it well. Madi-gamunda being ………. this periyur, - Siriyura’s son Marisinga, when the cows of Inbatur were carried off, died . When Chaura was ruling he died.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 38<br><br>ade grāmada śānabhoga yallappana hŏladalliruva vīrakallu.<br><br>pramāṇa 6 ghi 4.6<br><br>1. svastiśrī mādiyagāmuṃḍa<br>2. rī periyūru ūmiya siri<br>3. ūra rāmāganu mārasiṅga<br>4. inbatūra tūṟūgŏl̤ĕ satan<br>5. caūra āl̤ĕ sata.<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team<br>಄ svŏstiśrī mādĕyagāmuṃḍa<br>rī pĕriyūru ūmiya siri<br>ūra rāmāganu mārasiṅga<br>injatura tūṟūgŏl̤ĕ satan<br>i ūra āl̤vŏ sataṃ<br><br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 38<br><br>ಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮದ ಶಾನಭೋಗ ಯಲ್ಲಪ್ಪನ ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿರುವ ವೀರಕಲ್ಲು.<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 6 ಘಿ 4.6<br><br>1. ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀ ಮಾದಿಯಗಾಮುಂಡ<br>2. ರೀ ಪೇರಿಯೂರು ಊಮಿಯ ಸಿರಿ<br>3. ಊರ ರಾಮಾಗನು ಮಾರಸಿಙ್ಗ<br>4. ಇನ್ಬತೂರ ತೂಱೂಗೊಳೆ ಸತನ್<br>5. ಚಊರ ಆಳೆ ಸತ.<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team<br>಄ ಸ್ವೊಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀ ಮಾದೆಯಗಾಮುಂಡ<br>ರೀ ಪೆರಿಯೂರು ಊಮಿಯ ಸಿರಿ<br>ಊರ ರಾಮಾಗನು ಮಾರಸಿಙ್ಗ<br>ಇನ್ಜತುರ ತೂಱೂಗೊಳೆ ಸತನ್<br>ಇ ಊರ ಆಳ್ವೊ ಸತಂ<br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 13.04282<br>Longitude: 77.50981<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvze_kJ-i8YZMqsLV3YtssW3D6xWg5RTt4uNiooBhVk1MV5FDftj7i0lWAUeMwwncnqIFja57HzlAUUNVHSMdAGNoLhqSykKsDecd_oZiEtFslSfqMt6_t_ECQn8vyknts50-8zljBr1WobChCTx55YHIUxBgjpJ6Gktd6TMH1Z4XxhZ1QGPfmf-yb82DaUfbBrN17t?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtzsYLoIJMFhXm7UjU41XkGSmgK-TKBNeESi3ArCwJNas_8mB8AZrQrsYq4-gptmeA0wHd0v26nnHGcG8VLm7I71awo-sGsUDCgfvKRzVmHYOY9RX8EUkhmMaX5k6SMifmsY9SU1QR66uTjj1Z42c7kJbVEE95Mu0IzVl8XtjYM4epHOc3tUCdH-01BuJeTsx3RfJk?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuxX9f9tV-zne4q3KvqczuvV2egBzQe5kUe2PgbYLI8uJwlKf4DHR91CKmhOAZpeKTc-or4XUXGxh2nDeZ-qe0miB7tzeIiygEGFF-E7fBHG5DtCuXwedFvh9uk8HLmuJ66qmSNSZhTe95ttjTagIAtK7m9gXi4IXVGA9ojkCSkTG0jz48H4QZnkiaCs47LvchuxiA?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1000",
