        "Hobli": "Yelahanka Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At the same village, on a virakal in Shanbogha Ellappas field",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "38\n\nade grāmada śānabhoga yallappana hŏladalliruva vīrakallu.\n\npramāṇa 6 ghi 4.6\n\n1. svastiśrī mādiyagāmuṃḍa\n2. rī periyūru ūmiya siri\n3. ūra rāmāganu mārasiṅga\n4. inbatūra tūṟūgŏl̤ĕ satan\n5. caūra āl̤ĕ sata.\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team\n಄ svŏstiśrī mādĕyagāmuṃḍa\nrī pĕriyūru ūmiya siri\nūra rāmāganu mārasiṅga\ninjatura tūṟūgŏl̤ĕ satan\ni ūra āl̤vŏ sataṃ\n",
