        "name": "Vartur",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 40<br>Hobli: Vartur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Vartur (Varthur hobli), on a stone lying on the tank bund near the northern sluice<br>Installation Date: 01/01/0820<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 4'2\"X2'<br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 40<br>Date about 820 A.D.<br>Be it well.  When Permmanadi was ruling the kingdom of the earth :- and Nolemba Sivamara was ruling Morasu-nad :- of the Mahabali-vamsa,  Nijapa’s son Anniga received from both kings a devabhoga, and for the increase of ….. caused to be given 2 kandugas of land to Trailoka- vira.<br>Ereyappa and the Brahmans of Mangala are witnesses.<br>Kailasa-pandita wrote it. Imprecation<br>To the Nayaka 5 ploughs of land.<br><br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 40 <br><br>ವತ್ತೂರು ಹೋಬಳಿ ವತ್ತೂರುಕೆರೆ ಕಟ್ಟೆಮೇಲೆ ಉತ್ತರಕಡೆ ತೂಬಿದ್ದಿರುವ ಕಲ್ಲು <br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 4.2 ಘಿ 2<br><br>1.\tನಾಯಕಗಯ್ಗುಳಮಣ್ಣು<br>2.\tಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಪೆಮ್ರ್ಮಾನಡಿಪ್ರಿತಿವೀ<br>3.\tರಾಜ್ಯಂಗೆಯೆನೊಳಂಬಶಿ <br>4.\tವಮಾರಂಮೊರಸುನಾಡೆನಾಳು <br>5.\tತ್ತಿರೆಮೆಹಬಲಿವಂಸನಿಜವೆ <br>6.\tನಮಗಣ್ಣಿಗಿಬ್ರ್ಬರರಸು <br>7.\tಗಳಲ್ಲಿಪಡೆದು ದೇವಭೋಗ <br>8.\tಮೆರುಅಕುನ್ಪಾಡ್ಪಿಯನೆಅಲಗು <br>9.\tಡಿಸಿದತ್ರೈಲೋಕೆವೀರಕೆಕೊಟ್ಟನು <br>10.\tಣ್ಣುಇರ್ಖಣ್ಣುಗೆಅಯಪ<br>11.\tಮಂಗಳದಮಹಾಜನಸಾ <br>12.\tಕ್ಷಿಕಯಿಲಾಸವಣ್ಣಿತಬ್ರ್ಬ<br>13.\tರೆದಿಮಣ್ನಸಇದೋಂಬಾರ ಣಾಸಿಯಶ್ರೀಪಬ್ರ್ಬತಮದೋಂ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.9568372<br>Longitude: 77.7410146<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/0820",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Kannada",
        "Size": "4'2\"X2'",
        "Current_Status": "Not traceable",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "40\nDate about 820 A.D.\nBe it well.  When Permmanadi was ruling the kingdom of the earth :- and Nolemba Sivamara was ruling Morasu-nad :- of the Mahabali-vamsa,  Nijapa’s son Anniga received from both kings a devabhoga, and for the increase of ….. caused to be given 2 kandugas of land to Trailoka- vira.\nEreyappa and the Brahmans of Mangala are witnesses.\nKailasa-pandita wrote it. Imprecation\nTo the Nayaka 5 ploughs of land.\n\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "40 \n\nವತ್ತೂರು ಹೋಬಳಿ ವತ್ತೂರುಕೆರೆ ಕಟ್ಟೆಮೇಲೆ ಉತ್ತರಕಡೆ ತೂಬಿದ್ದಿರುವ ಕಲ್ಲು \n\nಪ್ರಮಾಣ 4.2 ಘಿ 2\n\n1.\tನಾಯಕಗಯ್ಗುಳಮಣ್ಣು\n2.\tಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಪೆಮ್ರ್ಮಾನಡಿಪ್ರಿತಿವೀ\n3.\tರಾಜ್ಯಂಗೆಯೆನೊಳಂಬಶಿ \n4.\tವಮಾರಂಮೊರಸುನಾಡೆನಾಳು \n5.\tತ್ತಿರೆಮೆಹಬಲಿವಂಸನಿಜವೆ \n6.\tನಮಗಣ್ಣಿಗಿಬ್ರ್ಬರರಸು \n7.\tಗಳಲ್ಲಿಪಡೆದು ದೇವಭೋಗ \n8.\tಮೆರುಅಕುನ್ಪಾಡ್ಪಿಯನೆಅಲಗು \n9.\tಡಿಸಿದತ್ರೈಲೋಕೆವೀರಕೆಕೊಟ್ಟನು \n10.\tಣ್ಣುಇರ್ಖಣ್ಣುಗೆಅಯಪ\n11.\tಮಂಗಳದಮಹಾಜನಸಾ \n12.\tಕ್ಷಿಕಯಿಲಾಸವಣ್ಣಿತಬ್ರ್ಬ\n13.\tರೆದಿಮಣ್ನಸಇದೋಂಬಾರ ಣಾಸಿಯಶ್ರೀಪಬ್ರ್ಬತಮದೋಂ",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "English_Translation__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "English_Transliteration__Retyped_By": "",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
