      "properties": {
        "name": "Pattandur",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 41<br>Hobli: Vartur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Pattandur (same hobli), on a stone to the west of the road.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1343<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 6'4\"x3'3\"<br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 41<br>Date 1343 A.D.<br>Be it well . (On the date specified), when the pratapachakravarthi Hoysala vira-Ballala- Devarasa was in Unnamale-pattana, ruling a peaceful kingdom; - the maha-savantadhipati Chikka-Kalaya-Nayaka, and all the farmers of Kadagodi-sthala in the tract within the stream on the south side fothe great Sanne-nad, granted to the senabhova of the Sanne kingdom, Perumbachari's (son) Satuvela Alala, a stone aasana as follows :- all the wet and dry land according to former custom included within the four boundaries of Hattandur in this sthala, have we granted as a sarvvamanya kodige, for as long as sun and moon endure, making the grant with a stone sasana.<br>Great good fortune.<br><br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 41<br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಪಟ್ಟಂದೂರು ತಿಟ್ಟನ್ಲಲಿ ರಸ್ತೆಪಶ್ಚಿಮ ಇರುವ ಕಲ್ಲಿನಲ್ಲಿ <br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 6.4 ಘಿ 3.3<br>1.\tಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಶಕಾಬ್ಬ125ನೆಯಚಿತ್ರಭಾ <br>2.\tಸುಸಂವತ್ಸಶು10ಸೋಗುಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಮ <br>3.\tತುಪ್ರತಾಪಚ್ಚಕ್ರವತ್ರ್ತಿತ್ರಿಹೊಯ್ಸಳಶ್ರೀವೀ <br>4.\tರಬಲ್ಲಾಳದೇವರಸವುಣಾಮಲಪಟ್ಟನ <br>5.\tದಲಿಸುಖರಾಜ್ಯಂಗೈಯವುತ್ತಿರಲುಶ್ರಿ <br>6.\tಮನುಮಹಾಸಾನಂತಾಧಿಪತಿಚಿಕ್ಕಕಳ <br>7.\tಯನಾಯಕಶ್ರೀಮನುಮಹಾಸಣ್ನೆ<br>8.\tನಾಡತೆಂಕಣಬಾಗೆಯತೋಅವಳ <br>9.\tವಿತಿಯಕಾಡಗೊಡಿಯಸ್ತಳದಸಮ<br>10.\tಸ್ತಗಉಂಡೆಗಳುಯಿಸಣ್ನೆರಾಜ್ಯದ<br>11.\tಗೇನಬೋವಸೆರುಂಬಾಚರಿಯಸಾತುವೆಲ<br>12.\tಅಲಾಳರಿಂಗೈಲಾಶಾಸನವಮಾಡಿಕೊ<br>13.\tಟಾಕ್ರಮವೆಂತೆಂದಡೆಯಗ್ತಳೆ[ದೂಳ]ದೊಳ<br>14.\tಗಣಹಟ್ಟಂದೂರಗದ್ದೆಬೆದ್ದಲುಚತು<br>15.\tಸೀಮೆವೊರ್ಒಮೆರಿಅದಿಏಸುಳ್ಳಹೊಲ<br>16.\tಸೀಮೆಯನೂಸರ್ಬಮಾನ್ಯದಕೊಡಿಗೆಯಾ<br>17.\tಗಿಚಂದ್ರದಿತ್ತರುಳ್ಳಂನಬರಸಲು<br>18.\tವಂತಾಗಿಶಿಲಾಶಾಸನಮಾಡಿಕೊ<br>19.\tಟ್ಟಉಮಂಗಳ ಮಹಾ ಶ್ರೀ ಶ್ರೀ ಶ್ರೀ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.98296<br>Longitude: 77.7518886<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1343",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Kannada",
        "Size": "6'4\"x3'3\"",
        "Current_Status": "Not traceable",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "41\nDate 1343 A.D.\nBe it well . (On the date specified), when the pratapachakravarthi Hoysala vira-Ballala- Devarasa was in Unnamale-pattana, ruling a peaceful kingdom; - the maha-savantadhipati Chikka-Kalaya-Nayaka, and all the farmers of Kadagodi-sthala in the tract within the stream on the south side fothe great Sanne-nad, granted to the senabhova of the Sanne kingdom, Perumbachari's (son) Satuvela Alala, a stone aasana as follows :- all the wet and dry land according to former custom included within the four boundaries of Hattandur in this sthala, have we granted as a sarvvamanya kodige, for as long as sun and moon endure, making the grant with a stone sasana.\nGreat good fortune.\n\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "41\nಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಪಟ್ಟಂದೂರು ತಿಟ್ಟನ್ಲಲಿ ರಸ್ತೆಪಶ್ಚಿಮ ಇರುವ ಕಲ್ಲಿನಲ್ಲಿ \nಪ್ರಮಾಣ 6.4 ಘಿ 3.3\n1.\tಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಶಕಾಬ್ಬ125ನೆಯಚಿತ್ರಭಾ \n2.\tಸುಸಂವತ್ಸಶು10ಸೋಗುಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಮ \n3.\tತುಪ್ರತಾಪಚ್ಚಕ್ರವತ್ರ್ತಿತ್ರಿಹೊಯ್ಸಳಶ್ರೀವೀ \n4.\tರಬಲ್ಲಾಳದೇವರಸವುಣಾಮಲಪಟ್ಟನ \n5.\tದಲಿಸುಖರಾಜ್ಯಂಗೈಯವುತ್ತಿರಲುಶ್ರಿ \n6.\tಮನುಮಹಾಸಾನಂತಾಧಿಪತಿಚಿಕ್ಕಕಳ \n7.\tಯನಾಯಕಶ್ರೀಮನುಮಹಾಸಣ್ನೆ\n8.\tನಾಡತೆಂಕಣಬಾಗೆಯತೋಅವಳ \n9.\tವಿತಿಯಕಾಡಗೊಡಿಯಸ್ತಳದಸಮ\n10.\tಸ್ತಗಉಂಡೆಗಳುಯಿಸಣ್ನೆರಾಜ್ಯದ\n11.\tಗೇನಬೋವಸೆರುಂಬಾಚರಿಯಸಾತುವೆಲ\n12.\tಅಲಾಳರಿಂಗೈಲಾಶಾಸನವಮಾಡಿಕೊ\n13.\tಟಾಕ್ರಮವೆಂತೆಂದಡೆಯಗ್ತಳೆ[ದೂಳ]ದೊಳ\n14.\tಗಣಹಟ್ಟಂದೂರಗದ್ದೆಬೆದ್ದಲುಚತು\n15.\tಸೀಮೆವೊರ್ಒಮೆರಿಅದಿಏಸುಳ್ಳಹೊಲ\n16.\tಸೀಮೆಯನೂಸರ್ಬಮಾನ್ಯದಕೊಡಿಗೆಯಾ\n17.\tಗಿಚಂದ್ರದಿತ್ತರುಳ್ಳಂನಬರಸಲು\n18.\tವಂತಾಗಿಶಿಲಾಶಾಸನಮಾಡಿಕೊ\n19.\tಟ್ಟಉಮಂಗಳ ಮಹಾ ಶ್ರೀ ಶ್ರೀ ಶ್ರೀ",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "English_Translation__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
