        "name": "Hagaduru",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsGeKP9SJ2esIre-sDz3_O1YFdrqG-oy2XgxzgcYFA4I_FGNy8_bv3Jp5wYkynkZJmF7fS3VpQD7iklN610J42PB6SZDKfu_AyvLbJBqJtKYRVQ-Zq1s_BUFQhYlPuHZvo-GaJihJkrFqybkmqh_6XHKh9tCgYbTSVtos7VcnFM1KTxC2cZoIWG5rFx6zm-z14gt3Y?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 43<br>Hobli: Vartur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Hagaduru (same hobli), in Mr. White's land to the west.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1283<br>Inscription Language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: 4'X1'6\"<br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 43<br>Date 1283 A.D.<br>(Tamil)- In the 29th year of the reign of Iramana-Devar-<br>(On the date specified), Irajaraja-Karkata-marayar Ganga-pperumal made a great of land.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 43<br>1.svasti šrī irāma-<br>2.ṉā tēvaṟ-<br>3.ku yāṇ-<br>4.ṭu 29 ā-<br>5.vatu śubhā4<br>6.nu samva<br>7.tsaram<br>8. ...irājarā<br>9. ...kkaṟkaṭa<br>10.mārāyar<br>11.kaṅkappe<br>12.rumāḷ viṭ<br>13.ṭa taṉmam<br>14.taṅkaḷ<br>15.keṭaparai<br>16.kāka nāyaṉā<br>17. ... ...<br>18. ... ...<br>19. ... ...<br>20.tāṇṭu<br>21.rāyaṇapurat<br>22.tukku….<br>23.ko ... ...<br>24. ... ... ...<br><br>English retyped text provided by S. Rajagopal <srgopal1950@gmail.com> & <br>S Paranthaman <paranthaman26@gmail.com><br><br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 43<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಹಗದೂರು ಗ್ರಾಮಕ್ಕೆ ಪಶ್ಚಿಮ ವೈಟ್ ಸಾಹೇಬರ ಜವಿೂನಿನಲ್ಲಿರುವದು <br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 4’ x 1’6”<br><br>ಗ್ರಂಥ ಮತ್ತು ಅರವಕ್ಷರ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: 43<br>1.ஸ்வஸ்ததி ஸ்ரீ இரராம-<br>2.னரா ததவற-<br>3.கு யராண-<br>4.டு 29 ஆ-<br>5.வது ச0பரா4 -<br>6.நு ஸம்வ-<br>7.த்ஸரம் ..<br>8. ...இரராஜரரா-<br>9. ...க்கறகட-<br>10.மராரராயர<br>11.கங்கப்பப<br>12.ருமராள் வதிட-<br>13.ட தன்மம்<br>14.தங்கள்<br>15.பகடபரர-<br>16.கராக நராயனரா-<br>17. ... ...<br>18. ... ...<br>19. ... ...<br>20.தராணடு. .<br>21.ரராயணபுரத்-<br>22.துக்கு….<br>23.பகரா ... ...<br>24. ... ... ...<br><br> Tamil retyped text provided by S. Rajagopal <srgopal1950@gmail.com> & <br>S Paranthaman <paranthaman26@gmail.com><br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.9666066<br>Longitude: 77.7562027<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
