        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "43",
        "Hobli": "Vartur Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At Hagaduru (same hobli), in Mr. White's land to the west.",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "43\n1.svasti šrī irāma-\n2.ṉā tēvaṟ-\n3.ku yāṇ-\n4.ṭu 29 ā-\n5.vatu śubhā4\n6.nu samva\n7.tsaram\n8. ...irājarā\n9. ...kkaṟkaṭa\n10.mārāyar\n11.kaṅkappe\n12.rumāḷ viṭ\n13.ṭa taṉmam\n14.taṅkaḷ\n15.keṭaparai\n16.kāka nāyaṉā\n17. ... ...\n18. ... ...\n19. ... ...\n20.tāṇṭu\n21.rāyaṇapurat\n22.tukku….\n23.ko ... ...\n24. ... ... ...\n\nEnglish retyped text provided by S. Rajagopal <srgopal1950@gmail.com> & \nS Paranthaman <paranthaman26@gmail.com>\n",
