        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "44",
        "Hobli": "Vartur Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At Immadihalli (same hobli), in the grazing ground to the north",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "44\nFront\n1.svasti šrī śkābda ……..\n2…..55 mēl cellā\n3.niṉṟa šrīmuka samvaṟsaṟatu\n4.tai māsa mutal tiyati tiṅka-\n5.kiḻamaiyu ṣaṣṭiyum peṟṟa\n6….ttu….. nissaṅka pratāpa\n7.pōcaḷa vīravallāḷa dēvar pṛudhi-\n8.vi rājyam paṇṇā niṉṟa kālattu sva-\n9.sti šrī manmahā vīracāmantā-\n10.tipati lakuma nāyakkaṉ makaṉ\n11.kaḷḷaya nāyakkaṉum sva-\n12.stišrī tuṟaivaḻi nāṭṭavar\n13.vaicca kāmuṇṭar poy-\nBack\n14.caḷaṉ pālitēva -\n15.ruḷḷiṭṭa nāṭṭavaru-\n16.m svasti šrī maṇikaṭ-\n17.ṭil ……..vaṉmārak-\n18.kavuṇṭar makaṉ cokka -\n19.ṉṉarkkum celvāṇ-\n20.ṭaikkum kuṭakai ūr\n21.kuṭuttapaṭi nāka kavuṇ-\n22.ṭaṉ paḷḷi nīṅkalāna pa-\n23.mma samutramum pamma-\n24.kiṟaiyum ivvūrukku\n25.ellai nāka kavuṇṇaṉ\n26.ḷḷi muṭakku….pai\n27.candrāditavarai…\n28………\n\n\nEnglish retyped text provided by S. Rajagopal <srgopal1950@gmail.com> & \nS Paranthaman <paranthaman26@gmail.com>\n",
