        "name": "Doddakannale",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 45<br>Hobli: Vartur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: On a veeragalu in the ruined fort<br>Installation Date: Not dated<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: Not given in the EC.<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 45<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ದೊಡ್ಡಕನ್ನಲೆ ಗ್ರಾಮದ ಪಾಳು ಕೋಟೆಯಲ್ಲಿರುವ ವೀರಕಲ್ಲು.<br><br><br>ವೆಯಸಂವತ್ಸರದ ಆನ್ಯಯುಜಸು15ಲುಯಕ್ಕದೇವರಸ.<br>ಕೂಡಿದದಿನನಂದನಸಂವತ್ಸರದಮಾಗಬೂಗುಮಾ..<br>ಯಸಿದ್ದಮಾಡಿದರು.<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.9074702<br>Longitude: 77.6950337<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
