        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKs-nAHlJTEnJmVN0mXcU8KWpoLGY3vUAXN-ou_V0LkgapPN4jJJwtVw7ps8E_4yYUufxqy_Urb5XMjB5G1wjaU7hyXDAJLGrz2nmJMcQtLnklRd7ffl1rhbFKzuNmKCWKme3NZBjKaxWt9SPpCHZSm70ggM6GTfbaMOvgoh70EihPR5wpOrowgJYjxzfmC8oyPco62d?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 46<br>Hobli: Vartur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the foot of a pillar<br>Installation Date: Not dated<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: Not given in the EC.<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 46<br><br>ಅದೇ ಸ್ಥಳದಲ್ಲಿರುವ ಕಂಭದ ಬುಡದಲ್ಲಿ<br><br><br>1ನಳಸಂವತ್ಸರ <br>2ದಚೈಯಿತ್ರರು <br>3 …. . .……. ಮಾರಪನಮ<br>4 ಗಸುರಲೋಕಕೆ.ದ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.9074702<br>Longitude: 77.6950337<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKt66FQi7Aa7QrszQ18rXOnv4-Xhr5n6idWf8E-NmhmQN__8lvCmm5WRbR6w516sW3YTdFyZbWMZxmKigGHazuPicTEc0BfKeyKG_mIGlkMnnI6T0v1fg8pCul7VbREg6SoA_5VkpuQpWIVYsxZUw-xom0Gj2eQl9bYzJY2QHAcHin8iiWyQvbK6RjuKccoA6m9S0pg3?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
