        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 48<br>Hobli: Vartur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: On a stone to the south of the Anjenaya Temple <br>Installation Date: Not dated<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 4'6\"X1'8\"<br>Current Status: Yet to verify<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: Not given in the EC.<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 48<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಕಸವನಹಳ್ಳಿ ಗ್ರಾಮದಲ್ಲಿ ಆಂಜನೇಯ ದೇವಾಲಯಕ್ಕೆ ದಕ್ಷಿಣ ಕಡೆ ನೆಟ್ಟಕಲ್ಲು<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 4’6” x 1’8”<br><br>1ಕುಭಮಸ್ತುನ. . . ಸೋಮೇಶ್ವ <br>2ರನೇ ಗ್ರಾಮದೇವತೆ . . . <br>. . . . . .  . . . . . <br>5ವಾರಣಾಸಿಯ . . . <br>6. . . .  ಹೋಹರುತಂಮತಾಯಿ ‘<br>. . . . ಗಳಿಗೆತಪ್ಪಿದವರು<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.9094467<br>Longitude: 77.6760711<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
