        "name": "Kaikondrahalli ",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsik4M-_YoXetDnmdHY5Hf1n0vhjq1HR1iJst1BWQi117hM5ind9jH-NccbCoVdaojEWhmRewXfm5FUT0JXeY3-qIyH1WQ8C1O_8Nbm6Z0N2rBx0VsJMDYoCFPnKSXHI8gVFjj9bf4NQ2oizlEuUCFffp31YWKXEtNCo87Hp79s8hnrWzmncdgTzgMHUF63lBjrknlj?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: Ithihaasa Darshana Vol 31<br>Hobli: Vartur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: On a Veeragalu<br>Installation Date: 01/01/0900<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: unknown<br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: Not in the EC<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: The Inscription<br>1 svasti śrī<br>2 kaliyugada<br>3 ṇuvaṃ nāgatta<br>4 raṃ rājyaṃgĕ<br>5 yyuttirĕ kaṇni<br>6 liya ĕṟĕya<br>7 mma gāvuṇḍanāl̤u<br>8 ĕṟĕyaṃga vā<br>9 daragaṃ yūral̤ivi<br>10 nalsattaṃ avana ma<br>11 gaṃ mārasiṃgha vā<br>12 daragaṃ māḍisidaṃ<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team<br>1 . svasti śrī<br>2 kaliyugada<br>3 ṇuvaṃ nāgatta<br>4 raṃ rājyaṃgĕ<br>5 yyuttirĕ kaṇni<br>6 liya ĕṟĕya<br>7 mma gāvuṇḍanāl̤ĕ<br>8 ĕṟĕyaṃga vā<br>9 daragaṃ yūral̤ivi<br>10 nalsattaṃ avana ma<br>11 gaṃ mārasiṃgha vā<br>12 daragaṃ māḍisidaṃ<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1 ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿ ಶ್ರೀ<br>2 ಕಲಿಯುಗದ<br>3 ಣುವಂ ನಾಗತ್ತ<br>4 ರಂ ರಾಜ್ಯಂಗೆ<br>5 ಯ್ಯುತ್ತಿರೆ ಕಣ್ನಿ<br>6 ಲಿಯ ಎಱೆಯ<br>7 ಮ್ಮ ಗಾವುಣ್ಡನಾಳು<br>8 ಎಱೆಯಂಗ ವಾ<br>9 ದರಗಂ ಯೂರಳಿವಿ<br>10 ನಲ್ಸತ್ತಂ ಅವನ ಮ<br>11 ಗಂ ಮಾರಸಿಂಘ ವಾ<br>12 ದರಗಂ ಮಾಡಿಸಿದಂ<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team<br>1 . ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿ ಶ್ರೀ<br>2 ಕಲಿಯುಗದ<br>3 ಣುವಂ ನಾಗತ್ತ<br>4 ರಂ ರಾಜ್ಯಂಗೆ<br>5 ಯ್ಯುತ್ತಿರೆ ಕಣ್ನಿ<br>6 ಲಿಯ ಎಱೆಯ<br>7 ಮ್ಮ ಗಾವುಣ್ಡನಾಳೆ<br>8 ಎಱೆಯಂಗ ವಾ<br>9 ದರಗಂ ಯೂರಳಿವಿ<br>10 ನಲ್ಸತ್ತಂ ಅವನ ಮ<br>11 ಗಂ ಮಾರಸಿಂಘ ವಾ<br>12 ದರಗಂ ಮಾಡಿಸಿದಂ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.91069<br>Longitude: 77.6807<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvWvtP86B6euZk-piClmWKWzpm2cvl5ddMH2pQBx9GKmKsy1BCx75_-SeNTyLFTahpvar6NOBKKUSKE3bSuTJ75b14YoyMWKqYrHZV7BSLKEOqfVxkYtWasrcYU-hguhw5yrVvbBotAfpBRZkY5XHKVdbzUnzMaUoWzcgvPu68cJcMHTzqlFqgOx7OrXfrbIcigq4hU?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsYWovr9biVNoAkG-6Jg64eoXubD5GJ58fkHj941_8sa8X9WMnF0mTSn9U2FlSvQWBawkY7G3M4lpb3eqZuG-rXbMSqq1cqhDMroisTZNbBlr4O0YSsgBgh9FZ4lOqIEc-BsMcv4KtNAC_oyVAFJLk_uSIRFtaTbNMeExXSDAAsZ9UPSVtIHNherF-6H_o0D_QzuNs?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtPZ8yFDtminJRsAWYjp1iKWy3dkFn-DU3-qdIUpS5VEaS2uI6XRdJK8C0fcLsxBoWWrdd1aV1RCUABGo1XYWrBWkdeUYOLnZ5QcJRvpBReG8OCQ3WXafZprLr9_6xW78xvJ-ddYNKxkbseMbpVOTJjCPusjqVwCSzm9Ijgkzv_Ei5PXkUXYSdfvwnLcnVaT053CPw?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
