        "Hobli": "Vartur Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "On a Veeragalu",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "The Inscription\n1 svasti śrī\n2 kaliyugada\n3 ṇuvaṃ nāgatta\n4 raṃ rājyaṃgĕ\n5 yyuttirĕ kaṇni\n6 liya ĕṟĕya\n7 mma gāvuṇḍanāl̤u\n8 ĕṟĕyaṃga vā\n9 daragaṃ yūral̤ivi\n10 nalsattaṃ avana ma\n11 gaṃ mārasiṃgha vā\n12 daragaṃ māḍisidaṃ\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team\n1 . svasti śrī\n2 kaliyugada\n3 ṇuvaṃ nāgatta\n4 raṃ rājyaṃgĕ\n5 yyuttirĕ kaṇni\n6 liya ĕṟĕya\n7 mma gāvuṇḍanāl̤ĕ\n8 ĕṟĕyaṃga vā\n9 daragaṃ yūral̤ivi\n10 nalsattaṃ avana ma\n11 gaṃ mārasiṃgha vā\n12 daragaṃ māḍisidaṃ",
        "Name_": "",
