        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 49<br>Hobli: Vartur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: On a broken Stone in front of Anjeneya temple<br>Installation Date: Not dated<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 6'X3'2\"<br>Current Status: Yet to verify<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: Not given in the EC.<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 49<br><br>ಅದೇ ದೇವಾಲಯದ ಮುಂದೆ ಬಿದ್ದಿರುವ ಒಡೆದ ಕಲ್ಲು <br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 6’x 3’2”<br><br>ನಾಗರಕ್ಷಕ <br><br>ಮುಂಭಾಗ <br><br>1.\t.  ಶುಭಮಸ್ತು . . .<br>2.\t. . . . . . . . . <br>3.ದಯಶಾಲಿವಾಹನ. <br>. . . . . . . . . . .<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.9094087<br>Longitude: 77.6761287<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
