        "name": "Marathahalli",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvoEl9WzjNMl8L2gi9i9X-QEjyq0HK_SVrlCLZNGCg79wvZ_suSZG5Ps2poca1xiWZOLhacyMuwKzVol5vQkFJl14AFi1DADTopOib77Wy6jnPKdAXVQEq0E2q3LB4pc18E-F4h4M7wiDuMndIOc0PEVfdyMj4RI_B_TlQ1yoEiDPgL6Gmgl2I9tlmgUYyrlIxeqSbv?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 52<br>Hobli: Vartur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Maratihalli (sanie hobli), on a stone near ihe asvattha mara.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1508<br>Inscription Language: Telugu<br>Size: 6'2\"X1'6\"<br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 52<br>Date 1301 A.D.<br>(Telugu)- Be it well. (On the date specified), when the maha-mandalesvara rajadhiraja raya-paramesvara………….vira-Narasinga-Raya-maharaya [was ruling]:---………………..<br> Imprecations.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 52<br>At Maratihalli (same hobli), on a stone near the as’vattha mara.<br>Svasti sri vijayabhyudaya-S’alivahana-saka-varshambulu 1429 Prabhava-samvatsara-Magha-suda 1 lu sriman-maha-madajesvara.. sahasa.. sri-vira pratapa vira-Narasinga-Raya-maha-raya …………………….. i-dharam yavaru saganiyani dora-pedda-kodakunu tane Varanasini champi a-mamsam tinavadu ani devatalu rishulu Brahmalu sapam Har-Haradulu sakshi.<br><br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 52<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಮಾರುತಿಹಳ್ಳಿಯ ವೂರುಮುಂದೆ ಆಶ್ವತ್ಥಮರದ ಬಳಿ<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 6’2” x 1’6” <br><br>1ಸ್ಯಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀ ವಿಜಯಾಭ್ಯುದಯಶಾ <br>2ಲಿವಾಹನಶಕವರ್ಷಂಬುಲು <br>3 1429ಪ್ರಭವಸಂವತ್ಸರಮಾ <br>4 ಫಶುದ1ಲುಶ್ರೀಮಾನ್‍ಮಹಾ<br>5ಮಂಡಳೇಶ್ವರರಾಜಾಧಿರಾಯರಾ <br>6ಯರಾಯಪರಮೇಶ್ವರ . . ಸಾ<br>7ಹಸ. . .ಶ್ರೀ ವೀರಪ್ರತಾಪ<br>8ವೀರನರಸಿಂಗರಾಯಮಹಾ <br>9ರಾಯ. . . <br>10. . . . . . <br>11¬ೂಧರ್ಮಯವರು <br>12 ನಾಗನಿಯನಿದೊರ <br>13ವೆದಕೊಡುಕುನು <br>14 ತಾನೆವಾರಣಾಶಿನಿ <br>15 ಚಂಪಿಆಮಾಂಸ <br>16ತಿನವಾಡುಅನಿದೇ<br>17ವತುಲುಋಪು <br>18 ಲುಬ್ರಾಹ್ಮಲುಶಾ <br>19 ಪಂಹರಿಹರಾ <br>20ದುಲುಸಾಕ್ಷಿ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Telugu the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.954058<br>Longitude: 77.693534<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKu4huLRDZG0kncH7ogI-lb-7pl5_M697n3nkdo5Jul6rEg3y6PAwtem1hN8fhZhSwemVEo6zCeJQtUZMMblYXsUdvDLFJJUl9gNpOih6qFLjbOnhZS0Rs6-1RC53-Weh1OhdHhJtxoljpXwPlT7f_h8EgQqttjk915gcHQ17VKuu1imPtdX37dv3THiTmB45oLMACA?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtwA4ealhBnix2Z612ZMowqFjNCtC1UcVnRjsehScGJmVGs5ZZO6sevxi0XztxzObKWbfATrIuJiuqlyl0ZYjsXuu8L57bbz8c8pFj9dVsJJLQBgVLqyNfssC4y3BQHpOXe-hcf-xGkyNxrPx3Sg66rIJ2bTRZ_oY9gzBXTb6bcaAgofcZT_2DOaoIXFyPT9xJGtDI?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuuPvQLYVBZYU8N6FjGYjqwyM1rjcj-OFXyUfqoIfMrtQ_gAybOsSiNQFMdhfh83sFg0-fdcDDMft97W81GtgM8NP0QBR8hHfJqYEWpZ2CZyTE1_QtZrYPWkF8gcLY2xRZo_aF6g8C6mmzsj7r4Ve7mmTQIJxYxcjWy-s6BuyJolcTUSlOU9OMvzjiDdTkrqjlz_yY?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtdglv--bMUeKQBrdRydVa2WAG1qXvoB3wTGLlBt5RmjiBxgVmRbznjahD7kdKt0RdJmhae_JWbukB8nR3wEi5oRkTvOnml9zbS_rXTdkpiBoYSjDc6-MpwYhHx8M0B3667AYyTW5bjPWa6BOhQCfpkx9dsCOnaHvhEhkcxHFavPL84ha7LTxdsFRG7zKmQ899-05GM?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKs45sJRgc-PTTpMoAnP_Ug2xtk5zasBfMNm7Q4URn4LCxXmF8GGF4skSabDPD9fUDeguftadcsVTqXT39bx_GM0dQTUO1d8Hm7HWerwImf8Gz0HmMRpNaIGZsfv321VZnb-ZEI5mrRPN6_z9USh8RSliQQN6g0ICvU932BbwVtBK-FsHeSNYB1y0JR8QdPgFz2tDKw?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsha6YOJ1D_nufEAwgwuIYM8-dq6WeVw7O2DCiT1MKmJZ7Ycd-a3fPq_cBIMt2_-uTp_Bx4X03uxTWLCwSkLbxblcyA3FA-WBH6E1Ptsn5azYKoQ2tfgZ6X-gt3WTgwQrTkEziV52fpeP8kMNXDczkAWV9eGzi7Y0HRKe5LocpYpH2qiF6-IOw_V_cgpgPbkJq7B5g?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
