        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvoEl9WzjNMl8L2gi9i9X-QEjyq0HK_SVrlCLZNGCg79wvZ_suSZG5Ps2poca1xiWZOLhacyMuwKzVol5vQkFJl14AFi1DADTopOib77Wy6jnPKdAXVQEq0E2q3LB4pc18E-F4h4M7wiDuMndIOc0PEVfdyMj4RI_B_TlQ1yoEiDPgL6Gmgl2I9tlmgUYyrlIxeqSbv?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKu4huLRDZG0kncH7ogI-lb-7pl5_M697n3nkdo5Jul6rEg3y6PAwtem1hN8fhZhSwemVEo6zCeJQtUZMMblYXsUdvDLFJJUl9gNpOih6qFLjbOnhZS0Rs6-1RC53-Weh1OhdHhJtxoljpXwPlT7f_h8EgQqttjk915gcHQ17VKuu1imPtdX37dv3THiTmB45oLMACA?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtwA4ealhBnix2Z612ZMowqFjNCtC1UcVnRjsehScGJmVGs5ZZO6sevxi0XztxzObKWbfATrIuJiuqlyl0ZYjsXuu8L57bbz8c8pFj9dVsJJLQBgVLqyNfssC4y3BQHpOXe-hcf-xGkyNxrPx3Sg66rIJ2bTRZ_oY9gzBXTb6bcaAgofcZT_2DOaoIXFyPT9xJGtDI?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuuPvQLYVBZYU8N6FjGYjqwyM1rjcj-OFXyUfqoIfMrtQ_gAybOsSiNQFMdhfh83sFg0-fdcDDMft97W81GtgM8NP0QBR8hHfJqYEWpZ2CZyTE1_QtZrYPWkF8gcLY2xRZo_aF6g8C6mmzsj7r4Ve7mmTQIJxYxcjWy-s6BuyJolcTUSlOU9OMvzjiDdTkrqjlz_yY?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtdglv--bMUeKQBrdRydVa2WAG1qXvoB3wTGLlBt5RmjiBxgVmRbznjahD7kdKt0RdJmhae_JWbukB8nR3wEi5oRkTvOnml9zbS_rXTdkpiBoYSjDc6-MpwYhHx8M0B3667AYyTW5bjPWa6BOhQCfpkx9dsCOnaHvhEhkcxHFavPL84ha7LTxdsFRG7zKmQ899-05GM?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKs45sJRgc-PTTpMoAnP_Ug2xtk5zasBfMNm7Q4URn4LCxXmF8GGF4skSabDPD9fUDeguftadcsVTqXT39bx_GM0dQTUO1d8Hm7HWerwImf8Gz0HmMRpNaIGZsfv321VZnb-ZEI5mrRPN6_z9USh8RSliQQN6g0ICvU932BbwVtBK-FsHeSNYB1y0JR8QdPgFz2tDKw?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsha6YOJ1D_nufEAwgwuIYM8-dq6WeVw7O2DCiT1MKmJZ7Ycd-a3fPq_cBIMt2_-uTp_Bx4X03uxTWLCwSkLbxblcyA3FA-WBH6E1Ptsn5azYKoQ2tfgZ6X-gt3WTgwQrTkEziV52fpeP8kMNXDczkAWV9eGzi7Y0HRKe5LocpYpH2qiF6-IOw_V_cgpgPbkJq7B5g?authuser=0&fife=s16383",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "52",
        "Hobli": "Vartur Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At Maratihalli (sanie hobli), on a stone near ihe asvattha mara.",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "52\nAt Maratihalli (same hobli), on a stone near the as’vattha mara.\nSvasti sri vijayabhyudaya-S’alivahana-saka-varshambulu 1429 Prabhava-samvatsara-Magha-suda 1 lu sriman-maha-madajesvara.. sahasa.. sri-vira pratapa vira-Narasinga-Raya-maha-raya …………………….. i-dharam yavaru saganiyani dora-pedda-kodakunu tane Varanasini champi a-mamsam tinavadu ani devatalu rishulu Brahmalu sapam Har-Haradulu sakshi.\n",
        "Name_": "",
        "EC_9_Ht_": "",
        "layer": "The Incredible Inscription Stones of Bengaluru — Bangalore Taluk",
        "path": "N:/02.CURATE STUDIO/25.02_INFRACULTURE/08. WATER AND THE CITY/03 Interactive Timelines/to map/The Incredible Inscription Stones of Bengaluru.kml|layername=Bangalore Taluk|geometrytype=Point25D|uniqueGeometryType=yes"
