        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKs6I3Yl1yLVwPaDmjDgh3L0cJ4tSgqPbZS4i1-BnXhmvKWI3gkLDPtC9lRUgCmt0o8hoAA0TErMcJerRxGit-KSdw7cwiyjRv6QhcqOZJ4CETnk09AMPJ_e6x1AyZvkSOp7yKDkuwuUTQzIrvoiOEMXeVu2TjsQwv6WCr1en1FLByv16G0hqt1faJWMOC962a-Etr7_?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvO87AGmc17wzZcYRT5bQHyM70WF-cZbEyzsewQO13yfKWT-7Ntz9cXU2NVjmYesIfxurH-6jYuzLKjGety4cA_14bRcNQJ4Z6Yf1KcmMxBeudCeC4fT0DgLNZZAFRWxkYEMPNxcbgpNVkCmJwl5NzB-RPjJSFSyCzQw7DMKTnA2BBBzWmQkjUlLX0uCdxdH45w5u4w?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvU37N7IVYangND5oAbt-hgFckURx6MjXIoFFkNniUUSMbE1ywjgE9KMcnQk7hvl47tjox_8aUDq2oSlFaP8isUOoqZB_WmmPnSbJkMo0eTCGAvsa9h1fIfTvFKkIg48RHuMkGPa--PYxHHj1Gmq7rC9_yHNnxe12_c1WgJjFCndwpGV6Crvah6TgnPEv6-um8g6vM?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://www.youtube.com/embed/Fu08FqFln1Q https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKusp-RUsi4sX-QFRjhvMyLR3P3s05p54K549aNSL_wtNlnix0tlQ1VmZCaUTvxA4XBncgQ6rf3SS2d-v3AH1VTitBAlWwvX6rpMqRLedRbw2wmzR27bAOC1YfOCVC5N1l2LTimiTc3zlI72opGe-KLEsVBhoOCu6bt89Fx6Fl7jJUl3vfEwL3U9cHg0fidgcP4etTI?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKv9sgQ2rU7OWvWycc6JlKNSc8KNFEkhSQS3zrflCqDVLvaoFfpXf4Vz93RUa7pixElSj4zvsjz4iyeL8OzoxKeG-kziMJOYdXPvfsXYtEG-a0iOhrAgq8U4pNo_wl-8eJChRzMT76YgQzn4-cHjjoUFsqDWVjtMbrRNU05jqwGTFA45yfczfXyDR0LUudjA1hnXpK8?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsCXRxYr4t74q3592QOtGNwA48YyyjNC9XaCDq0NAkfd3qsRkwuQUg12HUZNAZUwH9cF01n1SnRUe_bcOZnYiF7KiRffrpVcrxDSQOnWFWDDkx13g47LaQxuh14xeqlXu9XYF-x8t1Dwdz-8683BdzWTOHryFMghJREwVFcBVcW9LKOMkrZoUhKaNywzChEqdJo9vY?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtlK5H-5NRfG-H6YLpv-blbcHWAsUVde7Digl9gls7jvk1FBxcI8XN-0TtKPOJv1yciXCTjtaiLUZVNmLGT8U_wq4Uj7Pgi3zOYZZw44yDe51ggQiBkZmFCp_HTUXO5WlPlQHUqXpNqNWGJCCJFD2y9ss4X14JvmJSC71w2xijX33j74NVdwl1zKD9CFDfgXwVFu_eHBAIG6dSrENVRARVDXLXq41M3RUG1HYsm0ycz1K1x?authuser=0&fife=s16383",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "53",
        "Hobli": "Vartur Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At Dodda Nekkundi (same hobli), on a stone lying in gutte hola near the village",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "53\nAt Dodda Nekkundi (same hobli), on a stone lyng in gutte hola near the village. (Grantha and Tamil characters).\nSvasti samasta-bhuvanasraya sri-prituvi-vallabha maharajadhiraja puraradisvara Dvaravati-puravaradisvara Ya lava-kulambara-dvimani sarvajna-sudamani malaraja-raja malaiparul ganda ganda-berunda kadana-prasanda ekanga-viran asahaya-sura Sanivara-sidhi Giridugga-malla jalatunga-Rama vaiyribha-kandibhava Magarachchiya-nirmula S’ola-rachchi-pratishthasariya Pandiya-kula-samudha-rana nichchanga-pratapa-chchakravartti Hosala-sri-sri-vira-Ballala-Devarasar valukkun-dolukkun-jeyvam-aga svasti sri Masandi-nattu Periya-nattu Melamugattu Vira-Vallala-Deva-nattu nayakan-jeyvan Plla-gamindan ullitta nattavarum svasti srimanu-maha-prasattamma. Nan Machchan .. .. .. .. Tillappar ur .. ..adikarigalum svasti sri udaiyar S’ivagenge-udaiya-nayanarkku dana-sadhana-pramanam-panni-kkudutta-pparisavadu Devar Vira-Vallala-Devarasar vadakku Ariyar mel eduttu vittu Nakkigundi-kkottaiyum alittu venru padai I Dorasamuttirattile elundaruli.. rundu dushatanigraham sishta-sishta-pratipanam-pani prituvi-rachchiyam-panni na …………… ga.. prattigaiyil engal nattil Erumur-kkadappalli Nerkundi nanjai punjai nar-park-ellaiyum kinokkina kinaru menokkina maramum uttappada santiraditta-varaiyum nadappad-aga Kaliyuga-varusham 3649 S’akhandam 1225 idan mel sellaninra Krodhi-samvatchcharattu purattadi-magam 10 tiyum Mulanakshatramum perra nal udaiyar S;ivagengai-udaiyarkku-ttiruppadimarrukku dara-purvam-aga udakam-panni kuduttom nattavarom sva-dattam-para-dattam va yo hareta vasundara sashthi varu-sha-sahasrani-vishthayan sayate krimi i-tanmattukku iyavan oruvan langanampesinavan Gengai-kkaraiyir-kkurar-pasuvai-kkonran pavate pogakadayan i-ttanmam sri-Mahesva-rakshai subham astu.\n",
        "Name_": "",
