        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 54<br>Hobli: Vartur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: On a stone in Kondareddy muniyappa farm south of the village<br>Installation Date: Not dated<br>Inscription Language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: 5'X1'6\"<br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: Not given in the EC.<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: ಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮಕ್ಕೆ ದಕ್ಷಿಣ ಕೊಂಡಾರಡ್ಡಿ ಮುನಿಯಪ್ಪನ ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿ ಬಿದ್ದಿರುವ ಕಲ್ಲು <br><br>                     ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 5’ x  1’6”<br><br>1ಯೀಪುರಧರ್ಮಕೆವಕ್ರವಾದರು<br>2ವಾರಣಾಸಿಯಲಿಬ್ರಾಮರಕೊಂ<br>3ದಪಾಪಕೆಹೋಹರುಗಂಗೆ <br>4 ಯತಡಿಯಲಿಕಪಿಲೆ<br>5 ಯಕೋಂದಪಾಪಕ್ಕೆಹೋ<br>6 ಹರು <br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Tamil the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.9707766<br>Longitude: 77.6927843<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
