      "properties": {
        "name": "Krishnarajapura (now in the Bangalore museum)",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsmf-jFdhmXWmqgjeps8LjPfF0zYzh71Hh6Sh8DzFcLHDqS8td3ZJTyxXbSUCeIgHpZxu1Uegnc8TZ6S9vECLTOzYr2DS3qwgTOHI22e12Ew_pPr2fEgFF2yajUIgJmERx4A4fLS68-0-zDMr6rfyIorICv9bibn-DCAgePtrR4eDvzWHCe9jPFXfVSBW7yv9ADBiOI?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 55<br>Hobli: Krishnarajapura Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Krishnarajapura (Krishnarajapurahobli) , on a stone infront of Vasudeva-Rayara chhatra.(now shifted to the museum)<br>Installation Date: 01/01/0750<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 6'X5'6\"<br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 55<br><br>Date about 750 A.D.<br><br>When Sripurusha-maharaja was ruling :- ………………………….Mareya ……………pierced and fell.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 55<br>At Krishnarajapura (Krishnarajapura hobli) on a stone in front of Vasudevarayara cchatra<br>S’ripurusha-maharajar arasugeye Kannara ……………… porbakaru.. .. Poaura …… Mareyanu ur alisi… iridu bilda.<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team<br>1)śrī puruṣa mahārājararasugĕyĕ kannara . .<br>2)pŏrbākarurāl̤i pŏsaūraralgŏyanu . . . .<br>3)uraḻivi kadĕṟidu biḻdar<br><br><br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 55<br><br>ಕೃಷ್ಣಾರಾಜಪುರ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಕೃಷ್ಣಾರಾಜಪುರದಲ್ಲಿ ವಾಸುದೇವರಾಯರ ಛತ್ರದ ಮುಂದೆ ಬಿದ್ದಿರುವ ವೀರಕಲ್ಲು<br><br>ಹಳಗನ್ನಡಕ್ಷರ ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 6’ x 5’6”<br><br>1 ಶ್ರೀ ಪುರುಷಮಹಾರಾಜರರಸುಗೆಯೆಕನ್ನರ . . . ರಡು.. .<br>2ವೋರ್ಭಾಕರುರಾಳವೊಸೂರರಲ್ಗೊಯನುಮಾರೆಯನು<br>3 ಇರಛಿಳ್ . ವಿಲಿದುಛ್ವಿ<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team<br>1)ಶ್ರೀ ಪುರುಷ ಮಹಾರಾಜರರಸುಗೆಯೆ ಕನ್ನರ . .<br>2)ಪೊರ್ಬಾಕರುರಾಳಿ ಪೊಸಊರರಲ್ಗೊಯನು . . . .<br>3)ಉರೞಿವಿ ಕದೆಱಿದು ಬಿೞ್ದರ್<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.9747739<br>Longitude: 77.5958282<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKs_SLhyMJ1PqqLsl_m32yNnwpPHQ2GtmDbA-sSAHLSwPUMKhBSDyKyg4l2bC1w4u3a3FWODQ8RYf6cxCoOspXluMoxCgP9uURuapMSXYXal-qMTRewv3FYDe6RQ5w1m9SzDjowAKq8K4JvjaurynB90k3t1vbjlQ5UDQiHHs18QhPhAVKtiuP0W_6UqwXOmpxajYdPM30QiI7TYhJOmMX_Qquf1rt44h6H1GZft1aPQR-x8?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtuz0x5LHfizRBU8ANUzpnrUFRjBKJtBznVzpvGTsUrFf8-1aMp3vWCjKyurBvdQ4OejjUBMSJU7p4HLu7ZMI52Z4IL_ojh97F_yu2BhO6TJ-8b66V0bFvIPQI5dHVSZFS0QrGf1p4eWoHW2pxxeqJv2ZMZJUc9P8wYmjAGi47_1RF0s5anDULoNZjD9EEMouRt9fK7Xkk1ApsP3tOEyxGABW2sSICMZKoc1NUzXskDBYui?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
