        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "55",
        "Hobli": "Krishnarajapura Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At Krishnarajapura (Krishnarajapurahobli) , on a stone infront of Vasudeva-Rayara chhatra.(now shifted to the museum)",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "55\nAt Krishnarajapura (Krishnarajapura hobli) on a stone in front of Vasudevarayara cchatra\nS’ripurusha-maharajar arasugeye Kannara ……………… porbakaru.. .. Poaura …… Mareyanu ur alisi… iridu bilda.\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team\n1)śrī puruṣa mahārājararasugĕyĕ kannara . .\n2)pŏrbākarurāl̤i pŏsaūraralgŏyanu . . . .\n3)uraḻivi kadĕṟidu biḻdar\n\n",
