      "properties": {
        "name": "Kyalasanahalli",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 56<br>Hobli: Krishnarajapura Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Kyalasanahalli (same hobli), on a stone in Appajappa's field<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1366<br>Inscription Language: Telugu<br>Size: 3'X3'6\"<br>Current Status: Yet to verify<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 56<br><br>Date about A.D.<br><br>(Telugu)- Be it well. (On the date specified), Nagasani, -the wife of Narapa-Setti, son of the great vadda-vyavahari, Bava-Setti of Gundapalli in … varika-nad, acquainted with both ways (or creeds), - in order that her husband and other (relatives) for twenty-one generations might obtain merit, - had this tank constructed, to continue as long as sun and moon.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 56<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಕ್ಯಾಲಸನಹಳ್ಳಿ ಗ್ರಾಮಕ್ಕೆ ಪಶ್ಚಿಮ ಅಪ್ಪಾಜಪ್ಪನ ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿ ನೆಟ್ ಕಲ್ಲು <br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 3’ x 3’ 6”<br><br>1ಸ್ಯಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀ ಕಲಿಯುಗವರ್ಷಂಬುಲುಚ<br>2 ಡಿ4467ಲೋನನುಶಕವರುಷಂಬುಲು <br>3 12 ಅಗುಪರಾಭ(ವ) ಸಂವತ್ಸರಭಾ <br>4ದ್ರವದಶುದ್ಧ 5ನೇ|ಶ್ರೀಮನುಮಹಾವಡ್ಡವ್ಯ <br>5ವ...ವಾರಿಕನಾಡಿಲೋನಿಗುಂಡಪಲುಉಭಯ <br>7ಕಟ್ಟೆ... . . ದಾಮುನಾಗಸಾನಿತನವುಪುರುಪುಡು<br>8 ಮದಲುಗಾನುಯಿರುವೈಯೊಕ್ಕತರಮು<br>9 ಪಿತಾದಕುನ್ಕುಪುಣುಮುಗಾನುಕಟಿಂಬೆ<br>10 ನಚಛಿವುಆಚಂದ್ರಾಕ್ರ್ಕರ್ಶಸ್ಥಾಯೈ<br>11 ಚಲಗಲಯದಿಮಂಗಲಮಹ<br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Telugu the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 13.056392<br>Longitude: 77.658603<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1366",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Telugu",
        "Size": "3'X3'6\"",
        "Current_Status": "Yet to verify",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "56\n\nDate about A.D.\n\n(Telugu)- Be it well. (On the date specified), Nagasani, -the wife of Narapa-Setti, son of the great vadda-vyavahari, Bava-Setti of Gundapalli in … varika-nad, acquainted with both ways (or creeds), - in order that her husband and other (relatives) for twenty-one generations might obtain merit, - had this tank constructed, to continue as long as sun and moon.\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "56\n\nಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಕ್ಯಾಲಸನಹಳ್ಳಿ ಗ್ರಾಮಕ್ಕೆ ಪಶ್ಚಿಮ ಅಪ್ಪಾಜಪ್ಪನ ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿ ನೆಟ್ ಕಲ್ಲು \n\nಪ್ರಮಾಣ 3’ x 3’ 6”\n\n1ಸ್ಯಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀ ಕಲಿಯುಗವರ್ಷಂಬುಲುಚ\n2 ಡಿ4467ಲೋನನುಶಕವರುಷಂಬುಲು \n3 12 ಅಗುಪರಾಭ(ವ) ಸಂವತ್ಸರಭಾ \n4ದ್ರವದಶುದ್ಧ 5ನೇ|ಶ್ರೀಮನುಮಹಾವಡ್ಡವ್ಯ \n5ವ...ವಾರಿಕನಾಡಿಲೋನಿಗುಂಡಪಲುಉಭಯ \n7ಕಟ್ಟೆ... . . ದಾಮುನಾಗಸಾನಿತನವುಪುರುಪುಡು\n8 ಮದಲುಗಾನುಯಿರುವೈಯೊಕ್ಕತರಮು\n9 ಪಿತಾದಕುನ್ಕುಪುಣುಮುಗಾನುಕಟಿಂಬೆ\n10 ನಚಛಿವುಆಚಂದ್ರಾಕ್ರ್ಕರ್ಶಸ್ಥಾಯೈ\n11 ಚಲಗಲಯದಿಮಂಗಲಮಹ\n",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Telugu the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !",
        "English_Translation__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "English_Transliteration__Retyped_By": "",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "Photographs_Provided_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "Latitude": "13.056392",
