      "properties": {
        "name": "Sadaramangala",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuV94UH-PtlwCCMXolUzZINUAGdgHRp-J4pjXCJOrdxBeQeK4TZXx_2aPCXVdPZ31zizmUPqxj1m4Qjm3N6utyKZqRLOqKNPR2uVsadjaespquZdASYOWAv7pilr1OvGEaBH8__8DGzpoLKbU0CLvsnc5Z8s_jYvQxGy3GaXE4oQLufTjcMlNUU8_Ex8UemvL7ZT9A?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 59<br>Hobli: Krishnarajapura Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the same village, on a stone set up in the batayi land to the west.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1346<br>Inscription Language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: 4'6\"x2\"6\"<br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 59<br>Date 1346 A.D<br>(Tamil) – While the maha-mandalesvara, subduers of hostile kings, champions over kings who break their word, sri-vira-Ariyappa-udaiyar and Bukkana-udaiyar were ruling the earth (On the date specified), we-the great patta-viyapari Muttiyarasan Ilaman Suvasa-nayakkar and the inhabitants of Tentarru-Turaivali-nadu in Sanai-nadu of Rajendira Sola-vala-nadu in Nigarli-Sola-mandalam-granted, with pouring of water, certain lands (specified), together with the right to sell or mortgage, to Gangadhara …………….. of Savama-Kausika-gotra, a resident of S'enjiagaram in . . . chchi-ur-nadu of Tonda-mandalam. (Then follow boundaries of the lands granted)<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 59<br>At Sadaramangala (same hobli), on a stone set up at the village gate.<br>(Grantha and Tamil characters).<br>Svasti sri S’aka .. .. .. .. 268 n mel sellanira Vyaya-varshattu Arpasi-madattu apara-pakshattu Panchamiyum Velli-kkilamaiyum perra Mrigasirshattu nal svasti srimanu-maha-mandalesvaran ariraya-vibadan bashaikku tppuva rayara gandan sri-vira-Ariyappa-udaiyarum Bukkana-udaiyarum pritivi-rachchiyam-pannanirkka svasti srimanu-maha-pattaviyapari Muttiyarasan Ilaman S;uvasa-nayakkarum Nigarili-S’ola-mandalattu Rasendira-S’ola-vala-nattu S’anai-nattu Tendarru-tTuraivali-nattu ndavarum Tonda-mandalattu… chchiur-nattu S’enji-agarattil Savana-kKausika-gotrattil Gamgadhara ……………….. dhamana-vikrayangalu ………… vad-aga dhara-purvam a ………………… rum pauna .. .. …. nni kudut………………….. ta …………. Man ……….. tta .. .. .. .. idukku-kkila .. .. .. .. .. .. agara-nilattukku mer .. .. .. .. yum ter .. .. .. kku vada .. .. .. .. .. llai …….. ellaikku-kkilakkum vadak ……….. ttu.. da.. na…………….m ellaiy-aga vittu…………… duv-ulla.. .. .. .. .. m …………………..<br><br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 59 <br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ನಾದರಮಂಗಲದ ಊರುಬಾಗಲ ಬಳಿ ನೆಟ್ಟಕಲ್ಲು<br><br>ಗ್ರಂಥ ಮತ್ತು ಅರವಕ್ಷರ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Tamil the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.99919<br>Longitude: 77.73704<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKskA4MEtrG4wUDMrSDYNO4UtmQkLN_gibFJASjk3KhhWUgF9ZhGLD0hIsfY6Oy9QG-UQAtL4-7J8Q3__7eqMCfOKxAS4NUTkwnSjuVfbdJ0hMXxsLlSBDYGUJlz_SdKqIo6a98Ethfuok2tbjmB3VLPmydBdoGQJETd8PxXW59GY2rxyLvaXWWr5cnM3lMr31IalibqtVnQMrgosVyQcKpHdR1UMGkjXvGA-apE4x97Z1oh?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsPSO5JJH5EHQv4SlIq7qCQEL9Aru1_7feU1qi0WkUiaHfvnkoBukr_hXnRpGduKSHGeRXj_2Xp4xH2lwfti59dkXutLtoK5uipQPCVAHXG86_Mrn3oTs0_OBEVowkj_aetSCPgcEA2uOTUL1MmhKXioXGJC4xia3oSblwMU8aqNm77D44vEhtSfPFM_odo3asjFu28LjWC_GvgEfaUZ0h5ncUW5oNHIPKc7Nynidati9wa?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1346",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Grantha & Tamil",
        "Size": "4'6\"x2\"6\"",
        "Current_Status": "Intact",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "59\nDate 1346 A.D\n(Tamil) – While the maha-mandalesvara, subduers of hostile kings, champions over kings who break their word, sri-vira-Ariyappa-udaiyar and Bukkana-udaiyar were ruling the earth (On the date specified), we-the great patta-viyapari Muttiyarasan Ilaman Suvasa-nayakkar and the inhabitants of Tentarru-Turaivali-nadu in Sanai-nadu of Rajendira Sola-vala-nadu in Nigarli-Sola-mandalam-granted, with pouring of water, certain lands (specified), together with the right to sell or mortgage, to Gangadhara …………….. of Savama-Kausika-gotra, a resident of S'enjiagaram in . . . chchi-ur-nadu of Tonda-mandalam. (Then follow boundaries of the lands granted)\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "59 \n\nಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ನಾದರಮಂಗಲದ ಊರುಬಾಗಲ ಬಳಿ ನೆಟ್ಟಕಲ್ಲು\n\nಗ್ರಂಥ ಮತ್ತು ಅರವಕ್ಷರ",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Tamil the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
