        "Photographs_Provided_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "Latitude": "12.99919",
        "Longitude": "77.73704",
        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuV94UH-PtlwCCMXolUzZINUAGdgHRp-J4pjXCJOrdxBeQeK4TZXx_2aPCXVdPZ31zizmUPqxj1m4Qjm3N6utyKZqRLOqKNPR2uVsadjaespquZdASYOWAv7pilr1OvGEaBH8__8DGzpoLKbU0CLvsnc5Z8s_jYvQxGy3GaXE4oQLufTjcMlNUU8_Ex8UemvL7ZT9A?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKskA4MEtrG4wUDMrSDYNO4UtmQkLN_gibFJASjk3KhhWUgF9ZhGLD0hIsfY6Oy9QG-UQAtL4-7J8Q3__7eqMCfOKxAS4NUTkwnSjuVfbdJ0hMXxsLlSBDYGUJlz_SdKqIo6a98Ethfuok2tbjmB3VLPmydBdoGQJETd8PxXW59GY2rxyLvaXWWr5cnM3lMr31IalibqtVnQMrgosVyQcKpHdR1UMGkjXvGA-apE4x97Z1oh?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsPSO5JJH5EHQv4SlIq7qCQEL9Aru1_7feU1qi0WkUiaHfvnkoBukr_hXnRpGduKSHGeRXj_2Xp4xH2lwfti59dkXutLtoK5uipQPCVAHXG86_Mrn3oTs0_OBEVowkj_aetSCPgcEA2uOTUL1MmhKXioXGJC4xia3oSblwMU8aqNm77D44vEhtSfPFM_odo3asjFu28LjWC_GvgEfaUZ0h5ncUW5oNHIPKc7Nynidati9wa?authuser=0&fife=s16383",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "59",
        "Hobli": "Krishnarajapura Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At the same village, on a stone set up in the batayi land to the west.",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "59\nAt Sadaramangala (same hobli), on a stone set up at the village gate.\n(Grantha and Tamil characters).\nSvasti sri S’aka .. .. .. .. 268 n mel sellanira Vyaya-varshattu Arpasi-madattu apara-pakshattu Panchamiyum Velli-kkilamaiyum perra Mrigasirshattu nal svasti srimanu-maha-mandalesvaran ariraya-vibadan bashaikku tppuva rayara gandan sri-vira-Ariyappa-udaiyarum Bukkana-udaiyarum pritivi-rachchiyam-pannanirkka svasti srimanu-maha-pattaviyapari Muttiyarasan Ilaman S;uvasa-nayakkarum Nigarili-S’ola-mandalattu Rasendira-S’ola-vala-nattu S’anai-nattu Tendarru-tTuraivali-nattu ndavarum Tonda-mandalattu… chchiur-nattu S’enji-agarattil Savana-kKausika-gotrattil Gamgadhara ……………….. dhamana-vikrayangalu ………… vad-aga dhara-purvam a ………………… rum pauna .. .. …. nni kudut………………….. ta …………. Man ……….. tta .. .. .. .. idukku-kkila .. .. .. .. .. .. agara-nilattukku mer .. .. .. .. yum ter .. .. .. kku vada .. .. .. .. .. llai …….. ellaikku-kkilakkum vadak ……….. ttu.. da.. na…………….m ellaiy-aga vittu…………… duv-ulla.. .. .. .. .. m …………………..\n",
        "Name_": "",
        "EC_9_Ht_": "",
        "layer": "The Incredible Inscription Stones of Bengaluru — Bangalore Taluk",
