        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKt_vkotg9eFoNUbWggy1s132FTR26tWBARtLlQPmoe1d2JYKuBdx4eRBEDNeyUTrsRjprDZlt5js6waCuuOXFRf_JbI4ids_W8GfYf06jraM5XHueERw2tOxjyrGECgy3bYXRF-pNiG2Bp3rhaRPow31RovNBk8mIlHJ4sryhjoyYG3SNtTiBmSpn34PzOBgikgNo4?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 63<br>Hobli: Krishnarajapura Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the same village, on a stone in the Talavaras inam field<br>( Now in the Sri Mitra symphony apartments)<br><br>Installation Date: 01/01/1332<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 4'3\"x2'<br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 63<br>Date 1332 A.D.<br>Be it well. (on the date specified), by order of the maha-mandalesvara vira-Ballala-Deva-various lands (specified) were granted as kodage to Belaganchi Mayi-Nayaka’s ………….Machi-gavuda.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: ಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮಕ್ಕೆ ಉತ್ತರ ತಳವಾರನ ಇನಾಮತಿ ಜಮೀನಿನಲ್ಲಿ ನೆಟ್ಟಕಲ್ಲು<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 4’3” x 2’ <br><br><br>1ಆಂಗಿರಸಂವತ್ಸರ . . . . <br>2 . . . . 1 ಲುಸ್ಯಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಮ <br>3ನುಮಹಾಮಂಡಳೇಶ್ವರಹೊಯಿ <br>4ಸಣೇಶ್ಯರಶ್ರೀ ವೀರಬಲ್ಲಾಳ <br>5ದೇವರಬೆಸದಿಬೆಳಗಂಬೆಮ <br>6ಯಿನಾಯ್ಕರುಹೆರಿಹ. . . <br>7 . . . ಮಾಚೆಗವುಡ<br>8 ಗೆಊರುಕೊಡುಗೆ <br>10 ಮೆರಿಯಕೆಛೀಗೆಸೂ<br>11 . . . . ಸ1ಕೋ10<br>12 ಬಿಡಾರಿಕೆಛೀಗುಡಂಕೆ <br>13 ಛೀಕಟುಕೊಡಗೆಸ1<br>14 ಚಂದ್ರಸೂಯ್ರ್ಯ್‍ರುಳನ <br>15 ಕಸಲುಉದುಸುಭ <br>16 ಮಸ್ತು <br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Dr Byrappa MG<br>Latitude: 12.9972824<br>Longitude: 77.7175851<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtjCH89MXFZL9rHv1bKmgneNry1SEvyvBVFgcHyN8niHw2dTzL1MWxMbbsRlDJCA9SlRmd5AJahglXvG0KDk6bGlawfBUce0yRB28T-Mf4xVN-0ttvfIY9DSMEqv1aDyX3LU7UBzV3G2w32kmVSd4Y8NM3ayErrUr2LJk0Odxhdf2MoIzD-YTXXZ47-GC9-afkCyBk?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
