      "properties": {
        "name": "Madivalapalya",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 64<br>Hobli: Agara Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Madivalapalya (Agara hobli), on a door frame of chatra<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1793<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Yet to verify<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 64<br>Date 1793 A.D<br>(On the date specified), Atupakaam Annamale-Mudaliyar’s lawful wife Venkatamma’s dharma-chhatra was enlarged by her eldest son Raya-Bahadur  Ratna-Sabhapati-Mudaliyar in memory of his senior uncle Venkatachala-Mudaliyar’s lawful wife Mangatayi-Amma<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 64<br><br>ಅಗರದ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಮಡಿವಾಳಪಾಳ್ಯದ ಛತ್ರದ ಬಾಗಿಲ ದಾಲಬಂದ್ರದ ಮೇಲೆ <br><br>1ಶಾಲಿವಾಹನಶಖ1715ಪ್ರಮಾದೀಚಸಂವತ್ಸರಟುಪಾಕಂಅಂಣಾಮಲೆ <br>2ಮುದಲೆಯಾರ್ರವರಧರ್ಮಪತ್ರನಿವೆಂಕಟಂಮನವರ <br>3ಧರ್ಮಛತ್ರ. ಯಿವರಜೀಷ್ಫಾತ್ಮಜರಾಯಬಹದ್ದೂರ್‍ರತ್ನ ಸಭಾಪತಿಮುದಲಿಯಾ <br>4ರ್ರವರಿಂದ ಜೇಷ್ಟಪಿತೃವೆಂಕಟಚಲಮುದಲಿಯಾರ್ರವರಧರ್ಮ <br>5ಪತ್ನಿಮಂಗತಾಯಿಅಂಮನವರಗ್ಞಾಪಕಾರ್ಥವೃದ್ಧಿಮಾಡಲ್ಪಟ್ಟದ್ದು <br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.9180482<br>Longitude: 77.6132946<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1793",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Kannada",
        "Size": "",
        "Current_Status": "Yet to verify",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "64\nDate 1793 A.D\n(On the date specified), Atupakaam Annamale-Mudaliyar’s lawful wife Venkatamma’s dharma-chhatra was enlarged by her eldest son Raya-Bahadur  Ratna-Sabhapati-Mudaliyar in memory of his senior uncle Venkatachala-Mudaliyar’s lawful wife Mangatayi-Amma\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "64\n\nಅಗರದ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಮಡಿವಾಳಪಾಳ್ಯದ ಛತ್ರದ ಬಾಗಿಲ ದಾಲಬಂದ್ರದ ಮೇಲೆ \n\n1ಶಾಲಿವಾಹನಶಖ1715ಪ್ರಮಾದೀಚಸಂವತ್ಸರಟುಪಾಕಂಅಂಣಾಮಲೆ \n2ಮುದಲೆಯಾರ್ರವರಧರ್ಮಪತ್ರನಿವೆಂಕಟಂಮನವರ \n3ಧರ್ಮಛತ್ರ. ಯಿವರಜೀಷ್ಫಾತ್ಮಜರಾಯಬಹದ್ದೂರ್‍ರತ್ನ ಸಭಾಪತಿಮುದಲಿಯಾ \n4ರ್ರವರಿಂದ ಜೇಷ್ಟಪಿತೃವೆಂಕಟಚಲಮುದಲಿಯಾರ್ರವರಧರ್ಮ \n5ಪತ್ನಿಮಂಗತಾಯಿಅಂಮನವರಗ್ಞಾಪಕಾರ್ಥವೃದ್ಧಿಮಾಡಲ್ಪಟ್ಟದ್ದು ",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "English_Translation__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
