        "path": "N:/02.CURATE STUDIO/25.02_INFRACULTURE/08. WATER AND THE CITY/03 Interactive Timelines/to map/The Incredible Inscription Stones of Bengaluru.kml|layername=Bangalore Taluk|geometrytype=Point25D|uniqueGeometryType=yes"
