        "name": "Sunkenahalli",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKv9b_t5MWnQBTTQYkNF2losozgE_ziE8bA3dDUtMytRuveBSK-Rr_QWtw99LrxHCk6Y6bRsmQC0Ka-GgbI6hq9Ezpe1qRoVgBIYDz2oGm4ltCQhqqA8sknuYvdGI1KbcBw-hPm8N1aInFhFsUGFwENmIejIYjcc9n2WaIDMC4CRUKkRD_0ZN7eLRHdAb0CqldAsrRw?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 69<br>Hobli: Agara Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Sunkenahalli (same hobli), on a rock in the Abdul Karim sahib's garden<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1300<br>Inscription Language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 69<br>Date ? about 1300 A.D.<br>(Tamil) – To the god Sokkapperumal of Tombalur…………..<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 69<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಸುಂಕೇನಹಳ್ಳಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಅಬ್ದೂಲ್ ಕರೀಂ ಸಾಹೇಬರ ತೋಟದಲ್ಲಿನ ಗುಂಡಿನ ಮೇಲೆ<br><br>\tಗ್ರಂಥ ಮತ್ತು ಅರವಕ್ಷರ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Tamil the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.945296<br>Longitude: 77.5625901<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1300",
