        "name": "Sunkenahalli/Doddabasavannana gudi",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKu-D-qxQcu7VFMwtj4QdKG_8sb5AeOpkaKo0Ov3xV6hqB1T0NttB9AoUiezmpnCw6x5UOegbu-JSzzSFOZmQcciSijYOjTOidwKBX7R0ydVsymuglrvdAghdUJuvv6kqw2MpWGWXXXw5buKO6ewqVmNZlpym5zPT2HO3ULtGC4--eN8zx503aiEUNjMsNLdwV0IWMkO?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 70<br>Hobli: Agara Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the the same village, on the basement of Basavanna in the Doddabasavana temple<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1600<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 4'x2'<br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 70<br><br>Date? About 1600 A.D.<br><br>At the feet of this (god) Basaveswara is the river called Vrishabhavati rose, and flowed with its stream to the west.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 70<br>At the the same village, on the basement of Basavanna in the Dodda-Basavana temple.<br>yi-Basavesvaranapadadalli Vrishabhavatiy enisikomba nadi hutti paschimavahiniyagi nadeyutu | sri | da<br><br>Mythic Society 3d scanning of inscriptions project Re-reading:<br>1 yī basaveśvarana | pādadalli vriśabhāvati yĕni<br>2 sikŏṃba nadhi huṭṭi | paścamavāhiniyāgi naḍĕyu<br>3 tu | śrī<br><br><br><br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 70<br><br>ಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮದ ದೊಡ್ಡ ಬಸವಣ್ಣನ ಗುಡಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಬಸವಣ್ಣನ ಪೀಠದಲ್ಲಿ <br><br>1¬ೂಬಸವೇಶ್ವರನ|ಪಾದದಲಿವ್ರಿಶಭಾವತಿಯೆನಿ<br>2ಸಿಕೊಂಬನಧಿಹುಟ್ಟಿ|ಪಶ್ಚಮವಾಹಿನಿಯಾಗಿ ನಡೆಯು<br>3ತು|ಶ್ರೀ |<br><br>Mythic Society 3d scanning of inscriptions project Re-reading:<br>1\tಯೀ ಬಸವೇಶ್ವರನ | ಪಾದದಲ್ಲಿ ವ್ರಿಶಭಾವತಿ ಯೆನಿ<br>2\tಸಿಕೊಂಬ ನಧಿ ಹುಟ್ಟಿ | ಪಶ್ಚಮವಾಹಿನಿಯಾಗಿ ನಡೆಯು<br>3\tತು | ಶ್ರೀ<br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Arun Bharadwaj Dr YUvaraju R <arun45208@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.94206<br>Longitude: 77.56805<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvQGPMeFfLNCLciG3pSbUvGujHnsTWWeeKJgT8Auo-yc8T4PkyTM0MRkW8I2r9zKtEjiHRWu3r0ng2TbTmyls9MZHA9tZ8QjPRWBFAS_0WlWp_ACKAR4_kVyQHpNgXeSyV1yq6d9WTpRAhqbq-PcQ2MrQOabFhOgD8BauoL6nQR5cEVaHpBrggUd4TIMgstBxH-aUbf?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsxlkaN2Hh7VWgpZAFP9L1PAWz1JfOTH6xUZqynxmIXh95Kaaie2cZIcC4y1RAiHMMrYGgbM5jIjz-vBZFjLoz_nKsbrvbXXhWlHGAYc7yAMglQZTp638lLglxju4iH0yiHa6zLxp9euk2mQH_nEjjCbnIiFK-MlOixy_XNa_2Kn7YAoMZ7Q0lGZllWoF54Ty22ZgI?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvrymvSSk70X5QTS0aEI1g9sulcdccvh0KkT2z1c7u91HgKLZj-tx8oz303B8QiHVrl6kfBiwC2nC8EKEQOJTWqLlsrU5x3mB_FfNNAFBrAWRrEUPJD1Q2HYDG-3x7kNKWyjA54vni23F5Rjg9wnEahqHRwd4PZuzCNhAJzfAaMkZq7IKxDPKW_823o5cVzo6Aht4A?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKukiDntHwN2nBMSjG_bOt8upH7FOFazk_BcHMoWH0-8-AdbcKqn4YBs9w1mmUqWlgzqj24jEzhUd0jdSL-b0m-FgLNzoYeWo7LYVi0tyHg-h8uK_qe0H8EdQ1D-mkVsxJJBbUYtDiBZJziQM_HGY7Sm0EUTDQ4tzMe4_v_PcNCMbx3Ztzndc1z1xz3HjNQ6qM8VrJ8?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
