        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "70\nAt the the same village, on the basement of Basavanna in the Dodda-Basavana temple.\nyi-Basavesvaranapadadalli Vrishabhavatiy enisikomba nadi hutti paschimavahiniyagi nadeyutu | sri | da\n\nMythic Society 3d scanning of inscriptions project Re-reading:\n1 yī basaveśvarana | pādadalli vriśabhāvati yĕni\n2 sikŏṃba nadhi huṭṭi | paścamavāhiniyāgi naḍĕyu\n3 tu | śrī\n\n\n",
