      "properties": {
        "name": "Ibbalur",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 71<br>Hobli: Agara Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Ibbalur (same hobli), on a stone in the enclosure of the Anjenaya Temple<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1394<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 71<br>Date? 1394 A.D.<br>Be it well. (On the date specified), when the maha-mandalesvara vira-immadi-Bukkanna’s……….son…….vira……………….was ruling the kingdom :- Nayaka (rest illegible)<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 71<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಇಬ್ಬಲೂರು ಆಂಜನೇಯ ದೇವಾಲಯದ ಪ್ರಾಕಾರದಲ್ಲಿ ಬಿದ್ದಿರುವದು<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ  4’ x 2’<br><br><br>1ಸ್ಯಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀ ಶಕವರುಷ1365ನೆಯಭಾವಸಂವತ್ಸರ<br>2ದಕಾರ್ತಿಕಬ1ಶ್ರೀಮಂಮಹಾಮಂಡಳೇಶ್ವರಶ್ರೀವೀರ<br>3ಯಿಂಮಡಿಬುಕ್ಕಂಣ. . . ಮಕ್ಕಳು . . .<br>4 ವೀರ. . . . ರಾಜ್ಯಂಗೆಯಿ<br>5ವಲ್ಲಿಶ್ರೀಮತು. . . ನಾಯಕರ. . <br><br>(ಮುಂದೆ ಅಕ್ಷರಗಳು ಸವೆದು ಹೋಗಿವೆ)<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.9269334<br>Longitude: 77.6653028<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
