        "Inscription_language": "Grantha & Tamil",
        "Size": "3'x2'6\"",
        "Current_Status": "Intact",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "72\n\nDate? About 1350 A.D\n\n(Tamil)- We, Pamma-battar and Sembu-battar, having received full payment in gold, gave to Pillaiyar full possession of the land and the house which had been ours for a long time and transferred to him the service for fifteen days……… in the temple of this god, which we had purchased form kulainja-battar.\nThe signatures of Pamma-battar and Sembu-battar. Witnesses to the grant: Varadi-deva-kon and Sokkannan.\n\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "72\n\nಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಬೇಲೂರು ಸೋಮೇಶ್ವರ ದೇವಾಲಯದ ಮುಂದೆ ನೆಟ್ಟಿರುವದು \n\nಗ್ರಂಥ ಮತ್ತು ಅರವಕ್ಷರ\n\nಪ್ರಮಾಣ 3’ x 2’6”",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Tamil the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
