        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "72",
        "Hobli": "Agara Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At Belur (same hobli),on a stone setup in front of the Someshvara Temple",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "72\nAt Ibbaluru (same hobli), on a stone set up in fron of the Somesvara temple. (Grantha nnd Tmil characters).\nSvasti sri Talu .. kKulainja-bttar pakkal i-nnayanar koyilil nangal kondudaiyom-ana muppadu vattattu padinainju nalum munnalil.. lla mannum manaiyum Pillaiyarku pponn-ara kkondu mann-ara-kkudutton Pamma-battar S’embu-battaromippadikku Pamma-battar S’embu-battar eluttu ippatti ariven Varadi devakon ippatti ariven S’okkannanyena.\n",
