n in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuf36YaPIpkdC1WaQToTscUOLBwfLL4O5MhR3VsH1VGHLVIVFqvIeOKY7AF7GLJTxk9QCqqRgPdDRaedJEWI_BEpFDNFiygRVLOJaCx33PqO0WqKL4tH0Y5yDPOXU_IIg0jIdb01Sn3w4PEO4cCcwIrLgSKTwojF5hTlB3RtDZGzQN0s6hgl8bqO2IxCEHfLg9VbnlE?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsJswWEcohtCqPLlRf7hlWC9r8bKhcpu0IQEz_MG9c6UEh3owbzKyKItge_O-TbDnHWIs5P3wY2SuguYWk7Y0r_xbzgE4X5clK_hvnV6D_V8-LME8DjAtOQYKLbryoBY7byZgeGd5c_jmXcLQkYOp3f0T8JlAR22_BOiosqc5zpK9wSLKHgnL65DOcif2gKd0RZq0Q?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
