        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKv6T-EB9GhT0XseRc3sW1L0UcKxcRVxc1AEnug03sRolEp0V6E4JwfdNHuKtZvJxvKoKTp47BVMPDLiT9_fUMYgUrjkdsMQVkZui5bPGm__XwntE1K5d17i77yC4dq4SfXD6XdT28c748wLA0LdXpWyVxJp0a727LE9Ob_BR2PhO4sjMv44xiVd2qKCwNlGJZ2_hL4?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 75<br>Hobli: Agara Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the same village, on a stone in front of the Viranna temple.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1304<br>Inscription Language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: 5'x2'6\"<br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 75<br>Date 1304 A.D.<br>(Tamil)- (From the date specified), the inhabitants of Periya-nadu in Saruga-nadu the superintendents of Vira-Vallala-deva-nadu, Sembi-devar and Villa-gamundar, and several others (named) seem to have made some grant.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 75<br><br>ಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮದ ವೀರಂಣನ ಗುಡಿಯ ಮುಂದೆ ತಲಕೆಳಗೆ ನೆಟ್ಟಿರುವ ಕಲ್ಲಿನಲ್ಲಿ <br><br>ಗ್ರಂಥ ಮತ್ತು ಅರವಕ್ಷರ - ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 5’ x 2’6” <br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Tamil the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.941072<br>Longitude: 77.6669101<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
