        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtndisiW-BO9xJwgHgOm0jdNflsyX6VBrmFs5P09rsrAQKBbOioAEXRJ-Z8FC_gc00MgXG21EwwbsZFdmfPkh72I_eNnxgjD4uHqKvnHOCQWPRn2O9fJRonsUIgrskyuEfOOHbs_nh2FlMGrSig_42sJ-Feql9NT6iev9IUifSZeWztAY-NDSQe--JFsv0Gr4_GS-I?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 77<br>Hobli: Agara Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Tavarekere (same hobli), on a stone lyingin archaka Gangadharayya's field<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1310<br>Inscription Language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: 2'x1'9\"<br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 77<br>Date 1310 A.D.<br>(Tamil) – For victory to the sword and arm of the pratapa-chakravartti vira-Vallal-Devar- We, the inhabitants of Ku…nadu and Periya-nadu …, remitted certain taxes (named).. ..<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 77<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ತಾವರೆಕೆರೆ ಗ್ರಾಮದಲ್ಲಿ ಅರ್ಚಕ ಗಂಗಾಧರಯ್ಯ ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿ ಬಿದ್ದಿರುವದು <br><br>ಗ್ರಂಥ ಮತ್ತು ಅರವಕ್ಷರ - ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 2’ x 1’9” <br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Tamil the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.9263692<br>Longitude: 77.6043953<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1310",
