      "properties": {
        "name": "Jakkasandra",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 78<br>Hobli: Agara Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Jakkasandra (same hobli), on a stone on the jagati infront of the Gopdlasvami temple.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1495<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 3'x1'9\"<br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 78<br>Date 1495 A.D.<br>May it be prosperous, (On the date specified), Linga-rahuta’s son Lingana granted….ngadepura of Jakasandra, two parts for the god Naganatha of Belur and one part for the god Channakesava. Imprecations.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 5ರಾಉತರಮಕ್ಕಳುಲಿಂಗಣನವ<br>6ರುಎ.ಜಕಸಂದ್ರದ <br>7ಂಗಡೆಪುರವನೂಬೇಲೂ<br>8ರನಾಗನಾಥದೇವರಿಗಭಾಎ<br>9 ರಡುಚಂನಕೇಶವದೇವರಿಗೆ <br>10ಒಂದು ಭಾಗ. . . . <br>11ಟಕಾಸನಯಿಂತಪುರ <br>12ಕೆಆರುತಪಿದರುಗಂ<br>13ಗೆಯುತಡಿಯಲಿಕಪಿ<br>14ಲೆಯಕೊಂದಪಾಪಕೆಹೋ<br>15ಹರು<br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.924826<br>Longitude: 77.6374426<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1495",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Kannada",
        "Size": "3'x1'9\"",
        "Current_Status": "Not traceable",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "78\nDate 1495 A.D.\nMay it be prosperous, (On the date specified), Linga-rahuta’s son Lingana granted….ngadepura of Jakasandra, two parts for the god Naganatha of Belur and one part for the god Channakesava. Imprecations.\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "5ರಾಉತರಮಕ್ಕಳುಲಿಂಗಣನವ\n6ರುಎ.ಜಕಸಂದ್ರದ \n7ಂಗಡೆಪುರವನೂಬೇಲೂ\n8ರನಾಗನಾಥದೇವರಿಗಭಾಎ\n9 ರಡುಚಂನಕೇಶವದೇವರಿಗೆ \n10ಒಂದು ಭಾಗ. . . . \n11ಟಕಾಸನಯಿಂತಪುರ \n12ಕೆಆರುತಪಿದರುಗಂ\n13ಗೆಯುತಡಿಯಲಿಕಪಿ\n14ಲೆಯಕೊಂದಪಾಪಕೆಹೋ\n15ಹರು\n",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "English_Translation__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "English_Transliteration__Retyped_By": "",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
