      "properties": {
        "name": "Agara",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 79<br>Hobli: Agara Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Agara (Agara hobli), on a stone in the wet land near the westem sluice below the tanh.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/0870<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 3'x2'6\"<br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 79<br>Date about 870 A.D.<br>Be it well. In the victorious year of the Srirajya, under Satyavakya-Permmadi’s Kali-yugs Hanuman, Nagattara, - the Iruvvuliyur odeya, Irugamayya’s son Sriyamayya, fixed sluices to the two tanks, had the eastern tank built, and obtained the bittuvatta of the three tanks. Imprecation.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 79<br><br>ಅಗರದ ಕೆರೆ ಕಟ್ಟೇ ಕೆಳಗೆ ಪಶ್ಚಿಮ ತೂಬಿನ ಬಳಿ ಗದ್ದೇಲಿ ಬಿದ್ದಿರುವದು <br><br>ಹಳಗನ್ನಡಕ್ಷರ -ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 3’ x 2’6” <br><br>1ಸ್ಯಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀರಾಜ್ಯವಿಜಯಸಂವ<br>2ತ್ಸರಸತ್ಯವಾಖ್ಯಪೆಮ್ರ್ಮಡಿಯಕ <br>3 ಲಿಯುಗದಣುವನಾಗತರನೊಳ್ <br>4 ಇವ್ಯುಲಿಯೂರೊಡೆಇರುಗ <br>5ಮಯ್ಯನಮಗಂಸಿರಿಯಮ <br>6ಯ್ಯನೆರಡುಕೆಲಿಯಂತೂಂಬನಿ<br>7ಕ್ಕಿಮೂಡಣಕೆಅಯಂಕಟ್ಟಿಸಿ<br>8ಮೂಹಿಕೆಹಿಯಬಿತ್ತುಪಟ್ಟವಂ <br>9ಪಡೆದಂಬಿತ್ತುವಟವಂಸಲಿ<br>10 ಸದನುನಿಕ್ಕದುಣ್ಬನುಕವಿಲೆ<br>11ಯನಅದಂ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.9180101<br>Longitude: 77.6435162<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/0870",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Kannada",
        "Size": "3'x2'6\"",
        "Current_Status": "Not traceable",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "79\nDate about 870 A.D.\nBe it well. In the victorious year of the Srirajya, under Satyavakya-Permmadi’s Kali-yugs Hanuman, Nagattara, - the Iruvvuliyur odeya, Irugamayya’s son Sriyamayya, fixed sluices to the two tanks, had the eastern tank built, and obtained the bittuvatta of the three tanks. Imprecation.\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "79\n\nಅಗರದ ಕೆರೆ ಕಟ್ಟೇ ಕೆಳಗೆ ಪಶ್ಚಿಮ ತೂಬಿನ ಬಳಿ ಗದ್ದೇಲಿ ಬಿದ್ದಿರುವದು \n\nಹಳಗನ್ನಡಕ್ಷರ -ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 3’ x 2’6” \n\n1ಸ್ಯಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀರಾಜ್ಯವಿಜಯಸಂವ\n2ತ್ಸರಸತ್ಯವಾಖ್ಯಪೆಮ್ರ್ಮಡಿಯಕ \n3 ಲಿಯುಗದಣುವನಾಗತರನೊಳ್ \n4 ಇವ್ಯುಲಿಯೂರೊಡೆಇರುಗ \n5ಮಯ್ಯನಮಗಂಸಿರಿಯಮ \n6ಯ್ಯನೆರಡುಕೆಲಿಯಂತೂಂಬನಿ\n7ಕ್ಕಿಮೂಡಣಕೆಅಯಂಕಟ್ಟಿಸಿ\n8ಮೂಹಿಕೆಹಿಯಬಿತ್ತುಪಟ್ಟವಂ \n9ಪಡೆದಂಬಿತ್ತುವಟವಂಸಲಿ\n10 ಸದನುನಿಕ್ಕದುಣ್ಬನುಕವಿಲೆ\n11ಯನಅದಂ",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "English_Translation__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "English_Transliteration__Retyped_By": "",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
