      "properties": {
        "name": "Agara",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 80<br>Hobli: Agara Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the same village, on a stone near the village entrance.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1515<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 2'6\"x3'<br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 80<br>Date 1515 A.D.<br>May it be prosperous. Be it well (On the date specified), at the time of and eclipse of the moon, - when Krishna-Raya-maharaya was ruling the kingdom of the world :- Sivannappa-Nayaka, in order that dharma might be to his father, granted a field to provide for keeping up a cart for the Agara tank.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 80<br><br>ಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮದ ಊರು ಮುಂದೆ ಬಾಗಲು ಬಳಿ ದಕ್ಷಿಣ ಕಡೆ ಇರುವದು<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 2’6” x 3’ <br><br>1ಶುಭಮಸ್ಸತುಸ್ಯಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಜಯಾಭ್ಯುದಯಶಾಲಿವಾ <br>2ಹನಶಕ(ವ)ರುಪಸಾವಿರದನಾನೂಹಯಿಪ್ಪತ್ತುಏ <br>3ಳನೆಯಯುವಸಂವತ್ಸರದಭಾದ್ರಪದಕು<br>4ಧ15ಲೂಸೋಮೋಪರಾಗಪುಂಣ್ಯಕಾಲದಲ್ಲುಕ್ರುಷ್ಣ <br>5ರಾಯಮಹಾರಾಯರುವೃತ್ಯೀಗೈಉತಯಿರಲು<br>6ಸಿವಂಣಪನಾಯಕರುತಂಮತಂದೆಗೆಧರ್ಮವಾಗಬೇಕೆಂ<br>7ದುಅಗರದಕೆಹಗೆಭಂಡಿನಡೆಉದಕ್ಕೆಕೊಟ್ಟಹೊಲ<br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.923942<br>Longitude: 77.649767<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1515",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Kannada",
        "Size": "2'6\"x3'",
        "Current_Status": "Not traceable",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "80\nDate 1515 A.D.\nMay it be prosperous. Be it well (On the date specified), at the time of and eclipse of the moon, - when Krishna-Raya-maharaya was ruling the kingdom of the world :- Sivannappa-Nayaka, in order that dharma might be to his father, granted a field to provide for keeping up a cart for the Agara tank.\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "80\n\nಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮದ ಊರು ಮುಂದೆ ಬಾಗಲು ಬಳಿ ದಕ್ಷಿಣ ಕಡೆ ಇರುವದು\n\nಪ್ರಮಾಣ 2’6” x 3’ \n\n1ಶುಭಮಸ್ಸತುಸ್ಯಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಜಯಾಭ್ಯುದಯಶಾಲಿವಾ \n2ಹನಶಕ(ವ)ರುಪಸಾವಿರದನಾನೂಹಯಿಪ್ಪತ್ತುಏ \n3ಳನೆಯಯುವಸಂವತ್ಸರದಭಾದ್ರಪದಕು\n4ಧ15ಲೂಸೋಮೋಪರಾಗಪುಂಣ್ಯಕಾಲದಲ್ಲುಕ್ರುಷ್ಣ \n5ರಾಯಮಹಾರಾಯರುವೃತ್ಯೀಗೈಉತಯಿರಲು\n6ಸಿವಂಣಪನಾಯಕರುತಂಮತಂದೆಗೆಧರ್ಮವಾಗಬೇಕೆಂ\n7ದುಅಗರದಕೆಹಗೆಭಂಡಿನಡೆಉದಕ್ಕೆಕೊಟ್ಟಹೊಲ\n",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "English_Translation__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "English_Transliteration__Retyped_By": "",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
