        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKshKQ2uMXy8YhG6HBpvNOLnIP_-i_djA2tOHrg-mMS17wq3gPCFp4PzdTjpb7uw4-zVF7w2ZDa16mS_cIB8avz0VAQcHt0mQNJIZo1wrXNuDp65k8bCf6_ysHBaI57LVRxlU1xkJcaMbf-FwmTwRsM7ToA9GHXnda7Ag_pY7BTExq0ESuvWHLBExBm8NREDwnAllzt8HWr8Q73h4UZ-v1ca6XRJUuHGRsUSMDC8jfvJDQgP?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 84<br>Hobli: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: Begur ( now in the Govt musem Bangalore)<br>Installation Date: <br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Inatct<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: <br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1. svastiśrī tĕṃgālamadakaïdu . gāmuṇdana mayduṃ buydukūra kĕṟagana<br><br>2. ūradāvinŏl̤gĕlĕ kādi satta . . ti . . . . .<br><br>Mythic Society #d Scanning project Re-Reading<br>1)svastiśrī tĕṃgālamadakaïdu . gāmuṇḍana mayduṃ baydukūra kĕṟĕgana<br>2)ūrāḻivinŏl̤gĕlĕ kādi satta ā . . . . . . l̤a<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 84<br> 7' 6\" X 4' 6\".<br><br>1. ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀ ತೆಂಗಾಲಮದಕಇದು . ಗಾಮುಣ್ದನ ಮಯ್ದುಂ ಬುಯ್ದುಕೂರ ಕೆಱಗನ<br><br>2. ಊರದಾವಿನೊಳ್ಗೆಲೆ ಕಾದಿ ಸತ್ತ . . ತಿ . . . . .<br><br><br>Mythic Society #d Scanning project Re-Reading<br>1)ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀ ತೆಂಗಾಲಮದಕಇದು . ಗಾಮುಣ್ಡನ ಮಯ್ದುಂ ಬಯ್ದುಕೂರ ಕೆಱೆಗನ<br>2)ಊರಾೞಿವಿನೊಳ್ಗೆಲೆ ಕಾದಿ ಸತ್ತ ಆ . . . . . . ಳ<br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: <br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: <br>Photographs Provided By: P L Udaya Kumar<br>Latitude: 12.974849<br>Longitude: 77.5958112<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
