        "name": "Begur (Nageshwara temple)",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvDZaKwMPSdc-zglZciXiAvueh8RIijJAgGGrofIladcFTYbRc1QGvUSnKe_FaoI9cUZZF63JeONBMFe-K9whQrU1VSDxVRVESjBh0o2fiMAmSsHFnsZeiXfSrYmzubaLfG_y0DdXfTb-osYAWYm8DwYB7RPGYCM2HDZ4y7EqQSYnIqGi5C1G-H4O2GQoVx8wq0Fog?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 85a<br>Hobli: Begur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the same village, on the basement of the Nagesvara temple.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1300<br>Inscription Language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 85a<br>Date ? about 1300 A.D.<br>(Tamil)-(On the date specified), for the benefit of my father Sembandai-jiyar, I, Vallala-jiyar, made a grant for the god Tirunagesvaram-udaiya………. To provide for offerings of rice, sandal and other requirements, and for a procession during the festival in the month of Sittirai. (usual final imprecatory sentence). This grant is under the protection of Mahesvaras.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 85<br><br>ಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮದಲ್ಲಿ ನಾಗೇಶ್ವರ ದೇವಸ್ಥಾನದ ತಳಪಾದಿಯ ಕಲ್ಲಿನಲ್ಲಿ<br><br>ಗ್ರಂಥ ಮತ್ತು ಅರವಕ್ಷರ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Tamil the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.876815<br>Longitude: 77.626444<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsMzSAJ1aN4b3PvXOJ-WtQQnBD3dbCJku7AEpaaJwbDCMLQEoUlJZt_yyfEVunFuB9eQ2KgIqQS20Ybyzk-Jh4PnP4tQ5wH-bjYCrv3uySikTfElxKmsbvmjX7voZIos8W2-U5foaiMCQgE_w2jNFZ16ZT4YP1HysHFfM8QBwP9hM3rywGuo7YpcAL8QnqJNCxmJY4?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
