        "Size": "",
        "Current_Status": "Intact",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "85a\nDate ? about 1300 A.D.\n(Tamil)-(On the date specified), for the benefit of my father Sembandai-jiyar, I, Vallala-jiyar, made a grant for the god Tirunagesvaram-udaiya………. To provide for offerings of rice, sandal and other requirements, and for a procession during the festival in the month of Sittirai. (usual final imprecatory sentence). This grant is under the protection of Mahesvaras.\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "85\n\nಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮದಲ್ಲಿ ನಾಗೇಶ್ವರ ದೇವಸ್ಥಾನದ ತಳಪಾದಿಯ ಕಲ್ಲಿನಲ್ಲಿ\n\nಗ್ರಂಥ ಮತ್ತು ಅರವಕ್ಷರ",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Tamil the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !",
