        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "85b\nDate about 1262 A.D.\n(Tamil) – I, Rajaraja-Karkata-maharaja Sokkanayan, granted the wet and dry lands with their four boundaries in the village of Orriyavanpalli for the god Tirungisvarm-udaiya Mahadevar.\n",
