        "name": "Begur (Nageshwara temple)",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtKDvGq1msdz_s0XMg_6v-VriRqHnMVNLtShjqfZ3wFDjNIbQ6hPmSqZWx6Hf-12iyMqAxrT5APr_mOvW2uqEk66BR99quK4BliUdx_8AioUaBYQStt1uJ6A-w_hCmuBPqD8V-P9YW5SfoFuxcN6-1CqAo7-MLGkK80A9ioN-qntpADa_9rmIVzK-aVDvbNWcqp_ug?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 85c<br>Hobli: Begur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the same place. (On the basement stone of Nageswara Temple)<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1110<br>Inscription Language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 85c<br><br>Date ? about 1110 A.D.<br><br>(Tamil)- During the rule of Poysala-Deva:- Tamattandan, alias Murasu…..rajan, son of Murasu-nad-alvar, terrible to titled kings, who was the son of Sola-velar-one of the gamundas of Murasu-nadu in Rajendira-Sola-vala-nadu of Mudigonda-Sola-mandalam-granted certain lands (specified) below the big tank of Veppur as a devadana, caused a surrounding wall to be built at a cost of 500 pon, and gave certain lands to Periyandan, alias Narpattennayira-bettan, son of Era-battan, for conducting the duties of superintendent of the matha (madapattiyam) In the temple………………………<br>(Usual final imprecatory sentence and final phrase).<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 85<br><br>ಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮದಲ್ಲಿ ನಾಗೇಶ್ವರ ದೇವಸ್ಥಾನದ ತಳಪಾದಿಯ ಕಲ್ಲಿನಲ್ಲಿ<br><br>ಗ್ರಂಥ ಮತ್ತು ಅರವಕ್ಷರ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Tamil the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.876815<br>Longitude: 77.626444<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKt0llNHvndl7P-dkWANnOARjmpRb23x8v4SxNuni6bUz1ATgiISzFhfV0UQhoMR7eN4rQj7z8_s1ghhVo5TqSwTEKVpJ7YssZVxOFd9JIL_DAUOgzYuUgWEAn6wVLybPe1ZftMU-LVoRiwveXbDotO-3B9is-b74gT6nkUf5PDeX0nALpPGo52-u4i7f6nn7E4wQAU?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
