        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsOi1FryW_k3mcNFdJHVbvlnZBj_SIh5GnJA4V2XSEewRmiBaS7I6I64creIxg-0gloa-Zw5l2fLfNzURkjn-zhx-cyei-TYd7zDyALN1ewwMayqGwVVNoENF0kkF9h29MzvSrSraSZbOam-DbrE0CEJ5KMfA1t6ancHnYyG9KAg0er5NBbmKCneApWAaLouOLb4ZQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 87<br>Hobli: Begur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: On a virakal in the wall of the Nageshwara temple<br>Installation Date: 01/01/0900<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 87<br>Date about 900 A.D.<br>Be it well. Nagattara’s house-manager (mane-magadin) Pegura went to svargga and the other world.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 87<br><br>ಅದೇ ದೇವಾಲಯದ ಹಿಂದೆ ಪ್ರಾಕಾರದ ಗೋಡೆಗೆ ಹಾಕಿರುವ ವೀರ ಕಲ್ಲು.<br><br>1. ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀ ನಾಗ<br>2. ತ್ತರನ ಮನೆ ಮ<br>3. ಗದಿಂ . ಪೇಗೂ<br>4. ರ ಸ್ವರ್ಗ್ಗ ಪರಲೋ<br>5. ಕಕೆ ಸಂದ<br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.876815<br>Longitude: 77.626444<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
