        "Latitude": "12.876815",
        "Longitude": "77.626444",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "90",
        "Hobli": "Begur Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "On the dooframe of the Nagreshwara temple",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "1. svastiśrī nagare\n2. śvara devarigĕ be\n3. hūra callāṃ\n4. ḍi sĕṭṭiya ma\n5. ga gaüḍu sŏ\n6.ṃṇappanu kŏ\n7. ṭṭa upakaraṇa\n8. hariyāṇa a\n9. ḍḍaṇigĕ gaṃpi\n10. navārati dūpā\n11. rati baṭṭalu śaṃ\n12. ku\n\nMythic Society #d Scanning Team Re-Reading\n1 svasti śrī nagare\n2 śvara devarigĕ be\n3 hūra cĕllāṃ\n4 ḍi sĕṭṭiya ma\n5 ga gaüḍu sŏ\n6 ṃṇappanu kŏ\n7 ṭṭa upakaraṇa\n8 hariyāṇa a\n9 ḍḍaṇigĕ gaṃpi\n10 navārati dhūpā\n11 rati baṭṭalu śaṃ\n12 ka",
