bkCd8gI9MD2XAbfcL0Mq17IUdalV8_oZCj-ObOhwj7NqxS4iaYEkhClvGExx9HgMdyqGRe-MAOD7dVamW1I_9VXzpBlUUqFLzvZcRLzuQg84_gEIiUu0p7bN96fwBPgDJ0Lrihl0mrssRWxw8g2D8j0-ynYVWcmXwTu_qtVV9YVbpz3pUFiAU3TCNVoNc?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1294",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Grantha & Tamil",
        "Size": "",
        "Current_Status": "Intact",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "91a\nDate 1294 A.D.\n(Tamil)- In the 40th Year of the reign of the universal emperor sri-Posala-vira-Ramanada-Devar-\nAs there had been no provision made formerly for offerings of rice for the gof Kadikandiya suram-udaiya-nayanar, -to provide for offerings of rice for the god, I, Kulottunga-Sola-Tagadalli\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "91\n\nಅದೇ ದೇವಸ್ಥಾನದ ತಳಪಾದಿ ಕಲ್ಲಿನ ಮೇಲೆ\n\nಗ್ರಂಥ ಮತ್ತು ಅರವಕ್ಷರ",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Tamil the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !",
