        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "1 śrīmat nāgata\n2 rana manĕvaga\n3 ti pĕrvvŏṇasĕṭṭi\n4 bĕṃgal̤ūra kāl̤ĕ\n5 gadŏṟil̤nāga\n6 tarana magaṃ buṭṭaṇa\n7 pati sattaṃ\n\nMythic Society 3d Scanning Team Re-readiong\n1)śrīmat nāgata\n2)rana manĕvaga\n3)tiṃ pĕrvvŏṇaśĕṭṭi\n4)bĕṃgul̤ūra kāl̤ĕ\n5)gadŏ. tā . l̤nāga\n6)tarana magaṃ buṭṭaṇa\n7)pati sattaṃ",
