        "name": "Begur",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 92<br>Hobli: Begur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: On the right side wall of the Veerabhadra temple<br>Installation Date: Not dated<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: Not given in the EC.<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 92&suply<br><br>ಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮದ ವೀರಭದ್ರ ದೇವಾಲಯದ ಹೊರಗಡೆ ಬಲಭಾಗದ ಗೋಡೆ ಮೇಲೆ<br><br>1. ಪರಿಧಾವಿ ಸಂವತ್ಸರದ ಅಸ್ವೀಜ ಬ ೭ ಸೋಮವಾರ ರಾಮದೇ ಅಯನವರ ಕಲ ಮಂಟಪವನು<br>2. ತೋಗೂರ ತಿವ್ಪೊಡೇರ ಮಗ ಮಲ್ಲವೊಡೇರು ಕೊಟ್ಟ ಸದನಂ ಕಟಿದವನು ನ್ಯಾಕಪ್ಪನ ಮಗ ಸಿದ್ದಯ್ಯ<br>3. ನು ಬರದವ ಹಾಡುವರಾದುನುಶ್ರೀ<br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.875652<br>Longitude: 77.625201<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
