        "name": "Begur",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtAVJtVgeQlWNagn3HBBA9wFrgTY5I8u9cZgZqNcHi1bWnFyq4L-5a2FtFrPOhfA_w9zekG0GD-cLX99DSTKShUvTLuhqMaX4n9sAypaPSH6JvFZFUcEGzrAu0OKqcLDVRG8NMocHs0nHNcSwgijd1ALZVgP6nA83EFBrMNMC_yy_SRS3lh0eW7rIM9ZYag_WVGbrj8?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 93<br>Hobli: Begur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the same village, on a stone in the jagati to the right of the 2nd entrance of the fort.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/0950<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 3'x4'<br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 93<br><br>Date ? about 950 A.D.<br><br>.. .. .. Parmmanandi-bhattaaraka had this stone set up for Ravikanti-siddhanti, who was Mankabbe-kanti<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 93&Suply<br><br>ಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮದ ಕೋಟೆಯಲ್ಲಿ 2ನೇ ಬಾಗಿಲ ಬಲಭಾಗದ ಜಗಲಿಗೆ ಶೇರಿದ ಕಲ್ಲಿನಲ್ಲಿ<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 3’ x 4’<br><br>1. . . . . . .<br>2. . . . . .<br>3. . ಮ . . .<br>4. ಬ್ಬಿದುಸಣ<br>5. ಪಮ್ಮಣನ್ದಿ<br>6. ಭಟಾರರ ಮಾಳ<br>7. ವೆ ಕನ್ತಿಯರ ಸಿಪಿ<br>8. ತ್ತಿಯರಪ್ಪದುಂ ಕ<br>9. ಬ್ಬೆ ಕನ್ತಿಯರ್<br>10. . ನಿಬಂದಿ . ಲ್ಲ<br>11. . . ನ್ತನಿಱಿಸಿದ<br>12. ಮಂಗಳ<br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.8710993<br>Longitude: 77.6231483<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
