        "name": "Begur",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtf9vHtObrytTINTt12zsdyaD6yxD0Dmh1GL60QWxtM_WQ1zOTkisdO-AvD2lgX4rsr9nwyNfNUNKmQ0f3AbTYAWuy0iCGYSZMdr43ZMXdxz9C1RxbGbXm7SfC1HF0QF8CVVfiMQBZaltwkq2Jeu1zQLcHNnQUjr6kJr3vkrGjTYU3aUy_ogf58cKfmZsPaHnGoodKV?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 94<br>Hobli: Begur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the same place, on a pillar.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/0900<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 94<br><br>Date about 900 A.D.<br><br>May prosperity be to the jina sasana. Srimat Nagattara’s daughter Tondabbe, performing sanyasanam, expired.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 94<br>At the same place, on a pillar.<br>Baadrm astu Jina-sasanaya srimatu nagattarana magal Toudabbe sanyasanam gaidu mudipidal.<br><br>Mythic Society 3D Scanning team re-reading<br>಄ bhadramastu ji<br>na sāsanāya śrī<br>mat nāgatarana<br>magal̤tŏṇḍabbĕ sa<br>nyāsanaṃgĕydu<br>muḍipidal̤ <br><br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 94<br><br>ಅದೇ ಸ್ಥಳದಲ್ಲಿ ಕಂಬದ ಮೇಲೆ.<br><br>1. ಭದ್ರಮಸ್ತು ಜಿ<br>2. ನ ಸಾಸನಾಯ ಶ್ರೀ<br>3. ಮತು ನಾಗತ್ತರನ<br>4. ಮಗಳ್ರೊಣ್ಡಬ್ಬೆ ಸ<br>5. ನ್ಯಸನಂಗೈದು<br>6. ಮುಡಿಪಿದಳ್<br><br>Mythic Society 3D Scanning team re-reading <br>಄ ಭದ್ರಮಸ್ತು ಜಿ<br>ನ ಸಾಸನಾಯ ಶ್ರೀ<br>ಮತ್ ನಾಗತರನ<br>ಮಗಳ್ತೊಣ್ಡಬ್ಬೆ ಸ<br>ನ್ಯಾಸನಂಗೆಯ್ದು<br>ಮುಡಿಪಿದಳ್<br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.8710993<br>Longitude: 77.6231483<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsDp40khhSb01jEAAYG0sKmh-MaRUEWBKHlbPduGGn-xutL3wxAbUYMvavm8eJFcusVorCoOBQDTgZ6z97DIfUjQVd-Xpyg1TFBs2fa92GtTmK3UH5af2bEF13pd9DX3sUh-P4EcwisLj0BUCkCelqlJktSfArR-exJZZ_Oqj9DTqZR6-fCEG9VVAEppB0irWpI_gRf?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/0900",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Kannada",
        "Size": "",
        "Current_Status": "Intact",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "94\n\nDate about 900 A.D.\n\nMay prosperity be to the jina sasana. Srimat Nagattara’s daughter Tondabbe, performing sanyasanam, expired.\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "94\n\nಅದೇ ಸ್ಥಳದಲ್ಲಿ ಕಂಬದ ಮೇಲೆ.\n\n1. ಭದ್ರಮಸ್ತು ಜಿ\n2. ನ ಸಾಸನಾಯ ಶ್ರೀ\n3. ಮತು ನಾಗತ್ತರನ\n4. ಮಗಳ್ರೊಣ್ಡಬ್ಬೆ ಸ\n5. ನ್ಯಸನಂಗೈದು\n6. ಮುಡಿಪಿದಳ್\n\nMythic Society 3D Scanning team re-reading \n಄ ಭದ್ರಮಸ್ತು ಜಿ\nನ ಸಾಸನಾಯ ಶ್ರೀ\nಮತ್ ನಾಗತರನ\nಮಗಳ್ತೊಣ್ಡಬ್ಬೆ ಸ\nನ್ಯಾಸನಂಗೆಯ್ದು\nಮುಡಿಪಿದಳ್\n",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "English_Translation__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "English_Transliteration__Retyped_By": "",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "Photographs_Provided_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "Latitude": "12.8710993",
        "Longitude": "77.6231483",
        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtf9vHtObrytTINTt12zsdyaD6yxD0Dmh1GL60QWxtM_WQ1zOTkisdO-AvD2lgX4rsr9nwyNfNUNKmQ0f3AbTYAWuy0iCGYSZMdr43ZMXdxz9C1RxbGbXm7SfC1HF0QF8CVVfiMQBZaltwkq2Jeu1zQLcHNnQUjr6kJr3vkrGjTYU3aUy_ogf58cKfmZsPaHnGoodKV?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsDp40khhSb01jEAAYG0sKmh-MaRUEWBKHlbPduGGn-xutL3wxAbUYMvavm8eJFcusVorCoOBQDTgZ6z97DIfUjQVd-Xpyg1TFBs2fa92GtTmK3UH5af2bEF13pd9DX3sUh-P4EcwisLj0BUCkCelqlJktSfArR-exJZZ_Oqj9DTqZR6-fCEG9VVAEppB0irWpI_gRf?authuser=0&fife=s16383",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "94",
        "Hobli": "Begur Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At the same place, on a pillar.",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "94\nAt the same place, on a pillar.\nBaadrm astu Jina-sasanaya srimatu nagattarana magal Toudabbe sanyasanam gaidu mudipidal.\n\nMythic Society 3D Scanning team re-reading\n಄ bhadramastu ji\nna sāsanāya śrī\nmat nāgatarana\nmagal̤tŏṇḍabbĕ sa\nnyāsanaṃgĕydu\nmuḍipidal̤ \n",
