        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKv9GQSMPpgA8RJk41Alvk0N7dmrFY9NaoHMppRrjN3_ZuHt6sZs8UnW7Ew50NTkm8eWKos9P8ALlYgvH0w5eDE-6zE8lAvDrv-EllU5z8YDv8wn_ysClpqIGRNWXBSOPxIGfXoc5jOmCF0aZNbmnMjHhs9diHUX9Rf0OH6PSg6mF430e1ydJToCCmHnEANUF1fyOFRY?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 95<br>Hobli: Begur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the same place.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/0950<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Intact, plastered over<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 95&Suply<br><br>Date ? about 950 A.D<br><br>(The first part is nearly effected)<br><br>……………. Raya’s son ………….discipline of ………. – Kumaranandi-bhatara, with his face towards Kamapura and Madambapattana of the Bide-kanda, according to custom wandering about…………<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 95<br>ಅದೇ ಸ್ಥಳದಲ್ಲಿ <br>. . . . . . . . . . . . . .<br>4. ಸಟ್ಟಿ . . . . ರಾಯ<br>5. ಪುತ್ರ . . . . . . .<br>6. ನ ಸಿಧಾನ್ತಭ<br>7. . . . . . . .<br>8. . . . . . ವರಶಿಷ್ಯರ್<br>9. ಕುಮಾರ ಣನ್ದಿಭಟಾರ<br>10. ಕಾಮಪುರ ಬಿದಕಣ್ಡ<br>11. ದ ಮದಂಬಪಟ್ಟಣ<br>12. ನ್ತಾಭಿಮುಖಗಳಿಯ<br>13. ರ್ ಕ್ರಮದಿನ್ದವಿಹಾರಿಸು<br>14. ತ್ತು<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.8710993<br>Longitude: 77.6231483<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
