        "name": "Hongasandra ",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtpNkVD3Rd_b9HKWNCvNfv4uA-in7dPoLM5pn88G9COi0NV-OUGE4lVtIyCQ465b5j7p6n4APhRRIdl6T1rIoslb8mRErOzFIEpHL6CWeSsJl2JALslTXHu9yV8owTAyPjDxWBsReK_HVg0DzCrvcwAcZ4PEFfPp6Oknp32q0cV3TGV21Qfr0DGPRdJo83RHcjmlbo?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 98<br>Hobli: Begur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Hongasandra (same hobli), in Yerrappa's field to the north.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1298<br>Inscription Language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: 5'x2'6\"<br>Current Status: Not traceble<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 98<br>Date 1298 A.D<br>Tamil – (On the date specified), I, Imjairan-Karkata-maharajan, granted, with pouring of water, as a madappurram, the wet and dry lands with their four boundaries, including the wells underground and the trees overground, in the village of Vamayanpalli of Veppur-parru, to the emperor of ascetics Sivajnana-pauditar Sembi-jiyar. He shall enjoy (these lands) for as long as the moon and the sun endure. (Usual final imprecatory sentence.) he shall have this great engraved on copper and stone. The Signature of Vettiyar-chokkar, Nirukkanatti-udaiyar and Elumbador.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 98<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಹೊಂಗಸಂದ್ರ ಗ್ರಾಮಕ್ಕೆ ಉತ್ತರ ಯೆರ್ರಪ್ಪನ ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿ<br><br>ಗ್ರಂಥ ಮತ್ತು ಅರವಕ್ಷರ <br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 5’ x 2’6”.<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Tamil the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.8944872<br>Longitude: 77.6359731<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKv3WC9T9O8ct9NY-A1PIj5eHTV7fNVb943jvcQW50vahf-uQfAJayLSJ0N3-EYwcsdB5Z7Fnp5j-22r_VPaEpzn_9U32uyL6HHui-Fq4vSxnSzvawN6Zc8-56ICg6DX-2-mvWPhdm8Kw0KGpu5wC1L2bYu20R03y_NAay70IWlMbTE84APiZjn2PxJrPcyygeb-VCk?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1298",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Grantha & Tamil",
        "Size": "5'x2'6\"",
        "Current_Status": "Not traceble",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "98\nDate 1298 A.D\nTamil – (On the date specified), I, Imjairan-Karkata-maharajan, granted, with pouring of water, as a madappurram, the wet and dry lands with their four boundaries, including the wells underground and the trees overground, in the village of Vamayanpalli of Veppur-parru, to the emperor of ascetics Sivajnana-pauditar Sembi-jiyar. He shall enjoy (these lands) for as long as the moon and the sun endure. (Usual final imprecatory sentence.) he shall have this great engraved on copper and stone. The Signature of Vettiyar-chokkar, Nirukkanatti-udaiyar and Elumbador.\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "98\n\nಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಹೊಂಗಸಂದ್ರ ಗ್ರಾಮಕ್ಕೆ ಉತ್ತರ ಯೆರ್ರಪ್ಪನ ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿ\n\nಗ್ರಂಥ ಮತ್ತು ಅರವಕ್ಷರ \n\nಪ್ರಮಾಣ 5’ x 2’6”.",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Tamil the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "English_Translation__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
