        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKs7oNGN1oE1eBQVpAUtJUCwfoC2XfxGLu4RaLnAjcOxBVrB3uC3gIh75uu2FgL8OFQTRn5zn5LR7AEEtXWjlerorXn9sEOM-_7_q-ieWJsEae-WCjM32OwCpZ5-h7ilomPGOVjdxZn457JdVoOn1B0XG218otzPpNceUbdw947GyBmAT5Yt40-i1o9b1FAUwVnbcMI?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 99<br>Hobli: Begur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the same village, on a stone in Survey 50, Gopaliyengars palya<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1262<br>Inscription Language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: 5'x2'<br>Current Status: Inatact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 99<br><br>Date 1262 A.D<br><br>(Tamil)- (on the date specified), I, Rajaraja..Kurkata-maharaja Sokkanayan, granted, for….. Tribuvanamalla-puradiyar, alias Tamatta…., the wet and dry lands with their four boundaries, including tanks and ponds, in the village of Udayasamuttiram, to the mahajanas……….. including the pujaris Ilayavilli-alvar, Balendu-mauli……….. and Gangaya-vibudhan<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 99<br><br>ಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮಕ್ಕೆ ಶೇರಿದ ಗೋಪಾಲೈಯಂಗಾರ್ರ ಪಾಳ್ಯದ ಸರ್ವೇನಂಬರ್ 50ನೇ ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿ<br><br>ಗ್ರಂಥ ಮತ್ತು ಅರವಕ್ಷರ <br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 5’ x 2’<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Tamil the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Shashikumara Naik K C<br>Latitude: 12.8927041<br>Longitude: 77.6371774<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKt-1paK1GBFPMIMSeQOk2PjQvAum25v3XukaWjsgmZGamTQIGtH_kKIVrZMlb_rDaibm37c0SHr3KbNsGMWEWvdSxYLS_gje_0LJZyapzW9zPTXkjCyvrdSTB8p7HYmGwhkd2-qaQ7Ze6uVAdTepBbQM9l6Z2IPQppWhJ3POfBterwmlnGrPOCcX6weudBDCLfqhSY?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuqYE8uCg9fEzF4XvXvcvbJ9WMUNcsWCZu80Vv_QcqIPQtpcC7ZwZWt5g7-CyYln3xk5HTi9o9XXgARI_b4G5bj51ZS4nBR1u0vPDLJvh8KEktBnLlGl6YKi_Z4Wq5Doc2k9qx05MTyjmIK72mynbnZP8PF3nwV8zUs_CdRQT0k9I0K0HnX6Zi56XEyk9fVUREBmFo?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKviDb-Ge9u7GEo5csJiQDN1FLEu2DxdAqyRfu-eNzXht_Lzu1Oz4SdlpmhKaC9hTXiWA19-JN5Tok93nktY2s7k-UIrFi6uA8s-KQgO2NhEsjaxgNWKh-roHvELaxGoj0HZFgj6yn0dYvIPxw6V_jYfYno8uih8fnfeps8cyXa3Tb1aI8xT7vQcNsECfkbjbViDVm4?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
