        "name": "Konappa agrahara ",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtrT4zjKEW5Juu7xEHBtf3MUF1hQasE7hp1iSg8myNCToAUiPg5bJUpSE2O2FUJFon_KQMCQZeY5dCGQMNwpIPWWsRcz6vnnaAanwJnn6MpppjQCmFDtj6U9yz_6Ld5hOXqXsVF-JazJp0JkqI5xn4HCP6AN7CwIepdHyyP5fZ4J7-TTME6dyCc63RAIbuag1Ak_Xw?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 101<br>Hobli: Begur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Konappas agrahdra (same hobli), in Yellappa's field by the side of the Hosur road.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1361<br>Inscription Language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: 5'x2'6\"<br>Current Status: Yet to verify<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: Date 1361 A.D<br><br>(Tamil)- (On the date specified), Vallapa-denanyakkar, one of ……………… of the maha-mandalesvara, the champion over kings who break their word, Ariyappa-udaiyar, and the inhabitants of Veppur nadu-Sokkayappan and others (as few named) – seem to have made a grant<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 101<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಕೋನಪ್ಪನ ಅಗ್ರಹಾರದ ಬಳಿ ಹೊಸೂರ ರಸ್ತೆ ಪಕ್ಕದಲ್ಲಿ ಯಲ್ಲಪ್ಪನ ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿ<br><br>ಗ್ರಂಥ ಮತ್ತು ಅರವಕ್ಷರ <br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 5’ x 2’6”.<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Tamil the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.8540503<br>Longitude: 77.6624201<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1361",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Grantha & Tamil",
        "Size": "5'x2'6\"",
        "Current_Status": "Yet to verify",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "Date 1361 A.D\n\n(Tamil)- (On the date specified), Vallapa-denanyakkar, one of ……………… of the maha-mandalesvara, the champion over kings who break their word, Ariyappa-udaiyar, and the inhabitants of Veppur nadu-Sokkayappan and others (as few named) – seem to have made a grant\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "101\n\nಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಕೋನಪ್ಪನ ಅಗ್ರಹಾರದ ಬಳಿ ಹೊಸೂರ ರಸ್ತೆ ಪಕ್ಕದಲ್ಲಿ ಯಲ್ಲಪ್ಪನ ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿ\n\nಗ್ರಂಥ ಮತ್ತು ಅರವಕ್ಷರ \n\nಪ್ರಮಾಣ 5’ x 2’6”.",
