        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsbW8jEu-bR6R-Y3HUpgGS_xMyyk6-eCBmQhReu3DA7QRyIFKfR9HNUC9_9e4gDTQ7Gc_Rq9oXzuGTY2Ti3am34TK6Xw4BTV-7_NWSuQhXg1CmV80yKA9a227o80GGcGYzJR3NwKtEPKgyL3wdHD-iuXeP2nMrLCz3VXrwwoWQKecOhkwYtZt8fgeZqp7MwyylLzR4?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 103<br>Hobli: Begur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: ON a stone lying in Venkatachal Bhhatas inamti field<br>Installation Date: Not dated<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 4'x3'<br>Current Status: Yet to verify<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: Not given in the EC.<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 103<br><br>ade grāmadalli vĕṃkaṭācala bhaṭṭana ināmati hŏladalli biddiruva kallu<br><br>pramāṇa 4’ x 3’ hal̤agannaḍakṣara<br><br>(suttalū hogidhĕ)<br>raḍuvĕṃgida<br>rātirkal̤u<br>dĕyallādidi<br>ṭatul̤upa<br>riyaldapa<br>ṇdiru yyĕ<br>lurāga<br><br>sŏnakallisi<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team<br>1 . ḍuvĕṃgida<br>2 rātir kal̤u ma<br>3 dĕyalkādi di<br>4 ṭa tuṟupa<br>5 riyaldaṭa<br>6 ṇḍarayya<br>7 . lu pŏga<br>8 . . .<br>9 . . .<br>10 ka . . .<br>11 . . . .<br>12 nŏ . kallasi .<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 103<br><br>ಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮದಲ್ಲಿ ವೆಂಕಟಾಚಲ ಭಟ್ಟನ ಇನಾಮತಿ ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿ ಬಿದ್ದಿರುವ ಕಲ್ಲು<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 4’ x 3’ ಹಳಗನ್ನಡಕ್ಷರ<br><br>(ಸುತ್ತಲೂ ಹೋಗಿಧೆ)<br>ರಡುವೆಂಗಿದ<br>ರಾತಿರ್‍ಕಳು<br>ದೆಯಲ್ಲಾದಿದಿ<br>ಟತುಳುಪ<br>ರಿಯಲ್ದಪ<br>ಣ್ದಿರು ಯ್ಯೆ<br>ಲುರಾಗ<br><br>ಸೊನಕಲ್ಲಿಸಿ<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team<br>1 . ಡುವೆಂಗಿದ<br>2 ರಾತಿರ್‌ ಕಳು ಮ<br>3 ದೆಯಲ್ಕಾದಿ ದಿ<br>4 ಟ ತುಱುಪ<br>5 ರಿಯಲ್ದಟ<br>6 ಣ್ಡರಯ್ಯ<br>7 . ಲು ಪೊಗ<br>8 . . .<br>9 . . .<br>10 ಕ . . .<br>11 . . . .<br>12 ನೊ . ಕಲ್ಲಸಿ . <br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Rajeev Nrupathunga‎<br>Latitude: 12.8520523<br>Longitude: 77.6548497<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
