        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "103",
        "Hobli": "Begur Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "ON a stone lying in Venkatachal Bhhatas inamti field",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "103\n\nade grāmadalli vĕṃkaṭācala bhaṭṭana ināmati hŏladalli biddiruva kallu\n\npramāṇa 4’ x 3’ hal̤agannaḍakṣara\n\n(suttalū hogidhĕ)\nraḍuvĕṃgida\nrātirkal̤u\ndĕyallādidi\nṭatul̤upa\nriyaldapa\nṇdiru yyĕ\nlurāga\n\nsŏnakallisi\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team\n1 . ḍuvĕṃgida\n2 rātir kal̤u ma\n3 dĕyalkādi di\n4 ṭa tuṟupa\n5 riyaldaṭa\n6 ṇḍarayya\n7 . lu pŏga\n8 . . .\n9 . . .\n10 ka . . .\n11 . . . .\n12 nŏ . kallasi .",
