      "properties": {
        "name": "Bilakanahalli",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 104<br>Hobli: Begur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Bilakanahalli (same hobli), on the brindavana near the road.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1879<br>Inscription Language: Telugu<br>Size: 2'6\"x1'2\"<br>Current Status: Not Traceable ( Shashikumar Naik)<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 104<br><br>Date 1879 A.D.<br><br>(Telugu)- Obeisance to Ramanuja. Joined to the sacred feet (i.e. the discipline) of the establisher of the path of the Vedas, promoter of both vedanta (the Sanskrit and the Dravida) Tirukovilur Yatirajasvami, - Trisirapura Toreyur Poli-Setti’s (son) – to Krishnappa-Nayaini’s sons Narasimhalu-Nayini and Perumalu-Nayini, the brother, -Subrayalu-Nayadu, (on the date specified), gained the holy place of the sacred feet of the Acharyas (i.e, died).<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 104<br>At Bilakanahalli 9same hobli), on the brindavana near the road.<br>Srimate Ramanujaya namah srimad-veda-marga-pratishthapanacharyobhaya-vedanta-pravartakulaina sriman Tirukoviluru yatiraja-svami-tiruvadi-sambandhulaina Trisirapuram Torayura Poli-Setti ra || Krishnappa-Nayanivri kumarudunnu Narasimhula-Nayaniki Perumalu-Nayaniki sahodarudunnaina Subrayalu-Nayadu.. Kali 4981 ki sariyaina Pramadi-nama-sam Bhadrapada ba || dasami Avani-nela 27 tedi Budhavaram ratri 11 ghadiyalaku Acharyula tiruvadigalu cherina tirupalli ||<br><br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 104<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಟಿಳಕನಹಳ್ಳಿ ಗ್ರಾಮಕ್ಕೆ ಪಶ್ಚಿಮ ರಸ್ತೆ ಬಳಿ ಇರುವ ಬೃಂದಾವನದ ಮೇಲೆ<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 2’ 6” x 1’2”<br><br>ಶ್ರೀಮತೇರಾಮಾನುಜಾಯನಮಃ<br>ಶ್ರೀಮದ್ವೇದಮಾರ್ಗಪ್ರತಿಷ್ಠಾಪನಾಚಾರ್ಯೋ<br>ಭಯವೇದಾಂತಪ್ರವತ್ತಕುಲೈನಶ್ರೀರ್ಮಾತಿರುಕೋವಿ<br>ಲೂರುಯತಿರಾಜಸ್ವಾಮಿತಿರುವಡಿಸಂಬಂಧುಲೈವ<br>ತ್ರೀರಪುರಂತೊರಯೂರ||ವೋಲಿನೆಟ್ಟ||ರಾ||ಕ್ರಿಷ್ಣ<br>ಪೈನಾಯನಿವಾರಿಕುಮಾರುಡುನ್ನು ನರಸಿಂಹಲ<br>ನಾಯನಿಕಿಪೆರುಮಾಳುನಾಯನಿಕಿಸಹೋದುರುಡುಂನೈನ<br>ಸುಬ್ರಾಯುಲುನಾಯಡು<br>ಕಲಿ ಸರಿಯೈನಪ್ರಮಾದಿನಾಮಸಂ<br>ಭಾದ್ರಪದ||ಬ||ದಶಮಿಆವಣಿನೆಲ12 ತೇದಿ<br>ಬುಧವಾರಂರಾತ್ರಿ11 ಘೌಡಿಯಲಕುಆಚಾ<br>ರ್ಯುಲತಿರುವಡಿಗಳುಚೇರಿನತಿರುಪಳ್ಳಿ||<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Telugu the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.8998319<br>Longitude: 77.6077864<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1879",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Telugu",
        "Size": "2'6\"x1'2\"",
        "Current_Status": "Not Traceable ( Shashikumar Naik)",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "104\n\nDate 1879 A.D.\n\n(Telugu)- Obeisance to Ramanuja. Joined to the sacred feet (i.e. the discipline) of the establisher of the path of the Vedas, promoter of both vedanta (the Sanskrit and the Dravida) Tirukovilur Yatirajasvami, - Trisirapura Toreyur Poli-Setti’s (son) – to Krishnappa-Nayaini’s sons Narasimhalu-Nayini and Perumalu-Nayini, the brother, -Subrayalu-Nayadu, (on the date specified), gained the holy place of the sacred feet of the Acharyas (i.e, died).\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "104\n\nಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಟಿಳಕನಹಳ್ಳಿ ಗ್ರಾಮಕ್ಕೆ ಪಶ್ಚಿಮ ರಸ್ತೆ ಬಳಿ ಇರುವ ಬೃಂದಾವನದ ಮೇಲೆ\n\nಪ್ರಮಾಣ 2’ 6” x 1’2”\n\nಶ್ರೀಮತೇರಾಮಾನುಜಾಯನಮಃ\nಶ್ರೀಮದ್ವೇದಮಾರ್ಗಪ್ರತಿಷ್ಠಾಪನಾಚಾರ್ಯೋ\nಭಯವೇದಾಂತಪ್ರವತ್ತಕುಲೈನಶ್ರೀರ್ಮಾತಿರುಕೋವಿ\nಲೂರುಯತಿರಾಜಸ್ವಾಮಿತಿರುವಡಿಸಂಬಂಧುಲೈವ\nತ್ರೀರಪುರಂತೊರಯೂರ||ವೋಲಿನೆಟ್ಟ||ರಾ||ಕ್ರಿಷ್ಣ\nಪೈನಾಯನಿವಾರಿಕುಮಾರುಡುನ್ನು ನರಸಿಂಹಲ\nನಾಯನಿಕಿಪೆರುಮಾಳುನಾಯನಿಕಿಸಹೋದುರುಡುಂನೈನ\nಸುಬ್ರಾಯುಲುನಾಯಡು\nಕಲಿ ಸರಿಯೈನಪ್ರಮಾದಿನಾಮಸಂ\nಭಾದ್ರಪದ||ಬ||ದಶಮಿಆವಣಿನೆಲ12 ತೇದಿ\nಬುಧವಾರಂರಾತ್ರಿ11 ಘೌಡಿಯಲಕುಆಚಾ\nರ್ಯುಲತಿರುವಡಿಗಳುಚೇರಿನತಿರುಪಳ್ಳಿ||",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Telugu the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !",
        "English_Translation__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "English_Transliteration__Retyped_By": "",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "Photographs_Provided_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
        "Latitude": "12.8998319",
        "Longitude": "77.6077864",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "104",
        "Hobli": "Begur Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At Bilakanahalli (same hobli), on the brindavana near the road.",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "104\nAt Bilakanahalli 9same hobli), on the brindavana near the road.\nSrimate Ramanujaya namah srimad-veda-marga-pratishthapanacharyobhaya-vedanta-pravartakulaina sriman Tirukoviluru yatiraja-svami-tiruvadi-sambandhulaina Trisirapuram Torayura Poli-Setti ra || Krishnappa-Nayanivri kumarudunnu Narasimhula-Nayaniki Perumalu-Nayaniki sahodarudunnaina Subrayalu-Nayadu.. Kali 4981 ki sariyaina Pramadi-nama-sam Bhadrapada ba || dasami Avani-nela 27 tedi Budhavaram ratri 11 ghadiyalaku Acharyula tiruvadigalu cherina tirupalli ||\n",
        "Name_": "",
