      },
      "properties": {
        "name": "Hulimavu ",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 105<br>Hobli: Begur Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Hulimavu (same hobli), on a stone in Beguru Muniyappas field<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1652<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 4'6\"x2'6\"<br>Current Status: Yet to verify<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 105<br><br>Date ? 1652 A.D<br><br>May it be prosperous. (In the year specified), Channappanna-ayya’s agent yallapa-Nayaka remitted the marriage tax in the Saraki-sime, for all castes in the Bandaruda village, and the village belonging to the Amrapura temple, Imprecation.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 105<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಹುಳಿಮಾವು ಗ್ರಾಮದ ವೂರಮುಂದೆಯಿರುವ ಬೇಗೂರು ಮುನಿಯಪ್ಪನ ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿ<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 4’ 6’ x 2’ 6”<br><br>ಶುಭಮಸ್ತುನಂದನಸಂವತ್ಸ<br>ರದವಯಶಾಖಬ..ವಾರ<br>ದಯಲ್ಲಪನಾಯಕ ರೂಸಾಅ<br>ಕಿಯಸೀಮೆಗೆಮದುವೆಯ<br>ಸುಂಕವನುಬಿಟ್ಟು ಕೊಟದಂ<br>ಮಶಾಸನದಕ್ರಮವೆಂತೆಂದ<br>ರೆಸಾಅಕೆಯಸೀಮೆಯೊಳಗೆ<br>ಭಂಡಾರೂಡಗ್ರಾಮ ಆಮ್ರ<br>ಪುರದೇವಸ್ಥಾನಗ್ರಾಮದೊಳಗಾದ<br>ಲುಶ್ರೀಮತುಚಂನಪ್ಪಂಣಅ<br>ಯ್ಯನವರಕಾಯ್ರ್ಯಕೆಕತ್ರ್ತರಾ<br>ಗ್ರಾಮಗಳೊಳಗೆಯಿಹನಾನಾಜಾ<br>ತಿಗಳಿಗೆಮದುವೆಯಸುಂಕವಿಲ್ಲ<br>ವೆಂದುಕೊಟ್ಟ ದಂಮಶಾಸನಯಿ<br>ದಕೆಆವನೊಬ್ಬ ಅಳುಪಿದರೂ<br>ವಾರಣಾಸಿಯಲಿಗೋಬ್ರಾಹ್ಮಣ<br>ರಕೊಂದದೋಶಕೆಮಾತೃಗಮನ<br>ವಮಾಡಿದದೋಶಕೆಹೋಹರು<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.876585<br>Longitude: 77.609072<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
