      "properties": {
        "name": "Kengeri",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 106<br>Hobli: Kengeri Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Kenqeri, on the wall of Ekabilva-gavi of Bande-matha.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1851<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 2'6'x1'6\"<br>Current Status: Yet to verify<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 106<br><br>Date 1851 A.D<br><br>Be it well. (On the date specified), in the presence of Mari-Vrishabhendra-astablished at the one-leafed bilva tree of Bande-matha, adorned with all titles, Krishna-raja-Vadeyar if the Mysore State made a grant for the service of the matha.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 106<br><br>ಕೆಂಗೇರಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಬಂಡೇಮಠದ ಏಕಬಿಲ್ವ ಗವಿಯ ಗೋಡೆ ಮೇಲೆ<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 2’ 6” x 1’ 6”<br><br>ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀವಿಜಯಾಭ್ಯುದಯಶಾಲಿವಾಹನ<br>ಶಕವರುಷಂಗಳು1220ಸಂದವರ್ತಮಾನಪಾ<br>ದಸಾಧಾರಣನಾಮಸಂವತ್ಸರದಮಾಘಬ<br>ಸ್ಥಿರವಾರದಲ್ಲೂಬಂಡೇಮಠದಯೇಕದ<br>ಳಬಿಲ್ವಸಾಂನಿಧ್ಯನೆಲೆಗೊಂಡಿರುಲ್ವಹಂತಮ<br>ರಿವೃಷಭೇಂದ್ರಸ್ವಾಮಿಗಳ(ಸ್ವಾಮಿಗಳ)ಸನ್ನಿಧಿಗೆಶ್ರೀ<br>ಮತ್ಸಮಸ್ತಭೂಮಂಡಲೇತ್ಯಾದಿಸಮ<br>ಸ್ತಬಿರುದಾಂಕಿತರಾದಮೈಸೂರುಸಂ<br>ಸ್ಥಾನದಕ್ರಷ್ಣರಾಜವಡೆಯರವರು<br>ಮಾಡಿಸಿವಪ್ಪಿಶಿದಮಠದನೇವಾರ್ಥ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.9181582<br>Longitude: 77.4738066<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1851",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Kannada",
        "Size": "2'6'x1'6\"",
        "Current_Status": "Yet to verify",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "106\n\nDate 1851 A.D\n\nBe it well. (On the date specified), in the presence of Mari-Vrishabhendra-astablished at the one-leafed bilva tree of Bande-matha, adorned with all titles, Krishna-raja-Vadeyar if the Mysore State made a grant for the service of the matha.\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "106\n\nಕೆಂಗೇರಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಬಂಡೇಮಠದ ಏಕಬಿಲ್ವ ಗವಿಯ ಗೋಡೆ ಮೇಲೆ\n\nಪ್ರಮಾಣ 2’ 6” x 1’ 6”\n\nಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀವಿಜಯಾಭ್ಯುದಯಶಾಲಿವಾಹನ\nಶಕವರುಷಂಗಳು1220ಸಂದವರ್ತಮಾನಪಾ\nದಸಾಧಾರಣನಾಮಸಂವತ್ಸರದಮಾಘಬ\nಸ್ಥಿರವಾರದಲ್ಲೂಬಂಡೇಮಠದಯೇಕದ\nಳಬಿಲ್ವಸಾಂನಿಧ್ಯನೆಲೆಗೊಂಡಿರುಲ್ವಹಂತಮ\nರಿವೃಷಭೇಂದ್ರಸ್ವಾಮಿಗಳ(ಸ್ವಾಮಿಗಳ)ಸನ್ನಿಧಿಗೆಶ್ರೀ\nಮತ್ಸಮಸ್ತಭೂಮಂಡಲೇತ್ಯಾದಿಸಮ\nಸ್ತಬಿರುದಾಂಕಿತರಾದಮೈಸೂರುಸಂ\nಸ್ಥಾನದಕ್ರಷ್ಣರಾಜವಡೆಯರವರು\nಮಾಡಿಸಿವಪ್ಪಿಶಿದಮಠದನೇವಾರ್ಥ",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "English_Translation__Retyped_By": "Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com>",
