        "name": "Talegattapura",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuNSZwuIpI1ZeRpwOBNbs-iPwE5f1-9Tainki3fBg8XS-eTha88mh5hATcdShz2BEis06WltSOv5486yGgvRShBGUj5DlVru7Mn9TcnhsefJuVX5Psw7TFuHUvuZKoYSrJeAUUzlVKhjB0xGgjpYq1b1xIUg89rnw3Mbq0oRtrJ-4BQGiZGCLbzbAdkpt6uSEXJKyI?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 114a<br>Hobli: Kengeri Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Talegattapura (same hobli), on a stone in Symanas field<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1262<br>Inscription Language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 114a and 115<br>Date about 1262 A.D.<br>(Tamil) — I, Rajaraja-Kakkata-marayan S'okkaniyan, grnated Talaigattur S'ivapuram, together with the wet and dry lands within its four boundaries, to Muttin Kamayan and other Mahesvaras, (Usual final imprecatory sentence). S'ogudaiyan shall ? improve aad enjoy certain lands (specified). (Then follow names of the donees and details of the shares). I, Kama-devar, will exact a fine from and expel from his vritti any man who either leaves S'ivapurara for good, or slanders another, or commits adultery. S'uriya-deva gets ten kulaga of wet land.<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Tamil the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.864436<br>Longitude: 77.53378<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsUinKJeC0CGc8H-tNmGfJaNzE1I3UX8gyTPlnt5TXIpSsu1WUrx1mscsPXvSmDNI1LWLzo3zmbIDkbjjbL0mMvS3PKz295fR2kVMZOOmL12DR14nvqnoblakEkXS8SujacpZT8lcyLj4lk9N3GDVMbsZ2AEoo3TweJxhEUYbPFa9XVXD2Jc57vcCihso2V2h5ORq74?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1262",
