        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuYC_5U3M1n7hkH5G0YmNnR1ALyeDmIDpeLHMJBKvJQgs-BPwL9FPL-jlOqp7_4cPRTB1bHZ41X60hOHYDOBIR7-VNya_i7hQGwkDp2pVY2zY3x0qfZNpUtJYRv0mmOq8QmqBcmMI9EQmazNoPmIFa36E5wkwwpGzl35QICWWvmiqS86G5fZZxbXdvYrvB8laQFfJ0?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 115<br>Hobli: Kengeri Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Talegattapura (same hobli), on a stone in Symanas field<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1262<br>Inscription Language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: 5'X2'9\"<br>Current Status: Verified (efforts to shift to public place underway)<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 114 and 115<br><br>Date about 1262 A.D<br><br>(Tamil)- I, Rajaraja-Kakkata-marayan Sokkanayan, granted Talaigattur Sivapuram, together with the wet and dry lands within its four boundaries, to Muttin Kamayan and other Mahesvaras. (Usual final imprecatory sentence) . Sogudaiyan shall? Improve and enjoy certain lands (specified).(Then follow names of the donees and details of the shares), I, Kama-devar will exact a fine from and expel from his vritti any man who either leavers Sivapuram for good, or slanders another, or commits adultery. Suriya-deva gets ten kulanga of wet land.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Tamil the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.864436<br>Longitude: 77.533783<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtr88hS50MTToC0SSCZNNGngyx7P8wmVMfE5BNJhoV8cW8CqP_OwMFwr6Dqf8L6FCCvNFj4ROBuRHcVp-eiS9HAzmutCGHwGVCQxPlYJzqxxZVn1u7F2-SSrl1Wko7v2E4dLBc7YuH1TCdM8sPewlobRybImVCdOtoth5AIov5cnANBnr42qciE9Tvf0WJb0F-nuN5R?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
