        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuXZJSXFqfk7aczUas4XRoOi_xleO6kAKokUmayQBxq1JEmgdaLUAo02l61_dS-OZhgo-2ZCfNeUYH2yA-vl37pAIyKqJMKJwRnisc2N1KsF1SHPjUh1B9Dw9ckQaO1HW-yXQWj0ZMXQwObUZjGTLV3GoErxUi_jfl-zSelrag56RVe6MxoNMB7wPFX6oAd217KdDk?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsegdwArm4TxTUZpRBTRyAvCTcL7G5zR7Q5-sEeWq12IS68ie4zb8H1Esb3FktOSbxDSIUU4oL5ydEgagIjzhB9PiB9vQ9e6Sg_i0Ay4U7JvYdqJMXB_LCt2vOEBrGZvk9p6STo9rqYKaYbMUxb9SMcjJl6sMdXjHPShzgwpf2wfJRmvD_xWolnCdsdseEHL6f87tA?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtSUpr7oREnOZUfGzK9MA7eb-KkmB0EnbNd9WUqAPkBzCHw7UI9SkxIcpMSaWfwx_P3zEx4b-2GKmW2El7oGHCCWjnboVyyU4WRFDpS_FFBbi5-EjuggoTYJ9PBRHcrnI7SBWysX3KMdvH5BqRyDjidhV_1mNHvD5O-gesn9KedyxW6Py1VatQjLTyNKE-YiIB7dVM?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKt0br6jMfB4YOz5ETUmPUgx9y9ZsmkbIJO62oE1Zftb5ydD53Qetmj9eXDEvzfcGsr36hqTB_VGLU9Pt_zW0k9aeA_y1B1NGq7IRShX-ji5nvGJIXyNNLYVSE7rP9L9w-DvwlodtDD12b1c1i1a4O62NGOfflSwheMhEbZ_-d09BO4j-BXGSkQ45kN4inY8ossi21w?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsaHPsb386_6OZYFIAEQWTiQ_I5xDyVLr_f_drVFdJKctAezMmsulO834CGIlARvIKVQ5LpII9PTItUl9-7RLbxRGqf1WIkVVPeqJ8LJ-51ULvC4jA2g5E4kSPfqF8ZiJXkV2DXf26qKEawpqeyg8Jzlidh1dCr_6vvoCJC23KVcajAt6eK-1HZLJlotBshgMae4Mw?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtE7OokAQeOc7PjHavZ_SIEREUNluEWk8-0deQIWhJFPaaHbl1mscBpbdq28osmir3itu0A8cF7XStYlnop8ylCqFUen948YgCU6nY9Gz8ZbVi98z-vx2U9esMnHZ0ekGSR4Gjy91sQa9gbyGWscNYwOphQZMv7KaXQLFkDGYKoXpbVpsrDd3vLEtwo6F5-3u9x9us?authuser=0&fife=s16383",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "118",
        "Hobli": "Kengeri Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At Kottanur (same hobli), on a stone near the village entrance",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "118\nAt Kottanur (saine hobli), on a stone near the village entrance.\n\nsubuam astu svasti sri vijayabhyudaya-Salvahana-saka-varshangalu 1627 ne vartamanakke saluva Parthiva-naina-samvatsarada Sravana-ba 1 Angarakavara-subha-muhurtadalu srimad-rajadhiraja raja-paramesvara praudha-pratapan apratima-narapati Atreya-gotrodbhavar ada Mahisuranagarada sri-Deva-Raja-Vaderaiyanavara putrar ada sri-vira-Chikka-Deva-maharaja-Vaderaiyanavara putrar ada sri-Kanthirava-Narasa-Raja-Vaderaiyanavaru S'rirangapattanada simbasana,-rudhar agi prithuvi-samrajyam aluvut iddu tamma alvikege saluva Bengalura kotevalage tamma Appajiyavaru nutanavagi pratishte madisidantha VenkateSvara-svamiyavara paditara-diparadhanege dana-purvakav agi bittu kotta grama Bengalura kotege sauluv Gottegere valitav adantha Kottanuru-grama 1 yiy-ellege saluva vupagrama Kolatapurada-grama 1 Tidadahalli-grama 1 Bilappanahalli-gra[ma] 1 antu grama 4 kke achchukattu saha yiy-ellege saluva chatus-simeyolagana gadde beddalu ……. . tota-yata-kapile-jala-taru-nidhi-nikshepa-akshini-agami-muntada\nsakaladayavanu Venkatesvara-svamiya paditara-diparadhanege a- chandrarka-sthayiy aginadeyaliy endu dana-purvakav agi bittagrama (usual imprecatory phrases) yendu barasikotta dana-sasanakke a-chandrarkam astu {usual final verse)\nsva-datta duhiti bhumih pitri-datta cha sodari i\nanya-datta tu mata[.. ] yo haret tasu sangami ||\nekaiva bhagini loke sarvesham eva bhubhujam I\nna bhojya na kara-grahya, deva-datta, vasundhara ||\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team\n1 śubhamastu | svastiśrī vijayābhyudaya śālivāhana śakavaruṣaṃgal̤u\n2 1627nĕvartamānakkĕ saluva pārthivanāma saṃvatsarada śrāvaṇa śu 1 aṃgāra\n3 kavāra śubhamuhūrtadalū śrīmadrājādhirāja rājaparameśvara prahuḍa pra\n4 tāpanapratima narapati ātreya gotrodbhavarāda mahiśūra nagarada śrīdevarājava\n5 ḍeraiyanavara pātrarāda śrīvīra cikkadevamahārāja vaḍĕraiyanavara putrarāda śrī\n6 kaṃṭhīrava narasarājavaḍeraiyanavaru śrīraṃgapaṭṭaṇada siṃhāsanārūḍharāgi\n7 pṛthuvi sāṃmrājyaṃgaiutiddu naṃmma āl̤vikĕgĕ saluva bĕṃgul̤ūra koṭĕ val̤a\n8 gĕ naṃmma appājiyavaru nūtanavāgi pratiṣṭhĕ māḍisidaṃthā veṃkaṭeśvarasvāmi\n9 yavara paḍitara dīpārādhanĕgĕ dānapūrvakavāgi biṭṭukŏṭṭa grāma bĕṃgul̤ūra\n10 koṭĕgĕ saluva gŏṭṭĕgĕrĕ val̤itavādaṃthā kŏttanūra grāma1 yī yĕllĕgĕ saluva vu\n11 pagrāma kŏṟaṭapurada grāma1 tiḍadahal̤i grāma1 billappanahal̤i grā 1 aṃtu\n12 grāma4kkĕ accukaṭṭusaha yīyĕllĕgĕ saluva cĕtuḥssīmĕyŏl̤agaṇa gaddĕ\n13 bĕddalu kĕrĕ kuṃṭĕ aṇĕ accukaṭṭu toṭa yāta kapilĕ jala taru nidhi nikṣepa a\n14 kṣīṇi āgāmi muṃtāda sakalādāyavaṃnū veṃkaṭeśvarasvāmiya paḍita\n15 ra dīpārādhanĕgĕ ā cĕṃdrārkkasthāyiyāgi naḍĕyali yĕṃdu dānapūrva\n16 kavāgi biṭṭa grāma yidakkĕ yāru apalāpistarū kāsīli gohatya māḍi\n17 da brāmaṇa hatya māḍida pātakakkĕ hogonu mātṛgamana māḍida\n18 pātakakkĕ hŏgutanĕṃdu barasi kŏṭṭa dāna śāsanakkĕ ā cĕṃdrārkamastu\n19 svadattā dviguṇaṃ puṇyaṃ paradattānu pālanaṃ| paradattāpahāreṇa| sva\n20 dattaṃ niṣpalaṃbhavetu|| svadattā duhitābhūmi pitṛdattāca so\n21 darī aṃnyadattātu mātāyo harettā susaṃgamī| yekaivabhagini\n22 loke sarvĕṣāmeva bhūbhujāṃ nabhojyāna karagrāṃhya devadattāvasuṃdhara\n\n\n",
