        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKv8n0Lf_1QjJne0JvLDfdVldLKRRbt-suEucI9Y38DmK9mto8Molq13N6mEUej8uduvvWhawWKva6d0FCKU-KAbmw7g6T-qF-aIPm3fb0N7X6aiqBQ5Gxcn9SjsW5AUNMW7NvH5fI2Do0t1Oswb1xfn9UwVL2z2u3Se7WddZ5HmPvCTmBPTDJiqk2J5R1sv1n5YfRs?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 124<br>Hobli: Yasavantapura Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: To the south of the village entrance<br>Installation Date: Not dated<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 2'3x1'2\"<br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: Not given in the EC.<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 124<br><br>ಯಶವಂತಪುರದ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಯಶವಂತಪುರದ ಊರುಬಾಗಲಿಗೆ ದಕ್ಷಿಣಕ್ಕೆ ನೆಟ್ಟರುವ ಕಲ್ಲಿನಲ್ಲಿ<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 2’3” x 1’ 2”<br><br>ಶ್ರೀ ಸಾಧಾರಣಸಂ<br>ವತ್ಸರದಸ್ರಾವಣಬ<br>ರ್ಬುರೀಮನುವೋತನಬೋ<br>ವನಕಾಲದಲಿಕಣಿಕನೆ <br>ದುನಡುದ್ವನಮೆಚ್ಚಿ<br>ಯೆಲ್ಲೆಯನಡೆದಅರ <br>ವೋತನಬೋವನುಚೊಕ್ಕ<br>ಬೆಯಿರವಿಗೆಕೊಟ್ಟಕೊ<br>ಡಗೆಮಳಹೊಲದಲಿ<br>ಆಕರದಲುಆ__<br>ಕೊಳಗಹೊಲಯದಕೆಆ <br>ವನುಯಕಿಳು <br>ಯತಡಿಯ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 13.023214<br>Longitude: 77.554194<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
