        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 125<br>Hobli: Yasavantapura Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: Cow shed southside<br>Installation Date: Not dated<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 3'X1'6\"<br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: Not given in the EC.<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 125<br>ಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮದಲ್ಲಿ ದನದ ವೋಣಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ದಕ್ಷಿಣಕಡೆ ನೆಟ್ಟಿರುವ ಕಲ್ಲು. <br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 3’ x 1’ 6”<br><br>..................... ಚರ <br>...................... ಶ್ರೀಮತು . ಚ <br>ಮು .......... ಕೆ .. ನೆಯ <br>ಪ್ರ ........... ಲೆಯಕೆ <br>............... ಜಿಲಿಂ <br>.......... ಮಗಮಾ <br>....... ತಂಮನಿಗೆಕೊಟಮಾ<br>ನಿಯದಹೊಲಯಿಂದ <br>ಕೆತಪ್ಪಿದವತಂಮತಂ<br>ದೆತಾಯಿಕೊಂದಪಾಪ <br>ಕೆವ_ಣರಾಸಿಯಲಿ ಕವಿ <br>ಲೆಯಕೊಂದಪಾಪಕೆಹೋ<br>ಹರು <br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 13.022758<br>Longitude: 77.554032<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
