        "Latitude": "13.0631222",
        "Longitude": "77.5744056",
        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsdCfC8FX-ABy19pM6CH8dGxUIf8P-pcubky0bgv7ai481B_7xSq-IxWrDlxzvLzV4dBsKxHmqrkPed1agbZ2iV1uXU-bTUVuBaQwaQue-sy2zScSAPuNopxduQ7oAV_JNUin30u8Zqwe0FYKL5qDFMoUAzdk54ZGcgsEZaxOCRykRfxJqKdbPqC9JZ4vW7tEsyVMFK?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsAF5_q-o6CPxz6K3B9rzWmCjwTCErOpTvuIUreqa-sVPAwumfFrII5shjEsrC7k2BinMfwMB9H5lZlGkg6JBXAH-z0uKAkR4jeq7vW3IpaQ9g4eI93X8eFFF6ca69osOvArDvVfYtnPHCi2tO5ztzw30KW2DmbOlXe3dFgVj-U1G3BkYoe_4ivHWKblIRzm5dZsSUG?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKv6w7s6mJEK0nPeWfoflM_cQPUyF8CQm8ByQS4zQaAj25YuLdXk_KgzSNn1-oKXtF_16KppNDUJLXpG8YWie9dLDcsbUKh2tGI037mn4kSSPSfznjylq7KdMlABcfH3r625hJNhdnETA-Z_WLihUqmBVaVKO6B3rZ0pBwUJHooGKqG3jGpX9UDSIoz5CK5cuiUkdCSA?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtIk4p3X_9kdeMC_S1VdaLqsIHzOPvUnjAt97butIVZbxrpKWHwdFPxrbtglSlq2LDjWlgekzLrY6Oj4_TZu9tTw7vhHmdiQyboxIRt0HZWLKnVyNpJFhtty36JdbrXQoRswDlSlF3XAb2Rnx606YEA-Y_t05ZjDsZJIKVLsa2aQ1eFZjnHFIRZtrw00UsMmJToF4A?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsZslKaTJMiNw5jLLcy1CbzBEKdGG2aKO_s2XPj8BtswF321llYauevdDZoj5eqpmoXK9ppY8ddTYlQFII6rnu-XQjZPYcEUGbJCFx5NLOmEU2HIjC1EskGDPWbBfmYSv-H_5yTumDVr6KfR8E0zzNhF_Ze7maXsM1smzGDWU3Gcwt4eUHGa_Bd2Uzpyc2MTvefXoZT?authuser=0&fife=s16383",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "127",
        "Hobli": "Yasavantapura Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At Kodigehalli (same hobli), on a stone west of the Anjaneya temple. (the stone has now been shifted into the Anjaneya temple)",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "1 śrīgaṇādhipatiye namaḥ namastuṃga siraścuṃbyita caṃdra\n2 cāmara cārave ku trayilokya nagarāraṃba mūla\n3 staṃbā svastiśrī jĕyābudayā śakavaruṣa 1353nĕya\n4 saṃdu varttamāna virodhikrutu saṃvatsarada bādrapada\n5 su 1 gulu śrīmaṃmmahārājādhirāja rājaparamesvara śrīvīra\n6 vijayabhūpatirāya mahārāyara kumāraru devarāya ma\n7 hārāyaru vijĕyanagariya siṃhvāsanadalu sukasaṃkā\n8 ta vinodadiṃda pritivirājyaṃgĕyiuttayihalli a devarāya\n9 mahārāyara saṃmukada nirūpadiṃda sakanasamudra\n10 da vŏl̤agaṇa ūramuṃdaṇa somayadevara nayivedya aṃ\n11 garaṃgabogakkĕ śrīmaṃmahāpradhāna maṃgapadaṃṇāya\n12 kkara makkal̤u prathāparāyaru kŏṭṭa dharmasāsana a somaya\n13 devara nayivedya aṃgaraṃgabogakkĕ māḍida kaṭṭal̤ĕ naṃ\n14 ma nāyakkatanakĕ kŏṭṭiha sivanasamudrada kĕl̤agĕ salu\n15 va yĕlahakkanāḍalli taraṇiyappana bāgiya vŏl̤agaṇa devasa\n16 mudrada grāmada kāluval̤i virupākṣapurada grāmakaṃ\n17 prāku guttigĕya pramāṇa kāṇikĕ sahahuṭṭaval̤i ga16|| .\n18 grāmakkĕ aṃdina adāya apurvva adāyakāgi .\n19 ṭṭakŏṭṭadu ga3|| ubhayaṃ varaha ga20 varaha yippattu\n20 hŏṃnina grāmavāgi yiralāgi a grāmavanu vijĕyade\n21 varāyapuravĕṃba grāmavanu māḍi a devarāyapu\n22 ravĕṃba grāmavanu devasamudrada hiriyakĕṟĕya kĕ\n23 l̤agĕ bījavariya gaddĕ kha5 bījavariya gaddĕ ayi\n24 gaṃḍugavanu srāvaṇa ba30 sūriya parāka puṃṇyakā\n25 ladalu a devarāya mahārāyarigĕ ayirārogya a\n26 yisvariya vriddhi ahaṃtāgi śrīparamesvara prītiyāgi\nhiṃbāga\n27 dhārĕnĕṟadu kŏṭṭĕvāgi a devasamudrada\n28 kāluval̤i virupākṣapuravāda vijĕyadevarā\n29 yapuravĕṃba grāmadarekĕ ga20 varahayippa\n30 ttu hŏṃnina grāmavanu devasamudrada hiriyakĕṟya\n31 yalli gaddĕ ayigaṃḍuga gaddĕyalu māḍikŏṃ\n32 ḍu toṭa tuḍikĕ muṃtāgi agāmiyāgi mā\n33 ḍikŏṃbaṃtāu a grāmakkĕ saluva nidhinikṣepa\n34 jalapāsāṇa akṣīṇi agāmi siddhasādhya aṣṭa\n35 boga tejasvāmya muṃtāgi yenul̤l̤a sarvasvāmyavanu\n36 agumāḍikŏṃḍu asomayidevara nayivedya\n37 aṃgaraṃgabogakkĕ naḍasuva kaṭṭal̤ĕ yĕraḍu hŏ\n38 ttina nayivedya pātrabogakkĕ pātrada jana2 naṭṭa\n39 vana jana1 maddal̤ĕkāṟana jana1 sitārana jana1\n40 upāṃgada jana1 kaṃsāl̤ĕya jana1 aṃttu janael̤u\n41 jana yel̤aṟalu yĕraḍuhŏttu aṃgaraṃgaboga\n42 vanu naḍasi a virupākṣapuravĕṃba devarāyapura\n43 vāda grāma devasamudrada kĕṟĕya kĕl̤agaṇa gaddĕya\n44 agumāḍikŏṃḍu a caṃdrarkkastāyiyāgi su\n45 kadiṃ bogisuvadu|| dānapālanayormmadyadānātre\n46 yonupālanaṃ| dānāsvārgamavāpnopi pālanāda\n47 cuttaṃ padaṃ|| svadattā dviguṇaṃ puṃṇya paradattānu\n48 palānaṃ paradattāpahāreṇa svadattaṃ niśpalaṃbavetu\n49 maṃgal̤a mahaśrī a prathāparāyara baraha.\n",
