        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 128<br>Hobli: Yasavantapura Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: On a stone lying in Talavaras field<br>Installation Date: Not dated<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 2'6\"X1'9\"<br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: Not given in the EC.<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 128<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ನಾಗಶೆಟ್ಟಿಹಳ್ಳಿ ಗ್ರಾಮಕ್ಕೆ ಪಶ್ಚಿಮ ತಳವಾರನ ಹೊಲದ ಬಳಿ ಬಿದ್ದಿರುವ ಕಲ್ಲು<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 2’6” x 1’ 9”<br><br>ಹೇಮಳಂಬಿಸಂವತ್ಸರದಭಾ<br>..................<br>... ಯಿಹೊಲವನು<br>ಯನುಕ ........<br>ಯಿಹೊಲಗದೆಯನುಅವ<br>ನಾನೊಬ್ಬನುಆಳುಪಿದನು<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 13.0415585<br>Longitude: 77.5722354<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
