      "properties": {
        "name": "Nagasettihalli",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 129<br>Hobli: Yasavantapura Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: On a stone lying in Talavaras field<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1342<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 6'X2'<br>Current Status: Not traceable<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 129<br>Date 1342 A.D<br>Be it well. (On the date specified), when the pratapa-chakravartti Hoysala vira-Ballala-Devarasa was in the city of Unnamale, ruling the kingdom in peace and wisdom :- the nobleman (ekkatiga) of  his house, the maha-samantadhipathi, champion over mustaches, Chikka-Bayireya-Nayaka and a number of others (named), with all the farmers, made to Nagavara Maragonda’s Marapa a grant of Nagisettiyahalli with half the lands under the old tank of that village, as a kodage, for as long as the sun and moon endure.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 129<br><br>ಅದೇ ಸ್ಥಳದಲ್ಲಿ<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 6’ x 2’<br><br>ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿ<br>ಶ್ರೀಮತುಸಕವರುಷ 1264<br>ನೆಯವಿಮಸಂವತ್ಸರದ <br>ಬಲ್ಲಾಳದೇವರಸರುಉಣಾ<br>ಮಲೆಯಪಟ್ಟಣದಲಿಸು<br>ಖಸಂಕತಾವಿನೋದದಿಂ<br>ರಾಜ್ಯಂಗೆಯವುತ್ತಿರಲು<br>ಅವರಮನೆಯಯೆಕ್ಕಟಗ<br>ಶ್ರೀಮನುಮಹಾಸಾಮನ್ತಾಧಿ<br>ಪತಿಮಾನೆಯರಗಂಡ<br>ಚಿಕ್ಕಬಯಿರೆಯನಾಯ<br>ಕರೂಅವೆರಮೆಇದುನೆ<br>ತೊಳೆಯನಾಯಕರೂ<br>ಹಿಂಭಾಗ<br>ಶ್ರೀಮನುಮಹಾಮೆ<br>ಲಹಕ್ಕೆ ನಾಡಪ್ರ<br>ಭಾಗಳುಬಇರಿದೇ<br>ವತಾಮಿಯೆಪಮಾ<br>ಚಿದೇವಕಂನಗೋಡೆ<br>ನಾಡಸೇನಬೋವರ <br>ಫಾಲ್ಗುಣಶುಂಗು<br>ಶ್ರೀಮತ್ಸತಾಪಚಕ್ರ<br>ವತ್ರ್ತಿಹೋಸಳಶ್ರೀವೀರ <br>ಲ್ಲಾಳಜೀಯರೊಳಗಾ<br>ದನಮಸ್ತಗವುಡು<br>ಗಳೂಗೂಡಿನಾಗನಾರ<br>ದಮಾರಗೊಂಡನವರಮೆ<br>ಕಳೂಮರವನವರಿಗೆನಾಗಿ<br>ಸೆಟ ಯನೂಅದಕೆಸಲುವ<br>ನಾಗಿನೆಟಯಹಳಿಯನೂ<br>ಅದಕೆಸಲುವುದುಹಿರಿ<br>ಯಕೆ__ ಯಲರ್ದಬಾಗಿಯೂಜಾ<br>ಲಮಾಚಿಹಳಿಯೊಳಗಾದ<br>ಚತುಸೀಮೆಯೊಳಗುಳಗ<br>ದ್ವೆಬೆದ್ದಲನೂಚಂದ್ರ<br>ಸೂರಿಯರುಳಬ<br>ರಸ್ತಿರವಾಗಿನಡ್ಸೆಕೊಟ್ಟ<br>ಕೊಡಗೆಮಂಗಳಮ<br>ಹಾಶ್ರೀಶ್ರೀಶ್ರೀ<br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 13.0415585<br>Longitude: 77.5722354<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
        "tessellate": "-1",
        "extrude": "0",
        "visibility": "-1",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Records": "",
        "Installation_Date": "01/01/1342",
        "Hobli__as_recorded_in_EC_": "",
        "Inscription_language": "Kannada",
        "Size": "6'X2'",
        "Current_Status": "Not traceable",
        "English_translation_of_the_Inscription": "129\nDate 1342 A.D\nBe it well. (On the date specified), when the pratapa-chakravartti Hoysala vira-Ballala-Devarasa was in the city of Unnamale, ruling the kingdom in peace and wisdom :- the nobleman (ekkatiga) of  his house, the maha-samantadhipathi, champion over mustaches, Chikka-Bayireya-Nayaka and a number of others (named), with all the farmers, made to Nagavara Maragonda’s Marapa a grant of Nagisettiyahalli with half the lands under the old tank of that village, as a kodage, for as long as the sun and moon endure.\n",
        "Kannada_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "129\n\nಅದೇ ಸ್ಥಳದಲ್ಲಿ\n\nಪ್ರಮಾಣ 6’ x 2’\n\nಸ್ವಸ್ತಿ\nಶ್ರೀಮತುಸಕವರುಷ 1264\nನೆಯವಿಮಸಂವತ್ಸರದ \nಬಲ್ಲಾಳದೇವರಸರುಉಣಾ\nಮಲೆಯಪಟ್ಟಣದಲಿಸು\nಖಸಂಕತಾವಿನೋದದಿಂ\nರಾಜ್ಯಂಗೆಯವುತ್ತಿರಲು\nಅವರಮನೆಯಯೆಕ್ಕಟಗ\nಶ್ರೀಮನುಮಹಾಸಾಮನ್ತಾಧಿ\nಪತಿಮಾನೆಯರಗಂಡ\nಚಿಕ್ಕಬಯಿರೆಯನಾಯ\nಕರೂಅವೆರಮೆಇದುನೆ\nತೊಳೆಯನಾಯಕರೂ\nಹಿಂಭಾಗ\nಶ್ರೀಮನುಮಹಾಮೆ\nಲಹಕ್ಕೆ ನಾಡಪ್ರ\nಭಾಗಳುಬಇರಿದೇ\nವತಾಮಿಯೆಪಮಾ\nಚಿದೇವಕಂನಗೋಡೆ\nನಾಡಸೇನಬೋವರ \nಫಾಲ್ಗುಣಶುಂಗು\nಶ್ರೀಮತ್ಸತಾಪಚಕ್ರ\nವತ್ರ್ತಿಹೋಸಳಶ್ರೀವೀರ \nಲ್ಲಾಳಜೀಯರೊಳಗಾ\nದನಮಸ್ತಗವುಡು\nಗಳೂಗೂಡಿನಾಗನಾರ\nದಮಾರಗೊಂಡನವರಮೆ\nಕಳೂಮರವನವರಿಗೆನಾಗಿ\nಸೆಟ ಯನೂಅದಕೆಸಲುವ\nನಾಗಿನೆಟಯಹಳಿಯನೂ\nಅದಕೆಸಲುವುದುಹಿರಿ\nಯಕೆ__ ಯಲರ್ದಬಾಗಿಯೂಜಾ\nಲಮಾಚಿಹಳಿಯೊಳಗಾದ\nಚತುಸೀಮೆಯೊಳಗುಳಗ\nದ್ವೆಬೆದ್ದಲನೂಚಂದ್ರ\nಸೂರಿಯರುಳಬ\nರಸ್ತಿರವಾಗಿನಡ್ಸೆಕೊಟ್ಟ\nಕೊಡಗೆಮಂಗಳಮ\nಹಾಶ್ರೀಶ್ರೀಶ್ರೀ\n",
        "Tamil_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "NA",
