        "name": "Nagasettihalli",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsV508x8BPoJZdrly3KRmXJDBT001vrV474Clk9v85haF10prKpIGHZSjN60dTTpvXNGlmN238qsB69prtiexzvYjKhI_MmvcI_ZnqiNNtzFSHlUIiD_Rzu2kybwJy0Ps380R00bFwY4KNSFFCUXw9eO7Utx6c8dboyjjvG8cvT1A4QqBhh-YLmAH87dbAecacytq4u?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 131<br>Hobli: Yasavantapura Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Nagasettihalli (same hobli), on a stone in ihe talavara's field.<br>Installation Date: Not dated<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 2'6\"X2'<br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: Not given in the EC.<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 131<br><br>ಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮದ ಊರುಬಾಗಿಲ ಬಳಿ ನೆಟ್ಟಿರುವ ಕಲ್ಲು<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 2”6” x 2”<br><br>ಶ್ರೀಮತು<br>ರಪುರದವೆಮೇರೆಯಾರೊಬ್ಬರು<br>ಹೆಬ್ಬೂರಿಯವೀರಯ್ಯೊಡೆಯ<br>ತಪ್ಪಿದೋರುತಮ್ಮಗುರುವಿಗೆತಪ್ಪಿದೋರು<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 13.0418<br>Longitude: 77.57302<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
