      "properties": {
        "name": "Vibhutipura",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKu97EQB1iGf0VoP7ljuVbWFnZENz0Qm_aL8ZI5weiIgapmhX7J2rJ0-Ttxvq1Bp37kgtOZo5PCQB5m_0D1-LjgYgEUDI0BJqIrFpW09AUpYDNZ5R0iOYG5KmQOk6begWRW0kXza_pyq3ivRWQE_7I01uInMcyFVUf8NZxm0yzIw5MwiZI9xYjO_CwdDWATnxRctGNQ9?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 133<br>Hobli: Yasavantapura Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Vibhutipura (same hobli), on a stone set up in the land belonging to the matha.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1307<br>Inscription Language: Grantha & Tamil<br>Size: 3'x4'<br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 133<br>Date 1307 A.D.<br>(Tamil)- (From the year specified), for victory to the sword and arm of the pratapa-chakravattisri-Posala-vira-Vallala-Devar, and for the benefit of Vallapa-dennakkar, we the maha-prasayitta Ninran, the superintendent of the ? western portion of Masundi-nadu, Sembi-devar, Villa-gamundar and other (three named) inhabitants of the nadu, and Kovandai- Having cleared the jungle in the tract of land adjoining Peru-Erumur, ? leveled the ground, built a village, constructed a tank by removing the sand, and named the village Vachchidevarpuram, granted to Vacchi-devar the village and the wet and dry lands adjoining it, with their four boundaries, as a madappuram, exempt from taxes, for as long as the moon and the sun exist. (usual final imprecatory sentence).<br>The signature of Ninran. The Signature of the accountant of the nadu, Periyapillai.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 133<br>At Vibhutipura (same hobli), on a stone set up in the land belonging to the matha. (Grantha & Tamil characters)<br>Svasti srima-pratapa-chakravatti sri-Posala-vira-Villala-Devar valukun-dolukku nanraga .. Vallappa-dennakkarku nanrgavum manu-mahaprasayitta Ninran Masandi-nattu Menmugattu nattu-nayagan-jeyar S’embi-devarum Villa-gamundar S’anda-gamunda Veppuran Tanma. Siyar ullitta nattavarun-Govandiyum Vachchi-devarku-ttana-pramanam-panni-kkudutta parisavadu Plavanga-varusha-mudal Peru-Erumukk-adai… ppulattu-kkadu…. Tti-kkaruvittu ur-katti eriyu manal-olukki-kkatti Vachchidevarpuram enra per-akku.. .. .. ivv-urka adetta nanjai punjai narpal ellaryu mada-ppuram aga ivarku-chchantraditta-varai sarva-maniyam-aga-chchellakkadavad-aga vittom ivv-anaiverum inda-ttanmattukku ilanganam-panuinar udagil Gengai-kkaraiyil kurar-pasuvai-kkonra pavan golvar ivai ninrar eluttu nattu-kkanakkan Periyapillai eluttu.<br><br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 133<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ವಿಭೂತಿಪುರ ಗ್ರಾಮದ ಮಠದ ಜಮೀನಿನಲ್ಲಿ ನೆಟ್ಟ ಕಲ್ಲು<br><br>ಗ್ರಂಥ ಮತ್ತು ಅರವಕ್ಷರ - ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 3’ x 4’<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: Please help improve this map by providing us this. Please retype in Tamil the text of the inscription shown in the accompanying photos and email it to InscriptionStonesofBangalore@gmail.com. Thanks !<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.96515<br>Longitude: 77.68087<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKs7QDM4KoUGrJJIW34uvte5KOtmA1rSXZcb-dyL8UctLJRVY2XFdODdkW-ZjEO63jJlXmXnp2hqXhEy4RQjasMtl3-jy05DQFdMZ6a0SP-aCQo53ukSvz2ItHGwpIwian-lnzOWeGHzhzZVIxOTDjae5KSRo_TKVMAF2jtjWynX188Go35XWyJTQI5-OU9xFt5VyrOo?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvkMc7ASjPohVkHsR8rJVYc2e2C4WslM-LRjv2Z_yRNOxg-ZSh2905bcetKzS6TlfRjhZUqlt5og1rJvU_4TVaGTmPcJhZu6LFd4TuuLgvzGgHXiP5WL8hJGCo5UfylY4QjEYCVMbo2k4My1oZcBPNXd7y76I6dfwJxETWMgHPqN9LQTax-Nmj5Cy9ZB1QEkZmFwh8?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtzia7rEpPUaxdHcmXe1JG7gzC9aBfJ7NgfRhCdbqeWLiv8sq55w2GDxVC-H5V0kFU3rH5tPQjw6E2FctFQuKq8y4NGLt7gWqeHqnkzzJ6BtnGORhmuEKa3Qzq7YMyOod6BzSjZL4DA-meVnslHiv2mr7dR2VDnZBU8RZliKWIZaTtwdkqY8yTh7_qcBjJKZCUgHWg?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
