        "name": "Hebbala",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsOSlhKhFTf-JQ9-j8Mw7AExXRhba2I9LYNE0bnYO3O_fdjXnpg9Ax613m891M81HCPq8i0EroP-8DDRCLKCMN_OmnocruSdOO_Ysta-eEAzDgAf_Zfn7cLxIjKyVEg6ImI_sUhfWx4bW9Hti-iGqOPzCaRHuYyNxpteWQN7XCYelS62Oz6ONTfwAzqmOLl9pQZ9W8?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 136<br>Hobli: Yasavantapura Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the same village on a stone at the Village Gate<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1689<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: 2'X1'6'<br>Current Status: Intact, flaked<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: 136<br><br>Date 1689 A.D<br><br>(In the year specified), we, Marige-Gauda, will give to any one for this (iddake) 10 hana, 5 hana, 6 hana. At this rate the nad-sanubova………kola Nachap pa will……..the Gauda’s paddana Imprecation.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: Ec-09 bn-136<br>1. śukra saṃvatsarada cayitra<br>2. śu1llu śrīmatu marigĕ gaüḍa<br>3. nu yidakkĕ āvanŏbbanigĕ nāu<br>4. hattaṇa ayidaṇa āraṇa<br>5. yimĕriyalu nāḍa sānubo<br>6. va . kŏl̤anācappa gaüḍara<br>7. paddāṇayidakhu . . . .<br>8. ḍarĕ taṃna hĕṃḍiribbaranu<br>9. yivura tŏṭṭi kŏṭṭanu<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team<br>0 . śukra saṃvatsarada cayitra<br>0 śu1llu śrīmatu mariga gaüḍa<br>0 nu . . . . . vanŏbbanigĕ nāu<br>0 ha . . ayidaṇa āraṇa<br>0 yi . . . . . . sānubo<br>0 va . . . . . . uḍara<br>0 pa . . . . . . . . bbakŏṃ<br>0 ḍarĕ taṃna . . . ribbaranu<br>0 yivura tŏṭṭi kŏṭṭanu<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: Ec-09 bn-136<br>1. ಶುಕ್ರ ಸಂವತ್ಸರದ ಚಯಿತ್ರ<br>2. ಶು೧ಲ್ಲು ಶ್ರೀಮತು ಮರಿಗೆ ಗಉಡ<br>3. ನು ಯಿದಕ್ಕೆ ಆವನೊಬ್ಬನಿಗೆ ನಾಉ<br>4. ಹತ್ತಣ ಅಯಿದಣ ಆರಣ<br>5. ಯಿಮೆರಿಯಲು ನಾಡ ಸಾನುಬೋ<br>6. ವ . ಕೊಳನಾಚಪ್ಪ ಗಉಡರ<br>7. ಪದ್ದಾಣಯಿದಖು . . . .<br>8. ಡರೆ ತಂನ ಹೆಂಡಿರಿಬ್ಬರನು<br>9. ಯಿವುರ ತೊಟ್ಟಿ ಕೊಟ್ಟನು<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team<br>0 . ಶುಕ್ರ ಸಂವತ್ಸರದ ಚಯಿತ್ರ<br>0 ಶು೧ಲ್ಲು ಶ್ರೀಮತು ಮರಿಗ ಗಉಡ<br>0 ನು . . . . . ವನೊಬ್ಬನಿಗೆ ನಾಉ<br>0 ಹ . . ಅಯಿದಣ ಆರಣ<br>0 ಯಿ . . . . . . ಸಾನುಬೋ<br>0 ವ . . . . . . ಉಡರ<br>0 ಪ . . . . . . . . ಬ್ಬಕೊಂ<br>0 ಡರೆ ತಂನ . . . ರಿಬ್ಬರನು<br>0 ಯಿವುರ ತೊಟ್ಟಿ ಕೊಟ್ಟನು<br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 13.0404355<br>Longitude: 77.5911972<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsVe-7E5nXFpM6RZsQPBbzi171oa6M_vd9L-HzLJlPwAl4ifdS8I5sojRRj-tcgUItRM11UemG7WawtOU4Tq_U0TdmpuwFoBOgDqyi6j6oFGySp2-KgqAns1WLQiqYjhAZ3WglZEVCEOwdxwmAoGxNm5lepAgh_sU1jER3ozrxRcdLHJS9oVv_FSpnpt_WJdVUZK78?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvtdjcipMHSk95ldMGptsRT1Klc1D9k7RepME2hfe9gfO44pcQ-eC7TG0TjIlDcKRBG7yRk8np9Nw349Fe6klSDbl8tdwOyvALcLEGVRVcitPPNSfIdlWB_5NDbnPb2Fg9p_9w9B5WsyyDZC0wJibgpngU4TlDTrG_AAVQks6g1oXsWZqj3Sqin0Fzd5C2HGTdMuyY?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtJqUyS6pk7aaoDqjjAdaahBhD8Hx_zhNR6wU4iaYnTrkFfyjHyDZmuUtMhl5-lX3XrjPfwKqWrmMhoOAiUvpFQdAg-CfZqGXuZhdECXXKHTJcZwWYCXtVHICwJTDM5CSC0LEcHHZQODCupyYbm9ivxxkLYQPOiw3JF_xqZUp9msFqCCitzOjm3ddBB_9mFl88vJa00?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvYvjio0JxJZioLqvo2dKJjYEXTNonVt9rG78Qg1cAL3s2y9x4DE0V48O1c8FSYAH_grp1xiSrsJPVoDOf_LBaSANd4pVWZajBCmjXUiecE2lW5LLKf3Lf1