        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "136",
        "Hobli": "Yasavantapura Hobli",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At the same village on a stone at the Village Gate",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "Ec-09 bn-136\n1. śukra saṃvatsarada cayitra\n2. śu1llu śrīmatu marigĕ gaüḍa\n3. nu yidakkĕ āvanŏbbanigĕ nāu\n4. hattaṇa ayidaṇa āraṇa\n5. yimĕriyalu nāḍa sānubo\n6. va . kŏl̤anācappa gaüḍara\n7. paddāṇayidakhu . . . .\n8. ḍarĕ taṃna hĕṃḍiribbaranu\n9. yivura tŏṭṭi kŏṭṭanu\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team\n0 . śukra saṃvatsarada cayitra\n0 śu1llu śrīmatu mariga gaüḍa\n0 nu . . . . . vanŏbbanigĕ nāu\n0 ha . . ayidaṇa āraṇa\n0 yi . . . . . . sānubo\n0 va . . . . . . uḍara\n0 pa . . . . . . . . bbakŏṃ\n0 ḍarĕ taṃna . . . ribbaranu\n0 yivura tŏṭṭi kŏṭṭanu",
        "Name_": "",
        "EC_9_Ht_": "",
