      "properties": {
        "name": "Jibanahalli",
        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: 138<br>Hobli: Yasavantapura Hobli<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: On a rock at boundary of Kaval Bairasandra & Jibanahalli<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1538<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: Boulder<br>Current Status: Yet to verify<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: Date 1538 A.D<br>(On the date specified), when Achyuta-Raya-maharaya was on a secure throne:- Mecharasaya made a grant in Anupe…………in the Sivanasamudra-sime. Imprection.<br><br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 138<br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಕಾವಲ್‍ಬೈರಸಂದ್ರ ಮತ್ತು ಜೀಬನಹಳ್ಳಿ ಸರಹದ್ದಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಹುಟ್ಟು ಬಂಡೆ ಮೇಲೆ<br>1ಶಾಲಿವಾಹನಶಕವರುಕಂಗಳು1490ನೆಯವಿಳಂಬಿ<br>2ಸಂವಚರದಭಾದ್ರಪದಬ7ಲುಅಚುತರಾಯಮಹಾ<br>3ರಾಯರುಸ್ತಿರಸಿಂಹಾಸನದಲುಮೆಚರಸಯನವರು<br>4ಸಿವನಸಮುದ್ರದಸೀಮೆಯನುಪೆ.. ಗಳನುಬಿಟ್ಟಧರ್ಮಶಾಸನ<br>5ಯಿದಕೆಮುಂದೆಅರುತಪ್ಪಲಾಗದುಶ್ರೀ . . . ಅ4<br>6ಪಿದರು<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 13.0295734<br>Longitude: 77.6070933<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
