        "Hobli": "Bangalore City",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "On a rock to the south of the Malleshwara temple in Malleswaram",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "1. saumya saṃvatsarada mārgaśira śuddha (1/2 ?) lū\n2. śrīmatu mallapurada mallikārjuna devara deva mānyakkĕ yakoji rāyana bĕṃgul̤ura\n3. mahanāḍu kel̤alikāgi medaraniṃgahal̤iya dharmakkĕ kŏṭṭanu koṭi caṃdra sūryaru\n4. ul̤a kālaü dharmakkĕ kŏṭanu yi dharmakkĕ vakra māḍidavaru kattiya kāgiya caṃḍālara jalma\n5. dali huṭuvaru\n6. musālamānarādavaru makĕyali haṃditiṃda brāhmaṇa cĕtri vaiśya sūdra kāsiyali gova\n7. kŏṃda papakĕ hoguva\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team\n1 saumya saṃvatsarada mārgaśira śuda 2 lū\n2 śrīmatu mallapurada mallikārjuna devara devamanyakkĕ yĕkojirāyana bĕṃgul̤ura\n3 mahanāḍu kel̤ālikāgi medaraniṃganahal̤iya dharmakkĕ kŏṭṭanu koṭi caṃdrasūryaru\n4 ul̤akālaü dharmakkĕ kŏṭanu yī dharmakkĕ vakravādavaru kattĕya kākiya caṃḍālara jalma\n5 dali huṭuvanu\n6 musālamanāradavaru makĕyali haṃditiṃda brāhmaṇa cĕtri vaiśya sūdra kāsiyaligo\n7 kŏṃda papakĕ hoguva[ru]",
