        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuCUty2tNTNMiOzL7-qHvbJ7w-789FkoQOcd8CXMcxXf3nuaIX1uvcPK1CyZVo5faXuHYUE2Dq-12WrDiysYqEj_0Rs-cNfLR1S1UUlgZr12hjzEvBK5PtAz3JHQkLGuXLPrd484sqggC02DDkLKXW7zpmuOsVcpvLW72ywC6Mvt4acy3Ne526QJjaSYdua6E0QPUA?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtCymeP2SEG7Om2XGJB_B7bbtRRTod5143G7z0MgMFZnLuxp1brgiaX-gb3kjTEMrXngkXFJW0Ud5eKwp9288QGKZpQJBiBWP1H0pzmfoyyymKb7KwCUiEsRcdXeyw85kW0GjfmWb6oDNQpU5_p75RZ5GObsUObRw9kCxw3GGNbUXmoqDng4_KakYgeXHanVUIkTuI?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsT0Coibts63bgMZrEELul__ggDhFOOJeU_SrXHFjnKs4lSwtIOIttTbFSBYQrRnsZG_7qcOkmzjhXPYsVwk4ElJlnKed_O-7dGwHNTiDXLyHQAzg9UkUqWoiTX4owhEzpCV0hzeiLMkJekoze-6Msg0tlt4CpltbCyTEi-9JVhztgYQYOUaz53eI8H6Tq-FRNBPXo?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://www.youtube.com/embed/SVyOJhTf7_0",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "Not in EC, inscription was discovered in July-2018",
        "Hobli": "Bangalore",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "Yellama temple, Kumaraswamy Layout",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "1 svasti Sri Saka va-\n2 rusha 1324 sandu ci-\n3 trabhaanu samvatsarada jE-\n4 shTa ba 10 Su Sriman mahaa\n5 manDaLEsvaram Sri\n6 viira harihara raayanu\n7 prithvi raajyam geyivu-\n8 ttiralu Sri manu\n9 mahaa muuvaru raa-\n10 yara ganDa suuriya naa\n11 gapa naayakara maneya\n12 gavuDam maarappanu nagara\n13 ttara tirumale seTTi\n14 ya maga naaca seTTi na\n15 TTa SaaSana eLajiiyanaha-\n16 haLLiya siimelu keReya\n17 kaTTi tuubnu yikkisi\n18 dhararmmakke koTTa ko-\n\nleft side\n19 Duge khanDu-\n20 ga yeraDu\n21 kolaga ha-\n22 ttanuu salisu \n23 krama ma-\n24 ngaLa ma-\n25 haa Sri\n26 idakke ta-\n27 ppidava ga\n28 ngeya ta-\n29 Diyali \n30 . . . . \n31 . . . .\n32 . . . .\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team\n಄ svastiśrī śakava\nruṣa 1324 saṃdu ci\ntrabhānu saṃvatsarada je\nṣṭa ba10 śu śrī manmahā\nmaṃḍal̤esvaraṃ śrī .\nvīra harihararāyanu\nprithvi rājyaṃgĕyivu\nttiralu śrī manu\nmahā ma mūvaru rā\nyara gaṃḍa hiriya nā\ngĕyanāyakara manĕya\ngavuḍu mārappanu nagara\nttara tirumalĕsĕṭṭi\nya maga nācasĕṭṭigĕ kŏ\nṭṭa śāśana ĕl̤acīyanaha\nl̤l̤iya sīmĕlu kĕṟĕya\nkaṭṭi tūbanu yikkisida\ndhaṃrmmakkĕ kŏṭṭa kŏ\nide kallina ĕḍabhāgadalli\nḍagĕ khaṃḍu\nga yĕraḍu\nkŏl̤aga ha\nttanū salisi\nkrama ma\nṃgal̤a ma\nhāśrī\nidakkĕ ta\nppidaḍĕ ga\nṃgĕya ta\nḍiya kapi\nlĕya kŏ\nṃda pāpa ?\nlu hŏha[ru]\n",
