        "name": "Srinivagilu",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKs82A_7B1cR7uKx-81xbZxJ-AtVua5G5Ch0ucOiFTHuKodi8x8EN5o1PgV4X6w5H1_vXu9Dgbj8Q3ypKx6RroSEcSZVFWdKJouDPALcFDFw94uuIPUPCwfSsRa3-RYClyvn4Z3np1lwkYOG00zAP1ec3Qhgu4cp-p9r0OqL1zOYhLRrBF62gRGfx6VxEJycUNkut1jD?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: Documented in Shaasana Manthana by Dr. P V Krishnamurthy published by Tumkur UNiversity<br>Hobli: Bangalore<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At the Shiva temple<br>Installation Date: 01/01/800<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: Palchtereyemma of Siyyanelvagil beating away cattle thieves died.<br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1 svasti śrī pal̤catĕṟĕ<br>2 yamma siyyanĕlvā<br>3 gila tuṟuva nikisi<br>4 sattu saggiyādaṃ<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team<br>svastiśrī pal̤catĕṟĕ<br>yamma siyyanĕlvā<br>gila tuṟuvanikisi<br>sattu saggiyādaṃ<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1 ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿ ಶ್ರೀ ಪಳ್ಚತೆಱೆ<br>2 ಯಮ್ಮ ಸಿಯ್ಯನೆಲ್ವಾ<br>3 ಗಿಲ ತುಱುವ ನಿಕಿಸಿ<br>4 ಸತ್ತು ಸಗ್ಗಿಯಾದಂ<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team<br>ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀ ಪಳ್ಚತೆಱೆ<br>ಯಮ್ಮ ಸಿಯ್ಯನೆಲ್ವಾ<br>ಗಿಲ ತುಱುವನಿಕಿಸಿ<br>ಸತ್ತು ಸಗ್ಗಿಯಾದಂ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: NA<br>English Translation  Retyped By: Udaya Kumar P L<br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: NA<br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: NA<br>Photographs Provided By: Udaya Kumar P L, Dr Byrappa MG <udayakumar.pl@gmail.com><br>Latitude: 12.932406<br>Longitude: 77.640507<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuYYOvf5XdCr