        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvgQTcCLP1IPDxNFqzNJKaJrcvuJw23RbG4hOMAQH9k9G7QRMqbanGxVu_Ld9kY0OroWOiNo_OVdNXRMoGX0LvLZe1rTP7GSttrPL-i3Z2xrP-1XGmBweL9IE6oz0xv43kZUmCjnyrdj40GtOJheghfVMddaVnJ3H6ZZnB5RAiIlE2NLBAGPb-YDKhgmPF5sZxj5oU?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: K. Dhanpal in Shasana Adhyayana, Issue 11, Vol2<br>Hobli: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: <br>Installation Date: 1729<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: <br>English Translation Of The Inscription: <br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1 virodikṛta<br>2 saṃvatsarada ca<br>3 yitra ba(bu)10 diva<br>4 sa bĕṃgal̤ūru kŏ<br>5 ṭĕ val̤agĕ kaṃḍada<br>6 ḍidakĕ bahadara khā<br>7 na(ha)varigĕ kal̤atama<br>8 nahal̤i rattakŏḍagĕ<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team<br>1 virodi vikṛtu<br>2 saṃvatsarada cai<br>3 yita ba10 diva<br>4 sa bĕṃgal̤ūru kŏ<br>5 ṭĕ val̤agĕ kaṃḍada<br>6 ḍidakkĕ bāhadara khā<br>7 nahavarigĕ kal̤atama<br>8 nahal̤i rattakŏḍagĕ<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1 ವಿರೋದಿಕೃತ<br>2 ಸಂವತ್ಸರದ ಚ<br>3 ಯಿತ್ರ ಬ(ಬು)೧೦ ದಿವ<br>4 ಸ ಬೆಂಗಳೂರು ಕೊ<br>5 ಟೆ ವಳಗೆ ಕಂಡದ<br>6 ಡಿದಕೆ ಬಹದರ ಖಾ<br>7 ನ(ಹ)ವರಿಗೆ ಕಳತಮ<br>8 ನಹಳಿ ರತ್ತಕೊಡಗೆ<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team<br>1 ವಿರೋದಿ ವಿಕೃತು<br>2 ಸಂವತ್ಸರದ ಚೈ<br>3 ಯಿತ ಬ೧೦ ದಿವ<br>4 ಸ ಬೆಂಗಳೂರು ಕೊ<br>5 ಟೆ ವಳಗೆ ಕಂಡದ<br>6 ಡಿದಕ್ಕೆ ಬಾಹದರ ಖಾ<br>7 ನಹವರಿಗೆ ಕಳತಮ<br>8 ನಹಳಿ ರತ್ತಕೊಡಗೆ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: <br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: <br>Photographs Provided By: Dr Yuraju R<br>Latitude: 13.103468<br>Longitude: 77.516453<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img