        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuz97XovGjnHjQ-OmZRuj1HWKsO-sFuW-tpUVHQScEOK1zqNQ16qorEqqnYtHwP5gcGrbv4DAwXD9kUYtYIv-bgnCJeJAkc9aEIgsHyWO10sWgfcrpwNZf1CjjlBEuyFS860um40vIYWzCP4YRrl2_24CKC6Xu41xlNisJD26Hfmeinr_Pjgo0PRMWkkbB7fH5IE5YQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: Bn167 (Supplyment)<br>Hobli: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: At Kalkere village Annayyappa's Tota Muneshvara temple<br>Installation Date: 1318<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: <br>English Translation Of The Inscription: <br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1 kīlaka saṃvatsarada cayitra<br>2 su 1lu dal̤avāyi ĕlĕyanā<br>3 yakaru kalukĕṟĕya sīmĕ ŏl̤agĕ<br>4 kkisĕṭṭiya kĕṟĕya megaṇa sīmĕ<br>5 yanu nāu kaṭṭisida kĕṟĕyanu hi<br>6 riya ŏḍĕyaru cikkavŏḍĕyaru ma<br>7 llaya ŏḍĕyaru yī mūvaru<br>8 vŏḍĕyaravarigĕ tiṃmarasa<br>9 ŏḍĕyarigĕ dharmavāgabekĕṃdu<br>10 nāvu biṭṭa pura yidakĕ āvanānŏbanu<br>11 alipidavaru gaṃgĕya taḍiya taṃgĕl̤u<br>12 kapilĕya kŏṃda pāpadali hoharu<br>13 yĕṃdu kŏṭṭa śāsana<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team<br>1 kīlaka saṃvatsarada cayitra<br>2 su 1lu dal̤avāyi ĕlĕyanā<br>3 yakaru kalukĕṟĕya sīmĕ ŏl̤agĕ<br>4 cŏkkisĕṭṭiya kĕṟĕya megaṇa sīmĕ<br>5 yanu nāu kaṭṭisida kĕṟĕyanu hi<br>6 riya ŏḍĕyaru cikkavŏḍĕyaru ma<br>7 llaya ŏḍĕyaru yī mūvaru<br>8 vŏḍĕyaravarigĕ tiṃmarasa<br>9 ŏḍĕyarigĕ dharmavāgabekĕṃdu<br>10 nāu biṭṭa pura yidakĕ āvanānŏbanu<br>11 . . . . .ru gaṃgĕya taḍiya taṃgĕl̤u<br>12 . . . . . . . . . . . li hoharu<br>13 . . . . . . . . .<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1 kīlaka saṃvatsarada cayitra<br>2 su 1lu dal̤avāyi ĕlĕyanā<br>3 yakaru kalukĕṟĕya sīmĕ ŏl̤agĕ<br>4 kkisĕṭṭiya kĕṟĕya megaṇa sīmĕ<br>5 yanu nāu kaṭṭisida kĕṟĕyanu hi<br>6 riya ŏḍĕyaru cikkavŏḍĕyaru ma<br>7 llaya ŏḍĕyaru yī mūvaru<br>8 vŏḍĕyaravarigĕ tiṃm