        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "1 kīlaka saṃvatsarada cayitra\n2 su 1lu dal̤avāyi ĕlĕyanā\n3 yakaru kalukĕṟĕya sīmĕ ŏl̤agĕ\n4 kkisĕṭṭiya kĕṟĕya megaṇa sīmĕ\n5 yanu nāu kaṭṭisida kĕṟĕyanu hi\n6 riya ŏḍĕyaru cikkavŏḍĕyaru ma\n7 llaya ŏḍĕyaru yī mūvaru\n8 vŏḍĕyaravarigĕ tiṃmarasa\n9 ŏḍĕyarigĕ dharmavāgabekĕṃdu\n10 nāvu biṭṭa pura yidakĕ āvanānŏbanu\n11 alipidavaru gaṃgĕya taḍiya taṃgĕl̤u\n12 kapilĕya kŏṃda pāpadali hoharu\n13 yĕṃdu kŏṭṭa śāsana\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team\n1 kīlaka saṃvatsarada cayitra\n2 su 1lu dal̤avāyi ĕlĕyanā\n3 yakaru kalukĕṟĕya sīmĕ ŏl̤agĕ\n4 cŏkkisĕṭṭiya kĕṟĕya megaṇa sīmĕ\n5 yanu nāu kaṭṭisida kĕṟĕyanu hi\n6 riya ŏḍĕyaru cikkavŏḍĕyaru ma\n7 llaya ŏḍĕyaru yī mūvaru\n8 vŏḍĕyaravarigĕ tiṃmarasa\n9 ŏḍĕyarigĕ dharmavāgabekĕṃdu\n10 nāu biṭṭa pura yidakĕ āvanānŏbanu\n11 . . . . .ru gaṃgĕya taḍiya taṃgĕl̤u\n12 . . . . . . . . . . . li hoharu\n13 . . . . . . . . .",
