        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "1 svastimadakaṃkuṃbhakucasthal̤a pu\n2 pana karal̤aṭil̤a bhujavijaya\n3 lakṣmivallabha māhabali kulā\n4 . raṇa . ṇabhūvikramadṭhāra\n5 da . kaciyakaliyugadaṇuva\n6 ubhayallogaṇda\n7 (na)gattara rājyaṃgĕyyĕ(saka)vari\n8 ṣa (8)93 prajapati saṃvatsara\n9 dŏl̤amā . . . .\n10 ma gāmuṇḍa . . . . ci\n11 pagŏṇaṃka . yya\n12 naya maga\n13 i . . rada nāḍa\n14 l̤ŏga . . rada nāḍa\n15 prabhugal̤vi . . ma\n16 ga . . . . sattu\n17 saggiyāda\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team\nsvasti madakarikuṃbhikucastal̤a pra\ndana karāl̤anil̤a bhujavijaya\nlakṣmivallabha māhabali kulā\n. . raṇa baṇabhurikrama . ra\ndaṃ kacĕyaṃ kaliyugadaṇuva\nubhamŏgĕgaṇḍa . . .\ngatara rājyaṃgĕ . . . ri\nṣa (8)93 prajapati . . vatsa\nradŏl̤ mā . . pa . .\nva gāvuṇḍaṃ . . . . . .\nyaṃ gŏṇada . . . lĕ\n. ya maga . . . yya\ni . rayyana . .\n. l̤ŏgadŏ ĕraḍunāḍa\nprabhugal̤u ma\n. guḻĕ kādi sattu\nsaggiyāda .",
