        "name": "Singapura Inscription",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsJ6AX_h7SMe_0rvldVdnqIZD4OBQU8AmyfzjOb8NEjqW546_kN8NnFv_B3LE_uyRkeHRR_zqz3wEn43ubYV-dvOHVBQtdn34gVkpq2fiFXOLAfThMK-7F_mozimIN5tD3UG0yM7sPrZ_ogLA1cjUkWcadksDH8SJHq3mNEO1-bozzXt2GRAk2eRLNv_P6OKv_I6IQ3?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: Bengaluru Itihaasa Vaibhava Issue 1 (https://archive.org/details/singapura-itihaasa-vaibhava-nov-2021-english/page/29/mode/1up) <br>Hobli: Yelahanka<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: <br>Installation Date: 1528CE<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: <br>English Translation Of The Inscription: <br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: ma. . (gha ) si<br>sarvadāri śaṃvatsa.<br>da aṣaḍa śu1<br>lu nalapanāyka<br>siṃgāpuradabĕ<br>ṭĕyarāyagĕ siṃ<br>gappa nāykarigĕ<br>darmavāgabekĕṃ<br>dupa(la).bāgakĕ.<br>. vayagĕli . .<br>va(na) . . . .<br>(nā) . . . .<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team<br>1 ma . (gha) si .<br>2 sarvadāri śaṃvatsa[ra]<br>3 da āṣaḍa śu 1<br>4 lu nalapanāyka<br>5 siṃgāpurada bhĕ<br>6 ṭĕyarāyagĕ si0<br>7 gappanāykarigĕ<br>8 darmavāga bhĕkĕṃ<br>9 du pātrabŏgakĕ<br>10 tipayagĕ kŏ . .<br>11 va gadĕ(ddĕ)gĕ . . a(ā)<br>12 vanādaru . . .<br>. . . . (muṃdina sālugal̤alli tuṃbā saṇṇa akṣaragal̤alli kŏrĕdiddārĕ. idu bahupālu truṭitavāgidĕ)<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: ಮ. . (ಘ ) ಸಿ<br>ಸರ್ವದಾರಿ ಶಂವತ್ಸ.<br>ದ ಅಷಡ ಶು೧<br>ಲು ನಲಪನಾಯ್ಕ<br>ಸಿಂಗಾಪುರದಬೆ<br>ಟೆಯರಾಯಗೆ ಸಿಂ<br>ಗಪ್ಪ ನಾಯ್ಕರಿಗೆ<br>ದರ್ಮವಾಗಬೇಕೆಂ<br>ದುಪ(ಲ).ಬಾಗಕೆ.<br>. ವಯಗೆಲಿ . .<br>ವ(ನ) . . . .<br>(ನಾ) . . . .<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team<br>1 ಮ . (ಘ) ಸಿ .<br>2 ಸರ್ವದಾರಿ ಶಂವತ್ಸ[ರ]<br>3 ದ ಆಷಡ ಶು ೧<br>4 ಲು ನಲಪನಾಯ್ಕ<br>5 ಸಿಂಗಾಪುರದ ಭೆ<br>6 ಟೆಯರಾಯಗೆ ಸಿ೦<br>7 ಗಪ್ಪನಾಯ್ಕರಿಗೆ<br>8 ದರ್ಮವಾಗ ಭೆಕೆಂ<br>9 ದು ಪಾತ್ರಬೊಗಕೆ<br>10 ತಿಪಯಗೆ ಕೊ . .<br>11 ವ ಗದೆ(ದ್ದೆ)ಗೆ . . ಅ(ಆ)<br>12 ವನಾದರು . . .<br>. . . . (ಮುಂದಿನ ಸಾಲುಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ತುಂಬಾ ಸಣ್ಣ ಅಕ್ಷರಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಕೊರೆದಿದ್ದಾರೆ. ಇದು ಬಹುಪಾಲು ತ್ರುಟಿತವಾಗಿದೆ)<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: <br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: https://archive.org/details/singapura-itihaasa-vaibhava-nov-2021-english/page/n16/mode/1up<br>Photographs Provided By: The Mythic Society Bengaluru  Inscriptions 3D Digital Conservation Team<br>Latitude: 13.0786225<br>Longitude: 77.5372696<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvJWGkZMZgQEY-dnPGwsPa0pS7KXNttx-hBehuO3pi9L4XIwkSf2z2HcgO1hilpTF5WVHjZyrFO9v2J6SJSzJUaZ20GsFBvMQe3bQ5XDA5BoIGHFegc5dd_MucRqPNkuTZyOmGWR6onPTbpxAOXWsaYYwuI6n910emBDE9CTQxTVVQ2aibDmhuBub3W7WtjcZDGSaxX?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKs5dFR-JOqbPTX3D1y7CKVY-LknBbA3zaspgJbyvZ8r-7buIH1qBKS5e3ZwhgD5VT-lSDv7wNjjcmlKGjHGTJkk2Y_e1r-3xwW6oF9QuZvQs97YhRWpxgFkBnPlDJP43WJaQCFz7OTsaR5hV0yHMgBe_pCBHvLShFGnZ6xumWdkluxKZBNk_ndeeo8AHiLRdnOYUOY?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKu0G404tjAkENfut0RmOcr2SJDRp5esgOaauU8Z60Bnl64DxleauMfv4slImHWgickojD5ihy8cJzuOApm_GNJama1o87_qXrQVjtDU2iXudcHGYUt2vBNhZPnA00hw-IoCEc_JItEzUmoopXCw1DCLMzqm2qRf9zG6earE-_Ee18iu66fmQicjKd74Mi9IT1JstE44?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsaBykq3ZrvFrGDj_G_DOAfWt5qHOd7jIej2i032P_r8LdF9YwFuNeSwkMW3i2y5xI0OD_aXeKVLCuoVbF0qnA1NB3gXFR_cttUYO3WxR7nBfITMoG_pXY89L_00PoQ4lL0BCZiCDQ-x0_IdnCAAKxy0OEUo0PpRi79zM14wj-slj-TS3YNDHZZVgjWmASKLAbpcmim?authuser=0&fife=s1