        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "Bengaluru Itihaasa Vaibhava Issue 1 (https://archive.org/details/singapura-itihaasa-vaibhava-nov-2021-english/page/29/mode/1up) ",
        "Hobli": "Yelahanka",
