        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "ma. . (gha ) si\nsarvadāri śaṃvatsa.\nda aṣaḍa śu1\nlu nalapanāyka\nsiṃgāpuradabĕ\nṭĕyarāyagĕ siṃ\ngappa nāykarigĕ\ndarmavāgabekĕṃ\ndupa(la).bāgakĕ.\n. vayagĕli . .\nva(na) . . . .\n(nā) . . . .\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team\n1 ma . (gha) si .\n2 sarvadāri śaṃvatsa[ra]\n3 da āṣaḍa śu 1\n4 lu nalapanāyka\n5 siṃgāpurada bhĕ\n6 ṭĕyarāyagĕ si0\n7 gappanāykarigĕ\n8 darmavāga bhĕkĕṃ\n9 du pātrabŏgakĕ\n10 tipayagĕ kŏ . .\n11 va gadĕ(ddĕ)gĕ . . a(ā)\n12 vanādaru . . .\n. . . . (muṃdina sālugal̤alli tuṃbā saṇṇa akṣaragal̤alli kŏrĕdiddārĕ. idu bahupālu truṭitavāgidĕ)",
