        "description": "Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: Bn169 Suply<br>Hobli: kengeri<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: ಹುಲ್ಲಾಳದ ಸರಹದ್ದಿನಲ್ಲಿ ಹಾರನಕಟ್ಟೆ ಬಳಿ ಬಿದ್ದಿರುವ ಕಲ್ಲು<br>Installation Date: <br>Inscription Language: Kannada & Devanagari<br>Size: <br>Current Status: <br>English Translation Of The Inscription: <br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: (ದೇವನಾಗರಾಕ್ಷರ)<br>1. ಪೈಂಗ<br>2. ಳನಾ<br>3. ಮ ಸಂವ<br>4. ...ತ್ಸರದ<br>(ಕನ್ನಡದಲ್ಲಿ)<br>5. . . . <br>6. ಗುಜರ<br>7. ಶಿವಾಜಿ<br>8. ರಾಮ<br>9. ಸಮುದ್ರ<br>10. . . . <br>11. ಭೂದಾನ<br>12. ದ ಶಾಸನ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: <br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: <br>Photographs Provided By: <br>Latitude: 12.9585848<br>Longitude: 77.4792679<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): ",
