        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvYjEAvhjKLR_IbnUM7PDykX5f2HxorBGnq4BpoR-aEtm0sYjr-pqixTMwznEHgkSPjGjCDoNY8DwFk23vWsFyulhnJx_WuXOue4b2is19739ZaVu3-keVTbJ2fOaeUfalX5ggcYhL6lrX45eCLP4kHcdQ5_l7qBXjxJiqlzehJxrn9u9PUs8pNijT3fXBZj80lkEIR?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKt9ySOrZmuTLTw01o1xABT3cUZgOpX2xXmnH7_Vf5Slw3-MDL5GMl2-JbCJR3QSrQ1TOW6FxeQTZ5lZM6VA1WLm2VEDl-qmM_e_-R8cJN3tF4oNBQAgeynSg2LwrGKc2tEWCDss0ewvWCC6mwIEW-hG_dHsD5USXLhBwwnWMiMO577CjdwAMzolkh2-aBAGBk_NkVRA?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuq_Eg3gVUPM3gDZ9b5jlS0vB5s1IWuWdYkF33jvPgvT5_BFqy5JK9jq9HwmP2wShWGw0vrXiXA5-R6kRTOjgfahNo0MO8pj3E5IRadr-9Pk6VDioHxNgM328uanUhpLNREVD7Cuc8qqADsACEuNEIVuuqmXe13eO67pgd0xt7NlFa-LMA3YRBu2Lfyg8bqPO_9s-vk?authuser=0&fife=s16383",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "This inscription published in Itihaasa Darshana Volume -03, Issue01, 1988 by Devarakondareddy",
        "Hobli": "",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "1. svasti sama . . . . . . . dhimada . . . . . . . .\n2. . . . . nĕ rŏl̤gaṃḍa śroṇīta puravareśvara . . . . śvarara\n\n3. . . . . nātmajaṃ haravṛṣabha lāṃcanaṃ . . . . tri . tthi kopanaṃ bali\n\n4. ṣaṇaṃ nanni pĕrbbāṇa[0] samara pravīṇaṃ kāminīkāmaṃ mahā\n\n5. satya rādheyaṃ sāmantasundaraṃ līl̤āpurandaraṃ ghaṭeya[0?]\n\n6. śrī matnāgattaraṃ bīravarmana sādhisi ballavarasa raṭṭa . . . .\n\n7. bĕṃpūrŏl̤somanātana degulamammāḍisi divyāsakti bhaṭa\n\n8. rgĕllā kālakkaṃ tĕṟĕyā biṭṭu kālaṃkaḻci dhārĕyanĕrĕdu bi . . . .\n\n9. . . . . kañiṭṭagĕyū biṭṭu kavilĕ narĕyumaṃ kŏṭṭu [pa]\n\n10. (ḻpa) ttu khaṇḍuga maṇṇu maṃ sarvabhyantara siddiyāgirĕ kŏṭṭan. . . .\n\n11. siyumanaḻidŏṃ paṃcamahāpātakaṃ svadattaṃ paradattaṃ vāyo\n\n12. . . . . . . . . . . yapāta gā yo[na]rambrahmasvantu viṣaṃ ghŏraṃ nādi\n\n13. hanti devasvaṃ putra pautrikaṃ ī dhana namaṃ[pŏtva] baṭṭagikaḍu\n\n14. dĕ . . . . . . . . . dakkaṃ keḍaṃgĕyvonuṇbātannī degulagal̤aṃ paḍisali\n\nMythic Society 3D Scanning Team Re-reading\n\n1 ಄ svasti samara jal̤adhi mathana . . . . . . . . . .\n\n2 bhuvana kŏl̤gaṇḍaṃ śroṇītapuravareśvara . . . . . . . śvara .\n\n3 pagātmajaṃ hara vṛṣabha lāṃcanaṃ triphtātthikāṃcanaṃ bali\n\n4 ṣaṇaṃ nanni pĕrbbāṇaṃ samarapravīṇa kāminīkāmaṃ ma .\n5 satyarādhĕyaṃ sāmantasundaraṃ līl̤āpurandaraṃ ghaṭĕya\n\n6 śrīmat nāgataraṃ bīravarmanaṃ sādhisi ballavarasa raṭṭa pa . .\n\n7 .(bĕṃ)pūrŏl̤ somanātana degulamammāḍisi divyāsakti bha .\n\n8 . llā kālakkaṃ tĕṟĕyā biṭṭu kālaṃkaḻci dhārĕyĕṟĕdu ba . .\n\n9 kkĕñcaṭṭagĕyū biṭṭu kavilanarĕyadāyamaṃ kŏṭṭu pa\n\n10 . ttu khaṇḍugaṃ maṇnumaṃ sarvabhyantara siddhiyāgirĕ kŏṭṭan . .\n11 siyumanaḻidŏṃ paṃcamahapātakaṃ ಄ svadattaṃ paradattaṃ vā .\n\n12 dānaṃ trayaḥ pataka yo nara || brahmasvantuviṣaṃ ghorānādi\n\n13 hanti devasvaṃ putra pautrikaṃ || ī śāsanamaṃ biḻdĕbaṭṭagi kaḍu\n\n14 dĕvuduī kŏḍaṃgĕyvonuṇbātaṃnī degulaṃgal̤ā paḍisali .",
        "Name_": "",
        "EC_9_Ht_": "",
