        "name": "Bhoopasandra Durgi stone Inscription",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtpsPLmCCVeDTaF2PzvBooGxEIW3WG6EIsPwPXBrP8wqWe89RjgKeqgp6OMetz7IuWtL79pWJBHPmg1W77FFn-9CngEbTOCx9PjOQkhjETfQWx93B68wmWKVD60g0-ruySfMwXh_iyzEBiq7liulnoVm5Hjvuam5hA0QW-aFV28D8Kf1K8Hjdzb-ubMuVsd02v9-iwO?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: This Inscription published in Shasana Manthana book (Article No 3), Tumkur University. Author P.V. Krishnamurthy<br>Hobli: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: <br>Installation Date: 8th Century<br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: <br>English Translation Of The Inscription: <br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: bhūpasaṃdra grāmadalli durgi kallina meliruva śāsana.<br><br>1. . . . . l̤uba<br>2. . . . yama<br>3. padiḻtumbu<br>4. mañcagĕyaru<br>5. kaṟuvīda(ḍa)ru<br>6. nallŏlamŏl̤ĕyŏ<br>7. ru sākṣi idā<br>8. naḻivŏnvāraṇāsi<br>9. yul̤u pārvvaru ka<br>10.vilĕyu mān kŏnda<br>11.pañca mahāpāta<br>12.kana sanda lokakkĕ<br>13. sandŏrappā.<br><br>Mythic Society 3d Scanning Team Re-Reading<br>1). . . . l̤uba<br>2). . . yama<br>3)padiḻtumbu<br>4)mañcagĕyaru<br>5)kaṟuvīḍaru<br>6)nallŏlamŏl̤ĕyŏ<br>7)ru sākṣi idā<br>8)naḻivŏnvāraṇāsi<br>9)yul̤u pārvvaru.ka<br>10)vilĕyu mān kŏnda<br>11)pañca mahāpāta<br>12)kana sanda lokakkĕ<br>13)sandŏrappā .<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: ಭೂಪಸಂದ್ರ ಗ್ರಾಮದಲ್ಲಿ ದುರ್ಗಿ ಕಲ್ಲಿನ ಮೇಲಿರುವ ಶಾಸನ.<br><br>1. . . . . ಳುಬ<br>2. . . . ಯಮ<br>3. ಪದಿೞ್ತುಮ್ಬು<br>4. ಮಞ್ಚಗೆಯರು<br>5. ಕಱುವೀದ(ಡ)ರು<br>6. ನಲ್ಲೊಲಮೊಳೆಯೊ<br>7. ರು ಸಾಕ್ಷಿ ಇದಾ<br>8. ನೞಿವೊನ್ವಾರಣಾಸಿ<br>9. ಯುಳು ಪಾರ್ವ್ವರು ಕ<br>10.ವಿಲೆಯು ಮಾನ್ ಕೊನ್ದ<br>11.ಪಞ್ಚ ಮಹಾಪಾತ<br>12.ಕನ ಸನ್ದ ಲೋಕಕ್ಕೆ<br>13. ಸನ್ದೊರಪ್ಪಾ .<br><br>Mythic Society 3d Scanning Team Re-Reading<br>1). . . . ಳುಬ<br>2). . . ಯಮ<br>3)ಪದಿೞ್ತುಮ್ಬು<br>4)ಮಞ್ಚಗೆಯರು<br>5)ಕಱುವೀಡರು<br>6)ನಲ್ಲೊಲಮೊಳೆಯೊ<br>7)ರು ಸಾಕ್ಷಿ ಇದಾ<br>8)ನೞಿವೊನ್ವಾರಣಾಸಿ<br>9)ಯುಳು ಪಾರ್ವ್ವರು.ಕ<br>10)ವಿಲೆಯು ಮಾನ್ ಕೊನ್ದ<br>11)ಪಞ್ಚ ಮಹಾಪಾತ<br>12)ಕನ ಸನ್ದ ಲೋಕಕ್ಕೆ<br>13)ಸನ್ದೊರಪ್ಪಾ .<br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: <br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: <br>Photographs Provided By: <br>Latitude: 13.044367<br>Longitude: 77.5805995<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsYAr82yB3u7L2yWk5AFgLjt1wveb8DGRGzbY81VCc8gL0bWYFf7O1bNL2tmZB3o3Inwn-0bY7g92yEpIt9-RWER7GxwJ6Ag-jUxLPCttTH5iGqJI4j908p3XN9thtGNmxNE6IP1kke1VdZRs9piW60PwPVM8zAhfQbLwPlpkOrw8ULdaBsavcHJ4SYym3AqOfwQc7f?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsn0lT2q3nxFPoMKQqU3SMmmsfdxfdKYbaREWAMg3KVwnbnJgsTih6BuENVC-BIQZHQ3DF56_zDpsTFHdgSjmSdq4ykrYMlgqczFUK7Jj7h9zRLHkT11P2yFX_5NhgEOqcJxQzU4rySnYENog3jtqIExOu6otpuhybjFAql7GU35sxQjG4TZQJH9ELBCDabZX0uJE31?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
