        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "bhūpasaṃdra grāmadalli durgi kallina meliruva śāsana.\n\n1. . . . . l̤uba\n2. . . . yama\n3. padiḻtumbu\n4. mañcagĕyaru\n5. kaṟuvīda(ḍa)ru\n6. nallŏlamŏl̤ĕyŏ\n7. ru sākṣi idā\n8. naḻivŏnvāraṇāsi\n9. yul̤u pārvvaru ka\n10.vilĕyu mān kŏnda\n11.pañca mahāpāta\n12.kana sanda lokakkĕ\n13. sandŏrappā.\n\nMythic Society 3d Scanning Team Re-Reading\n1). . . . l̤uba\n2). . . yama\n3)padiḻtumbu\n4)mañcagĕyaru\n5)kaṟuvīḍaru\n6)nallŏlamŏl̤ĕyŏ\n7)ru sākṣi idā\n8)naḻivŏnvāraṇāsi\n9)yul̤u pārvvaru.ka\n10)vilĕyu mān kŏnda\n11)pañca mahāpāta\n12)kana sanda lokakkĕ\n13)sandŏrappā .",
