        "name": "Bileshivale Inscription (Tamil)",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvu5Qp8zs_OIvNF81i8Wa47QMrLC41OcIMQ4PJAQx2VA2F9L5x6pYZGgTzHqe2fn9nIg5F4qz_Y9IAV5RvUQ8JbTgTJN_3bO4sfxt-GIfPbENHNlEF_bIGNqsNhqVdWwn6pqu3-SaRWUcSHHgNHw7msFfSqHVt0sM5HIZawOWVDDtqh_6CqWvBzkX3gFVYTXQA9Na0K?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: This inscription mentioned in MAR - 1911. But the text of this Inscription published in Quarterly Journal of The Mythic society (QJMS), Volume - 113, 2022 by The Mythic society Inscription 3D conservation team (https://bit.ly/43undocblr)<br>Hobli: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: <br>Installation Date: 1399CE<br>Inscription Language: Tamil<br>Size: <br>Current Status: <br>English Translation Of The Inscription: <br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1\t... வருஷம் 4500 இதில் ஶகாப்தம்\t<br>2\t... ராஜராஜ பரமேஸ்வர ஸ்ரீ வீரஹரி\t<br>3\t... நின்ற காலத்து ப்ருமாதி வருஷத்து\t<br>4\t... த்து வெளண்ரையும் ப்ரஹஸ்பதி வ\t<br>5\t... ரலி சோழ வளநாட்டுச் சண்ணை\t<br>6\t... யக்கு செய்வார் கற்கிறையில்\t<br>7\t... வா மகன் தாமோதர செட்டியா(ர்)\t<br>8\t...ஸ்ரீ ஸ்ரீ <br><br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: <br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: 1. ... ವರುಷಂ 4500 ಇತಿಲ್ ಶಕಾಪ್ತಂ<br>2. ... ರಾಜರಾಜ ಪರಮೇಸ್ವರ ಶ್ರೀ ವೀರಹರಿ<br>3. ... ನಿನ಼್ಱ ಕಾಲತ್ತು ಪ್ರುಮಾತಿ ವರುಷತ್ತು<br>4. ... ತ್ತು ವೆಳಣ್ರೈಯುಂ ಬ್ರಹಸ್ಪತಿ ವ<br>5. ... ರಲಿ ಚೋೞ ವಳನಾಟ್ಟುಸ್ ಸಣ್ಣೈ<br>6. ... ಯಕ್ಕು ಚೆಯ್ವಾರ್ ಕಱ್ಕಿಱೈಯಿಲ್<br>7. ... ವಾ ಮಗನ್ ದಾಮೋದರ ಸೆಟ್ಟಿಯಾ(ರ್)<br>8. ...ಶ್ರೀ ಶ್ರೀ<br><br>Photographs Provided By: The Mythic society Inscription 3D conservation team<br>Latitude: 13.0514444<br>Longitude: 77.66625<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtqOCgWNlm8brn1h6ssKKRh63o5JbVHhbRZspYSHDvgywUaSjB_NJ04pXT22cvjtlnx9hh-upLJmYnV3NGbQPBlWUIKnsgl_Uj5upDQ95TVrfH8ZEQrvgSkPsx9noSPQ2PZ9_q6vYZDyFcxWLhFRC6lsJOWTK1vZyZcTcZ0xZ8fqLfgolXmCxvsTEpvqxYEiyFHvdYd?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtDePmWRpSvqQaUy_KLXjaR91X_hDoDoJkaJAaWfnmVb-VVcELr8oBo1NDXYfCskMttZCjvYMsNQLqx98wOyIpiEb6dd6QeZ20reMp2SJAeJhiD3SQcomJP7XM1cjs40fSeket_s0_z0KeyczX9Nq3UyXohOgdEov1X6zWQHxfNFE685isF_rXvERRNAtj-Ai5Izjm7?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
