        "name": "Domlur BN163",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKt1cBVyKAlUEBnZ1i_57YeBY64saAxkW0C2_gXG4kOyiYvJ55SIgSb3MJcHSJ8RPNjhC5FI3aeI9cQAKHbhBUdIXjvRv8544wxqA1Lo7KglG7myYICZOxGhAtkDRoV_y44V7mojyUIFyrmXS0HEI1daCSpOFn4I_qMvR2vT0KdwXZeXJNuwFljoBKqAv7u4LROanoqbA7OhvJNkkfbr7FrH9T8X-vy9b1C0R_JvNU31jHXE?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: BN163 (Supplementary<br>Hobli: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: <br>Installation Date: <br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: <br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1 svastiśrī jayābhyudayaśca śakavaruṣa 1251nĕya vibhava saṃvatsarada āśvayija ba11śu daṃdu<br>2 pŏṃnanaṃṇavara makkal̤u kāmaṃṇadaṃṇāyakaru ĕlahakanāḍa . . . padavaṃjīyaru dŏḍamāra*<br>*muṃdina bhāga dvārapālaka vigrahada hiṃdĕ seridĕ<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team:<br>svastiśrīmatpratāpa cakravartti hŏyisal̤a bhujabal̤a śrīvīraballāl̤a devarasaru sukha saṃkathā vinodadiṃ<br>1)svastiśrī jayābhyudayaśca śakavaruṣa 1251nĕya vibhava saṃvatsarada āśvayija ba11śu daṃdu<br>2)pŏṃnaṃṇanavara makkal̤u . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1 ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀ ಜಯಾಭ್ಯುದಯಶ್ಚ ಶಕವರುಷ ೧೨೫೧ನೆಯ ವಿಭವ ಸಂವತ್ಸರದ ಆಶ್ವಯಿಜ ಬ೧೧ಶು ದಂದು<br>2 ಪೊಂನನಂಣವರ ಮಕ್ಕಳು ಕಾಮಂಣದಂಣಾಯಕರು ಎಲಹಕನಾಡ . . . ಪದವಂಜೀಯರು ದೊಡಮಾರ*<br>*ಮುಂದಿನ ಭಾಗ ದ್ವಾರಪಾಲಕ ವಿಗ್ರಹದ ಹಿಂದೆ ಸೇರಿದೆ<br><br>Re-Reading from <br>The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team:<br>ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಮತ್ಪ್ರತಾಪ ಚಕ್ರವರ್ತ್ತಿ ಹೊಯಿಸಳ ಭುಜಬಳ ಶ್ರೀವೀರಬಲ್ಲಾಳ ದೇವರಸರು ಸುಖ ಸಂಕಥಾ ವಿನೋದದಿಂ<br>1)ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀ ಜಯಾಭ್ಯುದಯಶ್ಚ ಶಕವರುಷ ೧೨೫೧ನೆಯ ವಿಭವ ಸಂವತ್ಸರದ ಆಶ್ವಯಿಜ ಬ೧೧ಶು ದಂದು<br>2)ಪೊಂನಂಣನವರ ಮಕ್ಕಳು . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .<br>(ಮುಂದೆ ಕಾಣುವುದಿಲ್ಲ)<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: <br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: <br>Photographs Provided By: <br>Latitude: 12.96237<br>Longitude: 77.6350724<br>Name*: <br>EC 9 Ht#: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuXkfYzdYrlSrn0iqNzDKGPOScx1toQaeIR3k18q-DRjyQGyUyzsRlKwtVR3PMHeBjkUbVavmLpOguGVSodOjQO0hJeAcwtHgHOg9-zdZH-BJHYag2eljT5bCj9S_-efLGpIvTzHzt8Jv_RV4Qw86-4Ea70XCw2RqjXCs5O7IVyMCbXrJwLbKDztqOsOqKFq2ac-f4yLTRcmRzJ8vI-K3tjE2jzwEs70p82BTbScJps6_ye?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
