        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "162\n\n1 svastiśrī śakhavaruṣa sāvirada mūnnūṟa mūvattanĕya virodhi saṃvatsarada cayitra sudda 5so svasti śrīmanumahā rājā\n\n2 dhirāja rājaparameśvara śrīvīrapratāpa devarāya mahārāyara bhujapratāpa nāgappa daṃṇāykaru ĕlahkanāḍu vŏl̤agĕ\n3 cŏkkanātha devarigĕ saluvaṃtā dinakaṭṭalĕyalu karaḍiyahal̤iya catusīmĕ vŏl̤agāda biḍaṃgal̤igĕ saluva grāma1\n4 ṟa maggadĕṟĕ madu bhaḍagi kaṃmāṟa āsaga nāviṃda kuṃbhāra mādĕga kayyigāṇa yĕttugāṇa ĕttutŏttu\n5 baṃḍi kudurĕya kul̤imāṟida śuṃkha koṇa kuṟi ĕṃmĕ ālĕ aḍakĕ maraval̤i . . . . toṭa tuḍikĕ\n6 akkasālĕṟa grāmagal̤a vŏl̤avāṟi hŏpivāṟu maṟakŏḍagĕ kŏṃḍaṃtā ĕttu . . . . . kuṟi ĕṃ\n7 mĕ kudurĕ vŏl̤agāda enul̤aṃtā suṃkha svāmiya magadu vŏl̤agāda mĕlgapayi . . . . devara naṃdā\n8 dīvigĕgĕ dhārāpūrvvakhavāgi ā caṃdrārkasthāyiyāgi naḍĕyalĕṃdu . . . . sāśanakĕ\n9 nāgappa daṃṇāykara baraha yī dharmakkĕ āvanānŏbba tappidarū gaṃgĕya taḍiya kapilĕ . . . . . padalli hoharu\n10 svadattāṃ paradattāṃ vāyoharettu vasaṃdhara | ṣaṣṭirvvaruṣa srahasrāṇi vriṣṭāyāṃ . . . . mi\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team:\n1 0 svasti śrī śakhavaruṣa sāvirada mūnnūṟa mūvattanĕya virodhi saṃvatsarada cayitra sudda 5so svastiśrī manumahārājā\n2 0 dŏmanūra . . .\n3 dhirāja rājaparamesvara śrīvīraprathāpa devarāya mahārāyara bhujaprathāpa nāgappa daṃṇāykaru ĕlakkanāḍu vŏl̤agĕ\n4 cŏkkanātha devarigĕ saluvaṃthā dina kaṭṭalĕyalu karaḍiyahal̤iya catussīmĕ vŏl̤agāda grāmagal̤igĕ saluva grāma1\n5 ṟa maggadĕṟĕ madu bhaḍagi kaṃmāṟa āsaga nāviṃda kuṃbhāṟa mādĕga kayīgāṇa yĕttu gāṇa ĕttutŏttu\n6 0 baṃḍi kudurĕya kul̤imāṟida śuṃkha koṇa kuṟi ĕṃmĕ ālĕ aḍĕkĕya maraval̤i . . . . . [to]ṭa tuḍikĕ\n7 0 akkasālĕṟa grāmagal̤a vŏl̤avāṟu hŏṟavāṟu maṟu kŏḍagĕ kŏṃḍaṃtā ĕttu . . . . . kuṟi ĕṃ\n8 0 mĕ kudurĕ vŏl̤agāda enul̤aṃtā suṃkha svāmiya magadu vŏl̤agāda melgāpayi . . . . devara naṃdā\n9 0 dīvigĕgĕ dhārāpūrvvakhavāgi acaṃdrārkkastāyiyāgi naḍaiyalĕṃdu . . . . sāśanakĕ\n10 0 nāgappa daṃṇāykara baraha yī dharmakkĕ āvanānŏbba tappidarū gaṃgĕya taḍiya kapilĕ . . . . . . dalli ho . .\nsvadĕttāṃ paradĕttāṃ vāyoharettu vasuṃdhara | ṣaṣṭirvvaruṣa srahasrāṇi vriṣṭāyāṃ . . . . .",
