        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvyGFbwSPW-revpbuGjQX7Jc5KB-a6TqgUs5HuuVNoNmJ4WfsA4ZDGvUKdhKEbUwx2-Xnr67HMDSAirNENdYA-P1TOgWyNdY-qxxaK6UbPKL_XTM8LYHCQ95m1oEy9nCDZYTsC2rWJ4gumcyKuvMzBMdlR2xdOqeOVubIzjX9hg1s6ailwWP42IjW96z9yFZ8Q_7fs6z_LzV6zDMHN-PFaA4pI0Jx1l7Szz-DuE-s3tItPv?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtHDT-nAGL9oYCkH1PzKiZAVDgyZMaFolGPhAE5d5pbRR9-oIJzq9YeshxZ8xUGx_7oqOIK52mF45Q2KfOBIyEse_c_rC8hXOe9F4NQrqxK3MWFs9Jr92L34Rn4452Jz3Sco5RkaUEMNCoDbzOUxnjauzeBoWb6bUJD4C9arUzjngWPPqg4KjEs2I3k227X2g0nneZJDVzKw5nGtYIaAwN2WibU30spaBDUCHmGh4QZZe2d?authuser=0&fife=s16383",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "8",
        "Hobli": "Bangalore (Pete & Cantt)",
        "Description_of_Installed_Location_in_Historical_Record": "At Dommalur attached to Bangalore, on a stone lying in front of the Chokkanatha temple.",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "8\n\nbĕṃgal̤ūrigĕ serida dŏmmalūru jŏkkanātha devasthānada muṃdĕ biddiruva kallu.\n\npramāṇa 4’ 6” x 2”\n\n1 svastiśrī śakhavaru\n2 ṣa 1362 raüdrisaṃvatsa\n3 rada bhādrapada ba 7 so | rājā\n4 dhirāja rājaparameśvara śrīvī\n5 radevarāya mahārāyaru .\n6 . siṃhāsanārūḍharāgi yi\n7 rabekĕṃdu paṭṭaṇadarāyaṃ\n8 ṇaṃgal̤u kal̤ihida sŏṃḍĕyakŏ\n9 ppada veṃṭĕyada hĕjjuṃkada\n10 adhikāri mallarasaru ḍŏṃba\n11 lūra cŏkkanāthadevarigĕ kŏ\n12 ṭṭa dānadhārĕya kramavĕṃtĕṃ\n13 daḍĕ prākinalli sŏṃḍĕyakŏppa\n14 da vĕṃṭĕyakkĕ ārubaṃda a\n15 suṃkadavarū ā ḍŏṃbalū\n16 ra cŏkkanāthadevarigĕ salu\n17 vaṃtā catusīmĕyalli ul̤l̤aṃ\n18 tā āvāvā grāmagal̤igĕ bahaṃ\n19 tā hĕjjuṃkada vartanĕya uḍu\n20 garĕyanu pūrvvamariyya\n21 yādĕya ā caṃdrārkka stā\n22 yiyāgi naṃmmarāyaṃṇa\n23 yŏḍĕryyagĕ sakal̤a sāṃbrājya\n24 vāgi yirabekĕṃdu naṃ\n(hiṃbhāga)\n25 naṃmma varttanĕ uḍugarĕya\n26 nu cŏkkanātha devarigĕ uṣakkālada ā\n27 hārakkĕ dhārāpūrvakhavāgi ā\n28 caṃdrārkhkhastāyyāgi dhārĕyanĕṟa\n29 du kŏṭṭĕvāgi yī dharmmakhkhĕ ā\n30 vanānŏbba tappidaḍū gaṃgĕ\n31 ya taḍiyali khapilĕya kŏṃda pā\n32 padali hoharu|| sudĕttāṃ\n33 duguṇaṃ puṇyaṃ paradĕttā\n34 nu pālanaṃ paradĕttāpahāre\n35 ṇa svadĕttaṃ niṣpalaṃbavet||\n36 svadĕttāṃ paradĕttāṃ vāyo\n37 haretu vasuṃdhari ṣaṣṭirvaru\n38 ṣa śahasrāṇi viṣṭāyāṃ\n39 jāyate krimi || subhamastu\n40 maṃgal̤a mahā śrī śrī śrī\n\nRe-Reading From\nThe Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team\n1 svastiśrī śakhavaru\n2 ṣa 1362 raūdri saṃvatsa\n3 rada bhādrapada ba 7 so | rājā\n4 dhirāja rājaparameśvara śrīvī\n5 radevarāya mahārāyaru sti\n6 ra siṃhhāsanāṟūḍharāgi yi\n7 rabhekĕṃdu paṭṭaṇada rāyaṃ\n8 ṇagal̤u kal̤ihida sŏṃḍĕyakŏ\n9 ppada vĕṃṭhĕyada hĕjjuṃkada\n10 atikāri mallarasaru ḍŏṃba\n11 lūra cŏkkanātha devarigĕ kŏ\n12 ṭṭa dānadhārĕya kramavĕṃtĕṃ\n13 daḍĕ prākinalli sŏṃḍĕyakŏppa\n14 da vĕṃṭĕyakkĕ ārubaṃda a\n15 suṃkadavarū ā ḍŏṃbalū\n16 racŏkkanātadevarigĕ salu\n17 vaṃtā catusīmĕyalli ul̤aṃ\n18 tā āvāvā grāmagal̤igĕ bahaṃ\n19 tā hĕjjuṃkada varttanĕya uḍu\n20 gaṟĕyanū pūrvvamaryya\n21 yādĕya ā caṃdrārkka stā\n22 yiyāgi naṃmma rāyaṃṇa\n23 yŏḍĕryyagĕ sakal̤a sāṃbrājya\n24 vāgi yirabekĕṃdu naṃ\n(hiṃbhāga)\n25 naṃmma varttanĕya uḍugaṟĕya\n26 nu cŏkkanātha devarigĕ uṣakkālada ā\n27 hārakkĕ dhārāpūrvvakhavāgi ā\n28 caṃdrārkhkhastāyyāgi dārĕyanĕṟa\n29 du kŏṭṭĕvāgi yī darmmakhkhĕ ā\n30 vanānŏbba tappidaḍū gaṃgĕ\n31 ya taḍiya khapilĕya kŏṃda pā\n32 padalli hoharu || sudĕttāṃ\n33 duguṇaṃ puṃṇyaṃ paradĕttā\n34 nu pālanaṃ paradĕttāpahāre\n35 ṇa svadĕttaṃ niṣpalaṃbavet||\n36 svadĕttāṃ paradĕttāṃ vāyo\n37 haretu vasuṃdhari saṣṭirvvaru\n38 ṣa śahasrāṇi vriṣṭāyāṃ\n39 jāyatĕ krimi || subhamastu\n40 maṃgal̤a mahāśrī śrī śrī",
