        "name": "Jakkur Prashasti",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtZMHu4dz3h129BKo28jyX5Y3u3i4WhTwnlwksxfjbbF67WfqEOVxv53BAinwhBlw0A-ZrXHgtQt7exmsxjQovDQAwYuJct_NNVCOO3B4cIGsVYqoJTaw1f2unr3HqjXShyt7yB1G28n5L7oDlzRq2EXDeEtOuzevnY5yXinTzniI5QaCF8A6AQl516icu1v944rQgEkGdN129VCuUwlh2424Et1r7vRpDO4rX4ZGMvPXYF?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: Itihasa Drshana Vol 33<br>Hobli: <br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Record: <br>Installation Date: <br>Inscription Language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: <br>English Translation Of The Inscription: <br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1 . l̤gaṃgavāḍitŏṃbhattārusāyi<br>2 ramaneka chatracchāyĕyŏl̤arasugĕyyu<br>3 ttirĕ svasti samasta prasasti sahita śrīmat<br>4 navalakkadahal̤ādhipatiyappa ballava<br>5 patirāyaṃ gŏbĕṭṭada birudasĕdevana kāl̤aga<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team<br>1 . . ma . da gāl̤gaṃgavāḍi tŏṃbhattaṟusāyi<br>2 ramaneka chatracchāyĕyŏl̤arasugĕyyu<br>3 ttirĕ svasti samasta prasasti sahita śrīmat<br>4 navalakkadahal̤ādhipatiyappa ballava<br>5 tirāyaṃ gŏbĕṭṭada birudasĕdevana kāl̤ĕga<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: f The Inscription<br>1 . ಳ್ಗಂಗವಾಡಿತೊಂಭತ್ತಾರುಸಾಯಿ<br>2 ರಮನೇಕ ಛತ್ರಚ್ಛಾಯೆಯೊಳರಸುಗೆಯ್ಯು<br>3 ತ್ತಿರೆ ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿ ಸಮಸ್ತ ಪ್ರಸಸ್ತಿ ಸಹಿತ ಶ್ರೀಮತ್<br>4 ನವಲಕ್ಕದಹಳಾಧಿಪತಿಯಪ್ಪ ಬಲ್ಲವ<br>5 ಪತಿರಾಯಂ ಗೊಬೆಟ್ಟದ ಬಿರುದಸೆದೇವನ ಕಾಳಗ<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team<br>1 . . ಮ . ದ ಗಾಳ್ಗಂಗವಾಡಿ ತೊಂಭತ್ತಱುಸಾಯಿ<br>2 ರಮನೇಕ ಛತ್ರಚ್ಛಾಯೆಯೊಳರಸುಗೆಯ್ಯು<br>3 ತ್ತಿರೆ ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿ ಸಮಸ್ತ ಪ್ರಸಸ್ತಿ ಸಹಿತ ಶ್ರೀಮತ್<br>4 ನವಲಕ್ಕದಹಳಾಧಿಪತಿಯಪ್ಪ ಬಲ್ಲವ<br>5 ತಿರಾಯಂ ಗೊಬೆಟ್ಟದ ಬಿರುದಸೆದೇವನ ಕಾಳೆಗ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: <br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: <br>Photographs Provided By: <br>Latit