        "name": "Achigarahalli",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuqf8yvRLzhw4LgUynPCcPAt2vpS2EDjcnu7itQDyqS-lB5xKMtAHSHE7RNVQL4WxAjknZ0QNgt1vm_54Wn52T_e51BM_PbOvy5JkrfFE5Yaid4nFm10OjPgHlab61hZTBtInqRKOmSsJCR47EhJfNjqzDyMKu0MtyMoqJTWQ3GQJCwB3PgL4O69l6rdgSo-La9t4Mn?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>EC 9 Cp#: 15<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: At Achigarahalli behind the Mallesvara temple<br>Installation Date: <br>Taluq (as recorded in EC): Channapatna<br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): Closepete hobli<br>Poster in Exhibition?: <br>Inscription language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: <br>English translation of the Inscription: <br>English transliteration of the Inscription: ................<br>5 ..........kali...puravrittiyAginaM...<br>6 kaliyugadEvaraAmRutadapaDi...1...mADALajI...<br>7 yara..subbaBa . ge . traya ....samastaga^uDu<br>8 .. haLunaDasuvadarmma..... kraya<br> (muMde kANuvudilla)<br><br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 15<br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಅಚ್ಚಿಗರಹಳ್ಳಿಯ ಮಲ್ಲೇಶ್ವರ ದೇವಾಲಯದ ಹಿಂದೆ.<br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 5' 0\" X 2'6\"<br><br>................<br>೫ ..........ಕಲಿ...ಪುರವ್ರಿತ್ತಿಯಾಗಿನಂ...<br>೬ ಕಲಿಯುಗದೇವರಆಮೃತದಪಡಿ...೧...ಮಾಡಾಳಜೀ...<br>೭ ಯರ..ಸುಬ್ಬಭ . ಗೆ . ತ್ರಯ ....ಸಮಸ್ತಗ‍ಉಡು<br>೮ .. ಹಳುನಡಸುವದರ್ಮ್ಮ..... ಕ್ರಯ<br> (ಮುಂದೆ ಕಾಣುವುದಿಲ್ಲ)<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: Megha Nagendra (meghavn21@gmail.com)<br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: Krishna Curam<br>kcuram@yahoo.com<br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Krishna Curam<br>kcuram@yahoo.com<br>Tamil Transliteration Of the Inscription retyped by: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of the Inscription retyped by: <br>Photographs Provided By: Shashikumara Naik K C From The Mythic Society Inscriptions 3D Digital Conservation Team Member<br>Latitude: 12.712072,<br>Longitude: 77.26411<br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuRmGcSw2hq7U_M8L2WCgAkjskHJCCXD_VSJQ9ZWvCxLeBpqNfYkkJldOTGyFGYmjRrhCsN_CikTRzrwmBX3KGwhYdlFmNosVLitZENUueLxFJjKRE8MYSJVKiqJCnEwhfVFlzUYtbNqBvrge4oU5XqDFQ2DIODccf0SwuBTkgMuyi_0IWEcpXW3hveoh5DhtiS8G0?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKs8q4vJ8HjX9D-jz11o65WkcN3f44awqPChTCXbxT7RJjmW7nVucusDlvmLwN92lj7zNl6Durgc-zOQhqs-TLhkYBPEv-b3MVrhpA8VTCJOB1ihIKZjf2qHu7EfrkQvh3edzSAhXeB478-AwVqWSVQMmmEQjKmX95dR-cH71b_1z6Z1wgoNV4wLlsWYoZuNltIfHOw?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
