        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "................\n5 ..........kali...puravrittiyAginaM...\n6 kaliyugadEvaraAmRutadapaDi...1...mADALajI...\n7 yara..subbaBa . ge . traya ....samastaga^uDu\n8 .. haLunaDasuvadarmma..... kraya\n (muMde kANuvudilla)\n",
