        "name": "Gubbi",
        "description": "EC 9 Ht#: 114<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: At Gubbi (Gubbi hobli) on a stone near the Garuda-kambha of the Somesvara temple<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1426<br><br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): Gubbi<br>Poster in Exhibition?: <br>Inscription language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: <br>English Translation Of The Inscription: <br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1  swastishrIkaliyuga 4208 saKasaM 1331 saMsaparAbhavasaMvatsarada .... shrIrAjAdhirAjarAjaparamESwarapra<br>                                                                                       tApadEva<br>2  rAyavoDeyarasiMhAsanadalupRuthuvIrAjyaMgeyuvapiriseTTiyakumArapOliseTTinillisidakaMba<br><br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 114<br><br>ಗುಬ್ಬಿ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಕಸಬೆಗೆ ದಕ್ಷಿಣ ಸೋಮೇಶ್ವರ ದೇವ್ಲಯದ ಮುಂದೆ ಗರುಡಗಂಬದ ಜಗಲಿಯ ಕಲ್ಲು.<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ?'?\"ಘಿ ?'?\"<br><br>1 ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಕಲಿಯುಗ 4208 ಸಖಸಂ 1331 ಸಂಸಪರಾಭವಸಂವತ್ಸರದ ....<br>ಶ್ರೀರಾಜಾಧಿರಾಜರಾಜಪರಮೇಶ್ವರಪ್ರ<br>ತಾಪದೇವ<br>2 ರಾಯವೊಡೆಯರಸಿಂಹಾಸನದಲುಪೃಥುವೀರಾಜ್ಯಂಗೆಯುವಪಿರಿಸೆಟ್ಟಿಯಕುಮಾರಪೋಲಿಸೆಟ್ಟಿನಿಲ್ಲಿಸಿದಕಂಬ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: <br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: Krishna Curam <kcuram@yahoo.com><br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Krishna Curam <kcuram@yahoo.com><br>Tamil Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Telugu Transliteration Retyped By: <br>Photographs Provided By: <br>Latitude: 13.070792<br>Longitude: 77.673686<br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: <br>Name (Village): <br>Inscription Language: ",
