        "name": "Kitiganuru",
        "description": "EC 9 Ht#: 117<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: At Kitiganuru (same hobli, on a stone in the sanabhoga's inamati field.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1367<br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): Gubbi<br>Poster in Exhibition?: <br>Inscription language: Kannada<br>Size: 4'6\"X 2'9\"<br>Current Status: <br>English Translation Of The Inscription: <br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1 swastishrISaKAnda <br>2 1289 mElepalavaM <br>3 gasaMvatsaradaAShADaba <br>4 1 llu shrImanumahAmaMDaLESwara<br>5 bAsegetappuvarAyaragaMDashrI<br>6 vIrabukkaMNavoDeyarupru<br>7 rAjyamADuvalli <br>8 shrImanumahAsAvaMtAdhipatiya <br>9 LarAyaragaMDaliMgayanA <br>10 ykaruelahaMkanADaprabhu <br>11 ..didEvakaMnagauMDashAli<br>12 yappavoDeyaru || yAdava<br>13 booDDayappataNniyALuvaru<br>14 bidaregauMDahiriyaMNnamalpa<br><br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 117<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಕಿತಗನೂರಿಗೆ ಈಶಾನ್ಯ ಶಾನಭೋಗನ ಯಿನಾಮತಿ ತೋಟದಲ್ಲಿ ಬಿದ್ದುಯಿದ್ದ ಕಲ್ಲು.<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 4'6\"ಘಿ 2'9\"<br><br>1 ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಶಖಾನ್ದ | <br>2 1289 ಮೇಲೆಪಲವಂ | <br>3 ಗಸಂವತ್ಸರದಆμÁಡಬ | <br>4 1 ಲ್ಲು ಶ್ರೀಮನುಮಹಾಮಂಡಳೇಶ್ವರ<br>5 ಬಾಸೆಗೆತಪ್ಪುವರಾಯರಗಂಡಶ್ರೀ<br>6 ವೀರಬುಕ್ಕಂಣವೊಡೆಯರುಪ್ರು<br>7 ರಾಜ್ಯಮಾಡುವಲ್ಲಿ | <br>8 ಶ್ರೀಮನುಮಹಾಸಾವಂತಾಧಿಪತಿಯ | <br>9 ಳರಾಯರಗಂಡಲಿಂಗಯನಾ | <br>10 ಯ್ಕರುಎಲಹಂಕನಾಡಪ್ರಭು | <br>11 ..ದಿದೇವಕಂನಗೌಂಡಶಾಲಿ<br>12 ಯಪ್ಪವೊಡೆಯರು || ಯಾದವ<br>13 ಬೂಡ್ಡಯಪ್ಪತಣ್ನಿಯಾಳುವರು<br>14 ಬಿದರೆಗೌಂಡಹಿರಿಯಂಣ್ನಮಲ್ಪ<br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: <br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: Krishna Curam <kcuram@yahoo.com><br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Krishna Curam <kcuram@yahoo.com><br>Tamil Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Telugu Transliteration Retyped By: <br>Photographs Provided By: <br>Latitude: 13.0379548<br>Longitude: 77.710901<br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: <br>Name (Village): <br>Inscription Language: ",
