        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuiHkX_guNNxPsylt-dNHK3qyL-i2GicKuHirIQn5M3ric8r2ISlKhLZDy0y1lHfVmuTanXSkmWM8skEAOwyMf1FMgATkWD4m6isfihPRv0CuN5sS-fFzpg7ey9TuqeUgYDSCihp-DzFv6cUxghmQ3CDtcIM25d9USN5FA7kNAFxddelDBBJNsRx_u-PIObBDLxwDs?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>EC 9 Ht#: 123<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: At Bayiratti (same hobli), on the Jademuniyappa rock north of the village<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1000<br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): Gubbi<br>Poster in Exhibition?: <br>Inscription language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: <br>English Translation Of The Inscription: <br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1 musukaMduma hArusiyapitAmadEvaNasiddeyadEvariddaM<br>2 tAvanAsimamunigaLukopoojeyamADidatANa<br><br>Mythic Society #d scanning Project Team Re-Reading<br>1)musukuṃda mahārusiya pitāma revaṇa siddhaya devariddaṃ<br>2)tā vanāsrima munigal̤u pujĕya māḍida mulāttāṇa<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: f The Inscription<br>123<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಬಯಿರತ್ತಿ ಗ್ರಾಮಕ್ಕೆ ಉತ್ತರ ಜಡೇಮುನಿಯಪ್ಪನ ಬಂಡೇಮೇಲೆ<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ?'?\"ಘಿ ?'?\"<br><br>1 ಮುಸುಕಂದುಮ ಹಾರುಸಿಯಪಿತಾಮದೇವಣಸಿದ್ದೆಯದೇವರಿದ್ದಂ<br>2 ತಾವನಾಸಿಮಮುನಿಗಳುಕೊಪೂಜೆಯಮಾಡಿದತಾಣ<br><br>Mythic Society 3d scanning Project Team Re-Reading<br>1)ಮುಸುಕುಂದ ಮಹಾರುಸಿಯ ಪಿತಾಮ ರೇವಣ ಸಿದ್ಧಯ ದೇವರಿದ್ದಂ<br>2)ತಾ ವನಾಸ್ರಿಮ ಮುನಿಗಳು ಪುಜೆಯ ಮಾಡಿದ ಮುಲಾತ್ತಾಣ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: <br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: Krishna Curam <kcuram@yahoo.com><br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Krishna Curam <kcuram@yahoo.com><br>Tamil Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Telugu Transliteration Retyped By: <br>Photographs Provided By: <br>Latitude: 13.076772<br>Longitude: 77.655106<br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: <br>Name (Village): <br>Inscription Language: <br><br><img src=\"https://m