        "description": "EC 9 Ht#: 124<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: At the same village, on a stone on the ridge of Sitarappa's field, east of the village gate<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1328<br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): Gubbi<br>Poster in Exhibition?: <br>Inscription language: Kannada<br>Size: 6'0\"X 2'0\"<br>Current Status: <br>English Translation Of The Inscription: <br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1  swastishrImatushaKava  |  <br>2  ru Su 1252 neyavi  |  <br>3  bhavasaMvatsaradashrAvaNa  |  <br>4  su 15 sukravAradaM  |  <br>5  duswastishrImatupratA  |  <br>6  pachakravartihoyisaLa  |  <br>7  shrIvIraballALadEvarasaru  | <br>8  uNAmalepaTTaNadalu   <br>9 suKadiMdarAjyaMgevutta  |  <br>10 yiralushrImanumahApra  |  <br>11 dhAnaMponnaNanavaramakaLu  |  <br>12 kAma yadaNAyakaruela  |  <br>13 haMkanADasEnabhOva^allA<br>14 LavaMgebayirattiyagade<br>15 bedaluchatusImeya<br>16 lu^uLLadanusahagoDagi<br>17 yAgikoThe^uAcaMdrA<br>18 yitta ruLLanabarasaluhudu<br><br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 124<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಬಯಿರತ್ತಿ ಗ್ರಾಮಕ್ಕೆ ಉತ್ತರ ಜಡೇಮುನಿಯಪ್ಪನ ಬಂಡೇಮೇಲೆ<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 6'0\"ಘಿ 2'0\"<br><br>1 ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಮತುಶಖವ | <br>2 ರು ಶು 1252 ನೆಯವಿ |<br>3 ಭವಸಂವತ್ಸರದಶ್ರಾವಣ | <br>4 ಸು 15 ಸುಕ್ರವಾರದಂ | <br>5 ದುಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಮತುಪ್ರತಾ | <br>6 ಪಚಕ್ರವರ್ತಿಹೊಯಿಸಳ |<br>7 ಶ್ರೀವೀರಬಲ್ಲಾಳದೇವರಸರು | <br>8 ಉಣಾಮಲೆಪಟ್ಟಣದಲು | <br>9 ಸುಖದಿಂದರಾಜ್ಯಂಗೆವುತ್ತ | <br>10 ಯಿರಲುಶ್ರೀಮನುಮಹಾಪ್ರ | <br>11 ಧಾನಂಪೊನ್ನಣನವರಮಕಳು | <br>12 ಕಾಮ ಯದಣಾಯಕರುಎಲ | <br>13 ಹಂಕನಾಡಸೇನಭೋವಅಲ್ಲಾ<br>14 ಳವಂಗೆಬಯಿರತ್ತಿಯಗದೆ<br>15 ಬೆದಲುಚತುಸೀಮೆಯ<br>16 ಲುಉಳ್ಳದನುಸಹಗೊಡಗಿ<br>17 ಯಾಗಿಕೊಠೆಉಆಚಂದ್ರಾ<br>18 ಯಿತ್ತ ರುಳ್ಳನಬರಸಲುಹುದು<br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: <br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: Krishna Curam <kcuram@yahoo.com><br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Krishna Curam <kcuram@yahoo.com><br>Tamil Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Telugu Transliteration Retyped By: <br>Photographs Provided B