        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "1  swastishrImatushaKava  |  \n2  ru Su 1252 neyavi  |  \n3  bhavasaMvatsaradashrAvaNa  |  \n4  su 15 sukravAradaM  |  \n5  duswastishrImatupratA  |  \n6  pachakravartihoyisaLa  |  \n7  shrIvIraballALadEvarasaru  | \n8  uNAmalepaTTaNadalu   \n9 suKadiMdarAjyaMgevutta  |  \n10 yiralushrImanumahApra  |  \n11 dhAnaMponnaNanavaramakaLu  |  \n12 kAma yadaNAyakaruela  |  \n13 haMkanADasEnabhOva^allA\n14 LavaMgebayirattiyagade\n15 bedaluchatusImeya\n16 lu^uLLadanusahagoDagi\n17 yAgikoThe^uAcaMdrA\n18 yitta ruLLanabarasaluhudu\n",
