        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuL9Fp8VkdjaqUK7nuIC_TuxUNl8i96Cg0Bl8Dpk7pv9FpDyAtV0H2CQbptS8iEQ8Dtfi7rTa2EoBbZ2mIFIMW_ddLZjc92GUneq9K9HEshMfJ8HzMoBCuH8GftYVDQiVQapO407CgSogkMb1VC1_HLFOJqhCPqMEMiGDuEmGSfW0W_EhX4aRf9Q4Af38XICyR8I9o?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>EC 9 Ht#: 141<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: At Kadugodi (Kadugodi hobli), on the base of Garuda-kamba infront of the Anjaneya tcmple.<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1407<br><br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): Kadugodi<br>Poster in Exhibition?: <br>Inscription language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: <br>English Translation Of The Inscription: <br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1 swastishrIshakavaruSha 1329 | <br>2 neya sarvvajitusaMvatsara | <br>3 dAsADasuddapA 1 sOma | <br>4 vAradaMdusEviseTTiyamaga | <br>5 malliseTTihanumaMtadEvara<br>6 nupratiShTeyanumADisidIpa<br>7 mAleyakaMbavamADisidasuba<br>8 mastumaMgaLamahA shrI shrI shrI<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 141<br><br>ಕಾಡಗೋಡ ಹೋಬಳಿ ಕಸಬೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಆಂಜನೇಯ ದೇವಸ್ಥಾನದಗರುಡ ಕಂಭದ ಬುಡದಲ್ಲಿ.<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ ?'?\"ಘಿ ?'?\"<br><br>1 ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿಶ್ರೀಶಕವರುಷ 1329 <br>2 ನೆಯ ಸವ್ರ್ವಜಿತುಸಂವತ್ಸರ <br>3 ದಾಸಾಡಸುದ್ದಪಾ 1 ಸೋಮ <br>4 ವಾರದಂದುಸೇವಿಸೆಟ್ಟಿಯಮಗ <br>5 ಮಲ್ಲಿಸೆಟ್ಟಿಹನುಮಂತದೇವರ<br>6 ನುಪ್ರತಿμÉ್ಟಯನುಮಾಡಿಸಿದೀಪ<br>7 ಮಾಲೆಯಕಂಬವಮಾಡಿಸಿದಸುಬ<br>8 ಮಸ್ತುಮಂಗಳಮಹಾ ಶ್ರೀ ಶ್ರೀ ಶ್ರೀ<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: <br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: Krishna Curam <kcuram@yahoo.com><br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Krishna Curam <kcuram@yahoo.com><br>Tamil Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Telugu Transliteration Retyped By: <br>Photographs Provided By: Dr Byrappa MG<br>Latitude: 12.996671<br>Longitude: 77.767477<br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: <br>Name (Village): <br>Inscription Language: <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.