        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "1  swastishrIshakAbda 1268 neya chitrabhAnusaMvatsara   \n2  dapuShyaba 10 sO... shrImatupratApachchakrama tiha   \n3  yagrIvavIrabalAkaMbakrarasaruENAmalepaTTa    \n4  NadallusuKarAjyaMgaiyavuttirali shrImanuma     \n5  hAsi.maMDalAdhipatichakramartinAyakanu          \n6  shrImanumahAmA... nAdatiMkaNabAgayaNarA     \n7  jya . aileyakADagODiyakaraNasamastagoM\n8  DugaddeyasaNNa rAjyadaKajana 18 airuMbAbi\n9 yaNasOtu ... salilashAsanavumADi\n10  chakradoDilatiMda^ba^yakasaNNanelluaMga\n11 NadapaTTaMdoorugaTTabeddalichatussIme . Ala\n12 maraAkidanu .. sImeyannusAbhAgyadakoDageAgi\n13 AgichakrabattaAkitaruNanaMnabasaluvaMvAgishi\n14 lAshAsanamamADikoTTarumaMgaLamahA shrI shrI shrI",
