        "name": "Dodda-Banahalli",
        "description": "EC 9 Ht#: 151<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: At the same village, on a stone east of Subbaya's inamati-field<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1644<br><br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): Kadugodi<br>Poster in Exhibition?: <br>Inscription language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: <br>English Translation Of The Inscription: <br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1  kALAyuktiShaMva  <br>2  taradalimuMmaDitiM <br>3  meya^uDaruyalapana <br>4  haLLigabigenetarakoDuge...<br>5 nA....<br>(muMde kANuvudilla)<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 150<br><br>ಅದೇ ಹೋಬಳಿ ದೊಡ್ಡಬನಹಳ್ಳೀ ಶಾನುಭೋಗನ ಇನಾಮತಿ ಹೊಲದಲ್ಲಿ ನಟ್ಟ ಕಲ್ಲು.<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 4'0\"ಘಿ 1'6\"<br><br>1 ಕಾಳಾಯುಕ್ತಿಷಂವ  <br>2 ತರದಲಿಮುಂಮಡಿತಿಂ <br>3 ಮೆಯಉಡರುಯಲಪನ  <br>4 ಹಳ್ಳಿಗಬಿಗೆನೆತರಕೊಡುಗೆ...<br>5 ನಾ....<br>(ಮುಂದೆ ಕಾಣುವುದಿಲ್ಲ)<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: <br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: Krishna Curam <kcuram@yahoo.com><br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Krishna Curam <kcuram@yahoo.com><br>Tamil Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Telugu Transliteration Retyped By: <br>Photographs Provided By: <br>Latitude: 13.023767<br>Longitude: 77.747425<br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: <br>Name (Village): <br>Inscription Language: ",
