        "description": "EC 9 Ht#: 152<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: On a stone west ofthe same field<br>Installation Date: 01/01/1644<br><br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): Kadugodi<br>Poster in Exhibition?: <br>Inscription language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: <br>English Translation Of The Inscription: <br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1  shubhamastu       <br>2  swabhAnu saM   <br>3 puShya ba 4 lu     <br>4  naMjEgauDanakomA<br>5  ra kapaNaMgegabI<br>6  hosahaLikerekaTTi<br>7  dakkA kaTigoDige<br>8  holaKa |  0<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 151<br><br>ಅದೇ ಗ್ರಾಮದ ಕೊಡಗಿಸುಬ್ಬಯ್ಯನ ಇನಾಮತಿ ಹೊಲದ ಪೂರ್ವ ಕಡೆ.<br><br>ಪ್ರಮಾಣ 2'6\"ಘಿ 1'9\"<br><br>1 ಶುಭಮಸ್ತು<br>2 ಸ್ವಭಾನು ಸಂ<br>3 ಪುಷ್ಯ ಬ 4 ಲು <br>4 ನಂಜೇಗೌಡನಕೊಮಾ<br>5 ರ ಕಪಣಂಗೆಗಬೀ<br>6 ಹೊಸಹಳಿಕೆರೆಕಟ್ಟಿ<br>7 ದಕ್ಕಾ ಕಟಿಗೊಡಿಗೆ<br>8 ಹೊಲಖ | 0<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: <br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: Krishna Curam <kcuram@yahoo.com><br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: Krishna Curam <kcuram@yahoo.com><br>Tamil Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Telugu Transliteration Retyped By: <br>Photographs Provided By: <br>Latitude: 13.023767<br>Longitude: 77.747425<br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: <br>Name (Village): <br>Inscription Language: ",
