        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuB816J0psY-ZM5lZKbaHsv-9RVN6W8Np0VZ_D-dmtfQ1LT1422I8Es46sOnfxqPKui-nhKnc2RziCoK3GSBiRU7fxUfpyYX3zd_z6FrcD36pbDvRW5L_zHU0a7bFbrIVtS9NCP9ZRy9exjLhWJZW-7kVZ_acuCx_mTj7sMnVoMqKppp_t1fClKws_jc3qqyzBkxe0?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuJ9MQNXyFOhnfN9DrYo6EPEchduNXVaxzXvOZ0JrTTjAOEcE5rnDq2VlGn3wLIQFWzy0M1ONZGV6_tOTyczhB4oOXss1Yw7vWncM9fI_xNozOSHSKQBNZ2ZubuNnbSFYgOL-Z-gm7tKFxsudkp7CqsOVVmzqQKEpl5YhKnmpkpUmfVg-AgyC3hE56lFk0WOEC8ldE?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKvi-YjyXagxdap8UmfKYju8KuhdWQK4VUXVlGSC6IBI3eBLBCdy2c8z6DR5aG74SU-bgEyNu7gcQjBe9UiXKy1G-UTye_zVkcLATRuKNCqRM6kI_k2yccZuMHx37SbbdyAPSTQGe6A3kT3Dg5CA3uGbFGHnpMu2eHAWvVxynOqV4cDdCBFhBNtcQZZuuF7dSHiD-TA?authuser=0&fife=s16383",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "1 swastishrIshakavaruSha 1304 riMdamElesaluvaduMdhuMbhi\n2 saMvatsaradakArtikashuddha 5 sOmavAra^uttarAShADanakShatraSu\n3 bhayOgashubhakaraNayuktavAdapuNya . kAladallisastishrI\n4 mahAmaMDaLEShwara^arirAyavibhADabhAShegeta\n5 ppuvarAyaragaMDachatu:samudrAdhIpatIshrIvIrahariyaMNarA\n6 yarakumAdabukkaNNaoDeyarusAMbrAjyaMgeya^u\n7 ttiraluyivasEnAdhipati.. maMgaLada .. meya\n8 nAyakarukumArashrIvIravaLasiMharAyanavarurA.\n9 ragaMDanAgenAyakarutamagesarvavijayArttavAgi\n10 jayaMgoMDacOKavaMDaladaroRuvaLinADabanaha\n11 LLi yamooDaNadeSeyapeMmasamudrasImeyalika^usi\n12 kagOtradapusurOttamadEvanu | .. vaTTu kaTTida kere\n13 yuyidakesaluvachatu:sImeyayoLagaNanidhinikShEpa\n14 jalapAShANasiddhasAddhya^akShiNiyAgAmitEjaswAmya\n15 MagrahAratoravaLinADaprabhugaLurAharagauMDana\n16 magamArappachooDiyappasAkagavuDabElooratiru\n17 male. karamaga . yaravarukADAMgODiyahi\n18 riyaNaMnamaga . yarappanuoLagAdaga^uDaprabhu\n19 gaLuAchaMdrArkasthAyidhArApoorvakavAgiko\n20 TTe^uyIdharmmakke tappidavarigegaMgeyataDiya\n21 taMgELuka^uleyakoMdapApadalihOharoo\n\nMYthic Society 3D scanning team Re-reading\n1 svasti śrīśakavaruṣa 1352ḍanĕya\n2 śrīpramādica saṃvatsarada\n3 mārggasira su 10 sa śrīmaṃ\n4 nmahārājādhirāja rājapara\n5 mesvara śrīvīrapratāpa deva\n6 rāya mahārāyaru ṣakala\n7 sāṃbrāṃjyaṃgĕyutaṃvira\n8 lu śrīmaṃnmahā mūvarurā\n\n9 yara gaṃḍa sārakiya pĕṃmaya\n10 nāyakkara makal̤u pĕṃmĕyanā\n11 yakkaru prithuvi rājaṃgĕyivali\n12 tŏṟaval̤ināḍa mahāprabhu māci\n13 devana maga devijīya devijīyana\n14 maga cŏkkijīya cŏkkijīyana maga de\n15 vijīyanu tirumaladevara sevĕgĕ mā\n16 ḍisida kaṃbhakĕ maṃgal̤a maha śrī śrī\n(pakkada kallina tuṃḍinalliruvudu)\n17 .vara nayivedyakkĕ hŏla l(s*) 4 gaddĕ\n18 . . . . gavanu salisi bahĕnu yida\n19 . . rŏbbaru vakravādavaru gaṃgĕya\n20 . . . ya taṃgel̤u kapilĕya kŏṃda\n21 . padali hoharu maṃgal̤a ma\n22 . śrī śrī śrī śrī śrī\n\n",
