        "description": "EC 9 Ht#: Ithihasa Darshana(Adappa Pasodi)<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: At behind Anjaneya Temple Medahalli<br>Installation Date: 850<br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br>Poster in Exhibition?: <br>Inscription language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: <br>English Translation Of The Inscription: <br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1 svasti śrī rasamalla<br>2 pĕmma pṛthivi rājya<br>3 ṅgĕyyuttirĕ iggalūra<br>4 śaṃbayyana māvaṃ ka<br>5 bbayya pŏlĕyamma<br>6 gāvuṇḍa nŏḻaṃbara<br>7 pari bandu ĕṟĕya<br>8 pa maṅgalava ūraḻi<br>9 iṟiyĕ tal̤tiṟidu<br>10 sagga[ttanāda]<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team<br>1 . . . . . . . . .<br>2 mmāḍi pṛthivi rājyaṅgĕ<br>3 . yyuttirĕ iggalura ka<br>4 paba . . . gāvu<br>5 ṇḍa nŏḻaṃ . . pari bandu<br>6 . . . . . . . maṅgala<br>7 . . . . . . . iṟiyĕ ta<br>8 . . . . . . . rggattarāda<br>9 . . . . .<br>10 . . . . .<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1 ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿ ಶ್ರೀ ರಸಮಲ್ಲ<br>2 ಪೆಮ್ಮ ಪೃಥಿವಿ ರಾಜ್ಯ<br>3 ಙ್ಗೆಯ್ಯುತ್ತಿರೆ ಇಗ್ಗಲೂರ<br>4 ಶಂಬಯ್ಯನ ಮಾವಂ ಕ<br>5 ಬ್ಬಯ್ಯ ಪೊಲೆಯಮ್ಮ<br>6 ಗಾವುಣ್ಡ ನೊೞಂಬರ<br>7 ಪರಿ ಬನ್ದು ಎಱೆಯ<br>8 ಪ ಮಙ್ಗಲವ ಊರೞಿ<br>9 ಇಱಿಯೆ ತಳ್ತಿಱಿದು<br>10 ಸಗ್ಗ[ತ್ತನಾದ]<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team<br>1 . . . . . . . . .<br>2 ಮ್ಮಾಡಿ ಪೃಥಿವಿ ರಾಜ್ಯಙ್ಗೆ<br>3 . ಯ್ಯುತ್ತಿರೆ ಇಗ್ಗಲುರ ಕ<br>4 ಪಬ . . . ಗಾವು<br>5 ಣ್ಡ ನೊೞಂ . . ಪರಿ ಬನ್ದು<br>6 . . . . . . . ಮಙ್ಗಲ<br>7 . . . . . . . ಇಱಿಯೆ ತ<br>8 . . . . . . . ರ್ಗ್ಗತ್ತರಾದ<br>9 . . . . .<br>10 . . . . .<br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: <br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: <br>Tamil Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Telugu Transliteration Retyped By: <br>Photographs Provided By: <br>Latitude: 13.0189927<br>Longitude: 77.7243321<br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: <br>Name (Village): <br>Inscription Language: ",
