        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "1 svasti śrī rasamalla\n2 pĕmma pṛthivi rājya\n3 ṅgĕyyuttirĕ iggalūra\n4 śaṃbayyana māvaṃ ka\n5 bbayya pŏlĕyamma\n6 gāvuṇḍa nŏḻaṃbara\n7 pari bandu ĕṟĕya\n8 pa maṅgalava ūraḻi\n9 iṟiyĕ tal̤tiṟidu\n10 sagga[ttanāda]\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3D Digital Conservation Project Team\n1 . . . . . . . . .\n2 mmāḍi pṛthivi rājyaṅgĕ\n3 . yyuttirĕ iggalura ka\n4 paba . . . gāvu\n5 ṇḍa nŏḻaṃ . . pari bandu\n6 . . . . . . . maṅgala\n7 . . . . . . . iṟiyĕ ta\n8 . . . . . . . rggattarāda\n9 . . . . .\n10 . . . . .",
