        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKsCG07wmb5tqCAWiOIOfj9z_EioWeE0VANPi-Sti05xT0oo4hM6DH2Yd5ie7bTBhebFJGQjjglfJVnQ01YE5P-6yhJcPSNe-fBef3zQBEea2rRgvck0vmdQBRTkQU9fGG3McXh-VLGucGDQUl-lsKWytHRtPOqwIHJdSVCQwOpqNuKJj7xhptM-1_hCRi1zyJeglpywz5Xv7Txe1lsK8vJ-P_SX2fKBHv2lrhahejC2pGVA?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKs5y5OXMPgPjkCJuZXDEju1-6XaLc-PBrIYUElNa4KtuYJiEOB3a8fr56bzGQ92r6uZsnPpWchCG9Iju7MIoZsCTGUBlYxR3zxU45lVg0CZKmLd4gu5ZB5td9VPz0YYFg_fhh2eoT7Qk4dz0-VPhmK_uYDKV5XqPd7S9zqYDa4s1Dt9eFJbcm7NZLyXEIb7mIWJtXjwD6I4-mPQVkYpjfATzR17Vwhi23lVxBAWijcRPskg?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuQ2c-Bra7edyz5rwS2BFd07caaFGUfWsQhCryfR358aZg7VqnV8hsD1XRw8vzha9CmPoP5q9dUUVbXeQHfY5nnSLCKQxFO_Nr95SzEU6u2w5CJB5ACetYEm1ho82q5F_V2SW4aMEe1yhTmLSUO-HkVSBxcWAEuLWYDL5h2Zd1szoTKPg76EoODqAMnsZE_FP8KiSmtMrLFnfaDDETGhqeSYbEpvpUPExFH_wl0ygwY74IV?authuser=0&fife=s16383",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "1. svastiśrī śakavaruṣa 1304ṟiṃda melĕ saluva duṃdubhi\n2. saṃvatsarada kārtika śuddha 5 somavāra uttarāṣāḍha nakṣatra śu\n3. bhayoga śubhakaraṇayuktavāda puṇya . kāladalli svastiśrī\n4. maṃmahā maṃḍal̤eṣvara arirāya vibhāḍa bhāṣĕgĕ ta\n5. ppuva rāyaragaṃḍa catuḥsamudrādhipati śrīvīra hariyaṃṇarā\n6. yara kumāra bukkaṃṇṇa ŏḍĕyaru sāṃbrājyaṃgĕyaü\n7. ttiralu yivara senādhipati . . . maṃgal̤ada . . mĕya\n8. nāyakara kumāra śrīvīra val̤asiṃharāyanavaru rā .\n9. ragaṃḍa nāgĕyanāyakaru tamagĕ sarvva vijayārttavāgi\n10. jayaṃgŏṃḍa col̤amaṃḍal̤ada tŏṟaval̤ināḍa banaha\n11. l̤l̤iya mūḍaṇa dĕśĕya pĕṃmasamudrada sīmĕyali kaüsi\n12. ka gotrada purusottamadevanu| . . vaṭṭu kaṭṭida kĕṟĕ\n13. yu yidakĕ saluva catuḥsīmĕyŏl̤agaṇa nidhi nikṣepa\n14. jala pāṣāṇa siddha sādhya akṣiṇi yāgāmi tejasvāmya\n15. ṃagrahāra tŏṟaval̤ināḍa prabhugal̤u rāyagauṃḍana\n16. maga mārappa cūḍiyappa sākagavuḍa belūra tiru\n17. malĕ . kara maga . . . yaravaru kāḍāṃgoḍiya hi\n18. riyaṃṇana maga . yarappanu ŏl̤agāda gaüḍa prabhu\n19. gal̤u ā caṃdrārkasthāyi dhārāpūrvakavāgi kŏ\n20. ṭṭĕu yī dharmmakkĕ tappidavarigĕ gaṃgĕya taḍiya\n21. taṃgel̤u kaülĕya kŏṃda pāpadali hoharū\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3d scanning project Team\n1 svastiśrī śakavaruṣa 1304ṟiṃda melĕ saluva duṃdubhi\n2 saṃvatsarada kārttika śuddha 5 somavāra uttarāṣāḍha nakṣatra śu\n3 bha yoga śubhakaraṇayuttavāda puṇyava ktāladalli svastiśrī\n4 maṃmahā maṃḍal̤eṣvara arirāya vibhāḍa bhāṣĕgĕ ta\n5 ppuva rāyaragaṃḍa catuśamudrādhipati śrīvīra hariyaṃṇṇŏḍĕ\n6 yara kumāra bhukkaṃṇṇŏḍĕyaru sāṃbrājyaṃgĕyiu\n7 ttiralu yivara senādhipati . . . maṃḍalada cikkapĕṃmĕya\n8 nāyakara kumāra śrīvīra val̤asiṃhāra mūvarurāya\n9 ragaṃḍa nāgĕyanāyakkaru namagĕ sarvavijĕyārttavāgi\n10 jayaṃkŏṃḍa col̤amaṃḍal̤ada tŏṟaval̤i nāḍa banaha\n11 l̤l̤iya muḍaṇa dĕsĕya pĕṃmasamudrada sīmĕyalli kaüsi\n12 ka gotrada purusotama devanu karuvaniṭṭi kaṭṭida kĕṟĕ\n13 yu yidakĕ saluva catusīmĕyŏl̤agaṇa nidhi nikṣepa\n14 jala pāsāṇa siddha sādhya akṣiṇi yāgāmi teja mānya\n15 da agrāra tŏṟaval̤ināḍa prabhugal̤u rāyagauṃḍana\n16 maga mārappa cūḍiyappa sākagaüḍa belūra tiru\n17 malĕ cŏkkara maga bhayiravaru kāḍāṃgoḍiya hi\n18 riyaṇana maga bayirappanu ŏl̤agāda gaüḍu prabhu\n19 gal̤u ā caṃdrārkkastāyi dhārāpūrvakavāgi kŏ\n20 ṭṭĕu yī dhaṃrmmakkĕ tappidavarigĕ gaṃgĕya taḍiya\n21 kaṃdel̤u kaülĕya kŏṃda pāpadalli hoharū",
