        "name": "Dodda gubbi Nompi Inscription",
        "description": "<img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuRd7lHG7uVZ9kiqWRp9DAdg8aP01LXxMrPWHEqQ0_5LiqYDgURDHb2TtZporkXlqhARXTwwz5uJcBaBWEUoLTwiG1Ivz5FCwqp9cwIJFr2EhDG-VxFwCUnJSRw_nPtMi8AVMcMFEWf3-BpgMtWKEHGPozwaPBIBnSzt-5-44Q34NoCU6ua0WAkgx5oDV9oOBmg-F9-exqqjjc2v8JsYLC68SVlJhn-8RFQhSGsav1iysqt?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br>EC 9 Ht#: Puravasthu -2 , Bengaluru parisarada hosa shasanagalu - By Adappa Pasodi<br>Description of Installed Location in Historical Records: <br>Installation Date: <br>Hobli (as recorded in EC): <br>Poster in Exhibition?: <br>Inscription language: Kannada<br>Size: <br>Current Status: Intact<br>English Translation Of The Inscription: <br>English Transliteration Of The Inscription: The Inscription<br>1 svasti śrī śakābda 1293<br>2 ĕnĕya sādāraṇa saṃvatsa<br>3 ra puṣya su1 guruvārada<br>4 lu gubĕya stānaval̤i baṃ<br>5 gācāri bayirojana ma<br>6 ga cŏkka bhaktanu devaloka<br>7 kĕ saṃdandu ā cŏka<br>8 bhaktana maga bayirŏ<br>9 janu yi no[0]piya ni<br>10 lisidanu i sasānava<br>11 baradava kāl̤ācāri<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team<br>1 svasti śrī śakābda 1293<br>2 ĕniya sādhāraṇa saṃvatsa<br>3 ra puṣya su 1 guruvārada<br>4 lu gubiya stānaval̤i baṃ<br>5 gācāri bayirojana ma<br>6 ga cŏkkābaktanu devaloka<br>7 kĕ saṃdadu ā cŏka<br>8 baktana maga bayiro<br>9 janu yi nopiya ni<br>10 lisidanu i sasānava<br>11 baradātha kāḻa śrī<br>Kannada Transliteration Of The Inscription: 1 ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿ ಶ್ರೀ ಶಕಾಬ್ದ ೧೨೯೩<br>2 ಎನೆಯ ಸಾದಾರಣ ಸಂವತ್ಸ<br>3 ರ ಪುಷ್ಯ ಸು೧ ಗುರುವಾರದ<br>4 ಲು ಗುಬೆಯ ಸ್ತಾನವಳಿ ಬಂ<br>5 ಗಾಚಾರಿ ಬಯಿರೋಜನ ಮ<br>6 ಗ ಚೊಕ್ಕ ಭಕ್ತನು ದೇವಲೋಕ<br>7 ಕೆ ಸಂದನ್ದು ಆ ಚೊಕ<br>8 ಭಕ್ತನ ಮಗ ಬಯಿರೊ<br>9 ಜನು ಯಿ ನೋ[೦]ಪಿಯ ನಿ<br>10 ಲಿಸಿದನು ಇ ಸಸಾನವ<br>11 ಬರದವ ಕಾಳಾಚಾರಿ<br><br>Re-Reading from<br>The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team<br> 1 ಸ್ವಸ್ತಿ ಶ್ರೀ ಶಕಾಬ್ದ ೧೨೯೩<br>2 ಎನಿಯ ಸಾಧಾರಣ ಸಂವತ್ಸ<br>3 ರ ಪುಷ್ಯ ಸು ೧ ಗುರುವಾರದ<br>4 ಲು ಗುಬಿಯ ಸ್ತಾನವಳಿ ಬಂ<br>5 ಗಾಚಾರಿ ಬಯಿರೋಜನ ಮ<br>6 ಗ ಚೊಕ್ಕಾಬಕ್ತನು ದೇವಲೋಕ<br>7 ಕೆ ಸಂದದು ಆ ಚೊಕ<br>8 ಬಕ್ತನ ಮಗ ಬಯಿರೋ<br>9 ಜನು ಯಿ ನೋಪಿಯ ನಿ<br>10 ಲಿಸಿದನು ಇ ಸಸಾನವ<br>11 ಬರದಾಥ ಕಾೞ ಶ್ರೀ<br><br>Tamil Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>Telugu Transliteration Of The Inscription: <br>English Translation  Retyped By: <br>English Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Kannada Transliteration Retyped By: <br>Tamil Transliteration  Retyped By: <br>Telugu Transliteration Retyped By: <br>Photographs Provided By: The Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team<br>Latitude: 13.0710141<br>Longitude: 77.6738424<br>Epigraphia Carnatica Vol 9, Bangalore Taluq Inscription Number: <br>Name (Village): <br>Inscription Language: <br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKucbwDO-VNSTE1CkWm7D4rNmmsVYlUvwj_0rA8_zR_1yjSet4736v7Z6HYv4KZSL9muMn5Szb_Xn0-OrpLsZ9F7f124AodvD_LzS-zddo3wmOQ0cJXefy6Lq9y4__2C3CDMts4MQQP_hC2gHXqeg0SL70YAM2Wl8dL1cnhIxGEDl2M2Ir1A6ng9Bexo1qsEk_1LMkvevijJ_pdvUeiqcmYKsy0Ae9gKVhV8sNpIRZUQNU05?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" /><br><br><img src=\"https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtLoQ15cm7UhpDfpO4XBC7vakmOZYNBT78Aa6vbxBMe1pv_B6RIlAz2O1MA4W4AnW1S-Ro4N6JRHZdiLb0JUSgnE_09VMNdzQKz6h20Aiw4CqmXpj75fDfsfW09giUF_KtszOqFqlN3yM27YE16se19Isx1OVl1pZOMo-JdB-Dw5snCURIBVWdSHeqY5m84SSanR0VQdtfMoy1Gp_eJibY40MtCvI6BvHTqeOjtJZuw13JT?authuser=0&fife=s16383\" height=\"200\" width=\"auto\" />",
