        "gx_media_links": "https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKuRd7lHG7uVZ9kiqWRp9DAdg8aP01LXxMrPWHEqQ0_5LiqYDgURDHb2TtZporkXlqhARXTwwz5uJcBaBWEUoLTwiG1Ivz5FCwqp9cwIJFr2EhDG-VxFwCUnJSRw_nPtMi8AVMcMFEWf3-BpgMtWKEHGPozwaPBIBnSzt-5-44Q34NoCU6ua0WAkgx5oDV9oOBmg-F9-exqqjjc2v8JsYLC68SVlJhn-8RFQhSGsav1iysqt?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKucbwDO-VNSTE1CkWm7D4rNmmsVYlUvwj_0rA8_zR_1yjSet4736v7Z6HYv4KZSL9muMn5Szb_Xn0-OrpLsZ9F7f124AodvD_LzS-zddo3wmOQ0cJXefy6Lq9y4__2C3CDMts4MQQP_hC2gHXqeg0SL70YAM2Wl8dL1cnhIxGEDl2M2Ir1A6ng9Bexo1qsEk_1LMkvevijJ_pdvUeiqcmYKsy0Ae9gKVhV8sNpIRZUQNU05?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3ADbDBKtLoQ15cm7UhpDfpO4XBC7vakmOZYNBT78Aa6vbxBMe1pv_B6RIlAz2O1MA4W4AnW1S-Ro4N6JRHZdiLb0JUSgnE_09VMNdzQKz6h20Aiw4CqmXpj75fDfsfW09giUF_KtszOqFqlN3yM27YE16se19Isx1OVl1pZOMo-JdB-Dw5snCURIBVWdSHeqY5m84SSanR0VQdtfMoy1Gp_eJibY40MtCvI6BvHTqeOjtJZuw13JT?authuser=0&fife=s16383",
        "Epigraphia_Carnatica_Vol_9__Bangalore_Taluq_Inscription_Number": "",
        "English_Transliteration_Of_The_Inscription": "The Inscription\n1 svasti śrī śakābda 1293\n2 ĕnĕya sādāraṇa saṃvatsa\n3 ra puṣya su1 guruvārada\n4 lu gubĕya stānaval̤i baṃ\n5 gācāri bayirojana ma\n6 ga cŏkka bhaktanu devaloka\n7 kĕ saṃdandu ā cŏka\n8 bhaktana maga bayirŏ\n9 janu yi no[0]piya ni\n10 lisidanu i sasānava\n11 baradava kāl̤ācāri\n\nRe-Reading from\nThe Mythic Society 3D Scanning Project Team\n1 svasti śrī śakābda 1293\n2 ĕniya sādhāraṇa saṃvatsa\n3 ra puṣya su 1 guruvārada\n4 lu gubiya stānaval̤i baṃ\n5 gācāri bayirojana ma\n6 ga cŏkkābaktanu devaloka\n7 kĕ saṃdadu ā cŏka\n8 baktana maga bayiro\n9 janu yi nopiya ni\n10 lisidanu i sasānava\n11 baradātha kāḻa śrī",
        "EC_9_Ht_": "Puravasthu -2 , Bengaluru parisarada hosa shasanagalu - By Adappa Pasodi",
        "Tamil_Transliteration__Retyped_By": "",
        "Telugu_Transliteration_Retyped_By": "",
